  `c_0_operational_essence`: 'Totalising 5→0 return — the write-back that gathers the whole circuit into recognised unity (1/1=1=100%) and, totalising at 16/9 one epogdoon short of the octave, hands the live residue forward; close-as-opening, recognition reopening as vibration.',
