  `c_1_confluence_predictions`: 'E=15: O(3,5) ∩ N(5) - Deep confluence at genus-3 scaffolding. E=25: O(5,5) ∩ N(10) - Ultra confluence at genus-5. Pattern continues at 5g for all odd g.',
