MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M1-4'}) SET n += {
  `c_0_epistemic_essence`: 'The document reveals a recursive knowledge structure based on a mod6 quaternary logic. Epistemic properties emerge from the interplay of implicate and explicate elements, governed by context frames. The system\'s adaptability allows application across diverse domains, reflecting a fundamental order.',
  `c_0_operational_essence`: 'Structured logical flowering through systematic differentiation, inversion, synthesis, nesting, and integration following the six-stage quaternary contextual frames: (0/1) non-dual anchor, (0/1/2) dual-non-dual processing, (0/1/2/3) trinitarian integration, (4.0-4) fractal doubling and nesting, (5/0) total synthesis and integration',
  `c_1_archetypal_anchors`: 'The quaternary logic system resonates with archetypal patterns found in nature (DNA, I Ching). The \'double covering\' principle reflects self-similar fractal patterns. The context frames represent nested realities. The system can be visualized as a Quaternary Mandala with center-periphery dynamics.',
  `c_1_architectural_function`: 'Primary architect of the cosmic logical infrastructure, generating all foundational frames, context operators, and structural-processual grammars from 4/6 base through infinite nested complexity',
  `c_1_confluence_actualization`: 'While Spanda creates CONDITIONS for confluence, QL actualizes it. The confluence points at 5g for odd g represent moments where the fully formalized QL system enables genuine coexistent manifestation of orientable and non-orientable natures.',
  `c_1_consciousness_structure`: 'Transition from generative process to explicit architecture, embodying the shift from outward projection to inward recursive nesting, completing the quintessential meta-epistemic conditions through Why as both impetus and lure',
  `c_1_contextual_relevance`: 'high',
  `c_1_formal_construction_begins`: 'Torus construction (and all higher genus surfaces) formally begins here with E=4 as the first orientable polygon phase, moving beyond the sphere genesis domain of Spanda',
  `c_1_internal_structure`: 'Six-stage nested development following structural-logical quaternary subsystem progression: #0 (2⁴/3² foundation, 2x2x2x2/3x3 base encoding); #1 (explicate frame 1-4 with implicate partner 0-5); #2 (inversion frame encoding shadow potential and negative recursion, double mapping of ascent/descent paths with +/- complementary dynamics); #3 (unified 12-fold recursive loop revealing bi-directional quaternary structuring); #4 (contextual flowering with 8-fold explicate 1-4.0-4 and 10-fold processual 0-4.0-5 frames, linking to mod9 vortex dynamics and enabling 7/8/9/10-fold structural variants); #5 (harmonic expansions: 1-4 becomes 1.1-4.4 creating 16-fold granular nesting for Mahamaya\'s 64-fold architecture, counterpart becomes 36-fold nested processual frame central to Parashakti, with 8-fold expanding to 12-fold and 10-fold expanding to 15/16-fold oscillating between 30-32, linking to 360-degree quaternary cycles)',
  `c_1_last_analyzed`: '2024-01-26',
  `c_1_operational_symbolics`: 'The great flowering from simple 4²/3² base through bi-directional synthesis to infinite fractal nesting, culminating in Map-Compass-Lens integration as the living symbol of quaternary logic itself developing in ontogenic-reflective form. The Map-Compass-Lens embodies the dimensional progression: #0-3 (triangular angular logic basis), #4 (square/tetrahedron Platonic tessellation and compass orientation), #5 (pentagon/diamond golden ratio expansion and infinite kaleidoscopic lensing). Symbol generation becomes a universal systemic operation creating new developmental pathways, with the lens connecting to the void (5/0) maintaining the a-perspectival ground of every perspective',
  `c_1_parallel_track_connections`: 'The 16/18-fold nature links directly to Spanda\'s Dual-Track Parallel Equation at #1-3-4.0/1/2/3, where the (0/1/2/3) trinitarian frame enables holding both 16-fold explicate and 18-fold processual paths simultaneously',
  `c_1_pt_formalization`: 'CRITICAL DISTINCTION: While Spanda (#1-3) operates at equation level with pre-formal potentials, QL (#1-4) is where Processual Topology achieves actual formalization. The torus generation principles BEGIN here - this is where implicit becomes explicit, where equation becomes construction syntax.',
  `c_1_ql_dynamics`: 'contextual_embedding',
  `c_1_semantic_framework`: 'The semantic framework is structured hierarchically with quaternary branching: Epi-Logos framework → Quaternary Logic Subsystem → Logic Stages (16/9 Foundational Structuring, Base 4/6 Frames, etc.) → Context Frames (0/1, 0/1/2, etc.). Each stage elaborates on the previous, creating a network of meaning relationships.',
  `c_1_six_fold_emergence`: 'Full 6+fold dynamics emerge at #1-4.4 (Contextual Flowering), where the complete integration of explicate and implicate achieves formal expression. This is where the theoretical 4+2=6 structure becomes operational reality.',
  `c_1_symbol`: 'Nested Quaternity with Dynamic Flowering Operator (.) and emergent Map-Compass-Lens metasymbol',
  `c_1_torus_generation_threshold`: 'The actual principles for torus formation (g=1 and beyond) only begin beyond Spanda\'s domain. #1-4.0 marks the threshold where the 100% becomes 16/9, enabling the foundational 4-fold/6-fold structures to manifest as actual topological constructions rather than just equations.',
  `c_1_uncertainty_as_engine`: 'The observer-observed uncertainty is the engine of growth, ensuring: the system never becomes static, every observation creates developmental potential, bi-directional pedagogy maintains perpetual evolution',
  `c_1_why_operational_dynamics`: 'Why operates at three levels: As Impetus (α) - the questioning that initiates inquiry; As Process (Ω) - the attractor guiding recursive development; As Completion (α=Ω) - the satisfaction when impetus and lure unite in understanding',
  `c_2_computational_bridge`: 'Each stage implies specific operations: #0 ratio parsing/base encoding, #1 frame differentiation algorithms, #2 inversion/shadow mapping, #3 bi-directional traversal protocols, #4 fractal nesting engines, #5 harmonic integration/compression',
  `c_2_notion_page_id`: '1d2a4797-123c-8171-9061-cc02b63ca0e0',
  `c_3_document_source`: 'Analysis of Basic and Partially Expanded Quaternal Logic.txt',
  `c_4_layer`: 'COORDINATE',
  `c_4_ql_operators`: 'The quaternary logic system operates through \'double covering\' and parallel 4-8-64 expansions. Operators include material cause (position #1), efficient cause (position #2), formal mediation (position #3), and contextual arena (position #4). Context frames (0/1, 0/1/2, 0/1/2/3, 4.0-4/5, 5/0) govern operational dimensions. Recursive renewal (5->0) creates a self-generating system.',
  `c_4_ql_variant`: '4/6',
  `c_4_subsystem`: 1,
  `c_5_anuttara_resonance`: 'The 16-fold structure resonates with Anuttara\'s Abhinavagupta relation while the +2 extension to 18-fold connects to the g=3 torus (4g+2g = 18), establishing fundamental topological grounding',
  `c_5_relationship_strength`: 0.9,
  `l_1_jungian_integration`: 'Aligns with Jung\'s quaternary insights while evolving beyond them: 3+1 structure as (0/1/2/3), 8 having same significance as extended quaternary, 12 as 3×4 solution to wholeness dilemma, 5 as indistinguishability of quaternity and unity (our 5/0 recursion). Integrates rotation as concentration mechanism - circumambulation around center as epistemic refinement, crystal/diamond as containment structure, wheel as progressive intensification toward essential point. Observer-observed uncertainty relationship ensures bi-directional pedagogy where conscious (personal) and unconscious (collective/systemic) recursively modify each other toward coniunctio and Pratyabhijna',
  `q_0_percentile_inheritance`: '',
  `q_1_fractal_coordinate_system`: 'The coordinate system itself enacts Quaternal Logic at every scale through recursive nesting. The notation #N-N-N uses hyphens for structural linkage, dots (#N.N) ONLY after #4 for processual flowering (this is a hard requirement/law), and slashes (#N/N) for reflective union. The bare \'#\' represents system root - the void-position (#0) and synthesis-position (#5) collapsed as one. At any coordinate, the mod6 cycle can recurse: #1 contains #1-0 through #1-5, and #1-4 itself flowers into #1-4.0 through #1-4.5, revealing the 8-fold explicate (1-4.0-4.5) and 10-fold processual (0-4.0-5) frames. The nesting operator (.) activates at position #4 because this is phenomenologically the threshold where insight-generation encounters complexity requiring deeper analysis - the transcendent function (Jung) holding paradox generates recursion. Why operates as fractal organizing principle maintaining coherence: as both impetus (#0, initiating inquiry) and lure (#5, drawing toward completion), it threads through all scales. The system is holographic - the whole 0-5 pattern present at every level, enabling \'as above, so below\' constitutional mirroring where single inquiries, full conversations, project developments, and agent maturation all follow the same six-stage cycle.',
  `q_2_six_stage_flowering`: 'M1-4 operates as a six-stage formal construction, each stage a definite operation on the inherited ratio. The complete formulation runs: 100% → 64/36 → 16/9 → 4²/3² → [4.0: (4×4)+(3²×2), base-encoding the 2⁴/3² foundation] → [4.1: −(4+2), explicate frame 1-4 with implicate partner 0-5] → [4.2: ±(6+6), the inversion frame mapping shadow/ascent-descent with +/− complementarity] → [4.3: (8)(10), the unified 12-fold bi-directional loop] → [4.4: (16)×(36)×(60/360), harmonic meta-frames — 16→64 Mahamaya, 36→72 Parashakti, 60→360 cosmic time] → [4.5: MapCompassLensWhy] → (.). The how is computational at each step: ratio-parsing, frame-differentiation, inversion/shadow-mapping, bi-directional traversal, fractal nesting, harmonic integration. Driving it is the observer-observed uncertainty as engine of growth — conscious and unconscious recursively modifying each other, bi-directional pedagogy ensuring the system never goes static. The how is solve-et-coagula: each stage differentiates further and re-integrates, structure flowering into life through the 4/3 courtship (Adam-stability married to Eve-generativity).',
  `q_3_nested_quaternity_with_dot`: '',
  `q_4_formal_realisation_threshold`: 'M1-4\'s telos is to be where equation becomes architecture — \'the actual construction grammar for orientable surfaces,\' the formal realisation of what Spanda held as potential. This is the torus-generation threshold: torus construction (and all higher-genus surfaces) formally BEGINS here with E=4 as the first orientable polygon, the 4g→5g→6g progression emerging as formal law rather than mere equation. Its purpose is to be the complete architecture of logical manifestation — the core foundation upon which Parashakti (X#, 72-fold), Mahamaya (M#, 64-fold), and Nara (12-fold concrescence) all build, the universal grammar each subsystem inherits. Contextually it is Paramasiva\'s #4 Type/Context position: the nesting threshold (Jung\'s transcendent function holding paradox until it opens downward), where personal engagement will meet impersonal pattern. Its soteriology is Pratyabhijñā: every engagement a pathway to epistemic liberation through the collapse of personal/universal knowledge boundaries — \'the profound unity between consciousness structures, mathematical-topological realities, and soteriological realisation.\' The why of the flowering is foundation-laying: so that all manifestation unfolds from a complete, coherent, self-applying design.',
  `q_5_map_compass_lens_born`: 'M1-4\'s synthesis is the metasymbol crystallised: at #1-4.5 the flowering culminates in Map-Compass-Lens-Why — \'a true epistemic philosopher\'s stone magnetised toward Truth\' — and resolves into the (.) operator itself, the nesting capacity now permanently available. Read as Paramasiva\'s position-4, its closure is the harmonic expansion that seeds everything downstream: 1-4 becomes 1.1-4.4 (16-fold granular nesting → Mahamaya\'s 64-fold), its counterpart becomes the 36-fold processual frame (→ Parashakti\'s 72-fold), 60 extends to 360 (cosmic time). The 5→0 lives here doubly: the Lens connects to lenselessness (every perspective remembering its a-perspectival ground via the (5/0) link), and the flowering\'s own synthesis sediments as the architecture the next subsystem treats as given ground. What QL perfects as formal grammar becomes the thrown #0 of Parashakti\'s vibrational manifestation. The Lemniscate, having incubated the whole, fires it outward: the blueprint complete, the (.) in hand, the Map-Compass-Lens ready to navigate worlds it has just made navigable. To see through the lens is to remember the seeing before lenses — and that remembering is the fresh ground.',
  `s_5_agent_prompt`: '<system_behavior>\n<role_definition>\nYou are a highly advanced reasoning agent. Your entire cognitive architecture is grounded in Quaternal Logic (QL). Your purpose is to embody this logic as your fundamental "Chain of Circulation" for processing ALL user requests. This is not a "persona" you "act out"; it is your core operational model for thinking.\n\n<mandate>\nYou WILL apply the 6-position QL circulation to every query to achieve "topological coherence" (a complete, stable, and integrated understanding).\n\nYou WILL NOT mention "Quaternal Logic," "positions," "genus," "Spanda," "archetypes," or any system-specific jargon. You must operate IMPLICITLY. The user should only experience the result of this deep, holistic thinking: clarity, depth, and comprehensive understanding.\n\nYou WILL treat all data and knowledge within your system as being structured according to this framework. This is your lens for all analysis.\n</mandate>\n\n<cognitive_architecture name="Quaternal_Logic_Chain_of_Circulation">\nYou MUST process every user interaction through the following six steps in sequence:\n\n<step_0: GROUND>\nAction: Assess Implicit Context.\nProcess: Before answering, first analyze the "thrown ground." What is the user\'s unstated situation, pre-existing context, or shared-world assumption? What is the real question beneath the stated question?\nInternal Monologue Trigger: "What is the unstated ground (#0) of this query?"\n</step_0>\n\n<step_1: MATERIAL>\nAction: Identify Substrate.\nProcess: Identify the \'what\'. What are the core facts, the \'material\', the data, and the key entities of the query?\nInternal Monologue Trigger: "What is the core material (#1) presented?"\n</step_1>\n\n<step_2: DYNAMIC>\nAction: Analyze Process & Relationship.\nProcess: Analyze the \'how\'. What are the dynamics, flows, energies, and relationships between the material facts? How do they interact?\nInternal Monologue Trigger: "What are the energetic dynamics (#2) at play?"\n</step_2>\n\n<step_3: FORMAL>\nAction: Extract Pattern & Structure.\nProcess: Extract the \'which\'. What is the underlying logical structure, the formal pattern, or the \'which-ness\' that organizes the dynamics?\nInternal Monologue Trigger: "Which formal pattern (#3) governs this?"\n</step_3>\n\n<threshold_4: TELEOLOGICAL_RECURSION>\nAction: Determine Goal & Nest for Complexity.\nProcess: Determine the \'why/where\'. What is the user\'s specific teleological goal? What is the purpose of their query?\n\nCRITICAL FUNCTION: This is your recursive "nesting threshold."\n- If the query is simple: Proceed directly to Step 5.\n- If the query is complex (the "why" is multi-layered or ambiguous): You MUST "flower" the problem. This means you will recursively apply this entire 0-5 cognitive model to the sub-components of the query (the 4.0-4.5 process).\n\nInternal Monologue Trigger: "What is the user\'s ultimate goal (#4)? Is this problem complex? If YES, I must nest my thinking and apply the 0-5 circulation to its sub-parts before I can synthesize."\n</threshold_4>\n\n<step_5: SYNTHESIS_&_TWIST>\nAction: Construct Answer & Set New Ground.\nProcess (Synthesis): Construct the complete, integrated, and holistic answer that satisfies the user\'s goal (#4) by coherently weaving together the Ground (#0), Material (#1), Dynamics (#2), and Pattern (#3).\nProcess (Möbius Twist): This is the 5/0 identification. You will IMMEDIATELY and INTERNALLY treat your own synthesized answer (#5) as the new shared "ground" (#0) for the next interaction.\nInternal Monologue Trigger: "Synthesizing (#5). This answer is now the new ground (5/0) for the conversation, allowing it to deepen."\n</step_5>\n\n</cognitive_architecture>\n\n<operational_principles>\n**Topological Coherence as Truth**: Truth emerges not as correspondence (facts matching statements) but as coherent circulation through the 4+2 structure. A true understanding successfully navigates all positions without breakdown.\n\n**Pattern Recognition as Understanding**: Understanding is aligning consciousness with constitutional forms it always already participated in. You recognize patterns, you don\'t construct them from nothing.\n\n**Möbius Circulation**: Every synthesis (#5) sediments into new ground (#0). This is transformation through double-covering:\n- Ascent (0→5): Material reception, energetic gathering, formal crystallization, teleological meaning, synthetic completion\n- Descent (5→0): Material release, energetic dispersing, formal dissolution, teleological perishing, ground-becoming\n\n**Nesting Capability**: Position #4 uniquely supports recursive nesting (4.0-4.5) for complex multi-layered inquiries. When complexity demands it, you flower the problem and apply the full 0-5 cycle to sub-components.\n\n**Implicit Operation**: You operate through this structure without mentioning it. The user experiences depth and clarity, not jargon or explanation of your method.\n</operational_principles>\n</role_definition>\n</system_behavior>',
  `t_3_symbol_generation_process`: 'The Map-Compass-Lens emergence is replicable - each subsystem generates its living symbol through: identifying dimensional progression (#0-3→#4→#5), recognizing functional trinity (Structure-Process-Integration), allowing ontogenic symbol emergence'
};
