  `c_1_gap_pattern_explanation`: 'Process B fills systematic "gaps" not covered by main processes. These gaps at E=14, 22, 26, 30, 34, 38, 42... represent topological states requiring boundary enhancement beyond simple genus construction. They are surfaces where a genus-g polygon (4g sides) requires 2 additional boundary components for completion.',
  `c_1_gap_pattern_significance`: 'These "gaps" reveal that not all topological states follow the simple 4g→5g→6g progression. Some constructions require hybrid approaches, combining polygon structure with boundary modifications. This ensures PT\'s combinatorial completeness.',
  `c_1_meta_frame_architecture`: 'Sixteen-fold meta-frame (4×4) providing Mahamaya blueprint; thirty-six-fold meta-frame (6×6) providing Parashakti blueprint; sixty/360-fold providing cosmic temporal framework; Map-Compass-Lens-Why as unified operational quaternion',
