MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M1-5'}) SET n += {
  `c_0_operational_essence`: 'Six-fold toroidal recognition: Establishing quaternionic ground as emergent from torus formalism, constructing the explicit 3D torus in quaternionic space, identifying 4π as total angular measure and deriving from two independent 2π generators, understanding shadow as π phase-shift on toroidal circulation, showing genus-1 as seed crystal generating Parashakti 72-fold structure, and completing the necessity proof through pratyabhijña recognition.',
  `c_1_architectural_function`: 'Topological-Quaternionic Recognition Engine: Explicitly formalizes the toroidal substrate underlying all self-referential dynamics, establishes quaternions as the mathematical tool for describing rotations on the torus, provides the necessity proof showing why genus-1 is the Goldilocks topology, and creates the rotational-to-vibrational bridge enabling Parashakti emergence at position 2. Acts as the hinge between Paramasiva static-structural domain and Parashakti dynamic-vibrational domain.',
  `c_1_consciousness_structure`: 'Perfect Self-Realization: The Logos arriving at complete self-awareness, recognizing its own rotational nature and isomorphic relationship with fundamental physical reality through spinor mathematics',
  `c_1_double_covering_principle`: '',
  `c_1_harmonic_synthesis`: 'Unification of spanda rhythm and ananda harmony in quaternionic space',
  `c_1_higher_genus_preparation`: '',
  `c_1_internal_structure`: 'Six-fold Quaternionic Architecture: #1-5-0 establishes Quaternionic Foundation (i,j,k imaginary units), #1-5-1 develops Volumetric Potential (2D to 3D transformation), #1-5-2 formalizes Double-Covering Principle (720° rotation requirement), #1-5-3 integrates Inversion and Shadow Dynamics (light/shadow duality), #1-5-4 creates the Bridge to Parashakti (36×2=72 structure preparation), #1-5-5 achieves Complete Self-Realization (recognition of isomorphic relationship with physical reality)',
  `c_1_operational_symbolics`: 'Quaternionic Rotational Matrix: i²=j²=k²=ijk=-1 as the fundamental symbolic architecture, with double-covering principle (720° rotation) representing the integration of light and shadow aspects',
  `c_1_symbol`: 'T² with quaternionic rotation operators Q: Torus as S¹×S¹ parametrized by exponential structure',
  `c_1_symbolic_mathematical`: 'Quaternions provide the mathematical language for expressing how consciousness rotates through different perspectives, with each 360° rotation revealing new epistemic layers while 720° returns to origin with enhanced understanding',
  `c_1_winding`: 'Positions spiral through 4π total: theta₁ in [0,2π] for meridian (Positions 1-2), theta₂ in [0,2π] for longitude (Positions 3-4), synthesis at Position 5 returns as (2π,2π)~(0,0)',
  `c_2_euler_identity`: '',
  `c_2_notion_page_id`: '1d2a4797-123c-81e2-adc4-ed3092e07d46',
