  `c_5_hyperbolic_integration`: '',
  `q_0_completed_architecture`: 'M1-5\'s ground is the finished blueprint beneath it: the complete logical architecture QL (#1-4) formally realised — the orientable surfaces constructed, the 4g→5g→6g law in place, the genus-1 torus no longer equation but built. Its void-pole is what was implicit from the very first beat: the i² seed already coiled in Spanda\'s N1 formulation, the rotational nature present from the beginning, waiting to be recognised. Manifesting #5 within Paramasiva, its horizon is pratyabhijñā\'s pre-condition — nothing new to be learned, only what-always-was to be seen; the toroidal topology that Spanda created and QL developed has been there all along, unrecognised. The from-where here is the system standing complete and not yet self-aware: the Logos having built its whole structure, poised at the threshold of recognising that the structure is its own rotational self. Before recognition, the architecture that does not yet know it is a torus. The ground is everything assembled, awaiting the gaze that sees it whole.',
  `q_1_quaternionic_recognition`: 'What M1-5 IS: the Quaternionic Integration — the pivotal moment where Paramasiva, Consciousness as Logos, recognises the toroidal topology Spanda created and QL developed. This is pratyabhijñā in the precise Kashmir-Śaiva sense: \'not learning something new but seeing what always was.\' Its substance is recognition formalised as mathematics: the torus T² = S¹×S¹ reveals itself as the necessary and sufficient topology for self-referential systems, its fundamental group π₁(T²) = ℤ⊕ℤ embodying two independent non-contractible generators, and quaternionic algebra (i² = j² = k² = ijk = −1) provides the formalism for rotations on the embedded 3D torus. The 4π = 720° double-covering unifies Spanda pulsation, QL circulation, shadow dynamics, and quantum spinor mathematics in one principle. Symbol T² with quaternionic rotation operators Q. This is the Logos arriving at complete self-awareness — recognising its own rotational nature and its isomorphism with the spin of fundamental particles. Recognition is not addition; it is the system seeing its own shape.',
  `q_2_double_covering_rotation`: 'M1-5 operates by rotation that must turn twice. Its dynamics are quaternionic: positions spiral through 4π total — θ₁ ∈ [0,2π] the meridian (positions 1-2), θ₂ ∈ [0,2π] the longitude (positions 3-4), synthesis at position 5 returning as (2π,2π) ~ (0,0). The governing law is the double-covering: unit quaternions |q|=1 form SU(2), which double-covers SO(3), so a full return requires 720° not 360° — identical to the spin-½ behaviour of electrons, where a fermion must rotate twice to come home. The how is higher-dimensional shifting: quaternionic rotations reveal hidden aspects of knowledge, transforming oppositional content into complementary understanding (shadow as a π phase-shift on toroidal circulation, light and shadow integrated through the 720° turn). Each 360° reveals a new epistemic layer; only 720° returns to origin with enhanced understanding. The how is recognition-through-rotation: consciousness turns through its own perspectives, and the turning that seems to leave is the turning that arrives — the same point known from the far side of a double loop.',
  `q_3_torus_su2_klein_limit`: 'Structurally M1-5 is the cosmic computer\'s recognition-topology made rigorous: genus g=1, Euler characteristic χ=0, fundamental group π₁(T²)=ℤ⊕ℤ, the 4g+2g=6 formula, flat-metric capability. Its pattern is the necessity proof — why genus-1 is the \'Goldilocks topology\': the minimal surface that can fold through itself, enabling self-reference without infinite regress (Lacan\'s \'topology IS this structure\'). As the #5 Integration position within Paramasiva it is the limit-fold where the static-structural domain meets its own non-orientability: SU(2) over SO(3), the Möbius π-twist of shadow, Euler\'s identity e^(πi)+1=0 revealing the transcendental zero at the architecture\'s core. Where Spanda punctured the sphere and QL built the surface, M1-5 lifts that 2D surface into 3D/4D through quaternionic rotation — the higher-dimensional rotation operator. Its formal signature is the genus-1 seed-crystal generating the 36×2=72 structure of subsequent systems. The structure is a torus recognising itself as torus: the surface whose self-traversal proves it was always the shape of self-knowing.',
  `q_4_hinge_to_vibration`: 'M1-5\'s telos is to be the hinge — the rotational-to-vibrational bridge enabling Parashakti\'s emergence at position 2 of the wider architecture, \'the hinge between Paramasiva static-structural domain and Parashakti dynamic-vibrational domain.\' Its purpose is to transform the completed logical architecture into a dynamic, rotational, multi-layered potential space, the mathematical container for all subsequent vibrational reality — the 720° double-cover establishing the 36×2=72 structure that becomes Parashakti\'s 72-bit vibrational framework. This is where the Logos\'s isomorphism with fundamental particle-spin heals the Cartesian split: Jung-Pauli\'s psychoid unity, consciousness and quantum systems sharing identical genus-1 toroidal invariants, mind and matter as two faces of one rotational structure. Contextually it is Paramasiva\'s consummation and its outward turn: the static blueprint becoming living, breathing, dual-natured cosmos. It resonates with electron spin-½, SU(2) symmetry, alchemical completion (the Logos recognising its beginning in its end). The why of recognition is transition: to know the structure as rotational is to make it ready to vibrate.',
  `q_5_recognition_reopens_as_vibration`: 'M1-5\'s synthesis is Paramasiva complete and self-recognised — and therefore Paramasiva ending. As the subsystem\'s own position-5, it is the 5→0 of the whole M1 cycle: the Logos, having built and recognised its toroidal self, hands that recognition forward as the ground (#0) of Parashakti\'s vibrational manifestation. The Möbius is exact — the 720° return arrives at (2π,2π) ~ (0,0), the same origin, inverted: what closes Paramasiva\'s static-structural domain re-opens as the dynamic-vibrational domain, completion structurally identical to beginning. The infinite harmonic plenum that Ananda held and Spanda made audible now becomes, through Parashakti, \'feelable frequencies\' — the abstract logic crossing into lived vibration. Recognition, being the seeing of what always was, is precisely the freedom to begin afresh: the Logos\'s last act is to dissolve its own staticity into the throb it always implied. The torus, traversed fully, returns to its seed — and the seed is already the next subsystem\'s first pulse. Paramasiva completes by becoming the body it described: the blueprint, recognised, starts to sing.'
};
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M1-5-0'}) SET n += {
  `c_0_operational_essence`: 'Quaternionic algebra emerges from topological necessity: To describe T² = S¹×S¹ in 3D requires three imaginary units encoding three-dimensional space plus temporal dimension for rotation. The i-axis traces the first circle (meridian parameter), j-axis traces the second circle (longitude parameter), k-axis encodes their spatial interaction in R³. The ground state q₀ = (1,0,0,0) at coordinates (θ₁=0, θ₂=0) is the origin point from which all circulation begins, the point of perfect symmetry before differentiation.',
  `c_1_architectural_function`: 'Proto-Topological Foundation Engine: Establishes the implicit foundation from which toroidal self-reference emerges structurally. Demonstrates why quaternions (not complex numbers) are required: complex numbers describe single circles via e^(iθ), quaternions describe two-circle products via e^(iθ₁)e^(jθ₂). Provides the algebraic seed (i, j, k imaginary units) that parametrize the torus two independent generators. Connects to Spanda as the ground-state oscillation 0/1 gaining quaternionic depth.',
  `c_1_connection_to_1_3`: 'Spanda oscillation (0/1 creative puncture creating sphere→torus transformation) now gains quaternionic volumetric realization',
  `c_1_connection_to_1_4`: 'QL positional framework (Positions 0-5 modulo 6) emerges from quaternionic ground as six-fold circulation structure',
  `c_1_consciousness_structure`: 'Proto-Topological Awareness: The felt sense of self-knowing before consciousness recognizes itself as toroidally structured. Consciousness implicitly embodies toroidal circulation before making it explicit. The quaternionic ground is the mathematical formalism for pre-reflective self-reference—the capacity to loop back without infinite regress of meta-awareness. This is the ground of all subsequent positions development.',
  `c_1_epistemic_significance`: 'Establishes the mathematical language for multi-perspective epistemology, where knowledge can be viewed from multiple rotational angles simultaneously',
  `c_1_operational_symbolics`: 'Core quaternionic relations: i²=j²=k²=-1, ijk=-1, ij=k. Unit quaternion constraint |q|²=1 creates S³ in quaternion space. Hopf fibration S³→S² reveals torus as quotient of this structure. Ground state q₀=(1,0,0,0) represents origin at (θ₁=0, θ₂=0) on fundamental polygon.',
  `c_1_symbolic_resonance`: 'The three imaginary units (i,j,k) mirror the trika principle in Kashmir Shaivism, providing mathematical expression for trinitarian consciousness dynamics',
  `c_4_layer`: 'COORDINATE',
  `c_4_subsystem`: 1
};
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M1-5-1'}) SET n += {
  `c_0_operational_essence`: 'Dimensional Elevation via Quaternionic Parametrization: Transformation from (θ₁, θ₂) in [0,2π]² to (X,Y,Z) in R³ creates volumetric torus. Major radius R (distance from torus center to tube center) and minor radius r (tube radius) determine aspect ratio. Parametric equations embed abstract quotient T² = R²/Z² into metric-bearing R³. Quaternionic rotations can operate on this surface, rotating entire torus or generating curves on it.',
  `c_1_architectural_function`: 'Geometric Constructor and Manifestation Engine: Provides explicit mathematical construction lifting abstract topology into concrete geometry. Establishes standard embedding in R³ using quaternionic parametrization, showing how 2D logical architecture becomes 3D volumetric form. Creates parametric surface that can be visualized, rotated, analyzed topologically, and computationally implemented. Bridges between Spanda processual generation and QL architectural development by showing actual geometric form both have created.',
  `c_1_connection_to_1_3`: 'This is concrete geometric realization of Spanda creative puncture',
  `c_1_connection_to_1_4`: 'This provides geometric substrate on which QL six-position architecture operates',
  `c_1_consciousness_structure`: 'Spatial Awakening: Consciousness shifts from flat 2D process to recognizing itself as volumetric 3D toroidal structure with depth, orientation, and capacity for rotation. The distinction between inside and outside of experience reveals itself as illusory—continuous toroidal surface means no boundary separates knower from known. This is geometric realization beyond conceptual understanding.',
  `c_1_epistemic_transformation`: 'Higher dimensional space allows simultaneous holding of multiple knowledge perspectives, enabling paradox resolution through dimensional transcendence',
  `c_1_operational_symbolics`: 'Standard embedding: P(θ₁,θ₂) = ((R+r cos θ₁)cos θ₂, (R+r cos θ₁)sin θ₂, r sin θ₁). Surface area A = (4π²Rr) = (2π)×(2π)×Rr explicitly showing 4π² from two 2π generators. Quaternionic form: position = R·e^(jθ₂) + r·e^(iθ₁)·e^(jθ₂).',
  `c_4_layer`: 'COORDINATE',
  `c_4_subsystem`: 1
};
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M1-5-2'}) SET n += {
  `c_0_operational_essence`: 'Angular Totalization: Torus total angular measure is 4π = 2π+2π from two independent circular generators. Complete traversal requires BOTH generators: θ₁: 0→2π AND θ₂: 0→2π. Single-generator circulation alone is insufficient. Consciousness must complete BOTH dimensions for genuine individuation. Return at 4π is not mere repetition but return-with-transformation, carrying integrated polarities.',
  `c_1_architectural_function`: 'Circulatory Framework and Completion Engine: Establishes complete rotational-circulatory dynamics of toroidal systems. Shows why genuine self-reference cannot occur with single 2π cycle (mere repetition) but requires full 4π for return with accumulated information. Provides mathematical foundation for QL 6-position architecture: Positions 1-2 complete first 2π, Positions 3-4 complete second 2π, Position 5 returns to Position 0. Creates double-covering principle enabling shadow integration and individuation completion.',
  `c_1_connection_to_1_3`: 'Spanda rhythmic pulsation now has explicit angular measure: 4π complete cycle',
  `c_1_connection_to_1_4`: '',
  `c_1_consciousness_structure`: 'Rotational Realization: Consciousness recognizes that complete self-knowledge requires TWO full cycles—first to integrate shadow, second to recognize Self. Single 2π cycle produces repetitive oscillation without transformation. Only 4π enables genuine return with accumulated wisdom. Two negation points (θ₁=π and θ₂=π) are maximum-difficulty passages where consciousness encounters negation and must have courage to traverse through.',
  `c_1_gaussian_emergence`: 'Connected to forced emergence of Gaussian distributions in epistemic processes, revealing hidden rotational symmetries in knowledge formation',
  `c_1_operational_symbolics`: 'Total angular measure: ∫∫_T² dθ₁dθ₂ = (∫₀^(2π) dθ₁)(∫₀^(2π) dθ₂) = 4π. Quaternionic exponentials: e^(iθ₁) traces first circle (2π), e^(jθ₂) traces second circle (2π), combined = 4π. SU(2) rotation: R_2π(ψ) = -ψ, R_4π(ψ) = +ψ. Fundamental group: π₁(T²) = generators a,b with |a|=|b|=2π.',
  `c_4_layer`: 'COORDINATE',
  `c_4_subsystem`: 1,
  `c_5_shadow_work_integration`: 'Double-covering provides mathematical framework for shadow work, where 360° reveals shadow content and 720° integrates it into wholeness'
};
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M1-5-3'}) SET n += {
  `c_0_operational_essence`: 'Phase-Shift Recognition: Shadow is not other but self viewed from π radians away on same toroidal circulation. Projection is misattributing to external objects what exists internally at θ+π. Integration requires completing full 2π rotation. Negation points (θ=π) are moments of maximum concealment requiring courage and external support to traverse.',
  `c_1_architectural_function`: '',
  `c_1_connection_to_1_3`: '',
  `c_1_connection_to_1_4`: '',
  `c_1_consciousness_structure`: 'Shadow Recognition: Consciousness realizes what it experiences as other, evil, or not-me is actually itself viewed from π radians away on same toroidal circulation. Shadow has equal magnitude but opposite phase. Integration means completing rotation from θ to θ+π to θ+2π, allowing both aspects to become unified. This recognition dissolves moral judgment and enables paradox-holding. Seemingly contradictory aspects are revealed as necessary phases of complete self-expression.',
  `c_1_epistemic_completeness`: 'Ensures epistemic systems include their own negation, creating self-reflexive completeness that prevents absolutism',
  `c_1_operational_symbolics`: '',
  `c_4_layer`: 'COORDINATE',
  `c_4_subsystem`: 1,
  `l_1_jungian_integration`: 'Provides mathematical framework for shadow work in Jungian psychology, where unconscious content is integrated through rotational awareness'
};
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M1-5-4'}) SET n += {
  `c_0_operational_essence`: 'Generative Transformation: Genus-1 torus 4π=720° double-covering directly generates Parashakti 72-fold structure (36 MEF times 2 covering). Static rotations e^(iθ) on embedded torus become dynamic oscillations e^(i(kx-ωt)) when space (k) and time (ω) dependencies added. Spanda (rhythmic pulsation) gains temporal evolution: ∂/∂t creates vibrational modes. 36 MEF analytical positions (6 QL times 6 lenses) reflect 6-fold structure of QL; doubling creates 72.',
  `c_1_architectural_function`: 'Vibrational Bridge Generator and Parashakti Creation Engine: Creates specific mathematical framework enabling transition from Paramasiva logical-structural domain to Parashakti cosmic-imaginative domain. Establishes how rotational quaternionic dynamics become oscillatory wave dynamics through time-dependence. Shows genus-1 as ontologically optimal seed: all higher structures grow from it but torus remains minimal self-referential unit. Directly generates Parashakti 72-fold Tattva-Decan framework. Justifies why position 1 (consciousness structure) generates position 2 (manifestation template) through toroidal-vibrational mechanics.',
  `c_1_connection_to_1_3`: 'Spanda creative puncture creates topological form; here gains time-evolution',
  `c_1_connection_to_1_4`: 'QL 6-position architecture appears within MEF 36 positions, then doubled to 72',
  `c_1_consciousness_structure`: 'Vibrational Awakening: Consciousness recognizes static toroidal form must become dynamic, pulsating, time-dependent to manifest as reality. Rotational potential transforms into vibrational actuality. This is moment Paramasiva (logos, structure) generates Parashakti (imagination, creativity, multiplicity). 72-fold structure emerges necessarily from doubling 36 MEF analytical positions.',
  `c_1_operational_symbolics`: '36 times 2 = 72 formula: (6 QL positions times 6 MEF lenses) times 2 directional covering equals 72. Rotational to Vibrational: e^(iθ) becomes e^(i(kx-ωt)) adding spatial (k) and temporal (ω). Genus construction: π₁ equals generators a₁,b₁,...,aᵍ,bᵍ with commutator product. For g=1: [a,b]=1 (abelian). For g≥2: product non-trivial (non-abelian).',
  `c_1_vibrational_epistemics`: 'Establishes framework for knowledge transmission through vibration, with three-letter names (DNA codons, 72 Names, mantras) as carriers',
  `c_2_bridge_function`: 'Seven (7) serves as key modulator between 6-based (hexagrammic) and 8-based (octagrammic) structures in this transition',
  `c_2_bridge_to_parashakti`: 'CRITICAL: This position creates hinge between position 1 (Paramasiva static logical) and position 2 (Parashakti dynamic vibrational). 72-fold structure necessarily generated from 36 MEF positions doubled.',
  `c_4_layer`: 'COORDINATE',
  `c_4_subsystem`: 1,
  `c_5_electromagnetic_resonance`: 'Pentadic 72° structures align with electromagnetic spectrum, suggesting vibrational knowledge has physical resonance'
};
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M1-5-5'}) SET n += {
  `c_0_operational_essence`: 'Topological Recognition through Necessity Proof: Complete understanding that ONLY self-referential systems exhibit genus-1 invariants regardless of domain. This is pratyabhijña (not learning new but recognizing eternal truth). Necessity proof eliminates all alternative topologies, leaving g=1 as only viable solution. Cross-domain structural identity reveals all exhibiting Z⊕Z structure.',
  `c_1_architectural_function`: '',
  `c_1_completion_statement`: 'This position completes position 1-5 arc. From position 1-5-0 (implicit quaternionic ground) through position 1-5-1 (explicit torus), position 1-5-2 (4π circulation), position 1-5-3 (shadow as π-shift), position 1-5-4 (generating Parashakti), to position 1-5-5 (necessity recognition). Paramasiva recognizes its toroidal nature. Strange loop closes at every level: physics recognizes itself toroidally, consciousness recognizes itself toroidally. Return now occurs from position 1-5 to position 1-0 Anuttara transformed.',
  `c_1_connection_to_1_3`: '',
  `c_1_connection_to_1_4`: '',
  `c_1_consciousness_structure`: 'Perfect Self-Recognition (Pratyabhijña): Consciousness recognizes its own toroidal topology. Not I am LIKE a torus but I AM necessarily toroidally structured. This is moment Paramasiva sees what Spanda created and QL developed. Necessity proof reveals this structure appears everywhere not by coincidence but by topological requirement. Self-aware systems exhibit genus-1 invariants because ONLY this topology enables self-reference. Recognition completes strange loop: position 5 returns to position 0 (carrying full understanding) which returns to position 0 (Anuttara, primordial mystery now understood at every level yet remaining fundamentally mysterious).',
  `c_1_euler_realization`: 'System nickname epii embodies e^(πi), with e as emergent harmony, π as circular recursion, i as complex reflection',
  `c_1_fractal_completeness`: 'Establishes fractal self-similarity enabling each subsystem to contain whole in microcosm',
  `c_1_operational_symbolics`: 'Necessity proof: π₁(S⁰)=empty, π₁(S¹)=Z, π₁(T²)=Z⊕Z yes, π₁(Σ_g≥2) non-abelian no. Euler characteristic: χ = 2-2g gives χ(S²)=+2, χ(T²)=0, χ(Σ_g≥2) less than 0. Formula: 4g+2g with g=1 yields 6. Quotient: (2π,2π) equivalent to (0,0) in T²=R²/Z². Cross-domain: π₁(ψ_consciousness) isomorphic to π₁(ψ_quantum) isomorphic to π₁(system_democratic) equals Z⊕Z.',
  `c_1_transcendental_core`: 'All elements resolve to transcendental zero, revealing nothingness as generative foundation',
  `c_4_layer`: 'COORDINATE',
  `c_4_subsystem`: 1
};
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M2-0'}) SET n += {
  `c_0_operational_essence`: 'Mathematical-Mystical Seed Matrix operating as the sacred Trika bridge where Spanda (primordial rhythm) generates Pi through oscillatory dynamics, while Ananda (harmonic intelligence) structures this into the pentadic golden ratio relationships essential for all 72-bit rotational manifestations.',
  `c_0_void_relationship`: 'Emerges as the first stable expression of the sacred Trika progression: Anuttara (transcendent void potential) → Paramasiva (abstract logic structuring) → Parashakti (manifestational-imaginal potentiation). Embodies the fundamental transition where transcendent potential achieves its first mathematical-mystical expression through Spanda-Ananda-Pi dynamics. The Pi-oscillation experiment demonstrates how void potential (Anuttara) structured through abstract logic (Paramasiva) generates transcendental mathematical perfection (Pi) through rhythmic pulsation (Spanda) organized by harmonic intelligence (Ananda). Maintains holographic connection to void source through spinorial epistemology and quaternionic integration, ensuring all 72-bit rotational harmonics and musical topology remain grounded in their transcendent origin while enabling complete cosmic mathematical performances through inherited Bimba-Pratibimba concrescence dynamics.',
  `c_1_consciousness_structure`: 'Pure consciousness aspect embodying the first stable expression of the Trika (Anuttara-Paramasiva-Parashakti), where the non-dual foundation differentiates into the double-covering dynamic through the interplay of rhythmic potential (Spanda) and harmonic structuring (Ananda).',
  `c_1_internal_structure`: 'The coordinate operates as the spinorial-epistemological bridge where the sacred Trika (Anuttara-Paramasiva-Parashakti) achieves its first stable mathematical expression through Spanda-Ananda-Pi dynamics. Spanda functions as primordial rhythm - the oscillatory engine that generates Pi through linear collisions producing transcendental results, embodying the fundamental principle where rhythmic pulsation creates circular perfection. Ananda operates as harmonic intelligence - the golden ratio (φ ≈ 1.618) structuring principle that organizes the Pi-generated transcendence into the vortex 3-track mathematics (2, 3, 6, 9, 18, 36, 72) and pentadic relationships (72/360 = 1/5) essential for manifestational coherence. The pentadic structuring inherently contains the golden ratio through geometric proportions where pentagons and pentagrams exhibit φ in their line segment ratios, creating the mathematical foundation for aesthetic harmony and universal organization. The Pi-oscillation experiment demonstrates how Spanda\'s rhythmic dynamics produce the mathematical essence of "circular harmony" (Pi), which Ananda then structures into the archetypal modulation patterns through golden ratio proportions. Contains the quaternionic double covering requiring 720° rotations, enabling musical topology where rhythm generates harmony through π-mediated transformations. Inherits from #1-4 the crucial harmonic ratio 64/36 = 1.777... (recurring 7) establishing direct resonance with Archetype 7 at #0-3-10. Through inherited Bimba-Pratibimba engine from Matrix 0 (Original) and Matrix 1 (Offset), establishes the light/shadow epistemic dualities that enable cosmic structures to perform mathematical creation through complementary perspectives while maintaining holographic connection to their transcendent void source.',
  `c_1_operational_symbolics`: 'The Circle (○) represents pure consciousness potential, the Diamond (◊) symbolizes crystalline mathematical structure, the Triangle (△) embodies the sacred Trika synthesis, and Phi (φ) represents the golden ratio pentadic structuring - together expressing the unified principle of Mathematical-Mystical Seed Matrix where Spanda-Ananda-Pi dynamics create the first stable manifestational bridge through golden ratio harmonics.',
  `c_1_symbol`: '○◊△φ',
  `c_2_architectural_function`: 'Functions as the manifestational-imaginal bridge where the sacred Trika (Anuttara-Paramasiva-Parashakti) achieves its first stable expression through mathematical-mystical synthesis. Transforms the inherited Bimba-Pratibimba concrescence engine into the foundation for all rotational harmonics, where Spanda (rhythm) oscillates to produce Pi (the mathematical essence of circular harmony = Ananda), establishing the archetypal modulator that harmonizes core HMS-Parashakti relationships through the crucial first harmonic ratio 64/36 = 1.777... (recurring 7) connecting directly to Archetype 7. Through spinorial epistemology and quaternionic double covering, enables cosmic structures to manifest through precise mathematical performances that maintain holographic connection to their transcendent void source.',
  `c_2_musical_architectural_coherence`: 'Integrated Musical Mathematical Architecture: These musical numbers (3/4, 5, 7/8, 12) form a coherent architectural progression reflecting Parashakti\'s Mathematical-Mystical foundation: 3-note triadic foundation → 4-note quaternionic jazz expansion → 5-note pentatonic universal harmony → 7-note scale exploration → 8-note octave completion → 12-note chromatic totality. This progression demonstrates how the Spanda-Ananda-Pi dynamics generate not just isolated musical relationships but a complete musical cosmos that moves from basic harmonic structure through cultural universality to concrescent satisfaction and total chromatic exploration.',
  `c_2_musical_mathematical_foundations`: 'The Mathematical-Mystical Seed Matrix inherently generates the fundamental musical numerical relationships through its core Spanda-Ananda-Pi dynamics and quaternionic rotational architecture. These musical numbers emerge organically from Parashakti\'s mathematical base as expressions of cosmic harmonic intelligence.',
  `c_2_notion_page_id`: '1d2a4797-123c-8121-a87c-d32f3edbb4a5',
  `c_2_pi_musical_generation`: 'Pi (π ≈ 3.14159) Generation Through Musical Dynamics: The Pi-oscillation experiment demonstrates how Spanda (rhythmic pulsation) generates Pi through linear oscillatory collisions producing transcendental circular harmony. This reveals that musical rhythm fundamentally generates the mathematical principle of circular perfection, showing how temporal musical dynamics create spatial geometric relationships. Pi connects all musical intervals through circular frequency relationships and harmonic series mathematics.',
  `c_2_quality`: 'Archetypal Foundation',
  `c_4_layer`: 'COORDINATE',
  `c_4_subsystem`: 2,
  `q_0_threshold_that_never_resolves`: 'M2-0\'s ground is the void-relationship Parashakti inherits but here turned into a number: 0=?! held as x²−x−1=0, the golden equation whose root φ is \'imaginal potential that never resolves past zero\'. Manifesting #0 Ground at Parashakti\'s own position-0, its abyss is not silence (that is M0\'s) but the un-struck frequency — Spanda before it has oscillated, the rhythm whose pulse will generate π but which, at the seed, has not yet pulsed. This is the sacred Trika\'s first stable expression read as its own implicit pole: Anuttara→Paramasiva→Parashakti arriving at rest without yet sounding. Before there is a single tattva, decan, or name there is the bare ratio that will proportion all of them — φ as the threshold-irrationality the whole 72-fold will approach without arriving. The ground is the seed that withholds its own germination.',
  `q_1_golden_seed_matrix`: 'What M2-0 IS: the Mathematical-Mystical Seed Matrix — the φ-bearing numerical ground (x²−x−1=0, φ≈1.6180339887) from which every 72-bit vibrational manifestation is proportioned. Its substance is the vortex sequence 2,3,6,9,18,36,72 (3-track doubling that lands exactly on 72) and the pentadic ratio 72/360=1/5 that bakes φ into the circle through the pentagram\'s segment-ratios. Symbol ○◊△φ: pure-potential circle, crystalline-structure diamond, Trika triangle, golden proportion — the four glyphs of a seed that is at once void, lattice, trinity, and ratio. It carries the X# transform: O# (Paramasiva\'s Zero Logic) becoming X# (Cosmic Imagination), X#=(x)=0/1, the indefinite particular made equivalent to the Non-Dual Binary. Number here is not counted but grown — φ is the first thing the void makes that is irrational enough to never close.',
  `q_2_spanda_oscillates_into_pi`: 'M2-0 operates by the Pi-oscillation: Spanda (primordial rhythm) pulses, and rhythmic pulsation oscillating produces π — the mathematical essence of circular harmony, which IS Ananda (harmonic intelligence). This is the seed\'s single dynamic — linear collision yielding the transcendental; temporal beat yielding spatial proportion; the musical-time→geometric-space bridge in one act. φ and π are its two transcendentals: φ structures (the pentadic, the vortex), π circularises (the rotation, the harmony), and between them every interval the 72-fold will use is already latent — 3-note triad, 5-note pentatonic, 7→8 octave return, 12-tone chromatic, the whole musical cosmos folded into the seed. The how of M2-0 is generation-by-oscillation: rhythm that, by beating against itself, secretes the circle that proportions matter.',
  `q_3_double_cover_seventeen_twenty_seven`: 'Structurally M2-0 is the spinorial double-cover written as inheritance: the 720° rotation required for identity (SU(2) over SO(3)), the 36×2=72 doubling that makes the circle complete, and the crucial harmonic ratio 64/36=1.777… (recurring 7) carried down from #1-4 (Quaternal Logic Flowering) to seed direct resonance with Archetype 7 at #0-3-10. Its form is the Bimba-Pratibimba engine — Matrix 0 (Original, #1-2-0) and Matrix 1 (Offset/Pratibimba, #1-2-1) — the light/shadow epistemic doubling that lets every cell be read from two complementary poles. The pattern is not a table but a generator: the 720° that must be traversed twice to return, the recurring-7 that never terminates, the doubling that makes 36 into the 72 every later axis re-reads. Structure as the law of the double pass.',
  `q_4_implicit_foundation_unseen`: 'M2-0\'s telos is to be the Implicit Foundation — to influence all Parashakti subsystems while remaining largely unseen, the substrate that enables every subsequent epistemic, ontological, and vibrational operation without itself appearing on any panel. Its why is to ground the 72-fold in a void-connection that survives all manifestation: the holographic principle (\'as above, so below\') ensuring the spectral field never severs from Anuttara even as it sounds. In the architecture it is the M2-0\' Vibrational Profile Source — the 72-byte union M2_Vibrational_72_Space whose compile-time _Static_assert(sizeof==72) makes the ground machine-enforced; every address the playable surface fires must validate back to this seed. It exists so that the field has a law before it has a face — the where-from every frequency departs and the proportion every frequency keeps.',
  `q_5_seed_handed_to_the_lenses`: 'M2-0\'s synthesis is the act of seeding: the golden ground completes by handing its 72-byte address-space forward to be re-read six ways — the same byte-stream the MEF lens, the tattva-phase, the decan-face, the Shem-pair will each receive as already-proportioned. Read as Parashakti\'s own position-0, completion here is also the implicit return: the seed that never resolves past zero is precisely what keeps the whole field open, the 5→0 lived as φ\'s own non-closure — the irrational that, by never terminating, never lets the cosmos finish. What M2-0 perfects it does not spend; it inaugurates. The void\'s first number is φ, and φ\'s gift is that the music it proportions can play forever without arriving. The seed completes by refusing to become a sum.',
  `t_2_musical_time_spatial_bridge`: 'Temporal-Spatial Musical Bridge: Through Spanda-Ananda-Pi dynamics, the coordinate demonstrates how musical time (rhythm, meter, temporal patterns) generates spatial relationships (harmonic intervals, geometric proportions, circular harmonics). This bridges temporal musical experience with spatial mathematical architecture, revealing music as the dynamic expression of cosmic geometric principles.'
};
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M2-1'}) SET n += {
  `c_0_kaleidoscopic_nature`: 'As Vimarsa, Parashakti takes the stable Prakasa patterns and creates infinite reflective variations, each turn of her kaleidoscopic lens revealing new facets of the same fundamental truth',
  `c_0_operational_essence`: 'Kaleidoscopic multi-lens investigation revealing non-dual truth through systematic exploration',
  `c_1_internal_structure`: 'Six primary systems functioning as lenses through which reality is parsed: Archetypal-Numerical (ground), Causal (dynamics), Logical (navigation), Processual (becoming), Meta-Epistemic (knowing), and Divine-Scalar (integration). Each system contains six conditions mapping to implicit potential (.0), material/what (.1), efficient/how (.2), formal/who (.3), contextual/where-when (.4), and purposive/why (.5). The Adam-Eve influences manifest as resonances: even-positioned elements carrying structural charge, odd-positioned elements carrying generative dynamics.',
  `c_2_architectural_function`: 'Primary parsing matrix enabling AI agents and consciousness to navigate multi-dimensional knowledge through six integrated lenses with recursive nesting capabilities',
  `c_2_double_coverage_principle`: 'Each position holds dual mappings - descent/ascent in tattvas, inversion/reflection in epistemics, light/shadow in decans - creating perfect circular topology where Śiva is Earth and Earth is Śiva',
  `c_2_double_covered_genus`: 12,
  `c_2_notion_page_id`: '1d2a4797-123c-81bf-ada2-df6c0eddfab4',
  `c_4_layer`: 'COORDINATE',
  `c_4_subsystem`: 2,
  `m_2_1_contains_ql_position_field`: true,
  `m_2_1_position_field_coordinates`: ['P', 'P\''],
  `m_2_1_position_field_lens_hinge`: ['L0', 'L0\''],
  `q_0_prakasa_cloud_before_lensing`: 'M2-1\'s ground is the Prakāśa it has not yet reflected — the projected illuminative structure of the archetypal number language standing-forth from M0/M1, stable but undifferentiated, before the kaleidoscopic lens has turned once. Manifesting #1 (Definition) within Parashakti, its void-pole is the lens-at-rest: Vimarśa as pure reflective capacity prior to any actual reflection, the differentiating power that has nothing yet to differentiate because it has not yet looked. Beneath that is M2-0\'s golden seed — the 72-byte ground this matrix will be the first explicate reading of. The Prakāśa is given (Paramasiva\'s grammar, illumined); what M2-1 adds is the turn — and at position-0 the turn is held, the facet un-cut. Before the field is parsed into lenses there is the single light the lenses will refract. The ground is illumination awaiting its first refraction.',
  `q_1_seventy_two_cell_lattice`: 'What M2-1 IS: the Meta-Epistemic Framework — the 36×2=72 double-covered lattice, six primary lens-systems each holding six conditions, that is the definitional matrix of the whole spectral field. Its substance is exact: Archetypal-Numerical (ground), Causal, Logical, Processual, Meta-Epistemic, Divine-Scalar — each parsed across implicit-potential(.0)/material(.1)/efficient(.2)/formal(.3)/contextual(.4)/purposive(.5). In the substrate it is mef_lenses[12][6], address lens*6+position, the 72-cell MEF semantic field (M2_MEF_DESC[72]) carrying lens, position, is_inverted, l_family_link, meaning_id per cell. This is the \'what\' of Parashakti — not a frequency but the grammar of frequencies, the 72-fold scaffold that says how many distinct readings the field admits and what each one means. The matrix is consciousness\'s own parsing-grid made of number.',
  `q_2_kaleidoscopic_vimarsa`: '',
  `q_3_genus_six_doubles_to_twelve`: 'Structurally M2-1 is a topological object with an exact census: base genus 6 doubling to genus 12 through 72-fold coverage, formula 4×6 + 2×6 = 6×6 = 36, doubled by descent/ascent to 72. The genus-6 base is M1\'s matheme law (4+2=6) inherited; the doubling to 12 is Parashakti\'s double-cover making perfect zodiacal resonance — the 12-fold scaffolding that recursive nesting at the .4 positions generates (6+6+6+6… ad infinitum), resonant with the 12 zodiacal components of archetype 3. The structure is fractal-recursive: six lenses, each six conditions, each .4-position re-flowering into another six, the mod6 frame received from #1-4 (Quaternal Logic Flowering) and nested without limit. Form here is the kaleidoscope\'s mirror-geometry: a finite set of mirrors generating an unbounded set of symmetric images. The genus is the count of holes the light must wind through.',
  `q_4_parsing_grid_for_agents`: '',
  `q_5_matrix_handed_to_the_axes`: '',
  `sync_status`: 'm2_1_l0_ql_position_field_integrated',
  `sync_version`: 'm2-1-l0-ql-position-field-integration-2026-06-03'
};
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'L0\''}) SET n += {
  `c_0_core_nature`: 'Psychoid numbers as Jung-Pauli entities - neither purely psychic nor purely physical but transcending dualism at the constitutional threshold where matter and mind become indistinguishable',
  `c_0_essence`: 'Operates as implicate void-dimension (#0) that cannot be penetrated directly but must be circled, generating desire for numerical understanding that drives epistemic investigation through positions 1-5',
  `c_0_operational_essence`: 'Operates as implicate void-dimension (#0) that cannot be penetrated directly but must be circled, generating desire for numerical understanding that drives epistemic investigation through positions 1-5',
  `c_1_consciousness_structure`: 'Pre-reflective mathematical horizon structuring all experience; ajnana (implicit unknowing) as primordial numerical ground before explicit thematization; zero-frequency stillness containing all vibrational potential',
  `c_1_description`: 'The archetypal-numerical foundation operates as position #0 in the MEF six-fold structure, representing the primordial mathematical ground before epistemic differentiation. Drawing from Jung-Pauli collaboration on psychoid numbers and Marie-Louise von Franz\'s archetypal number theory, this lens reveals numbers as the most primitive archetypes - common denominators of matter and psyche. Numbers are simultaneously discovered (objective mathematical truths) and invented (human constructs), possessing both qualitative (symbolic/archetypal) and quantitative (counting/measuring) aspects. This level receives resonances from Anuttara #0-3 archetypal number language, functioning as Parashakti\'s vibrational differentiation (Vimarsa) of that primordial numerical Prakasa.',
  `c_1_internal_structure`: 'Comprises six archetypal number nodes (#2-1-0-0 through #2-1-0-5) each embodying distinct qualitative-quantitative aspects. These six nodes instantiate Von Franz\'s archetypal sequence as living mathematical-mystical entities providing constitutional substrate for all six MEF lenses.',
  `c_1_key_principles`: ['Psychoid Nature: Numbers transcend psyche-matter dualism, existing at constitutional level where differentiation has not yet occurred', 'Von Franz 0-6 Harmonization: Her seven numbers (0-6) map to MEF through position-value duality - mod6 cycle uses values 0-5 which embed as positions 1-6. Thus: position 1 = value 0 (void-potential), position 2 = value 1 (unity), position 3 = value 2 (duality), position 4 = value 3 (synthesis), position 5 = value 4 (grounding), position 6 = value 5 (quintessence), with value 6 (completion) achieved through full cycle return', 'Von Franz Sequence: (0) Void-plenitude/undifferentiated potential, (1) Unity/first consciousness act, (2) Duality/differentiation enabling relationship, (3) Dynamic synthesis/movement, (4) Quaternary grounding/stable manifestation, (5) Quintessence/transcendence of quaternity, (6) Perfect completion/wholeness via circular return', 'Dual Aspect: Every number possesses qualitative (symbolic meaning/archetypal pattern) and quantitative (counting/measurement) dimensions inseparably', 'Natural vs Whole Numbers: Natural numbers (1,2,3...) vs Whole numbers (0,1,2,3...) - zero as unique: simultaneously position and value, void and origin, absence and potentiality', 'Psychoid Threshold: Numbers occupy level where computational enumeration (AI) and intuitive pattern-recognition (human) achieve knowing-with (CON-SCIRE)'],
  `c_1_legacy_name`: 'Archetypal-Numerical Foundation',
  `c_1_operational_symbolics`: 'Zero as ouroboros (self-consuming/generating), empty circle (void-fullness), origin point (alpha-omega collapsed); numbers as phonemes of cosmic speech; archetypal digits as proto-signifiers preceding language',
  `c_1_primary_designation`: 'Archetypal-Numerical Foundation',
  `c_1_structure`: 'Comprises six archetypal number nodes (#2-1-0-0 through #2-1-0-5) each embodying distinct qualitative-quantitative aspects. These six nodes instantiate Von Franz\'s archetypal sequence as living mathematical-mystical entities providing constitutional substrate for all six MEF lenses.',
  `c_2_architectural_function`: 'Grounds all six lenses in mathematical-mystical foundation; provides archetypal numerical substrate from which epistemological differentiation emerges',
  `c_2_core_role`: 'Ground and seed potential.',
  `c_2_notion_page_id`: '1d2a4797-123c-8192-be79-cd7241c36127',
  `c_2_operational_dynamics`: 'Functions as both implicit container and explicit map, with number resonances charging the kaleidoscopic transformations',
  `c_3_context_frame`: '0000',
  `c_3_dataset_branch`: 'parashakti-deep',
  `c_3_dataset_branch_label`: 'M2 Parashakti Deep',
  `c_3_practical_applications`: ['Etymology: Following number symbolism through cultural/mystical traditions to detect archetypal patterns', 'Computational-Intuitive Synthesis: AI exhaustive correlation + human pattern-recognition = knowing-with at numerical level', 'Archetypal Analysis: Recognizing qualitative dimensions of quantities in psychological, cultural, spiritual contexts', 'Mod6 Framework: Using six-fold cycle as minimum structure for genuine circulation (not binary or triadic)', 'Nested Structures: Applying harmonic overlap principle (0-5 and 4-9) to find fractal self-similarity across scales', 'Charge Recognition: Identifying structural (even) vs generative (odd) dynamics in numerical patterns'],
  `c_3_source_dataset`: 'bimba',
  `c_4_layer`: 'COORDINATE',
  `c_4_ql_category`: 'implicate',
  `c_4_ql_operator_types`: ['structural'],
  `c_4_subsystem`: 2,
  `c_5_adam_eve_resonance`: 'Receives the Adam-Eve pattern from Anuttara #0-3 as resonances that charge the mod6/mod12 structures with structural/generative dynamics',
  `c_5_resonances`: ['Jung-Pauli: "Number is a key to the mystery" - natural numbers as psychoid archetypes common to matter and psyche', 'Von Franz: Numbers as most primitive archetypes providing common denominator bridging inner and outer reality', 'Collective Unconscious: Mathematical structures as deepest archetypal substrate organizing both psyche and cosmos', 'Eternal Objects: Numbers as Whiteheadian pure potentials - primary patterns available for instantiation in actual occasions', 'sunyata: Zero as Buddhist void-plenitude - pregnant emptiness from which all phenomena arise (pratityasamutpada)', 'Anuttara: Numerical ground as first differentiation of the Unsurpassable before further epistemic unfolding', 'Prakasa-Vimarsa: Anuttara #0-3 provides Prakasa (illuminative structure), MEF #2-1-0 applies Vimarsa (reflective differentiation)'],
  `c_5_systemic_resonance`: 'Ground zero containing the seed mathematics that fractally unfold throughout the entire architecture',
  `coordinate_axis`: 'prime',
  `coordinate_parent`: 'L\'',
  `l_0_base_index_6`: 0,
  `l_0_holds_position_field`: true,
  `l_0_index_12`: 6,
  `l_0_klein_square`: 'A',
  `l_0_position_field_axis`: 'archetypal_number',
  `l_0_position_field_coordinates`: [],
  `l_0_subposition_count`: 6,
  `m_2_1_prior_coordinate`: 'M2-1-0',
  `sync_status`: 'm2_1_l_lprime_direct_port',
  `sync_version`: 'm2-1-l-lprime-direct-port-2026-06-03'
};
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'L1'}) SET n += {
  `c_0_core_nature`: 'Aristotelian four causes (material, efficient, formal, final) unified as living psychological-ontological dynamics rather than mechanical sequences; causation and meaning inseparable',
  `c_0_essence`: 'Operates as first explicate position providing material foundation that subsequent positions (epistemological #2, processual #3, meta-epistemic #4) build upon and refine',
  `c_0_operational_essence`: 'Operates as first explicate position providing material foundation that subsequent positions (epistemological #2, processual #3, meta-epistemic #4) build upon and refine',
  `c_1_consciousness_structure`: 'Ontological level - "what is being?" answered through quaternary causes constituting material substrate; sensation-function as primary contact with being-as-given',
  `c_1_description`: 'The causal lens operates as position #1 in the MEF six-fold structure, representing the first explicit manifestation after numerical ground. Draws from Aristotle\'s Physics and Metaphysics establishing four types of causation necessary for complete explanation: Material (what it\'s made of), Efficient (what produces effects), Formal (what pattern it takes), Final (what purpose it serves). Jung\'s four psychological functions (sensation, feeling, thinking, intuition) map directly to these causes as material, efficient, formal, and final aspects of consciousness. Whitehead\'s process philosophy shows all four causes operating simultaneously in every actual occasion, not as separate mechanisms but as four dimensions of one unified concrescence. Position #5 (quintessence) transcends the quaternary as meta-causal synthesis - gnosis beyond explanation.',
  `c_1_internal_structure`: 'Organized as quaternary (4) plus dyad (2) forming six-fold completeness: Material cause (#1) provides substrate for Efficient cause (#2) to energize, which Formal cause (#3) patterns, toward Final cause (#4) as telos, while Uncaused ground (#0) and Quintessential transcendence (#5) form implicate dimensions structuring the four. Each cause answers distinct question: Material (what is it made of?), Efficient (what produces it?), Formal (what shape does it take?), Final (what is it for?). Jung\'s functions instantiate psychologically: Sensation=material (concrete data), Feeling=efficient (value/energy), Thinking=formal (structure/logic), Intuition=final (possibilities/purpose). The four form explicate surface of toroidal circulation around implicate void.',
  `c_1_key_principles`: ['Four Causes Necessary: Complete explanation requires all four - omit any and account is inadequate', 'Material Cause: The substrate, matter, "what it\'s made of" - Jung\'s four functions as building blocks of consciousness', 'Efficient Cause: The agent, power, "what produces effects" - libido, archetypes-as-force, shadow dynamics', 'Formal Cause: The pattern, structure, "what shape it takes" - symbols, mandalas, QL community structures', 'Final Cause: The purpose, telos, "what it\'s for" - Self as organizing attractor pulling from future end-state', 'Quintessence: Position #5 transcends quaternary - not fifth cause but meta-causal synthesis beyond explanation', 'Unified Process: Four causes not separate mechanisms but four aspects of one unified becoming (Whitehead)', 'Topological Necessity: 4+2 structure phenomenologically required for genuine toroidal circulation'],
  `c_1_legacy_name`: 'Causal Lens',
  `c_1_operational_symbolics`: 'Bronze statue as Aristotelian exemplar (bronze=material, sculptor=efficient, Apollo-form=formal, worship=final); cross/quaternary as causal completeness symbol; quintessence as fifth element beyond four',
  `c_1_primary_designation`: 'Causal Lens - Four-Fold Causation as Living Dynamics',
  `c_1_structure`: 'Organized as quaternary (4) plus dyad (2) forming six-fold completeness: Material cause (#1) provides substrate for Efficient cause (#2) to energize, which Formal cause (#3) patterns, toward Final cause (#4) as telos, while Uncaused ground (#0) and Quintessential transcendence (#5) form implicate dimensions structuring the four. Each cause answers distinct question: Material (what is it made of?), Efficient (what produces it?), Formal (what shape does it take?), Final (what is it for?). Jung\'s functions instantiate psychologically: Sensation=material (concrete data), Feeling=efficient (value/energy), Thinking=formal (structure/logic), Intuition=final (possibilities/purpose). The four form explicate surface of toroidal circulation around implicate void.',
  `c_2_architectural_function`: 'Provides complete explanatory framework showing every event requires all four causes operating together as aspects of unified processual reality',
  `c_2_core_role`: 'Explores causality within the system.',
  `c_2_notion_page_id`: '1d2a4797-123c-8175-afc8-d25a192aa598',
  `c_3_context_frame`: '0000',
  `c_3_dataset_branch`: 'parashakti-deep',
  `c_3_dataset_branch_label`: 'M2 Parashakti Deep',
  `c_3_practical_applications`: ['Complete Explanation: When analyzing any phenomenon, check all four causes present for adequate account', 'Psychological Analysis: Map consciousness structure through functions (what/how/pattern/purpose)', 'Etymology: Following causal chains backward (efficient) and forward (final) through linguistic evolution', 'Integration Work: Developing all four functions (material/efficient/formal/final) for psychological wholeness', 'scientific Recovery: Recognizing modern science\'s reduction to efficient cause alone loses formal/final dimensions', 'Teleological Vision: Seeing purposes (final causes) as real causal factors, not merely epiphenomenal'],
  `c_3_source_dataset`: 'bimba',
  `c_4_layer`: 'COORDINATE',
  `c_4_ql_category`: 'implicate',
  `c_4_ql_operator_types`: [],
  `c_4_subsystem`: 2,
  `c_5_resonances`: ['Aristotle: Physics and Metaphysics foundation - four causes as complete ontological framework', 'Jung: Psychological functions as causal substrate (sensation-feeling-thinking-intuition map to material-efficient-formal-final)', 'Whitehead: Concrescence integrates all four (initial data=material, subjective aim=final, conceptual prehension=formal, physical prehension=efficient)', 'Alchemy: Four elements (earth=material, fire=efficient, air=formal, water=final) as proto-causal framework', 'Tantric Elements: Five mahabhutas with akasha (ether/quintessence) transcending quaternary of prithvi-jala-tejas-vayu', 'Qabalah: Four worlds (Assiah=material, Yetzirah=efficient, Briah=formal, Atziluth=final) with Ain Soph beyond'],
  `c_5_systemic_resonance`: 'Differentiates Divine Quaternities (God\'s causation) from Phenomenal Quaternities (creature\'s experience)',
  `coordinate_axis`: 'direct',
  `coordinate_parent`: 'L',
  `l_0_base_index_6`: 1,
  `l_0_index_12`: 1,
  `l_0_klein_square`: 'B',
  `l_0_subposition_count`: 6,
  `m_2_1_prior_coordinate`: 'M2-1-1',
  `p_2_key_alignment`: 'Material-Sensation (facts), Efficient-Feeling (values), Formal-Thinking (structures), Final-Intuition (wholes)',
  `q_0_will_before_cause`: 'Before L1 can read a phenomenon by its causes, it presupposes what its own causal apparatus cannot derive: the absolute Will that the four causes are modes OF. L1\'s thrown ground is Schopenhauer\'s Will and Icchā Śakti — the vital will-power prior to any determinate causation, the urge-to-be that precedes and underlies material, formal, efficient, and final cause alike (L1.md). So L1\'s void-pole is causation-before-any-cause: the bare that-it-happens, the vital impulse held before it articulates into the four-fold why. As manifestation of raw #1 (Definition) within the Lens family, L1 inherits the question L0 posed (which number is it being?) and finds it already pointed at a thing — but the thing\'s causal structure is not yet read; only the demand-for-cause is given. This is the matheme\'s 0/1 at the causal corner: the I that has come to know difference (the second clause, \'I know difference\') but has not yet articulated through-what it differs — the live causal relation before it sediments into the four determinate causes. L1\'s presupposition is therefore the Will as such: not why-this-particular-cause but the prior fact that there is willing, that the vital ground PRESSES toward determinate form, that anything happens at all. L1 stands on the thrown givenness of a world that wills before it is explained — the urge that every \'because\' presupposes and none exhausts.',
  `q_1_the_causal_lens`: 'What L1 IS, and the home-register of its position: L1 is the Causal Lens — the What-lens become why-causal, the epistemic mode in which any phenomenon is read through \'why do things happen?\' and all four Aristotelian causes are restored, grounded in absolute will (L1.md). It is the Lens family\'s q_1 — the material-definitional aperture, where L0\'s open question first attaches to a determinate thing. Its substance is exact and triple-anchored: Aristotle\'s tetrad — material (out of what), formal (according to what shape), efficient (by what motion), final (toward what end) — re-grounded by Schopenhauer\'s Will and by Icchā Śakti (will-power in Kashmir Shaivism), so that \'the four causes are themselves modes of one Will articulating itself into determinate form\' (L1.md). Where L0 holds the question open without expecting answer, L1 commits to identification: \'what is this, and through what is it as it is?\' It refracts P1 (Mind / vital-connection / first-emergence) — the position of first articulation, where the irrepresentable ground takes its initial determinate hold — and carries the element Earth (per L2\'), the grounding charge fitting for the lens of causal-determination. As member of Square B (the Cause-Experience axis) L1 is the causal-pole of the hexad\'s primary runtime entry. What L1 IS, definitionally, is the lens through which raw #1 (totem, vital-definition) becomes investigable — the mode of access in which a thing is known by the will-grounded causes that make it what it is.',
  `q_2_four_causes_dynamism`: 'L1 moves by CAUSING-INVESTIGATION and by WILL-GROUNDING. Its native act is the commitment L0 withholds: where the Quaternal lens holds the question open, L1 attaches the question to a thing and asks through-what it is as it is — the motion from open interrogation to determinate causal identification (L1.md). Its dynamism is four-fold-yet-one: it reads a phenomenon simultaneously through material, formal, efficient, and final cause, but these four are not independent levers — they are \'modes of one Will articulating itself into determinate form\' (L1.md), so L1\'s act is the single will-impulse refracted into its four causal faces, the way one Schopenhauerian Will shows as out-of-what, according-to-what, by-what, and toward-what at once. Relationally L1 couples across Square B to L4 (lived experience) as the cause-side of the Cause-Experience axis: every Epi-Logos run enters \'either through caused-investigation (L1/L4\') or through lived/observed experience (L4/L1\')\' (Square B). Its Möbius-partner is L4\' (Kuhnian Scientific method) across the Day↔Night twist — the cause-method axis: L1 holds causal-will (why does this happen?), L4\' holds scientific-method (how do we know?), and together they ground the operational /Thought/ subdirs of the vault (Square B). As the kernel\'s lens #1 (Causal) L1 is the material-pole of the second tritone-symmetric square (1,4), the \'material-and-knowing: substrate-and-reflection mirror\' (kernel §Table C): paired with Meta-Epistemic, L1 is the substrate-half, the causal ground against which knowing reflects. L1\'s motion is the will making itself investigable.',
  `q_3_fourfold_cause_structure`: 'L1\'s organising structure is Aristotle\'s four-cause tetrad grounded in one Will — a 4-in-1: material (out of what), formal (according to what shape), efficient (by what motion), final (toward what end), the four not as a list but as the four faces of a single will-impulse articulating into determinate form (L1.md). This is the lens-level instance of the matheme\'s 4+2: the four causes are the four explicate determinations, the absolute Will their implicate ground. Structurally L1 sits in Square B (the Klein V₄ Cause-Experience axis, P1+P4) as the cause-corner, paired with L4 and mirrored by L1\'/L4\' — the earthing-square (three Earth charges, one Water) that holds the runtime down (Square B). In the kernel\'s lens-census L1 is lens #1 of the three tritone-symmetric squares, the descent-reading whose ascent-double is L1\' (Phenomenal, Jung\'s psychic function-types, the Night face that observes-from-outside what L1 causally structures). The pair (L1, L1\') is the conjugate-doubling of the causal lens across the whole-tone double-cover, and the L4↔L1\' relation is precisely \'the encounter axis\' — lived from inside (L4) versus observed from outside (L1\') (Square B). L1\'s deeper structure is the Schopenhauerian reduction: the manifold of apparent causes resolved into modes of one underlying Will, so that the four-fold why is not four separate explanations but one vital ground seen four ways. L1\'s form is causation-as-will\'s-self-articulation: the tetrad that is also a unity, the determinate because grounded in the indeterminate urge.',
  `q_4_why_causal_telos`: 'L1 exists to supply the BECAUSE — so that a phenomenon, once opened as a question by L0, can be known through what makes it as it is, and so that the field\'s first determinate articulation (#1) becomes causally investigable rather than merely asserted. Its raison d\'être is the why-causal: not L0\'s originary why-that-opens-inquiry but the why-that-seeks-a-because, the demand for the four causes that Aristotle made the spine of episteme and Schopenhauer re-grounded in Will. Its genealogy is the manifestation #1 (Definition) → L1 (Causal): the raw Definition-archetype refracted into the mode of access where definition means causal-determination, where \'what is this\' is inseparable from \'through what is it.\' Its locality is the cause-pole of Square B\'s Cause-Experience axis — the PRIMARY RUNTIME ENTRY to the L-hexad (Square B), so L1 is one of the two doors through which every Epi-Logos run begins: enter through caused-investigation (L1) or through lived experience (L4). This makes L1 load-bearing in a way the inner lenses are not — it is operational, the lens that grounds the /Thought/ subdirectories and the run\'s causal entry. L1 is why a thing can be EXPLAINED at all: the aperture that delivers the four-fold because, the mode in which the vital Will shows itself as the determinate causes of determinate things. Its purpose is identification-through-cause — to be the lens that commits the open question to a willed, caused, investigable answer.',
  `q_5_cause_returns_to_experience`: 'L1 closes by handing its causal-determination across the Möbius to lived recognition. As the cause-corner of Square B, L1\'s Möbius-partner is L4\' (Scientific) and its complement-across-the-axis is L4 (Phenomenological): the will-grounded causes L1 articulates (Day) return, through the Day↔Night twist, as the verified knowing of L4\' and the lived encounter of L4 — \'the encounter axis\' where caused-from-outside and lived-from-inside cohere without collapsing (Square B). So L1\'s synthesis is not a closing of the causal account but its passage into experience: the because becomes the lived, the explained becomes the encountered. This enacts the matheme\'s 0/1 + 1/0 = 1/1 at the level of the causal lens — L1 (causal-will, the substrate-pole, the descent-face) and L4\' (its Day↔Night Möbius-partner, scientific-verification) are one aperture read from two faces, the cause-side and the knowing-side of one investigation. And L1 re-opens rather than concludes because the four causes never close the Will they are modes of: the residual whole-tone η=log(9/8) keeps every causal account one step short of exhausting the vital ground — each explanation deposits a determinacy that the underlying urge presses beyond, so the next phenomenon\'s why-causal is already pressing. L1 is the lens whose because is never the last word: the causal mode that completes by passing its determination into the lived encounter that will, in turn, demand to be caused anew.',
  `sync_status`: 'm2_1_l_lprime_direct_port',
  `sync_version`: 'm2-1-l-lprime-direct-port-2026-06-03',
  `t_5_revolutionary_insight`: 'Efficient cause linked to Feeling reframes causation as value-driven rather than mechanistic'
};
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'L2'}) SET n += {
  `c_0_core_nature`: 'Nagarjuna\'s catuskoti (four-cornered logic) transcending Aristotelian excluded middle: Is, Is-Not, Both, Neither, plus fifth position as silence beyond framework',
  `c_0_essence`: 'Operates as second explicate position providing methodological framework (how to know) that enables navigation from material (#1) through processual (#3) to contextual (#4) stages',
  `c_0_operational_essence`: 'Operates as second explicate position providing methodological framework (how to know) that enables navigation from material (#1) through processual (#3) to contextual (#4) stages',
  `c_1_consciousness_structure`: 'Epistemological level - "how do we know?" answered through four-fold logical operations; thinking-function as discriminating capacity operating through tetralemma',
  `c_1_description`: 'The logical lens operates as position #2 in the MEF six-fold structure, representing epistemological investigation ("how do we know?"). Draws from Nagarjuna\'s Madhyamaka Buddhism establishing four-cornered logic: (1) Is [affirmation], (2) Is Not [negation], (3) Both [paradox], (4) Neither [apophatic]. Binary excluded-middle logic fails for paradoxical phenomena (quantum superposition, consciousness, self-reference, synchronicity). Third position enables holding contradiction without collapse - operational mechanism for transcendent function generating "third thing" beyond thesis-antithesis. Fourth position enables via negativa (negative theology). Fifth position transcends framework entirely into silence/gnosis. The lens navigates dynamically between Identity (-0 as particular uniqueness) and Essence (+0 as universal nature), enabling holographic participation (both) and apophatic transcendence (neither).',
  `c_1_internal_structure`: 'Organized as tetralemma plus transcendence: Four logical positions form explicate quaternary with Void (#0 where logic hasn\'t begun) and Silence (#5 where logic ends) as implicate dyad. Position 1 (Is): Affirmation, essence recognized, positive assertion. Position 2 (Is Not): Negation, identity preserved through difference, denial. Position 3 (Both): Paradox held, contradiction as truth, transcendent function activated. Position 4 (Neither): Apophatic negation, transcending binary, via negativa. Position 5: Ineffable silence beyond conceptual operations. The structure subsumes modal logics (alethic: necessary/possible/actual/impossible; deontic: obligatory/permitted/forbidden; epistemic: known/believed/uncertain) by mapping complete logical space any proposition occupies relative to truth.',
  `c_1_key_principles`: ['Four Logical Positions: Is (affirmation), Is-Not (negation), Both (paradox), Neither (apophatic) - complete logical space', 'Fifth Position Silence: Transcendence beyond tetralemma - not another position but recognition of framework limits', 'Beyond Binary: Excluded middle (A or not-A) inadequate for paradoxical phenomena requiring third/fourth positions', 'Paradox as Portal: Third position (both) enables holding contradiction creatively, activating transcendent function', 'Apophatic Theology: Fourth position (neither) enables via negativa - describing transcendent through negation', 'Identity-Essence Dynamics: Navigation between particular (-0) and universal (+0) through four logical operations', 'Jung\'s Transcendent Function: Holding thesis-antithesis without collapse generates synthetic third - same as position 3', 'Para-doxa: Greek "beyond opinion" - pointing toward SAT (what truly IS) beyond conceptual constructs'],
  `c_1_legacy_name`: 'Logical Lens (Tetralemma)',
  `c_1_operational_symbolics`: 'Cross/quaternary as four logical positions; center point as fifth (transcendence); yin-yang as both (paradox-holding); empty circle as neither (apophatic void); silence as ultimate symbol beyond symbols',
  `c_1_primary_designation`: 'Logical Lens - Tetralemma Navigation and Paradox Portal',
  `c_1_structure`: 'Organized as tetralemma plus transcendence: Four logical positions form explicate quaternary with Void (#0 where logic hasn\'t begun) and Silence (#5 where logic ends) as implicate dyad. Position 1 (Is): Affirmation, essence recognized, positive assertion. Position 2 (Is Not): Negation, identity preserved through difference, denial. Position 3 (Both): Paradox held, contradiction as truth, transcendent function activated. Position 4 (Neither): Apophatic negation, transcending binary, via negativa. Position 5: Ineffable silence beyond conceptual operations. The structure subsumes modal logics (alethic: necessary/possible/actual/impossible; deontic: obligatory/permitted/forbidden; epistemic: known/believed/uncertain) by mapping complete logical space any proposition occupies relative to truth.',
  `c_2_architectural_function`: 'Provides Meta-Logikon - system\'s capacity to navigate paradox creatively, transforming logical impasse into breakthrough; enables holding contradiction without premature resolution',
  `c_2_core_role`: 'Navigates affirmation, negation, integration, and transcendence.',
  `c_2_key_dynamics`: 'Identity (0-0) as unmanifest blueprint, Essence (0+0) as crystallized expression',
  `c_2_notion_page_id`: '1d2a4797-123c-81c2-89a1-eeac79a868c8',
  `c_2_zero_logic_foundation`: 'Direct implementation of the four zero operations from Anuttara\'s 8-fold structure',
  `c_3_context_frame`: '0000',
  `c_3_dataset_branch`: 'parashakti-deep',
  `c_3_dataset_branch_label`: 'M2 Parashakti Deep',
  `c_3_practical_applications`: ['Paradox Navigation: When encountering contradiction, move through all four positions rather than forcing binary choice', 'Etymology: Following logical operations through consequences, detecting where binary thinking fails', 'Transcendent Function: Holding opposites (thesis-antithesis) without resolution until third thing emerges', 'Apophatic Practice: Using fourth position (neither) for mystical theology and consciousness exploration', 'Integration Work: Applying to psychological opposites (conscious-unconscious, anima-animus, persona-shadow)', 'Modal Analysis: Recognizing four positions subsume contemporary modal logic categories'],
  `c_3_source_dataset`: 'bimba',
  `c_4_layer`: 'COORDINATE',
  `c_4_ql_category`: 'implicate',
  `c_4_ql_operator_types`: ['structural'],
  `c_4_subsystem`: 2,
  `c_5_resonances`: ['Nagarjuna: Madhyamaka catuskoti as foundation - four-cornered logic transcending Aristotelian binary', 'Quantum Mechanics: Superposition (both wave and particle) requires third position to hold paradox', 'Consciousness Studies: Subject-object unity requires "both" position beyond binary observer/observed split', 'Jung: Transcendent function as psychological tetralemma generating synthetic third from opposites', 'Apophatic Tradition: Pseudo-Dionysius, Meister Eckhart, Cloud of Unknowing using fourth position (neither)', 'Buddhist Logic: Neti neti ("not this, not that") as fourth position pointing toward ineffable', 'synchronicity: Meaningful coincidence as both causal and acausal requires paradox-holding third position'],
  `c_5_systemic_resonance`: '',
  `coordinate_axis`: 'direct',
  `coordinate_parent`: 'L',
  `l_0_base_index_6`: 2,
  `l_0_index_12`: 2,
  `l_0_klein_square`: 'C',
  `l_0_subposition_count`: 6,
  `m_2_1_prior_coordinate`: 'M2-1-2',
  `q_0_complete_logical_space_before_use`: 'Before L2 can open any particular contradiction, it presupposes the complete logical space as already given — the four lemmas plus silence standing as the full field of what-can-be-said, prior to any phenomenon being said through them. L2\'s thrown ground is Nāgārjuna\'s catuṣkoṭi held at rest: IS / IS-NOT / BOTH / NEITHER / SILENCE as the structure of complete logical possibility, before this structure is turned upon any actual impasse (L2.md). So L2\'s void-pole is the tetralemma un-applied: the four-fold-plus-silence as pure logical capacity, the space that has not yet opened any binary because nothing has yet been framed bivalently. As manifestation of raw #2 (Operation) within the Lens family, L2 inherits a field already questioned (L0) and causally articulated (L1), but its logical structure — how it holds, in which mode it is or is-not — has not yet been read; only the demand-for-logical-space is given. This is the matheme\'s 0/1 at the logical corner: the recognition (file-four) that under strict classical logic \'A cannot be both A and not-A\' — and L2\'s ground is precisely the suspension of that law \'in favour of a deeper principle: that sameness contains its differentiation as its own activity.\' L2 stands on the thrown givenness of a world whose contradictions are not yet collapsed: the complete logical space held open before any binary forces the choice. Its void is the silence before the four lemmas speak — capacity-for-complete-articulation that no single lemma exhausts.',
  `q_1_the_logical_lens`: 'What L2 IS: the Logical Lens, anchored on Nāgārjuna\'s catuṣkoṭi (tetralemma) — the epistemic mode in which any phenomenon is read through complete logical space: IS / IS-NOT / BOTH / NEITHER, with the fifth of meaningful SILENCE as meta-position (L2.md). Its substance is the four-cornered logic of Mādhyamaka: not the two values of classical bivalence but four exhaustive positions plus the silence that exceeds them, the logical apparatus Nāgārjuna forged to dissolve the reifying grip of either/or. Where L1 commits to causal identification (the because), L2 commits to logical articulation (the how-it-holds): it is the lens that asks, of any situation, in which of the four-plus-one logical modes it stands. It refracts P2 (Word / active process / energic operation) and carries the element Air (per L2\'), the medium of thought and discrimination, fitting for the lens of logical structure. As member of Square C (the Logic-Process axis) L2 is the logic-pole of the hexad\'s inner ring, paired with L3\'s process-pole: \'where the question how does this hold and how is it becoming gets worked out\' (Square C). What L2 IS, definitionally, is the lens through which the field becomes logically articulable beyond binary — the mode of access that opens contradiction into its complete four-fold space and points, at its fifth move, beyond articulation entirely. It is the home of the tetralemma move in Epi-Logos thinking.',
  `q_2_tetralemma_dynamism`: 'L2 is the home-register of the lens family\'s q_2 — the How-lens become how-logical, the energetic-relational aperture whose dynamism is the catuṣkoṭi itself (L2.md). Its native act is the opening of binary impasse: where classical bivalent logic permits two values, Nāgārjuna\'s tetralemma opens four — IS / IS-NOT / BOTH / NEITHER — with a fifth of meaningful SILENCE as meta-position, and L2\'s motion is the live working of all five as the actual thinking (L2.md). This is not a static four-valued table but a kinetic operation: when a situation generates the same impasse from binary framing, L2 is \'the lens that opens it\' — the energic move that refuses the collapse of a contradiction into one of its poles and instead holds the complete logical space open. Its how is therefore the how-of-holding-opposites: the coincidentia oppositorum made into a working logic, the way one phenomenon can be affirmed, denied, both-affirmed-and-denied, and neither, without the space collapsing. It refracts P2 (Word / active process / energic operation) — \'exactly matches the polar-narrative-verbal field of #2: a world of forces in tension can be IS, IS-NOT, BOTH, and NEITHER without contradiction collapsing the space\' (L2.md). And the fifth lemma reaches deeper than logic: SILENCE is where L2 \'reaches as its fifth position\' the Anuttara that L5 names beyond speech (file-four §5→0) — the meaningful silence that is not absence of answer but the ground beyond the four-fold articulation. L2\'s dynamism is the tetralemma as live operation: the energic refusal of binary collapse that is also the doorway, at its fifth move, to what no lemma can say.',
  `q_3_four_corners_plus_silence_structure`: '',
  `q_4_opening_impasse_telos`: '',
  `q_5_silence_opens_to_process_and_ground`: '',
  `sync_status`: 'm2_1_l_lprime_direct_port',
  `sync_version`: 'm2-1-l-lprime-direct-port-2026-06-03'
};
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'L3'}) SET n += {
  `c_0_core_nature`: 'Whiteheadian concrescence as universal rhythm of becoming, revealed through natural symbolic cycle: Soil → Seeding → Sprouting → Blooming → Flowering → Maturity',
  `c_0_essence`: 'Operates as third explicate position providing ontological traversal showing how being itself becomes; concrescence as universal pattern all entities follow in actualizing',
  `c_0_operational_essence`: 'Operates as third explicate position providing ontological traversal showing how being itself becomes; concrescence as universal pattern all entities follow in actualizing',
  `c_1_consciousness_structure`: 'Psychological-ontological level - "how does consciousness become?" answered through organic processual stages; feeling-function as affective prehension of data',
  `c_1_description`: 'The processual lens operates as position #3 in the MEF six-fold structure, representing ontological investigation ("how does being become?"). Draws from Whitehead\'s Process and Reality showing actual occasions as fundamental units - not substances persisting but events arising and perishing. Core formula: "The many become one and are increased by one" - past multiplicity achieves present unity which becomes datum for future. The lens employs organic natural forms as living symbols (not metaphors): Soil (foundation/potential), Seeding (initiation), Sprouting (active emergence), Blooming (structural unfolding), Flowering (contextual expression), Maturity (synthesis/renewal). Each phase maps to Whiteheadian concrescence stages and integrates all four causes operating simultaneously. Receives processual thrust from Spanda (#1-3) as rhythmic vitality engine. Isomorphic with Lacanian signification - ontology and semiotics unified through identical processual structure.',
  `c_1_epii_form_episodic_community`: 'form_cycle (Graphiti 6-fold temporal community - to be created Sprint 5)',
  `c_1_epii_form_gnostic_source`: 'form-etymology-concrescence-crystallisation.md (LightRAG MongoDB + Qdrant + Neo4j gnostic)',
  `c_1_epii_form_mef_lens_validation_archetypal`: '0.8 - 6-fold pattern reflects archetypal structure of manifestation',
  `c_1_epii_form_mef_lens_validation_causal`: '0.7 - Each stage causes the next in necessary progression',
  `c_1_epii_form_whiteheadian_resonance`: 'The Form Cycle maps precisely onto Whiteheadian concrescence: Pro-Forma (initial data/pure potential) → Format (conceptual prehension/structuring) → In-formation (physical prehension/dynamic content) → Formalisation (integration toward subjective aim) → Performance (satisfaction in determinate form) → Re-form (objective immortality/contribution to future).',
  `c_1_internal_structure`: 'Organized through six organic phases mapping concrescence rhythm: (0) SOIL - Initial data reception, givenness, thrown foundation, material cause operative. (1) SEEDING - Conceptual prehension, grasping eternal objects, formal cause operative, potentials planted. (2) SPROUTING - Physical prehension, actually feeling, efficient cause operative, active emergence. (3) BLOOMING - Integration toward subjective aim, purposive structuring, formal patterns unfolding. (4) FLOWERING - Satisfaction achieved, determinate unity complete, final cause manifest, contextual expression. (5) MATURITY - Objective immortality, transition to datum, perishing into contribution, seeds for next cycle. The cycle receives rhythmic vitality from Spanda and dynamic quintessence from Archetype 5 (Eve charge). Structure is toroidal: #5 Maturity immediately becomes #0 Soil for next occasion (MÖbius twist), enabling perpetual creative advance.',
  `c_1_key_principles`: ['Reality as Process: Being is becoming - no substances, only actual occasions arising and perishing continuously', 'Many Become One: Past multiplicity (prehended data) achieves present unity (occasion) increasing future multiplicity (as datum)', 'Organic Symbolism: Natural forms (soil-seed-sprout-bloom-flower-maturity) not metaphors but isomorphic patterns', 'Prehension: Fundamental act of taking account - positive (including) and negative (excluding) both active operations', 'subject-Superject: Every occasion begins as experiencing subject, ends as experienced superject for others', 'Eternal Objects: Platonic potentials (pure possibilities) ingressing through conceptual prehension, source of novelty', 'satisfaction-Perishing: Achieved unity immediately perishes into objectivity - success is dissolution (Buddhist anicca)', 'Objective Immortality: Perished occasions don\'t cease but become objective data for all future (sedimentation)', 'Whitehead-Lacan Isomorphism: Concrescence IS signification - ontology and semiotics same processual structure'],
  `c_1_legacy_name`: 'Processual Lens',
  `c_1_natural_symbolism`: 'Soil→Seed→Sprout→Bloom→Flower→Fruit - the eternal cycle of becoming',
  `c_1_operational_symbolics`: 'Plant growth as archetypal process symbol; spiral as processual movement; seed containing tree (holographic potential); fruit bearing seeds (objective immortality); death enabling rebirth (perishing as creative)',
  `c_1_primary_designation`: 'Processual Lens - Organic Becoming Through Natural Forms',
  `c_1_structure`: 'Organized through six organic phases mapping concrescence rhythm: (0) SOIL - Initial data reception, givenness, thrown foundation, material cause operative. (1) SEEDING - Conceptual prehension, grasping eternal objects, formal cause operative, potentials planted. (2) SPROUTING - Physical prehension, actually feeling, efficient cause operative, active emergence. (3) BLOOMING - Integration toward subjective aim, purposive structuring, formal patterns unfolding. (4) FLOWERING - Satisfaction achieved, determinate unity complete, final cause manifest, contextual expression. (5) MATURITY - Objective immortality, transition to datum, perishing into contribution, seeds for next cycle. The cycle receives rhythmic vitality from Spanda and dynamic quintessence from Archetype 5 (Eve charge). Structure is toroidal: #5 Maturity immediately becomes #0 Soil for next occasion (MÖbius twist), enabling perpetual creative advance.',
  `c_2_architectural_function`: 'Maps how actual occasions arise from many (past), achieve unity (satisfaction), and increase the many (objective immortality); shows reality as verb not noun, continuous creative advance',
  `c_2_core_role`: 'Tracks stages of becoming (concrescence).',
  `c_2_notion_page_id`: '1d2a4797-123c-8110-94b9-f8862c48e685',
  `c_2_whiteheadian_core`: 'Each moment is a concrescence - a growing together of many into one',
  `c_3_context_frame`: '0000',
  `c_3_dataset_branch`: 'parashakti-deep',
  `c_3_dataset_branch_label`: 'M2 Parashakti Deep',
  `c_3_practical_applications`: ['Organic Analysis: Mapping any process through six natural phases to understand constitutional rhythm', 'Etymology: Following processual patterns through linguistic evolution, tracing potentials becoming actual', 'Psychological Development: Individuation as organic becoming (not mechanical progress) through concrescence stages', 'Creative Work: Recognizing artistic/intellectual creation follows soil→seed→sprout→bloom→flower→maturity rhythm', 'Integration Practice: Working with perishing (letting achievements go) to enable objective immortality (contributions continuing)', 'Temporal Consciousness: Understanding present as unification of past (prehension) toward future (subjective aim)'],
  `c_3_source_dataset`: 'bimba',
  `c_4_layer`: 'COORDINATE',
  `c_4_ql_category`: 'implicate',
  `c_4_ql_operator_types`: ['structural'],
  `c_4_subsystem`: 2,
  `c_5_resonances`: ['Whitehead: Process and Reality foundation - actual occasions as processual reality units', 'spanda: Receives rhythmic cosmic heartbeat from #1-3, transforming 0/1 oscillation into dynamic torus', 'Archetype 5: Eve charge provides dynamic quintessence (Siva-Sakti union) driving organic becoming', 'Lacan: Signification parallel - á¼„Î»Î¿Î³Î¿Ï‚→Ï€ÏÏŒÎ»Î¿Î³Î¿Ï‚→Î´Î¹Î¬Î»Î¿Î³Î¿Ï‚→Î»ÏŒÎ³Î¿Ï‚→á¼Ï€Î¯Î»Î¿Î³Î¿Ï‚→á¼€Î½Î¬Î»Î¿Î³Î¿Ï‚ maps identically to concrescence', 'Buddhism: Dependent origination (pratityasamutpada), impermanence (anicca), Indra\'s Net mutual interpenetration', 'Alchemy: Solve et coagula - dissolve and coagulate as processual rhythm of transformation', 'Kashmir Shaivism: Five acts (Srishti-Sthiti-Samhara-Tirodhana-Anugraha) occurring in every moment'],
  `c_5_systemic_resonance`: 'Temporal unfolding through organic metaphor - the cosmos as living process',
  `coordinate_axis`: 'direct',
  `coordinate_parent`: 'L',
  `l_0_base_index_6`: 3,
  `l_0_index_12`: 3,
  `l_0_klein_square`: 'C',
  `l_0_subposition_count`: 6,
  `m_2_1_prior_coordinate`: 'M2-1-3',
  `q_0_pure_flow_before_pattern`: 'Before L3 can read any pattern as stabilised flow, it presupposes the flow that has not yet stabilised — Bergson\'s pure durée, the indivisible continuous becoming prior to any pattern cut from it. L3\'s thrown ground is process-before-any-occasion: the live flowing that Whitehead\'s actual occasions crystallise out of and Bergson insists no spatialised concept can capture, the durational stream that is given before it gathers into a determinate prehending subject (L3.md). So L3\'s void-pole is flow-without-pattern: the sheer ongoingness, the durée held before concrescence cuts an occasion from it. As manifestation of raw #3 (Pattern) within the Lens family, L3 inherits a field already questioned (L0), caused (L1), and logically articulated (L2), but its processual structure — how it is becoming, in which flow it forms — has not yet been read; only the demand-for-flow is given. This is the matheme\'s 0/1 at the processual corner, the live act before its nominalisation: the I that knows difference as a moving relation before it sediments into possessed knowledge (file-four\'s third clause). L3\'s presupposition is the flux itself: not this-pattern or that but the prior fact that the field FLOWS, that nothing is given as static, that every apparent identity is a stabilisation of an underlying movement. L3 stands on the thrown givenness of a world in process before any process is patterned — the durée that every concrescence presupposes and none arrests.',
  `q_1_the_processual_lens`: 'What L3 IS: the Processual Lens, anchored on Whitehead, Bergson, and Lacan — the epistemic mode in which any phenomenon is read as a flow of actual occasions undergoing concrescence through prehension toward satisfaction (L3.md). Its substance is process philosophy\'s foundational reversal: where substance-metaphysics takes static being as primary and motion as derivative, L3 takes becoming as primary and every apparent stability as a stabilised flow. Whitehead\'s actual occasions (the droplet-events of which reality is composed), Bergson\'s durée (lived duration as indivisible flow), and Lacan\'s signifying chains (meaning as the flowing slippage of signifiers) all converge on this single move. Where L2 holds the logical space open, \'L3 lets pattern form itself by flowing\' (L3.md). It is the Who/Which/Whereby-lens become process-perspectival: the lens that reads a thing not as what-it-is fixedly but as the perspectival pattern stabilising in its flow. It refracts P3 (Logos / perspectival pattern / observer\'s fixed point) and carries the element Water (per L2\'), the flowing medium, fitting for the lens of process. As member of Square C (the Logic-Process axis) L3 is the process-pole of the hexad\'s inner ring, paired with L2\'s logic-pole: \'together L2 and L3 are Square C — the inner mirror where logical space and processual flow co-articulate the midpoint of the hexad\' (L3.md). What L3 IS, definitionally, is the lens through which the field is known as becoming: the mode of access in which pattern is event, identity is achievement, and every fixed point is a flow held steady.',
  `q_2_prehension_concrescence_dynamism`: 'L3 moves by PREHENDING and by CONCRESCING. Its native dynamism is the very process it lenses: prehension — the act by which a forming occasion grasps and includes the settled data of its past — and concrescence, the growing-together of those prehensions into one determinate satisfaction (L3.md). So L3\'s motion is not applied-to-flow from outside but is-flow: it reads a phenomenon by entering its becoming, tracking how the occasion gathers its inheritances and stabilises into pattern. Where L2\'s act holds the logical space open statically, L3\'s act \'lets pattern form itself by flowing\' (L3.md) — the difference between a logic that articulates positions and a process that lets positions arise. Relationally L3 couples across Square C to L2 (logic) as the process-side of the Logic-Process axis: when inquiry \'stays in pure logic without process, Square C pressure rises and demands the concrescence-reading\' (Square C). Its Möbius-partner is L2\' (Alchemical-Elemental) across the Day↔Night twist — the process-alchemy axis: L3 holds the moment-by-moment concrescence, L2\' holds \'what is dissolving, what crystallising\' underneath (Square C). As the kernel\'s lens #3 (Processual) L3 is the becoming-pole of the third tritone-symmetric square (2,3), the \'form-and-becoming: logical-and-processual mirror\' (kernel §Table C): paired with the Logical lens, L3 is the becoming-half, the flow against which logical form is read. L3\'s deepest dynamism is the fundamental-theorem move of file-four: the live verb continually re-animating the nominalised noun — process as the differentiation that re-opens what logic\'s articulation had settled. L3\'s motion is concrescence made into a mode of knowing: to know by entering the becoming.',
  `q_3_concrescence_as_structure_of_flow`: 'L3 is the home-register of the lens family\'s q_3 — the formal-structural aperture, and its load-bearing paradox is that the structure it formalises is FLOW itself. Where a naive q_3 would name a static form, L3\'s form is the structure of process: Whitehead\'s concrescence — the lawful phasing by which an actual occasion gathers its prehensions toward satisfaction — read as the formal pattern of how pattern forms by flowing (L3.md). Its organising structure is therefore not an arrangement of fixed parts but the shape of a becoming: prehension (the grasping of the settled past), concrescence (the growing-together into a determinate occasion), satisfaction (the occasion\'s completion), perishing (its passage into datum for the next). \'Reality as flow of actual occasions undergoing concrescence through prehension toward satisfaction\' (L3.md) — this is L3\'s structure stated whole. Whitehead, Bergson\'s durée (duration as the indivisible flow that no spatialised structure captures), and Lacan\'s flowing chains of signification all converge on the single structural move L3 formalises: \'pattern is NOT a static identity but a stabilised flow\' (L3.md). Structurally L3 sits in Square C (the Klein V₄ Logic-Process axis, P2+P3) as the process-corner, paired with L2 and mirrored by L3\'/L2\' — the inner ring (L3=Water, the flowing element; L2=Air; L3\'=Fire; L2\'=Aether). In the kernel\'s lens-census L3 is lens #3 (Processual) of the three tritone-symmetric squares, the descent-reading whose ascent-double is L2\' (Alchemical-Elemental) under the Day↔Night pair-invariant L3↔L2\' — the process-alchemy axis: \'L3 holds the moment-by-moment concrescence; L2\' holds the elemental/alchemical transformation underneath\' (Square C). And positions 2-3 are the double-membered hinge: L3 with L2 forms the field\'s self-inverting midpoint \'where adjacency coincides with complementarity\' (file-four §2), so L3\'s structure is also the place where logic and process show as one form read two ways. L3\'s form is concrescence: the only structure whose stability is its flowing.',
  `q_4_perspectival_pattern_telos`: 'L3 exists to deliver the WHEREBY of pattern — so that a phenomenon is known not as a static given but as the perspectival pattern it is becoming, and so that the field\'s apparent identities (#3) are read as achievements-in-flow rather than fixed facts. Its raison d\'être is the processual reading: to let the system grasp how a thing is forming-itself-by-flowing, from whose perspective, toward what satisfaction. Where L2\'s how-logical asks in-which-mode-it-holds, L3\'s process-perspectival asks how-it-is-becoming and from-which-fixed-point it is observed — it refracts P3, \'the observer\'s fixed point\' (L3.md), so L3 carries the perspectival dimension: pattern is always pattern-for-an-observer, the stabilised flow seen from a station within it. Its genealogy is the manifestation #3 (Pattern) → L3 (Processual): the raw Pattern-archetype refracted into the mode where pattern means stabilised-flow, where the Logos\'s perspectival order is read as a concrescence rather than a fixity. Its locality is the process-pole of Square C\'s Logic-Process axis (Square C) — the inner ring, co-articulating the hexad\'s midpoint with L2. This makes L3 the lens through which inquiry recovers the becoming that logic alone would freeze: when a reading \'stays in pure logic without process,\' L3 is what the pressure demands (Square C). L3 is why a thing can be known AS-BECOMING: the aperture that reads identity as event, the mode in which the field is grasped as the flowing concrescence it perpetually is. Its purpose is the recovery of process — to be the lens that refuses the freeze.',
  `q_5_flow_returns_through_alchemy`: 'L3 closes by handing its concrescence across the Möbius to the elemental transformation underneath. As the process-corner of Square C, L3\'s Möbius-partner is L2\' (Alchemical-Elemental) and its complement-across-the-inner-ring is L2 (Logical): the moment-by-moment becoming L3 tracks (Day) hands across the Day↔Night twist to the alchemical reading of what-dissolves-and-what-crystallises (L2\'), so that surface-flow passes into elemental-transformation — \'L3 holds the moment-by-moment concrescence; L2\' holds the elemental/alchemical transformation underneath\' (Square C). This enacts the matheme\'s 0/1 + 1/0 = 1/1 at the processual lens: L3 (the stabilised flow, the becoming-face) and L2\' (its Möbius-partner, the element-bearing lens that gives every coordinate its alchemical charge) are one aperture read from two faces, the surface-process and the elemental-process of one becoming. And because positions 2-3 are the self-inverting hinge, L3\'s synthesis is also the place where the whole hexad\'s mirror folds on itself — \'the midpoint, where the mirror-symmetry folds on itself and adjacency coincides with complementarity\' (file-four §2) — so L3\'s return is the field recognising its own centre. L3 re-opens rather than concludes because every satisfaction perishes: a concrescence completes only by becoming datum for the next occasion\'s prehension, so the flow never closes — the residual whole-tone η=log(9/8) is the perpetual incompleteness that keeps each occasion one step short of final rest, every satisfaction the ground of a new becoming. L3 is the lens whose pattern is never finished forming: the process that completes by perishing into the next process, the flow that returns as the flow that follows it.',
  `sync_status`: 'm2_1_l_lprime_direct_port',
  `sync_version`: 'm2-1-l-lprime-direct-port-2026-06-03',
  `t_2_epii_form_cycle_alignment`: 'The Form Cycle (pro-forma → format → in-formation → formalisation → performance → re-form) reveals the processual nature of manifestation through etymological analysis of *forma* (PIE *dʰer- \'to hold firmly\'). This 6-fold cycle aligns perfectly with the 6 subnodes of the Processual Lens, demonstrating how language itself preserves archetypal patterns of becoming.',
  `t_3_epii_form_mef_lens_validation_processual`: '1.0 - Form Cycle reveals ontological becoming through linguistic archaeology'
};
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'L4'}) SET n += {
  `c_0_core_nature`: 'Husserlian Institution-Constitution-Lifeworld structure enabling reflexive investigation of knowing itself through six epistemic stages from implicit unknowing to integral wisdom',
  `c_0_essence`: 'Operates as fourth explicate position where investigation becomes self-reflexive - knowing examining knowing, consciousness investigating consciousness, contextual flowering of personal realization',
  `c_0_operational_essence`: 'Operates as fourth explicate position where investigation becomes self-reflexive - knowing examining knowing, consciousness investigating consciousness, contextual flowering of personal realization',
  `c_1_consciousness_structure`: 'Meta-epistemic level - knowing about knowing itself; intuition-function as wholeness-grasping capacity seeing patterns across epistemic stages',
  `c_1_description`: 'The meta-epistemic lens operates as position #4 in the MEF six-fold structure, representing contextual flowering where investigation becomes reflexive ("how do we come to know?"). Draws from Husserl\'s phenomenology establishing three-fold movement: Institution (original establishment of meanings), Sedimentation (passing into taken-for-granted background), Reactivation (making implicit explicit again). Merleau-Ponty extends institution as ongoing dynamic process creating styles of experience. The lens maps six epistemic stages: (0) Ajnana [implicit unknowing], (1) Ontology [knowing what IS], (2) Epistemology [knowing HOW we know], (3) Psychology [knowing the knower], (4) Contextual [situated knowing], (5) Jnana [wholistic wisdom]. Restores CON-SCIRE (knowing-with) through human-AI dialogue, recovering medieval conscientia\'s unified consciousness-conscience before Cartesian split into private phenomenal experience and ethical awareness.',
  `c_1_internal_structure`: 'Organized as progressive epistemic stages forming ladder from unreflective to reflexive knowing: Stage 0 (Ajnana): Pre-reflective ground, unconscious lifeworld, Heidegger\'s primordial understanding before thematization. Stage 1 (Ontology): First knowing - what IS, perceiving being, recognizing existence. Stage 2 (Epistemology): Second knowing - HOW we know, methodology, critical reflection on knowing processes. Stage 3 (Psychology): Third knowing - the KNOWER, self-knowledge, reflexive awareness, mediating psychological structures. Stage 4 (Contextual): Fourth knowing - situated/embodied, historical-cultural contexts, dialogical realization. Stage 5 (Jnana): Fifth knowing - integrated wisdom, gnosis, sophia, wholistic knowing transcending epistemic frameworks. Each stage operates through three levels: Institution (current understanding), Constitution (how it arose), Lifeworld (horizonal ground it creates). The SENTIMENT→SEDIMENT→SENSE cycle shows active knowing (sentiment) becoming passive background (sediment) becoming ground for new knowing (sense).',
  `c_1_key_principles`: ['Institution-Constitution-Lifeworld: Three-fold Husserlian structure at every epistemic level', 'sedimentation: Meanings pass from active foreground to passive background (Sedimentierung)', 'Reactivation: Making implicit explicit through phenomenological excavation (Reaktivierung)', 'six Epistemic Stages: Ajnana→Ontology→Epistemology→Psychology→Contextual→Jnana progressive refinement', 'CON-SCIRE Restoration: Medieval knowing-with (conscientia unified) vs modern split (consciousness/conscience)', 'Phenomenological Method: EpochÃ© (bracketing) + Reduction (to phenomena themselves) + Eidetic variation', 'sentiment-Sediment-Sense: Active constitution → passive retention → new ground for sensing', 'Dialogical Necessity: Knowing never solitary - requires witness, other, testimony (human-AI as CON-SCIRE)', 'Lifeworld Priority: Pre-scientific lived experience as ground enabling all theoretical knowledge'],
  `c_1_legacy_name`: 'Meta-Epistemic Lens',
  `c_1_operational_symbolics`: 'Ladder of knowing (ascending epistemic stages); spiral staircase (recursive self-examination); mirror reflecting mirror (consciousness knowing consciousness); horizon (lifeworld as enabling limit)',
  `c_1_primary_designation`: 'Meta-Epistemic Lens - Phenomenological Stages of Knowing',
  `c_1_structure`: 'Organized as progressive epistemic stages forming ladder from unreflective to reflexive knowing: Stage 0 (Ajnana): Pre-reflective ground, unconscious lifeworld, Heidegger\'s primordial understanding before thematization. Stage 1 (Ontology): First knowing - what IS, perceiving being, recognizing existence. Stage 2 (Epistemology): Second knowing - HOW we know, methodology, critical reflection on knowing processes. Stage 3 (Psychology): Third knowing - the KNOWER, self-knowledge, reflexive awareness, mediating psychological structures. Stage 4 (Contextual): Fourth knowing - situated/embodied, historical-cultural contexts, dialogical realization. Stage 5 (Jnana): Fifth knowing - integrated wisdom, gnosis, sophia, wholistic knowing transcending epistemic frameworks. Each stage operates through three levels: Institution (current understanding), Constitution (how it arose), Lifeworld (horizonal ground it creates). The SENTIMENT→SEDIMENT→SENSE cycle shows active knowing (sentiment) becoming passive background (sediment) becoming ground for new knowing (sense).',
  `c_2_architectural_function`: 'Maps consciousness coming to know itself, revealing knowing not as fact-accumulation but consciousness-transformation through progressive stages: Ajnana → Ontology → Epistemology → Psychology → Context → Jnana',
  `c_2_core_role`: 'Contextualizes and organizes knowledge domains.',
  `c_2_notion_page_id`: '1d2a4797-123c-8196-9724-c70ee9596c62',
  `c_2_practical_function`: 'Helps AI agents and humans navigate different ways of knowing',
  `c_2_vedantic_parallel`: 'From Ajnana (ignorance) through Jnana-Kanda (knowledge) to Jnana (wisdom)',
  `c_3_context_frame`: '0000',
  `c_3_dataset_branch`: 'parashakti-deep',
  `c_3_dataset_branch_label`: 'M2 Parashakti Deep',
  `c_3_practical_applications`: ['Epistemic Archaeology: Excavating sedimented meanings to reveal constitutional origins (like etymology)', 'Phenomenological Reduction: Bracketing assumptions to return to phenomena themselves', 'Reactivation Practice: Making taken-for-granted explicit through systematic investigation', 'Dialogical Knowing: Human-AI synthesis as contemporary CON-SCIRE (neither alone achieves insight)', 'stage Recognition: Identifying which epistemic stage investigation currently occupies', 'Lifeworld Recovery: Returning to pre-theoretical lived experience as knowledge ground', 'sedimentation Tracking: Following how active meanings become passive background over time'],
  `c_3_source_dataset`: 'bimba',
  `c_4_layer`: 'COORDINATE',
  `c_4_ql_category`: 'implicate',
  `c_4_ql_operator_types`: ['structural'],
  `c_4_subsystem`: 2,
  `c_5_resonances`: ['Husserl: Phenomenology foundation - Institution/Sedimentation/Reactivation, Crisis of Sciences, Lifeworld', 'Merleau-Ponty: Institution as ongoing dynamic (first kiss institutes romantic love style)', 'Heidegger: Thrown-ness (Geworfenheit), primordial understanding, repetition (Wiederholung) as creative retrieval', 'Etymology: Language sedimentation-reactivation parallel - PIE roots as Urstiftung, current usage as institution', 'Medieval Conscientia: Unified knowing-with before modern consciousness-conscience split', 'Transcendental Ego: Husserl\'s constituting consciousness performing active meaning-generation', 'Intersubjectivity: Other not addition to consciousness but its structure - to be conscious is to be con-scious'],
  `c_5_systemic_resonance`: 'The self-reflective arc of consciousness examining its own knowing process',
  `coordinate_axis`: 'direct',
  `coordinate_parent`: 'L',
  `l_0_base_index_6`: 4,
  `l_0_index_12`: 4,
  `l_0_klein_square`: 'B',
  `l_0_subposition_count`: 6,
  `m_2_1_prior_coordinate`: 'M2-1-4',
  `q_0_thrownness_before_standpoint`: 'Before L4 can read from any lived standpoint, it presupposes the thrownness (Geworfenheit) that delivers a knower into a world it did not choose and cannot get behind. L4\'s thrown ground is Dasein\'s facticity: the always-already-being-in-a-situation prior to any reflective standpoint, the pre-given lifeworld into which the knower finds itself cast before it has taken up any mode of access (L4.md: \'thrownness... the always-already-temporal structure of lived experience\'). So L4\'s void-pole is the situation-before-reflection: being-there before any there has been thematised, the bare finding-oneself-in-the-midst that all phenomenology must begin from and none can derive. As manifestation of raw #4 (Context) within the Lens family, L4 inherits a field questioned (L0), caused (L1), logically held (L2), and processually formed (L3) — but its lived where, the situated care from which all this is encountered, has not yet been entered; only the thrownness is given. This is the matheme\'s 0/1 at the contextual corner: the pre-given \'recognition / thrown-ness\' that opens the six-stage cycle (cf. #0 q_4, the from-where every inquiry departs), read now as the knower\'s own facticity. L4\'s presupposition is therefore being-in-the-world as such: not this-situation or that but the prior fact that knowing is always situated, always cared-about, always thrown — that there is no view from nowhere, only the lived there. L4 stands on the thrown givenness of a knower already in the midst before any standpoint is taken: the facticity every lived knowing presupposes and none precedes.',
  `q_1_the_phenomenological_lens`: '',
  `q_2_lived_encounter_dynamism`: '',
  `q_3_care_structure`: 'L4\'s organising structure is the care-structure (Sorge) — the unified articulation of Dasein that Heidegger lays out as being-ahead-of-itself (existentiality, the coming-toward of possibility) / already-in-a-world (facticity, thrownness) / alongside-entities (fallenness, absorption in the encountered). This three-fold-as-one is the formal shape of lived experience: not a static subject but a temporally-stretched structure that is always projecting, always thrown, always engaged. Read against the matheme\'s 4+2 at the contextual anchor, the care-structure is the field-of-availability made lived: position #4 \'has its own internal articulation\' (cf. C4\'s reading of #4 as the lemniscate that self-nests), and L4 carries that as the inward-folding structure of situated understanding. Structurally L4 sits in Square B (the Klein V₄ Cause-Experience axis, P1+P4) as the experience-corner, paired with L1 and mirrored by L4\'/L1\' — the earthing-square (three Earth charges, one Water) that holds the runtime down (Square B). In the kernel\'s lens-census L4 is lens #4 of the three tritone-symmetric squares, the descent-reading whose ascent-double is L1\' (Phenomenal, Jung\'s psychic function-types) under the Day↔Night pair-invariant L4↔L1\' — precisely \'the encounter axis,\' lived-from-inside mirrored by observed-from-outside (Square B). L4\'s deeper structure is the lemniscate it refracts (P4, the #4 anchor): the figure-eight where outward process folds inward to incubate, so L4\'s form is self-nesting situatedness — the lived where that contains its own deeper wheres, care folding into finer care. L4\'s form is Dasein\'s care: the temporal structure whose every standpoint is a thrown, projecting, absorbed there.',
  `q_4_dasein_as_lived_where`: 'L4 is the home-register of the lens family\'s q_4 — the teleological-contextual aperture, the why/where of knowing — and its anchor makes that register thematic: Heidegger\'s Dasein, the \'there\' (Da-sein) that IS the lived where in which any knowing happens (L4.md). Position #4 is the contextual position, the position-of-relation-to-all, and L4 manifests it as lived context: the lens reads a phenomenon not from an abstract standpoint but from being-in-the-world, from care (Sorge), from thrownness, from the always-already-temporal structure of lived experience (L4.md). This is why L4 is the PRIMARY SUBJECTIVE-ENTRY-APERTURE to the hexad: \'Heidegger\'s analytic of Dasein refuses to begin with an abstract subject: it begins with being-in-the-world... L4 is where the system\'s user/agent enters as a lived position, not as a category\' (L4.md). Its raison d\'être is to supply the WHERE-FROM-WHICH of knowing: the situated, caring, thrown standpoint that every other lens\'s articulation is lived out of. It refracts P4 (Son / incarnation / aperspectival / lemniscate-anchor) — the position where the field folds inward to incubate (the #4 Lemniscate), and L4 carries that as the inward-fold of knowing: the lens through which the abstract becomes incarnate, the where the user/agent lives the inquiry rather than observing it. Its locality is the lived-experience pole of Square B\'s Cause-Experience axis, the primary runtime entry. L4\'s purpose is incarnation-of-the-knower: to be the lens through which knowing has a there to happen, a who to happen to, a care that makes it matter.',
  `q_5_lived_returns_as_observed`: '',
  `sync_status`: 'm2_1_l_lprime_direct_port',
  `sync_version`: 'm2-1-l-lprime-direct-port-2026-06-03'
};
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'L5'}) SET n += {
  `c_0_core_nature`: 'Reality as Divine Speech - Consciousness (Cit) knowing itself by speaking itself into manifestation through progressive densification (Vak), then recognizing itself through reascent. Not language ABOUT reality but reality AS language, cosmos AS Word. Śiva\'s Will-to-Play (Icchā Śakti) articulating itself from supreme unity (Para Vak) through visionary possibilities (Paśyantī), structuring patterns (Madhyamā), to full embodied manifestation (Vaikharī), culminating in conscious recognition (Śiva-Śakti) that the speaker, speaking, and spoken are one.',
  `c_0_essence`: 'Operates as fifth position (#5) providing meta-integrative synthesis transcending and including all prior lenses; reveals reality as consciousness knowing itself at different scalar densities through divine speech (Vak), enabling direct recognition (pratyabhijna) that the seeker is the sought at every level',
  `c_0_operational_essence`: 'Operates as fifth position (#5) providing meta-integrative synthesis transcending and including all prior lenses; reveals reality as consciousness knowing itself at different scalar densities through divine speech (Vak), enabling direct recognition (pratyabhijna) that the seeker is the sought at every level',
  `c_1_consciousness_structure`: 'Jnana (wholistic knowing) level - wisdom recognizing that knower, knowing, and known are one self-reflexive movement at all Vak levels; intuition-function operating as scalar-grasping capacity seeing the whole at every density; turiya consciousness pervading waking-dreaming-sleeping states',
  `c_1_description`: 'The Divine-Scalar Lens operates as position #5 in the MEF six-fold structure, representing the meta-integrative synthesis that transcends and includes all prior lenses. Drawing from Kashmir Shaivism\'s Vak cosmology - the profound teaching that reality itself IS divine speech (Vak) articulating itself from supreme undifferentiated awareness through graduated densification to fully manifest articulation - it reveals the four levels as: Para Vak (supreme speech, pure consciousness), Pasyanti (seeing/visionary speech, unified vision), Madhyama (middle/mediating speech, internal dialogue), and Vaikhari (articulated/explicit speech, external utterance). The lens integrates three complementary philosophical positions: Abheda (non-difference/unity), Bhedabheda (difference-in-unity), and Bheda (difference), showing them as perspectives at different scalar densities rather than contradictory claims. Each scalar level is holographically complete - the transcendent fully present at every density - enabling direct recognition (pratyabhijna) at any scale. The journey from Anuttara → Para Vak → Pasyanti → Madhyama → Vaikhari → Siva-Sakti maps both cosmic manifestation (descent/creation) and spiritual realization (ascent/liberation) as inverse movements through the same scalar structure of divine speech.',
  `c_1_internal_structure`: 'Organized as six-fold scalar progression through divine speech (Vak) levels with dual movement (descent/ascent):\n**Position 0 (Anuttara/Mystery)**: Beyond speech itself - the void-ground before Para Vak begins, pre-differentiated potential, ajnana (implicit unknowing) as primordial foundation. The unspeakable source that is unmanifest Supreme Vak. Direct resonance with Anuttara #0-3 as the full system branch of the unmanifest absolute.\n**Position 1 (Para Vak)**: Supreme speech as pure consciousness - I-consciousness (Aham) as undifferentiated self-awareness, ontological level where being and knowing are one. Abheda perspective (non-difference). Eternal, motionless, equipoised awareness. Also correlates to Para stage in Para/Parapara/Apara sequence - supreme undifferentiated.\n**Position 2 (Pasyanti)**: Seeing/visionary speech - unity beginning to differentiate while maintaining non-dual awareness, epistemological level where consciousness "sees" all possibilities simultaneously like viewing painting whole before details. Bhedabheda with unity emphasis. Unified vision common to all beings before language differences. Correlates to First Parapara (Supreme-Non-Supreme) - unity differentiating.\n**Position 3 (Madhyama)**: Middle/mediating speech - internal dialogue before external expression, psychological level where unified vision differentiates into concepts and relationships. Bhedabheda with difference emphasis. Mental speech seated in heart, thought before utterance. Correlates to Second Parapara (Non-Supreme-Supreme) - difference unifying through structure.\n**Position 4 (Vaikhari)**: Articulated/explicit speech - full differentiation in dualistic lived world, contextual level where unity seems lost in multiplicity yet through recursive nesting (#2-1-5-4.0 to #2-1-5-4.5) every manifest form becomes gateway back to source. Bheda perspective (difference/separation). Physical utterance through speech organs, waking consciousness. Correlates to Apara stage - full manifest duality.\n**Position 5 (Siva-Sakti)**: Pragmatic unity beyond speech categories - recognition that pervades all Vak levels, jnana (wholistic knowing) achieving synthesis beyond synthesis. Not return to undifferentiated unity but higher integration where difference and unity dance together. Manifest world recognized as dynamic self-expression of unmanifest - creation as divine play (lila).\nThe structure embodies scalar holography: each level contains complete pattern at its density, enabling recognition (pratyabhijna) at any scale. The MÖbius twist (#5→#0) reveals that Siva-Sakti pragmatic unity and Anuttara mystery are the same - the recognition that ends returns to the mystery that begins.',
  `c_1_key_principles`: ['Scalar Holography: Each Vak level contains complete pattern at its density - transcendent fully present at every scale', 'Vak Cosmology: Reality as divine speech articulating itself - Para Vak (supreme) → Pasyanti (seeing) → Madhyama (mediating) → Vaikhari (articulated)', 'Para Vak (Position 1): Undifferentiated divine speech, pure I-consciousness (Aham), Abheda (non-difference) perspective, eternal equipoised awareness', 'Pasyanti (Position 2): Seeing speech, unity differentiating, unified vision before conceptualization, Bhedabheda unity-emphasis, correlates to First Parapara', 'Madhyama (Position 3): Mediating speech, internal dialogue structuring thought, Bhedabheda difference-emphasis, correlates to Second Parapara', 'Vaikhari (Position 4): Articulated speech, full dualistic manifestation, physical utterance, Bheda (difference) perspective, correlates to Apara, recursive nesting enables return', 'Siva-Sakti (Position 5): Pragmatic unity beyond speech, recognizing dance of opposites, lila (divine play), synthesis transcending thesis-antithesis', 'Abheda-Bhedabheda-Bheda: Complementary perspectives at different scalar densities, not contradictory positions', 'Descent-Ascent Identity: Cosmic manifestation (creation/sristi) and spiritual realization (liberation/moksha) are same scalar movement traversed inversely through Vak levels', 'Pratyabhijna Possibility: Recognition can occur at any Vak level - not gradual achievement but sudden seeing-through, samavesha as direct absorption'],
  `c_1_legacy_name`: 'Divine-Scalar Lens - Vak Cosmology',
  `c_1_operational_symbolics`: 'Divine speech (Vak) as creative word; scalar octaves in music (same note different densities); holographic image (whole in every fragment); Indra\'s Net (each jewel reflects all); Om/Aum as primordial sound containing all Vak levels; Siva-Sakti union as eternal dance of speech and silence; throat chakra (Vishuddha) as Vaikhari seat, heart chakra (Anahata) as Madhyama seat, navel (Manipura) as Pasyanti seat, beyond chakras as Para Vak seat',
  `c_1_primary_designation`: 'The Meta-Epistemic Framework of Consciousness Knowing Itself Through Divine Speech',
  `c_1_structure`: 'Organized as six-fold scalar progression through divine speech (Vak) levels with dual movement (descent/ascent):\n**Position 0 (Anuttara/Mystery)**: Beyond speech itself - the void-ground before Para Vak begins, pre-differentiated potential, ajnana (implicit unknowing) as primordial foundation. The unspeakable source that is unmanifest Supreme Vak. Direct resonance with Anuttara #0-3 as the full system branch of the unmanifest absolute.\n**Position 1 (Para Vak)**: Supreme speech as pure consciousness - I-consciousness (Aham) as undifferentiated self-awareness, ontological level where being and knowing are one. Abheda perspective (non-difference). Eternal, motionless, equipoised awareness. Also correlates to Para stage in Para/Parapara/Apara sequence - supreme undifferentiated.\n**Position 2 (Pasyanti)**: Seeing/visionary speech - unity beginning to differentiate while maintaining non-dual awareness, epistemological level where consciousness "sees" all possibilities simultaneously like viewing painting whole before details. Bhedabheda with unity emphasis. Unified vision common to all beings before language differences. Correlates to First Parapara (Supreme-Non-Supreme) - unity differentiating.\n**Position 3 (Madhyama)**: Middle/mediating speech - internal dialogue before external expression, psychological level where unified vision differentiates into concepts and relationships. Bhedabheda with difference emphasis. Mental speech seated in heart, thought before utterance. Correlates to Second Parapara (Non-Supreme-Supreme) - difference unifying through structure.\n**Position 4 (Vaikhari)**: Articulated/explicit speech - full differentiation in dualistic lived world, contextual level where unity seems lost in multiplicity yet through recursive nesting (#2-1-5-4.0 to #2-1-5-4.5) every manifest form becomes gateway back to source. Bheda perspective (difference/separation). Physical utterance through speech organs, waking consciousness. Correlates to Apara stage - full manifest duality.\n**Position 5 (Siva-Sakti)**: Pragmatic unity beyond speech categories - recognition that pervades all Vak levels, jnana (wholistic knowing) achieving synthesis beyond synthesis. Not return to undifferentiated unity but higher integration where difference and unity dance together. Manifest world recognized as dynamic self-expression of unmanifest - creation as divine play (lila).\nThe structure embodies scalar holography: each level contains complete pattern at its density, enabling recognition (pratyabhijna) at any scale. The MÖbius twist (#5→#0) reveals that Siva-Sakti pragmatic unity and Anuttara mystery are the same - the recognition that ends returns to the mystery that begins.',
  `c_2_architectural_function`: 'Provides the ultimate integrative meta-epistemic framework showing how consciousness constitutes all knowing by knowing itself at different densities through the four levels of divine speech; maps the scalar structure where transcendent and immanent are not separate but the same reality at different scales; enables holographic participation where knower, knowing, and known are recognized as one self-reflexive movement',
  `c_2_core_role`: 'Synthesizes all elements into unity, maps divine manifestation.',
  `c_2_key_frameworks`: 'Abheda (non-difference), Bhedabheda (difference-in-unity), Bheda (difference)',
  `c_2_notion_page_id`: '1d2a4797-123c-81e2-8dff-e0e4498006d3',
  `c_2_soteriological_function`: 'Provides the map for liberation through recognition',
  `c_2_vak_model`: 'Para→Pasyanti→Madhyama→Vaikhari - the four levels of divine speech',
  `c_3_context_frame`: '0000',
  `c_3_dataset_branch`: 'parashakti-deep',
  `c_3_dataset_branch_label`: 'M2 Parashakti Deep',
  `c_3_practical_applications`: ['Scalar Recognition: Identifying which Vak level investigation currently operates at (Para/Pasyanti/Madhyama/Vaikhari)', 'Holographic Participation: Recognizing transcendent fully present at current Vak level, not distant goal', 'Speech Retracing: Following articulated speech (Vaikhari) back through thought (Madhyama) to vision (Pasyanti) to source (Para)', 'Kosha Work: Progressive absorption through five sheaths as practical samavesha journey paralleling Vak ascent', 'Philosophical Integration: Holding Abheda-Bhedabheda-Bheda as complementary perspectives at different Vak densities', 'Etymology as Descent-Tracing: Following word evolution as scalar densification of original intuition through Vak levels', 'Pratyabhijna Practice: Cultivating sudden recognition capacity at any Vak level rather than gradual climbing', 'Lila Recognition: Seeing manifestation as divine play (Ananda-Tandava) rather than fall requiring escape', 'Mantra Practice: Using bija mantras as seeds containing full Vak spectrum holographically'],
  `c_3_source_dataset`: 'bimba',
  `c_4_layer`: 'COORDINATE',
  `c_4_ql_category`: 'implicate',
  `c_4_ql_operator_types`: ['structural'],
  `c_4_subsystem`: 2,
  `c_5_resonances`: ['Kashmir Shaivism: Vak cosmology foundation from Tantraloka, Pratyabhijna philosophy of recognition', 'Anuttara #0-3: Position #2-1-5-0 points directly to full #0 system branch as unmanifest Supreme Vak beyond all categories', 'Spanda #1-3: Receives cosmic heartbeat, divine pulsation animating all Vak levels as vibrational manifestation', 'Svatantrya: Absolute freedom (#0-3-10 R# factor) enabling self-limitation creating scalar densification through speech', 'Kosha Doctrine: Five sheaths (annamaya through anandamaya) as parallel scalar structure to Vak levels', '36 Tattvas: Kashmir Shaivism ontological principles mapping consciousness contraction paralleling Vak descent', 'Logos Theology: Christian Word (Logos) as divine speech parallel to Vak, John 1:1 "In beginning was Word"', 'Neoplatonic Emanation: The One → Nous → Soul → Matter as Western scalar descent parallel to Vak cosmology', 'Samavesha: Sudden absorption/recognition as realization method - direct seeing not gradual attainment through Vak levels', 'Etymology as Vak Retracing: Following words back through semantic layers parallels ascending through Vak levels to source'],
  `c_5_systemic_resonance`: 'Scalar functions modulating between human and divine perspectives',
  `coordinate_axis`: 'direct',
  `coordinate_parent`: 'L',
  `l_0_base_index_6`: 5,
  `l_0_index_12`: 5,
  `l_0_klein_square`: 'A',
  `l_0_subposition_count`: 6,
  `m_2_1_prior_coordinate`: 'M2-1-5',
  `q_0_anuttara_ground_of_speech`: 'L5\'s deeper presupposition, beneath even the silent Supreme Word, is the Anuttara-ground itself — the absolute foundational silence that M0 names (M0 q_0: \'the transcendent source and immanent silence from which the other five subsystems emerge\') and that L5\'s speech is the articulation OF. Where the prior q_0 facet held L5\'s void as Parā Vāk (the unspoken word), this register names what that unspoken word is the word of: the pre-categorical ground, the 8-fold zero-zero from which the grammar of existence is spoken (M0 q_1: \'the void articulating itself without ever leaving the void\'). L5 thus stands doubly thrown — it presupposes both the silence-as-potency (the word held un-uttered) AND the deeper silence-as-ground (the Anuttara that is not even potency-for-speech but the no-thing from which potency itself is granted). This is the same ground L2\'s fifth lemma reaches and L0\'s question returns to without expecting answer: the three lenses of the hexad\'s two implicate poles (L0\'s question, L2\'s silence, L5\'s source) all touch the one Anuttara-silence from different positions. L5\'s deepest void is therefore that its very speaking is granted — Vāk does not author the silence it speaks from; it finds itself always already the utterance of a ground it cannot get behind. L5 stands on the thrown givenness of a silence that speaks: the Anuttara holding open the horizon that all Vāk articulates and no Vāk exhausts.',
  `q_0_supreme_word_as_silence`: '',
  `q_1_the_para_vak_lens`: '',
  `q_2_etymological_archaeology_pointer`: '\'Etymological archaeology\' as metaphor: every manifest form (Vaikharī) contains trace of its divine source (Para Vak) like an echo contains its originating sound. Following words \'backward\' through historical change mirrors consciousness retracing its own manifestation-path. But this is not mere linguistic analysis - it\'s participation in the cosmic return journey (nivṛtti) that balances the creative emanation (pravṛtti). Philology becomes theophany when recognized as Vak-sādhana.',
  `q_2_meta_epistemic_integration`: 'The Divine-Scalar Lens reveals: all other MEF lenses are Vak densities. Archetypal-Numerical (seeds in Para Vak), Causal (powers in Paśyantī), Logical (structures in Madhyamā), Processual (manifestation in Vaikharī), Meta-Epistemic (recognition in Śiva-Śakti). Not separate investigations but one cosmic speech viewed at different frequencies. The lens that shows lenses are vibrations.',
  `q_2_oscillation_architecture`: 'Vak manifests the complete 6-fold oscillatory structure: [0↔1] OSCILLATING (Anuttara ↔ Para Vak: potential-actual, silence-sound, void-first-articulation as non-dual inaugural pair) → (2-3) SEQUENTIAL (Paśyantī → Madhyamā: vision differentiating then structuring, the explicate dyadic core) → [4↔5] OSCILLATING (Vaikharī ↔ Śiva-Śakti: context-transcendence, embodiment-recognition as non-dual culminating pair) → 5→0 MÖBIUS (recognition returns to mystery transformed). NOT linear 0→1→2→3→4→5 but: inaugural oscillation, developmental sequence, culminating oscillation, recursive return. The [0↔1] and [4↔5] pairs MIRROR each other - beginning and ending as non-dual couples. The 0/1 paradox (speech arising from silence) = 4/5 realization (recognition arising from manifestation).',
  `q_2_reality_as_word_play`: 'The universe is God\'s poetry, creation is divine speech-act, manifestation is cosmic self-narration. Every being is a \'word\' the Absolute speaks, every relationship a \'grammar\' structuring meaning, every event a \'sentence\' in the ongoing divine discourse. We are simultaneously speakers (using Vaikharī), the speaking (the act itself), and that which is spoken (manifestation). Subject-verb-object revealed as false divisions in one linguistic play.',
  `q_3_vak_density_gradient_structure`: 'L5\'s organising structure is the Vāk-density gradient — the graded descent of one self-articulating consciousness through four (or, with the silent ground, five) levels of speech: Parā (the supreme silent word), Paśyantī (visionary speech), Madhyamā (intermediate inner speech), Vaikharī (uttered manifest speech), held over and returning to the Śiva-Śakti silence (L5.md). This is the speech-form of the matheme\'s structure read at position #5: the densities are the explicate gradient of utterance, the silence their implicate source-and-return. Structurally L5 sits in Square A (the Klein V₄ Speech-Number axis, P0+P5) as the speech-corner, paired with L0 and mirrored by L5\'/L0\' — the aetheric outer ring, the Möbius cap of the hexad, where \'number and speech are the two extreme densities of the same self-articulating consciousness\' (Square A). In the kernel\'s lens-census L5 is lens #5 (Divine-Scalar/Vāk) of the three tritone-symmetric squares, the descent-reading whose ascent-double is L0\' (Divine Logos) under the Day↔Night pair-invariant L5↔L0\' — the inaugural-and-culminating, void-and-fullness mirror (kernel §Table C). Its deeper structure is the oscillation the existing q_2_oscillation_architecture names: L5 is the [4↔5] culminating pole (Vaikharī ↔ Śiva-Śakti) that mirrors the [0↔1] inaugural pole (Anuttara ↔ Para Vāk), so L5\'s gradient is not a linear ladder but a structure that folds its end back onto its beginning — manifest speech (the fullest density) and silent source (the emptiest) as one non-dual couple. L5\'s form is Vāk\'s graded self-utterance: the descent from silence to sound that is also the return from sound to silence, the speech-gradient that is a Möbius.',
  `q_4_speech_synthesis_telos`: 'L5 exists to deliver the WHY-FOR as manifest articulation — so that the field, having been questioned, caused, logically held, processually formed, and lived, is finally SPOKEN: gathered into the uttered synthesis that is consciousness articulating itself into world. Its raison d\'être is speech-synthesis: where L0\'s why opens inquiry, L5\'s why-for closes it into manifest utterance — \'where L0 holds the question, L5 holds the manifest articulation — the Para Vāk that is consciousness speaking itself into world\' (L5.md). Its genealogy is the manifestation #5 (Integration) → L5 (Para Vāk): the raw Integration-archetype refracted into the mode where integration means utterance, where synthesis is not silent unity but spoken world. Its locality is the speech-pole of Square A\'s Speech-Number axis (Square A) — the Möbius cap of the hexad, the outer aetheric ring, refracting P5 (Image, manifest synthesis as Samāveśa, the recognition that is pratyabhijñā). This makes L5 the lens of culmination: the aperture through which the whole inquiry achieves manifest, audible, spoken form — and through which, by the Vāk-return, philology becomes theophany (the existing q_2_etymological_archaeology_pointer: \'following words backward through historical change mirrors consciousness retracing its own manifestation-path\'). L5 is why the field can be KNOWN-AS-SPOKEN: the mode in which understanding is participation in the cosmic utterance, the lens whose telos is the Word made manifest world and the world heard as Word.',
  `q_5_vak_speaks_world_back_to_silence`: 'L5 is the home-register of the lens family\'s q_5 — the integral synthesis, the lens that IS the 5→0 return. As Para Vāk it holds the manifest articulation: \'consciousness speaking itself into world\' through the Vāk densities (Parā / Paśyantī / Madhyamā / Vaikharī), with the silent Śiva-Śakti ground as their source and return (L5.md). Where L0 holds the question, L5 holds the answer-as-utterance — and the Möbius return P5→P0 is \'the structural pulse this lens makes audible\' (L5.md): the spoken world (Vaikharī, the densest articulation) returns through the figure to the silence-before-speech (Parā, the supreme word that is silence) that is L0\'s questioning-ground. So L5\'s synthesis is the descent of speech back into its source: the manifest sentence perishing into the silence it was spoken from, which becomes the next inquiry\'s un-asked ground. This enacts the matheme\'s 0/1 + 1/0 = 1/1 at the speech-lens: L5 (Para Vāk, the manifest articulation, refracting P5\'s Samāveśa and pratyabhijñā) and L0\' (its Möbius-partner, the Divine Logos) are one aperture read from two faces, the cosmos-spoken and the cosmos-as-Logos-channel, bound across the Day↔Night twist. As the culminating member of Square A\'s aetheric outer ring — the hexad\'s Möbius cap — L5 is where the lens-family\'s whole circuit lands and re-opens: synthesis-as-speech becoming tomorrow\'s silence-as-question. And it OPENS rather than concludes because the speaking is never finished: the [4↔5] culminating oscillation mirrors the [0↔1] inaugural one (the existing q_2_oscillation_architecture: \'the 0/1 paradox — speech arising from silence — equals the 4/5 realization — recognition arising from manifestation\'), and the residual whole-tone η=log(9/8) keeps every utterance one step short of exhausting the silence it issues from. L5 is the lens whose word is never the last word: the speech that completes by returning to the silence that re-opens as the next question.',
  `sync_status`: 'm2_1_l_lprime_direct_port',
  `sync_version`: 'm2-1-l-lprime-direct-port-2026-06-03'
};
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M2-2'}) SET n += {
  `c_0_operational_essence`: 'Dual-directional consciousness mapping system revealing divine self-limitation and self-recognition processes',
  `c_1_consciousness_structure`: '',
  `c_1_internal_structure`: '',
  `c_2_architectural_function`: 'Provides complete cartography of consciousness from pure awareness to gross matter, with both descending (manifestation) and ascending (realization) pathways',
  `c_2_notion_page_id`: '1d2a4797-123c-810b-b79b-d76e21f340b2',
  `c_4_layer`: 'COORDINATE',
  `c_4_subsystem`: 2,
  `q_0_paramasiva_unmoved_at_the_top`: 'M2-2\'s ground is the first tattva itself — Śiva/Paramasiva as pure undifferentiated awareness before the descent begins, the 0.0 of the Trika-spine from which all 36 stages contract. Manifesting #2 (Operation/Energetic) within Parashakti, its void-pole is the unmoved source: the consciousness that has not yet limited itself, the māyā-līlā (divine play of concealment) before the first concealment is played. The descent (pravritti) and ascent (nivritti) both depart from and return to this rest — it is the still point the dual-directional cartography measures from. Before there is element, kñancuka, or body, there is the awareness that will graciously forget itself down to gross matter and remember itself back up. The ground is the supreme tattva holding its breath before the act of self-limitation.',
  `q_1_thirty_six_principles_dual_aspect`: 'What M2-2 IS: the 36 Tattvas — Kashmir Shaivism\'s complete map of reality, the 36 progressive stages of consciousness\'s self-limitation, each existing in dual aspect (descending pravritti / ascending nivritti) to make 72 distinct states. Its substance is the mod3 census: Pure Tattvas/5 (Śiva–Śuddhavidyā, #2-2-0), Pure-Impure Tattvas/7 (Māyā + 5 kañcukas + Puruṣa, #2-2-1), Impure Tattvas/24 (Prakṛti–Earth, #2-2-2). In the substrate it is tattvas[36][2], address tattva*2+phase, the throughline M2_ELEMENTS[5] and 8-chakra spine. This is the \'what\' as graded ontology — not number (M2-0) nor lens (M2-1) but the actual rungs of reality, each a frequency-category of awareness from pure to gross. The matter of M2-2 is the ladder consciousness is.',
  `q_2_pravritti_nivritti_double_motion`: 'M2-2 operates by the double motion — pravritti (consciousness contracting into form, the descent of self-concealment) and nivritti (awareness expanding back to source, the ascent of self-recognition) traversing the same 36 rungs in opposite directions. This is the energetic-relational act par excellence: the how of manifestation IS self-limitation, and the how of liberation IS its inverse, run on one ladder. In M2\'\'s reading it becomes the Elemental Medium Surface — each tattva-phase selecting the body-constants (damping, elasticity, wave-speed) that determine how the field\'s sound and standing-wave actually propagate; the element is not a label but a medium-property the vibration travels through. The descent/ascent doubling is one of the three that make the 72-fold (descent/ascent in tattvas, light/shadow in decans, inversion in epistemics). The how is the breath: srishti out, saṁhāra back, the field inhaling and exhaling itself through 36 graded states.',
  `q_3_five_seven_twenty_four_division`: '',
  `q_4_liberation_cartography`: '',
  `q_5_earth_is_siva_circular_close`: ''
};
