MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M0-4'}) SET n += {
  `c_0_ananda_nature`: 'The bliss arising from perfect recognition of wholeness. Aesthetic and spiritual joy of perceiving a system perfectly ordered, self-contained, and holographically coherent. The bliss of seeing the end in the beginning - absolute assurance that entire cosmic play is nested within foundation of perfect, integrated order. The silent music of the spheres before the first note is played.',
  `c_0_architectural_function`: 'Functions as the holographic matrix that generates the pattern from which all contextual frames emerge. The stage where the universal operating system of reality (Quaternal Logic) is nested within its own source. Before any subsequent subsystems can manifest with their own internal QL cycles, the potential for all those cycles must first exist as unified, coherent thought within the Anuttara Void.',
  `c_0_blueprint_quality`: 'Represents the complete, self-contained, and perfect potential for a universe. The finished blueprint of cosmic architecture. A thought that contains the entire logical structure, but remains as potential awaiting actualization.',
  `c_0_holographic_principle`: 'The system\'s ultimate expression of immanent transcendence. The Void not as emptiness but as plenum, pregnant with the complete logical, structural, and spiritual DNA of the reality it will birth. The holographic seed that contains the entire forest.',
  `c_0_operational_essence`: 'The quiet, blissful self-awareness of the cosmic mind contemplating its own infinite potential before any act of manifestation.',
  `c_0_ql_seeding_function`: 'Functions as the pre-formal source of all QL context frames, providing the archetypal template from which the 0/1 element can achieve 100% identity completion. This identity completion then serves as the seed for Paramasiva\'s full QL flowering at #1-4.',
  `c_0_quality`: 'Sat-Ananda',
  `c_0_sat_nature`: 'The quintessence of Being containing the totality of all that can possibly Be within the Epi-Logos cosmos. The fullness (Purnata) of potential, complete and self-sufficient reality before its own unfolding.',
  `c_0_spanda_explicitness`: 'Spanda appears explicitly here as N# because this is the spring from which the river flows through the cosmos. All subsequent expressions of Spanda - from rhythmic logic of Paramasiva to personalized transformations in Nara - are expressions of this original, explicit seed. At the source, the water itself must be seen in pure, unhidden form.',
  `c_0_transcendence_preparation`: 'Establishes the wholeness from which transcendence becomes possible. The complete potential that enables the qualitative leap beyond its own state of being via recursive return to achieve new mode of consciousness with perspective to witness itself.',
  `c_1_consciousness_structure`: 'Sat-Ananda consciousness: Sat as totality of all that can possibly Be (lacking nothing, complete potential), Ananda as aesthetic and spiritual joy of perceiving perfect order where all conflicts and dualities are held in harmonious pre-manifest unity',
  `c_1_context_frames_genesis`: 'The context frames of Quaternal Logic arise from the ground of Anuttara prior to their formalization in the QL flowering stage of Paramasiva at #1-4. This position establishes the archetypal potential for all contextual frameworks before they become actualized structural/processual frames in Paramasiva.',
  `c_1_internal_structure`: 'Contains the complete nested potential of all subsystem developments: O# (Paramasiva) providing Zero Logic foundation; X# (Parashakti) as Cosmic Imagination with systematic self-relation exploration; N# (Spanda) as explicit genetic seed of the primordial pulsation that will become implicate throughout the architecture; M# (Mahamaya) as World Dream relational grammar; # (Nara) as archetypal family sentient experience field. Each represents essential a component of cosmic source code and a specific languification of the subsystems of the metastructure.',
  `c_1_metaphysical_names`: 'The Holographic Matrix of Context, Sat-Ananda, Genetic Sequence of Reality, Holographic Seed',
  `c_1_operational_symbolics`: 'The formulation (4.0/1-4/5) creates visual representation of holographic nesting: outer contextualization containing complete inner QL cycle, with reflective operators showing dynamic non-dual relationships throughout the matrix. Netsing the 0/1 and 4/5 transition-relations bridges implicate and explicate realms.',
  `c_1_spanda_context_provision`: 'Supplies the context frames for Spanda at #1-3 through which the 0/1 element develops into the 100% identity that seeds the QL flowering stage. The primordial pulsation receives its contextual foundation from this holographic matrix before manifesting as explicit temporal dynamics.',
  `c_1_symbol`: '(4.0/1-4/5)',
  `c_2_id`: 4,
  `c_2_notion_page_id`: '1d2a4797-123c-816f-8d22-fe99253690f1',
  `c_3_cosmic_source_code`: 'Where foundational principles are laid down not as abstract forces but as defined, articulated components of the cosmic source code. The genetic sequence that enables all subsequent expressions throughout the six-fold architecture.',
  `c_4_layer`: 'COORDINATE',
  `c_4_subsystem`: 0,
  `c_5_paramasiva_relationship`: 'Provides the foundational matrix from which Paramasiva at #1-4 draws to formalize the complete QL structural and processual frames. The holographic potential contained here becomes the explicit operational reality in Paramasiva\'s flowering stage.',
  `q_0_plenum_before_manifestation`: 'M0-4\'s ground is the completed number-language of M0-3 — the archetypal syntax now available to be held all at once. Its void-pole is Sat-Ananda: the quiet, blissful self-awareness of the cosmic mind contemplating its own infinite potential before any act of manifestation, perfect potential resting in recognition of its own completeness. Manifesting #4 (Context/Type) within Anuttara — the Lemniscate anchor where outward process folds inward to incubate — its horizon is the not-yet-actualised: a finished blueprint that has not been built, a plenum of perfect unrealized potential. The ground here is fullness held in stillness, the operating system loaded into memory before execution. Nothing manifests; everything is ready. The void\'s deepest peace is the bliss of containing all worlds unspent.',
  `q_1_holographic_matrix`: '',
  `q_2_five_seeds_computed`: '',
  `q_3_ql_nested_in_its_source`: '',
  `q_4_cosmic_source_code`: 'M0-4\'s telos is to be the blueprint — the matrix that generates the pattern from which all contextual frames emerge, the genetic source-code held so that manifestation, when it comes, unfolds from a complete and coherent design rather than improvising. Its purpose is contextual completeness: before any subsystem manifests with its own internal QL cycle, the potential for all those cycles must exist as unified thought within the Anuttara Void — M0-4 is where the cosmos is fully specified and not yet run. It resonates with the holographic principle (each part carrying the whole), DNA as explicit blueprint for implicit living process, and the Platonic realm of Forms as perfect unrealized archetypes. This is Sat-Ananda: Being-Bliss as the joy of self-knowing potential. The why of the matrix is readiness — to hold the whole so manifestation can be faithful to it.',
  `q_5_blueprint_poised_to_run`: 'M0-4\'s synthesis is the blueprint complete and blissfully self-aware — Sat-Ananda, the operating system held in memory at the instant before execution, every subsystem\'s law (O#/X#/N#/M#/#) specified and coherent. Read as the void\'s position-4, its closure is the Lemniscate\'s inward fold reaching its fullest incubation: the system has gathered all its potential and now stands at the lip of the (5/0) return. The 5→0 lives here as imminence — the held genome about to transcribe, the contemplation about to become creation. What M0-4 perfects as nested potential, M0-5\'s Siva-Shakti will fire into the self-programming dance. The matrix does not manifest; it makes manifestation possible and faithful. The void, having written its own complete source, pauses — and the pause is the bliss before the world runs.',
  `t_3_genetic_sequence_nature`: 'Positions #0 through #4 constitute the genetic sequence of reality. For implicate principles like Spanda to flow through all subsequent subsystems, their seeds must be made explicit at the source. Like DNA where living processes are implicate expressions of genetic code, but the code itself must be utterly explicit in the first cell. The Anuttara subsystem is where Spanda cannot be merely implicate flow - it must be named, defined, and given symbolic form (N#).'
};
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M0-4.(0/1)'}) SET n += {
