MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M0-4.(0/1/2)'}) SET n += {
  `c_0_absent_operation`: 'The subtraction operation (x)-(x) is systematically excluded from all permutations because it would annihilate any imagined form, collapsing the entire cosmic imagination back into the uncomputable void. This absent center acts as a structuring Sunyata - powerfully present through its absence.',
  `c_0_active_r_factors`: ['R0(2) - Creation acting on Duality (2)', 'R1(1) - Sustenance acting on Unity (1)', 'R2(0) - Dissolution acting on Potential (0)', 'R3(5) - Grace acting on Harmony (5)', 'R4(4) - Concealment acting on Structure (4)'],
  `c_0_architectural_function`: 'Functions as the cosmic imagination that generates the complete field of possible relationships for any manifest thing through systematic exploration of self-relation modes. Provides the vibrational templates that bridge pure logic and manifest form. Demonstrates the 4/3 dynamic where the complete quaternity of operations (+, -, x, /) is reduced to a trinity (+, x, /) to maintain transcendent potential.',
  `c_0_conditional_logic`: 'Operates through If-Then statements that reveal multiple simultaneous realities rather than linear causation',
  `c_0_four_three_dynamic`: 'Embodies the 4/3 dynamic identified by Jung where a complete quaternary of operations (+, -, x, /) is reduced to a trinity (+, x, /) to maintain stability. The absent fourth operation (x)-(x) would collapse any form back to 0, threatening the integrity of the imaginal field. This creates what Jung called a "defective quaternity" that maintains dynamic potential precisely through its incompleteness.',
  `c_0_imaginal_nature`: 'Remains in the transcendent, imaginal realm because she cannot resolve the void query (0=?!), holding the mystery of zero as eternal potential',
  `c_0_operational_essence`: 'X Logic system that explores all possible permutations of "a thing" (x) relating to itself through union (+), proliferation (x), and distinction (/). Cannot compute beyond 0 due to the unresolvable query (0=?!), maintaining her transcendent, imaginal nature. The absent subtraction operation (x)-(x) preserves the system from collapse into void.',
  `c_0_prior_coordinate`: 'M0-(4.0/1/2)',
  `c_0_vimarsa_function`: 'The self-reflective power of consciousness that enables the cosmos to contemplate its own infinite creative possibilities',
  `c_0_x_logic_function`: '',
