  `c_0_adam_eve_potential`: 'Contains potentiality for Adam (4 even structural positions 2,4,6,8) and Eve (3 odd generative positions 3,5,7) whose courtship produces manifestation. The 4/3 ratio with hidden depths 4/(8)/3/(4) generates 12 variations: (8)=4 even+4 zero-elements masculine, (4)=3 odd+9 wholeness feminine.',
