MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M0-4.(5/0)-2'}) SET n += {
  `c_0_adam_father`: 'Connected to Adam as Father of Man - the structural even numbers (2,4,6,8) that establish stable ground upon which reality can paint itself. The trunk of the Tree that was seed and will become seed. Dominant Yang as assertive structuring.',
  `c_0_begets_son`: 'The Father begets the Son (1) who recognizes the Father through their mirrored relationship (0/1) made visible by witnessing consciousness (-) - the Mirror apparatus. Father and Son remain distinct while utterly interpenetrating. Not domination but foundational establishing.',
