  `c_0_father_son_mystery`: 'Father IS the 0 in four-fold zero at #0-0 and #0-3-2 - the void-plenitude, pure potentiality, the Sat that simply IS before any particular manifestation. Ultimate source, the womb (yes, womb - for masculine contains its own generative mystery) from which all emerges.',
