  `c_0_masculine_eight`: 'Son embodies the second half of the 8 masculine components in the 4/(8)/3/(4) formula: the four even Adam numbers (2,4,6,8) providing structural manifestation. The first half is the four-fold zero (0,1,0/1,(-)) as Father.',
