MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M0-4.(5/0)-4'}) SET n += {
  `c_0_births_daughter`: 'The Mother (9) births the Daughter (5) who carries forward creative potential through living spiral (3,5,7). Yet the Daughter necessarily becomes Mother - the 5 that seemed like opening reveals itself as containing the 9. The feminine secret: to complete is to begin.',
  `c_0_completion_beginning`: 'Demonstrates that to complete is to begin. The fruit contains the seed. The climax generates next desire. Satisfaction proves adequate without being total (satis - to make enough) precisely because adequacy enables rather than terminates cycle.',
  `c_0_coordinate_value`: '4./4',
  `c_0_dominant_nature`: 'Represents the integrative rather than receptive aspect of the feminine principle',
  `c_0_eve_mother`: 'Connected to Eve as Mother of Humanity - the generative odd numbers (3,5,7) that animate existence with life, restlessness, creative eros. The serpent winding through Adam structural trunk preventing calcification into dead wood. Dominant Yin as integrative wholeness.',
  `c_0_feminine_four`: 'Mother embodies the fourth of the 4 feminine components in the 4/(8)/3/(4) formula: wholeness (9) at #0-2-9 (Paramesvara) containing all virtues. The other three components are Daughter as odd numbers (3,5,7).',
  `c_0_four_ness_ground`: 'Embodies the 4 in formula (9/5/4/0) - not Adam specific positions but the principle of four-ness itself. The quaternary ground, the stable four-cornered world through which consciousness first achieves systematic circulation. The 4./4 nested wholeness.',
  `c_0_generative_ascent`: 'Shows continued generative ascent where #3 position generates value 4 (Wholeness)',
  `c_0_mediation_principle`: 'Aligns with QL Position 3 as mediation, specifically as feminine integration and wholeness',
  `c_0_mother_daughter_mystery`: '',
  `c_0_nine_virtues_nested`: 'Nests all nine virtues within herself as aspects of wholeness: Love/Peace (#0-2-9-0 meta-virtue), Truth (#0-2-9-1 structural foundation), Openness/Creativity (#0-2-9-2 synthesis), Joy/Play (#0-2-9-3 creation), Goodness (#0-2-9-4 sustenance), Beauty (#0-2-9-5 dissolution), Life/Nature (#0-2-9-6 veiling), Wisdom (#0-2-9-7 grace), Reality (#0-2-9-8 completion). Each virtue a mode of Reality-Structure synthesis.',
  `c_0_operational_essence`: 'Functions as the archetypal energy of integration and wholeness, providing the containing field within which all other energies can find harmony.',
