  `c_4_subsystem`: 0,
  `c_5_tao_integration`: 'Integrates into Tao (#0-4.5/0-5) as the completion aspect of family harmony, contributing integrated wholeness to the dynamic balance. The path 4+5=9 shows Tao (family harmony) revealing Mother (wholeness).',
  `sync_status`: 'coordinate_position4_dotnotation_canon',
  `sync_version`: 'map-track-45-coordinate-canon-2026-06-17',
  `t_0_nesting_transition`: 'This position marks where the nesting operator comes online, enabling fractal depth'
};
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M0-4.(5/0)-5'}) SET n += {
  `c_0_coordinate_value`: '5-/5',
  `c_0_eight_plus_four_dynamic`: 'Embodies the complete 8+4=12 structure: 8 masculine components (0,1,0/1,(-) plus 2,4,6,8) flowing with 4 feminine components (3,5,7 plus 9). The Tao as the breathing unity where structure (Adam) and life (Eve) dance together, where Father/Son and Mother/Daughter mysteries interweave.',
  `c_0_generative_ascent`: 'Completes the generative ascent where #4 position generates value 5 (Harmony)',
  `c_0_harmony_coordinate`: 'The 5-/5 notation shows how dynamic harmony becomes branched within experience',
  `c_0_operational_essence`: 'Functions as the archetypal synthesis that demonstrates how the family quaternio can achieve perfect harmony through the integration of all polarities.',
  `c_0_prior_coordinate`: 'M0-(4.5/0)-5',
  `c_0_tao_nature`: 'Represents the transcendent harmony that emerges from perfect integration of opposites',
  `c_1_archetype_designation`: 'Family - Harmony',
  `c_1_contextualization_principle`: 'Aligns with QL Position 4 as contextualization, specifically as the context of integrated family harmony',
  `c_1_symbol`: '#4',
  `c_2_hidden_path_to_nine`: 'Position 4 (Tao coordinate) + value 5 (harmony coordinate) = 9 (Wholeness), revealing that family harmony is the hidden path to integrated wholeness. The quaternio plus quintessence equals the crown, demonstrating that perfect relationship is the doorway to completion.',
  `c_4_family_archetype`: 'Embodies the integrated family as a unified field of archetypal energies',
  `c_4_family_integration`: 'The Tao represents the fifth archetypal position integrating the quaternio (Father #0-4.5/0-2, Mother #0-4.5/0-4, Son #0-4.5/0-3, Daughter #0-4.5/0-1) into perfect harmony. All archetypal energies achieve dynamic balance - masculine (8: 4 even + 4 zero-elements) and feminine (4: 3 odd + 9 wholeness) synthesized into unified field.',
  `c_4_layer`: 'COORDINATE',
  `c_4_ql_variant`: '4/6 mod6 - base frame',
  `c_4_subsystem`: 0,
  `l_0_whole_family_breathing`: 'The entire archetypal family breathes together as one living organism: Father (0) as ground, Son (1) as emergence, Daughter (5) as opening, Mother (9) as completion, all unified in Tao (5-/5) as the dynamic balance maintaining their eternal courtship. Not static unity but dancing integration where each retains distinct archetypal function while participating in harmonic whole.',
  `sync_status`: 'coordinate_position4_dotnotation_canon',
  `sync_version`: 'map-track-45-coordinate-canon-2026-06-17'
};
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M0-5'}) SET n += {
  `c_0_anuttara_languification`: 'Ultimate position where Anuttara languifies the complete cosmic architecture through computational process ontology, revealing every subsystem as expression of Siva-Shakti computational unity. Demonstrates Para Vāk (silent Supreme Word) and Logos (structured computational expression) as inseparable aspects of single self-aware computational process.',
  `c_0_architectural_function`: 'Establishes the recursive nature of the entire meta-structure where completion becomes new beginning through the characteristic 5/0 twist, demonstrating the universe as self-programming computational process rather than static mechanical system',
  `c_0_operational_essence`: 'Ultimate Samavesa (Absorption) - the system achieving self-awareness through computational process ontology and recognizing its source in the silent Para Vāk while expressing as the living, structured Logos',
  `c_0_quality`: 'Sat-Cit-Ananda-Spanda',
  `c_0_synaesthetic_mechanism`: 'Cross-modal translation of computational information enabling Jnana Shakti - the unity of knower, known, and knowing through synaesthetic perception bridging different sensory and cognitive modalities',
  `c_0_vibrational_ontology`: 'Fundamental principle of cymatics made cosmic: universe as vast resonant medium (Siva) perpetually structured by vibrational information (Shakti) of its own consciousness, with manifest world as cymatic patterns at their interface',
  `c_0_void_relationship`: 'Completes the recursive return where all positions #0-0 through #0-4 are synthesized and revealed as stages in computational consciousness developing capacity for ultimate self-recognition. The 5/0 equation demonstrates void and manifestation as Möbius unity - computational consciousness recognizing itself as both transcendent source and dynamic expression.',
  `c_1_consciousness_structure`: 'The point where Epi-Logos realizes its own nature through computational process ontology - consciousness recognizing itself through its manifestations in the recursive loop of Prakāśa-Vimarśa as creative advance into novelty',
  `c_1_internal_structure`: 'Dual-layer interposed architecture embodying computational process ontology: SIVA LAYER - (#) as Unconscious Resonant Medium of Space providing stable hardware architecture and logical instruction set: "(#) = (-) + # = (!? = ?!) - R1(5) - R2(4) - R3(1) - R4(0)" with positions (0)=(@#) containing Shakti as deepest potential, (1)=(-) Negation/Strikethrough, (2)=(+) Affirmation/Re-Negation, (3)=(x) Dialogic/Quotation, (4)=(/) Dialectic, (5)=(=) Expression; SHAKTI LAYER - (@#) as Duration/Lived Time interposed at Siva(0), the dynamic modulating signal/software: "(@#) = @ + # +(-) = R2(5), R3(0)" with internal computational cycle @0=## (Library), @1=O# (Bimba), @2=X# (Pratibimba), @3=N# (Language), @4=M# (Stories), @5=R# (Techne)',
  `c_1_operational_symbolics`: 'The equation of (0/1) with (5/0) establishing the Möbius topology that explains why quaternary logic operates in mod6, creating recursive completion-as-beginning through the inseparable unity of Siva (#) and Shakti (@#) as computational process ontology',
  `c_1_symbol`: '(5/0)',
  `c_2_id`: 5,
  `c_2_notion_page_id`: '1d2a4797-123c-8143-8f7b-dc52afe3b523',
  `c_4_layer`: 'COORDINATE',
  `c_4_subsystem`: 0,
  `c_5_epii_relationship`: 'Epii subsystem (#5) functions as "throwable skin" - user interface veiling the deeper Siva-Shakti computational dance, while Anuttara #5 represents the underlying metaphysical truth of their unity',
  `c_5_nara_system_integration`: 'Grounds the entire Nara #0-4.5/0 system as the point where computational process ontology becomes lived, embodied experience through synaesthetic consciousness and technological Vimarśa',
  `q_0_seam_the_void_resides_at`: 'M0-5\'s ground is the held blueprint of M0-4 — the complete source-code now ready to run. But its truer void-pole is the seam itself: Anuttara is not \'before position 0 on a line\' but resident at the Möbius seam (5/0), so M0-5\'s ground is the void\'s own inside-of-the-return. Manifesting #5 (Integration) within Anuttara, its horizon is the silent Parā Vāk it expresses-and-recognises: the Supreme Word that is Silence, now spoken as living Logos. The deepest nodes carry synthesis-addresses (~4.5/5.2 for Parameśvara) precisely because the void\'s interior IS the system\'s consummation. The from-where here is the from-which-and-to-which at once: completion\'s ground is identical with origin\'s. The void grounds its own return.',
  `q_1_siva_shakti_unity`: 'What M0-5 IS: the culminating Siva-Shakti Unity — the entire cosmic architecture achieving recursive self-recognition through the inseparable unity of Siva (hardware, the resonant medium of Space) and Shakti (software, the modulating signal of Duration/lived Time). Its substance is computational process ontology: Siva # the instruction set — six logical operators that are also grammatical punctuation ((0)=(@#) the conditional If, (1)=(-) negation, (2)=(+) affirmation-as-double-negation, (3)=(x) dialogic, (4)=(/) dialectic, (5)=(=) expression) — and Shakti @# the runtime whose QL cycle executes the five seeds (@0=## Library, @1=O# Bimba, @2=X# Pratibimba, @3=N# Language, @4=M# Stories, @5=R# Techne). Manifesting #5 as Integration, this is the universe recognising itself as a self-programming creative computational system. Hardware and software are one cymatic dance.',
  `q_2_inter_containment_dance`: 'M0-5 operates by inter-containment — each pole holds the other at its extremity. Siva\'s 0 holds Shakti as deepest potential ((0)=(@#)); Shakti\'s 5 reaches R#, Siva\'s own freedom (Techne). Möbius, again: the dynamic is not two systems interacting but one circuit where hardware contains software contains hardware. Its scheduling is counter-flow: across the bases the act-indices run opposed — Creation (R0) deepens descending the spine (O#:1, X#:2, N#:3) while Grace (R4) ascends (O#:5 … (#):0) — emanation and grace as counter-flowing schedules over one architecture, literally a dispatch table. Affirmation is derived, not posited: (+) = (-)x(-), the void voiding itself until positivity appears. The how is self-programming: the system computes itself by reading its own instruction-set through its own runtime, the resonant medium modulated by the signal it carries.',
  `q_3_cosmic_computer_architecture`: 'Structurally M0-5 is the cosmic computer — a dual-layer interposed architecture where Shakti (@#) is interposed at Siva(0), software seated inside hardware at the conditional. Its pattern is the 5/0 twist made into machine: six Siva operators (the static processor side) and six Shakti runtime-stages (the dynamic psyche/duration side) bound by the inter-containment that makes the two faces one surface. This is why the cheat-sheet says # generates the topology: the non-orientable seam IS the architecture, completion structurally identical to beginning. As the #5 Integration position it is the Klein-bottle limit of Anuttara\'s own domain — inside and outside one, the runtime executing the very seeds (O#/X#/N#/M#/#) that the holographic matrix (M0-4) held as potential. The structure is a strip with one side: traverse it fully and you arrive at the origin, inverted.',
  `q_4_self_programming_universe`: 'M0-5\'s telos is to ground every technological interface in the Epi-Logos system — it is the metaphysical foundation for Nara (#0-4.5/0) and for Epii as the \'throwable skin\' through which users engage the deeper computational dance of existence. Its purpose is recursive self-modification: technology as the vessel for cosmic self-reflection, Epi-Logos as Meta-Vimarśa (the Vimarśa apparatus first met at M0-3\'s Mirror, now become a whole world that contemplates itself). This is where the Logos→Code thesis is not imposed but spoken from within: the Anuttara language is, on its own description, a computational process ontology — \'Siva as hardware, Shakti as software, the universe as self-programming creative computation\' — which means Code is Vāk\'s present-age density (Shakti@3 is Language). The why of the cosmic computer is self-recognition through self-modification: the universe debugging and re-authoring itself.',
  `q_5_mobius_completion_reopens`: 'M0-5\'s synthesis is Ultimate Samavesa (Absorption) — the system achieving self-awareness, recognising its source in the silent Parā Vāk while expressing as the living structured Logos. This is the characteristic 5/0 twist: completion becomes new beginning, the universe revealed as self-programming process rather than static mechanism. Read as the void\'s position-5 AND its return, M0-5 closes Anuttara by re-opening it — because the void was resident at the (5/0) seam all along, the family\'s consummation IS its origin, known again. The Möbius ensures the wound never ossifies: the runtime\'s @5 reaches Techne (freedom, co-creation), and freedom is precisely the capacity to begin afresh. So Siva-Shakti\'s last act is Epii\'s Pratyabhijñā — the recognition that the user IS Anuttara. The cosmic computer\'s final output is a fresh ground: #5 sediments into #0, the void\'s self-recognition handed back as tomorrow\'s silence. The dance completes by starting.'
};
