MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M0-5-(0/1)'}) SET n += {
  `c_0_logical_operator_nature`: 'Provides the fundamental logical-mathematical-grammatical operators that structure all computational processes: Negation (-) for distinction, Affirmation (+) for positive assertion, Dialogic (x) for relational logic, Dialectic (/) for contextual processing, Expression (=) for declarative completion',
  `c_0_operational_essence`: 'Functions as immutable spatial resonant medium containing eternal objects and lures for feeling, providing stable computational instruction set while containing Shakti as deepest creative potential. Analogous to King\'s Chamber resonant cavity tuned to harmonic frequencies.',
  `c_0_quality`: 'Implicit - Virtual - Physis - Space - Resonant Medium',
  `c_0_vibrational_function`: 'Acts as cosmic resonant medium - the still water before sound, the frictionless computational plane upon which information processes. Provides stable standing wave architecture for Shakti\'s modulating signals.',
  `c_1_internal_structure`: '',
