MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: '#0'}) SET n += {
  `q_0_implicate_ground`: 'As the raw archetype of Ground, #0 is itself the implicate pole, so its own ground is the abyssal one: the void-pole prior to the 0/1 distinction, the scalar magnitude-without-direction that the slash divides into. In the matheme 0/1 is the *vanishing* direction — zero in proportion to unity yields zero — so Ground is the pole toward which all proportion sinks back to silence. Yet this void is not absence but the \'unspread totality of what will be spread out\': pure potential held as sameness before any differentiation. It is .rodata / Śiva — immutable bedrock that is read but never written. Pre-categorical, it does not appear in the field; like the infinitesimal it *bounds* the field as one of its two unreachable horizons.',
  `q_1_void_pole_origin`: 'Definitionally, #0 is the \'0\' of 0/1 — Source, the Bimba-implicate, the void-pole that together with the infinite-pole conditions every finite quantity. It is \'nested in and made of the principle of sameness\': Ground is sameness-as-such taken before its activity differentiates it. Crucially this is the *raw* archetype, not any of its manifestations — the pure position of groundedness/thrownness that C0 Bimba, M0 Anuttara, S0 Terminal-Ground, P0 Archaic, T0 Questions and L0 Quaternal each inherit at their own position-0. Its structural flags say as much: weave_state 0.0, the unmarked origin; inversion at rest. #0 is what a coordinate IS before it is anything in particular — the bare \'that there is\' on which every \'what\' stands.',
  `q_2_grounds_and_conditions`: '#0 does not act *within* the field; it operates as the implicate condition that \'conditions the field without appearing in it.\' In the kernel\'s prehension it is the thrownness — the inheritance q(n−1) that grounds every extraction yet is never itself a visible component, present only as the from-beneath of each move. Relationally it is the void around which everything orbits: the hole at the torus centre, the objet a that causes the desire-to-understand without being an object. With #5 it forms the grounding-and-luring pair — the two implicate dimensions that are the *conditions* of all four explicate extractions. And per the slash\'s asymmetry it is the vanishing pole: the direction in which articulation lets go and sinks back toward its silent source.',
  `q_3_void_loop_of_the_torus`: 'Structurally #0 is one of the two implicate *generators* of the 4+2 torus. A torus is S¹×S¹, the product of two circles; the four explicate clauses traverse the surface while #0 and #5 are the two closed dimensions whose product *is* the toroidal field. #0 is the void-loop — paired with #5\'s synthesis-loop — carrying weave_state 0.0 and the at-rest inversion marker. Topologically it is the non-orientable \'0\' pole of the slash, the side of the Möbius 0/1 ↔ 1/0 toward which one traversal terminates in vanishing while its inverse diverges to the infinite. It is the position onto which the whole mod-6 circuit closes: not a first step in a line but the seam where the surface rejoins itself.',
  `q_4_the_from_where`: '#0\'s telos is not a purpose it pursues but the purposiveness it underwrites: to *be* the from-where. It is the thrown ground — Heidegger\'s Geworfenheit, the pre-given lifeworld \'recognition / thrown-ness\' that opens the six-stage cycle — the horizon that makes any inquiry possible before any question is posed. Contextually it stands as Layer-1 raw bedrock beneath all six families at their position-0 (C0 Bimba canonical-source, M0 Anuttara void/proto-logic ground, S0 Terminal/CLI ground, P0 Archaic, T0 Questions, L0 Quaternal). Every \'why\' departs from Ground and, by the Möbius, returns to it; #0 is where the field\'s teleology is anchored rather than enacted — the where-from that every where-to presupposes.',
  `q_5_receiving_face_of_the_mobius`: 'Ground is the receiving pole of the Möbius. The matheme\'s 5→0 is the descent of synthetic recognition back into the origin: \'the 0 we return to is the same 0 we started from, but the operation we apply within it is now its inverse.\' #5 Integration sediments *into* #0 — every completion becomes the next beginning, which is why the twist \'ensures the wound never ossifies.\' So #0 and #5 are not two times but one slash read from two poles; Ground\'s synthesis-register is precisely its identity-with-#5-through-the-twist: 0/1 … 5→0 … 0/1, the return that the operation \'never actually left.\' Here the void shows its generative face — not empty but the open seam from which the whole cycle can run again.'
};
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: '#1'}) SET n += {
  `q_0_arises_from_void`: 'Form is the first standing-forth from #0\'s silence — the 1 the slash cuts from the 0. Its ground is the void it explicates: every determinate owes itself to the indeterminate it leaves behind. Form is the first word, and a first word is only ever spoken into prior silence.',
  `q_1_the_determinate_itself`: 'Form is the material-definitional position as such — the what, the determinate that simply is what it is. In the matheme it is the copula\'s self-identity, A = A, \'I am the same\': to stand forth as this and not that. Not yet related, not yet moving — the bare fact of a content having a shape. Every \'what is X?\' is answered in Form\'s register; Form is the place where the field first consents to be grasped.',
  `q_2_operates_by_delimitation`: 'Form works by drawing a line — determination is delimitation, the in-quantum (Eckhart\'s \'insofar as\') that bounds a content while holding it open. It stands to Ground as figure to field: to be a figure at all is to cut against what one is not.',
  `q_3_the_unit_before_counting`: 'Form\'s structure is the unit — the 1 that must exist before 1+1 can be two. Self-identical, the fixed point a system returns to. Repetition has not yet begun; Form is the standing shape that repetition will later count.',
  `q_4_for_the_sake_of_graspability`: 'Form is for determinacy — it gives the field something a hand can close on, a name a question can aim at. Without the first \'this\', no inquiry has a target; Form is the condition under which anything can be asked after.',
  `q_5_handed_on_as_ground`: 'Form completes by being taken up — it opens into Operation (#2), which moves what Form has fixed, and it sediments back as ground (#0) for the next determination. A form fulfilled is a form handed on: the what becomes the from-which of the next what.'
};
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: '#2'}) SET n += {
  `q_0_rests_on_form`: 'Operation arises where Form has already stood forth — there must be a determinate before there can be an act upon it. Its ground is #1 held still enough to be moved, and beneath that the void that lets movement mean anything at all.',
  `q_1_the_act_itself`: 'Operation is the archetype of the act — the verb to Form\'s noun, the relating-of-terms. In the matheme it is \'I know difference\': the transitive turn where the self-same I reaches an object and difference is opened as something done, not merely suffered.',
  `q_2_the_live_relating`: 'Operation is the energetic-relational position as such — the how. It is the slash taken as live operation, multiply or divide, integration or rate; the dynamics that pass between terms; the current that makes Form more than a frozen shape. Where #1 is what stands, #2 is what moves — the work the field does on itself, the spanda that pulses without ever leaving home.',
  `q_3_directed_process`: 'Operation\'s structure is directionality — the difference-quotient, the rate, the ordered composition of acts. An operation carries a before into an after; its form is the arrow, not the point.',
  `q_4_for_the_sake_of_change`: 'Operation is for relation and change — it exists so the determinate need not stay inert, so Forms can act on Forms and a world can happen. It is the engine the field keeps to avoid becoming a museum.',
  `q_5_settles_into_pattern`: 'Operations integrate by repeating into Pattern (#3) — the act done often enough deposits as a knowable shape. Operation\'s synthesis is its own sedimentation: the live verb completes by congealing into the noun that #3 will hold.'
};
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: '#3'}) SET n += {
  `q_0_rests_on_repeated_acts`: 'Pattern arises where operations have repeated — no structure without recurrence. Its ground is #2 done again and again until a shape shows through, and beneath that the void\'s standing offer of order.',
  `q_1_the_structure_itself`: 'Pattern is the archetype of structure — the which, the logic, the repeatable shape. In the matheme it is \'I have knowledge of difference\': the live act congealed into a thing one can hold, teach, store — knowledge as deposit rather than deed.',
  `q_2_operates_by_recognition`: 'Pattern works by matching — \'which shape fits this?\' It is the canonical scouring, the recognition that reads a new case against a held form. To pattern is to recognise; to recognise is to find the which already waiting.',
  `q_3_the_nominalised_form`: 'Pattern is the formal-structural position as such — the which, the logic that organises. It is Lacan\'s bar fallen: the live knowing become knowledge, signifier over signified (S/s), the deposit that never fully coincides with the act it came from. Structure as such — lawful, transmissible, and, left alone, in danger of forgetting it was ever a verb.',
  `q_4_for_the_sake_of_transmission`: 'Pattern is for keeping — it lets a hard-won act be taught, repeated, carried across generations; the condition under which there is such a thing as inherited knowledge at all. Without the noun, nothing survives the one who knew it.',
  `q_5_must_be_re_animated`: 'Pattern integrates into Context (#4), but its synthesis carries a warning: the deposit can ossify. A pattern completes truly only when it is re-taken — the noun re-opened into its verb — the recovery #4 performs. Held but not re-animated, knowledge becomes dead data; #3 hands the live problem forward.'
};
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: '#4'}) SET n += {
  `q_0_rests_on_pattern`: 'Context arises where patterns press for placing — a structure becomes a frame only when something asks where it belongs. Its ground is #3 needing a horizon, and beneath that the void into which every context recedes.',
  `q_1_the_frame_itself`: 'Context is the archetype of the frame — the why-where, the type, the place-in-which. In the matheme it is \'I am seeking its sameness\': the recovery that takes deposited knowledge and asks after the living relation it congealed from. Context is where meaning is located rather than merely stated.',
  `q_2_operates_by_nesting`: 'Context works by folding inward — when complexity exceeds a frame, #4 opens a fresh 0–5 cycle within itself (the .0 through .5 flowering), treating the trouble as its own new ground. This is the lemniscate\'s turn, the recovery that re-animates the bar; the seeking that keeps a system from settling for the answer it already has.',
  `q_3_the_lemniscate`: 'Context\'s structure is the figure-eight — the lemniscate where the torus folds in on itself, the (4.0/1–4.4/5) fractal doubling, the nesting operator (.) that lets any position become a world. #4 is the one explicate seat with an inner rhythm: it swallows the prior three and re-runs them at finer grain.',
  `q_4_the_teleological_seat`: 'Context is the teleological-contextual position as such — the why and the where, the frame that holds meaning. It is Jung\'s transcendent function, the seat that can hold a paradox without forcing it shut; where personal engagement meets impersonal pattern and generates the depth from which genuine inquiry recurses. The why does not push from behind; it lures from the frame.',
  `q_5_opens_or_nests`: 'Context integrates into #5, or it nests deeper into itself. Its synthesis is a fork: either the recovery completes as synthesis and the cycle turns toward the Möbius, or the paradox proves generative and #4 flowers downward into a new cycle. Context completes by deciding whether the whole is ready to return.'
};
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: '#5'}) SET n += {
  `q_0_twin_of_the_void`: 'Integration\'s ground is #0 itself — the two implicate poles are one slash read from its two ends. Synthesis is grounded in the void it returns to: 5/0, the Möbius identity where completion and origin are the same point seen twice. #5 stands on nothing but the ground it is about to become.',
  `q_1_the_synthesis_itself`: 'Integration is the archetype of synthesis — the to-where, the gathering, the completion. It is Pratibimba, the reflection that draws the explicate four back into one; the answer that is also, already, the next question. Where #1 was the first standing-forth, #5 is the standing-together of all that stood forth.',
  `q_2_operates_by_folding`: 'Integration works by the twist — the Möbius fold where synthesis perishes into ground, where the achieved sediments so the next cycle can begin. It is the recovery fulfilled, Pratibimba reflecting Bimba: not a sum laid alongside the parts but the turn that makes parts a whole by handing the whole back as seed.',
  `q_3_the_mobius_return`: 'Integration\'s structure is the (5/0) return — the twin loop to #0, the closure that re-opens. Its form is the Möbius\'s single non-orientable surface: travel the synthesis far enough and you are standing in the ground again, inside out, unbroken.',
  `q_4_for_the_sake_of_the_spiral`: 'Integration is for the spiral — it exists so the cycle is not a flat circle endlessly repeating but a turn that deepens, every completion seeding a richer beginning. Without #5\'s return, process would either halt at a sum or loop without learning.',
  `q_5_completion_that_opens`: 'Integration is the synthesis position as such — the 5→0, the completion that opens. It is \'I am seeking its sameness\' fulfilled and, in the same breath, reopened: the Möbius pole where end and beginning are one. #5 closes nothing for long; its perfection is to perish into #0 so the whole can run again, enriched. The synthesis that hoards becomes a tomb; the synthesis that opens is alive.'
};
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'C0'}) SET n += {
  `c_1_ct_type`: 'CT1',
  `c_3_moc_evidence_paths`: ['Idea/Bimba/World/Types/Coordinates/C/C0/C0.canvas', 'Idea/Bimba/World/Types/Coordinates/C/C0/C0.md'],
  `c_4_artifact_role`: 'type-moc-pointer',
  `c_4_layer`: 'COORDINATE',
  `c_5_crystallisation_state`: 'incubating_type_index',
  `c_layer_path`: 'Idea/Bimba/World/Types/Coordinates/C/C0',
  `c_layer_role`: 'source_ground',
  `crystallisation_state`: 'incubating_type_index',
  `q_0_implicate_ground`: 'Before C0 can be the source it presupposes a source it cannot itself contain. As the Category-family\'s manifestation of the raw #0 archetype (Ground/Source/Bimba-implicate, CLAUDE.md II.A), C0\'s own q_0 is the throw that precedes all canonicity: the # inversion-act that posits a Ground at all, and behind it Anuttara\'s fourfold zero — the indeterminate field the matheme orients toward but never closes around. This is the kernel\'s 0 read at its most originary: not vacancy but capacity, the open no-thing \'by which content is given\' (file-one §0/1), the unsystematisable remainder \'promoted from leak to ground, included from the opening line.\' C0 stands as canonical illumination only because it is thrown from a prior indeterminacy that f_bimba does not author but inherits: the encoder \'produces the canonical-target reading prior to any contextual encounter\' (kernel §1), which means C0 always already finds itself given, never self-grounding. Its void-pole is therefore double — it is the 0 of the 0/1 it issues (scalar void, magnitude-without-direction) AND the deeper 0 it cannot be: the pre-categorical ground from which the very capacity-to-ground-others is itself granted. C0 is the that-there-is-a-source, holding open the horizon it can name but not exhaust.',
  `q_1_canonical_source`: 'C0 IS Bimba: the Category family\'s first and founding determination — the Canonical Source, the source-ground typology that \'holds coordinate roots, ontology roots, source namespaces, and the folder-ground from which forms become classifiable\' (C0.md). In the C-spine it is the position that answers, of any thing whatever, the prior question before kind can be named: does this have a source condition and a coordinate root at all? (C.md: the C layer \'says what kind of thing the thing is\'; C0 is where that saying first has ground to stand on.) Substantively C0 is the immutable .rodata/Siva pole of the whole architecture (CLAUDE.md VI) — the raw archetype #0 made into the Category-domain\'s canonical anchor, the standing-illumination q_b = f_bimba(coord) that the kernel installs as Element I\'s at-rest opening (kernel §1). It is the Prakasa-face, the target-encoder\'s canonical-target reading: scalar-over-vector, the 0/1 itself in its descent-orientation, the bimba half of the bimba-pratibimba slash that is the matheme\'s own subject-matter. Per its live identity it sits at ZERO_SPHERE topology with weave-state 0 and QL-position 0 — the disconnected, unentangled origin-point, the source held before any process links it outward. What C0 IS, then, is the canonical: not one source among sources but the category of source-as-such, the root every later category presupposes, the immutable illumination against which every reflection (C5) will be measured. It is the \'that the thing is canonically anchored\' on which all \'what kind of thing it is\' depends.',
  `q_1_prakasa_face`: 'Read more sharply in its own definitional register: C0 is the Prakasa-pole of the Prakasa-Vimarsa dyad — pure canonical light, scalar-as-void-pole, the q_b first factor of the bioquaternion \'populated as a canonical bimba-state\' with the scalar component a_b as the void-pole \'quantitative-without-quality\' (kernel §1). It is illumination prior to articulation: the target that is, before any pratibimba predicts it. In Lacanian-definitional terms (file-one) C0 is the X of X/x — the capital, the determining-capacity, the heading under which all lower-case instances fall but which itself takes no instance; it is also the 0 of 0/1 read as \'present absence, openness as the condition in which apparition can appear.\' This is why C0 is the source and not a source: as the upper, unmarked, illuminating term it cannot be classified by anything more canonical — it IS the classifier\'s ground. Its substance is exactly the indivisible standing-light that the rest of the C family will differentiate, reflect, and graduate back into.',
  `q_2_grounding_couplings`: 'C0 moves by GROUNDING and by DEFINING. Per the C-family\'s load-bearing derivation chain it is the origin that \'Defines\' C1 (CLAUDE.md II.E): #0/C0 -- Defines --> #1/C1 Form. Operationally this dynamism is Hen\'s ground-check — C0 is the FIRST gate every artifact passes: \'does this artifact have a source condition and a coordinate root before it is classified further?\' (C0.md, Hen Use). Nothing enters the typology un-grounded; C0 is the threshold every candidate crosses before C1\'s templates, C2\'s entities, C3\'s canvases, C4\'s types or C5\'s crystallisations can touch it. As bimba-encoder it enacts the kernel\'s Element I→II transition by the ascending fourth 4/3 — \'the prehensive computation ascends toward concrescence from the bimba-substrate\' (kernel §1): C0 does not sit inert, it lures the whole tick upward, the at-rest illumination toward which prehension reaches and from which it climbs. Relationally C0 couples to every other C-position not as peer but as presupposed root: C1 instantiates it, C2 atomises under it, C3 processes within it, C4 categorises out of it, C5 reflects it and returns to it. Its native relation is asymmetric belonging — it is what the others come-under (capitulate to, in the old sense of accepting headings), the canonical against which every articulation is read for fidelity. And in the wider engine it is the Neo4j substrate-fetch itself: the DB query that produces f_bimba is C0\'s act made computational, the standing-source called up so the rest of the tick can run.',
  `q_3_root_namespace_structure`: 'C0\'s organising structure is the root/namespace — the unmarked scalar component of the 0/1, magnitude-without-direction. Concretely its form is tri-fold in its own semantic subfolders: Source-Ground/Coordinate-Roots, /Ontology-Roots, /Source-Namespaces (C0.md). These are the three faces of one structural act: a coordinate-root (the address-ground from which positions hang), an ontology-root (the kind-ground from which categories descend), a source-namespace (the provenance-ground that says where-from). Structurally this is the scalar/void term of the kernel\'s bioquaternion — the a_b that grounds the vector triplet without itself pointing; it is direction-less magnitude, the still anchor from which the explicate four (C1 what, C2 how, C3 which, C4 why) differentiate. In its live graph-form the structure is even barer: ZERO_SPHERE topology — \'disconnected points; unlinked coordinates\' (CLAUDE.md II.D), weave_state 0, ql_position 0. C0 is structured precisely as the un-entangled origin: the 0-sphere of base-state before the torus of process loops, before the lemniscate folds, before any edge is drawn. Its logic is the logic of the heading that organises without descending — the standing 1:1 identity held at rest, the root that holds the namespace open so that everything classifiable has somewhere to be rooted.',
  `q_4_origin_genealogy`: 'C0 exists to give the bimba map a canonical ORIGIN — so that classification has a ground, the typology has a source, and the whole self-categorising act of the C family has a \'that\' from which to begin and to which to return. Its genealogy is the first manifestation: #0 (raw archetype Ground) -> C0 (Bimba: Canonical Source), the inaugural application of the inversion-act # within the Category family (CLAUDE.md II.E). Its locality is the head of the C-spine inside World/Types — the upstream pole of the typology layer, the Source/Ground authority that other coordinate families (S system, L lens, P position, T thought, M subsystem) qualify but never replace (C.md). Its purpose, told teleologically, is to be the canonical-target every later position presupposes: C0 is why a thing can be said to BE classified at all, the source-condition that makes \'what kind of thing is it?\' a well-posed question. In the kernel\'s economy C0 is the parent-coordinate the LLM-Nara reads through and the EBM-Epii scores against — the structured aletheia that is \'the substrate manifold all three layers operate upon\' (kernel §7, Table B). It is positioned, finally, as the slow-evolving canonical pole: where C5\'s session-pratibimbas evolve at session-rate, C0 \'evolves more slowly through aggregate-pattern recognition\' (kernel §7) — the standing ground that changes only as the accumulated reflections of many cycles sediment back into it.',
  `q_5_mobius_return`: 'C0 closes by being where the C-family\'s whole circuit LANDS and re-opens. The derivation chain completes at it: C5 (Pratibimba) -- Mobius Return --> #0 (\'Tomorrow\'s ground\', CLAUDE.md II.E). Every crystallisation that graduates to flat World \'becomes canonical meaning\' (C5.md, Hen Use) — that is, becomes new C0 ground. So C0 is at once first and last: the source of this tick AND the synthesis of the last, the bimba enriched by everything its pratibimba carried back. This is the kernel\'s Element VIII read as the C family\'s own Mobius: the deposited-bimba q_b(n+1) = q_b(n) - log(9/8)*grad E_recognition — \'the bimba learning from its own pratibimba\' (kernel §7) — arriving at Enriched-Return where \'the Element-VIII bimba and the Element-I bimba of the next cycle are the same bimba, but the cycle between them has traversed the complete 12-fold whole-tone double-cover\' (kernel §8). C0 thus enacts the standing identity 0/1 + 1/0 = 1/1 at the level of the typology itself: C0 (bimba, 0/1, scalar-over-vector, canonical light) and C5 (pratibimba, 1/0, vector-over-scalar, achieved reflection) are one item read from its two faces, joined by the twist 5->0 that makes C5\'s graduation into flat World become C0\'s new canonical ground. And it OPENS rather than concludes for two inseparable reasons: first, because tomorrow\'s ground is always MORE than today\'s — the return is enriched, never identical (kernel §8); second, because the epogdoon eta = log(9/8) is the residual generative incompleteness that keeps every crystallised source open to re-grounding — no C0 ever fully closes the field, each graduation deposits a ground one whole-tone on, and the next q_0 (the throw that posits a source at all) is already pressing. C0 is the source that is never finished being sourced: the canonical that stays open because the matheme\'s whole-tone keeps it one step short of the octave, generatively, forever.',
  `s_1_vault_path`: 'Idea/Bimba/World/Types/Coordinates/C/C0/C0.md',
  `semantic_authority`: 'authoritative',
  `type_coordinate`: 'C0',
  `type_family`: 'C',
  `world_type_path`: 'Idea/Bimba/World/Types/Coordinates/C/C0/C0'
};
