  `c_3_moc_evidence_paths`: ['Idea/Bimba/World/Types/Coordinates/C/C4/C4.canvas', 'Idea/Bimba/World/Types/Coordinates/C/C4/C4.md'],
  `c_4_artifact_role`: 'type-moc-pointer',
  `c_4_layer`: 'COORDINATE',
  `c_5_crystallisation_state`: 'incubating_type_index',
  `c_5_embedding`: [],
  `c_layer_path`: 'Idea/Bimba/World/Types/Coordinates/C/C4',
  `c_layer_role`: 'types_contexts_mocs',
  `crystallisation_state`: 'incubating_type_index',
  `q_0_categorial_horizon`: 'Type does not begin. It arrives only where processes have already stabilised enough to be gathered — C3 categorized-into C4 (CLAUDE.md II.E). Its thrown ground is the raw archetype #4, the Context/Type position, the LEMNISCATE anchor (c_4_topo_mode: LEMNISCATE on the live node): the formal pattern that incubates inward before any folder is yet decided to BE a type. What C4 presupposes is the whole field of instances it will frame — it cannot say \'what kind of thing\' until there are things, and cannot supply a residency-law until something seeks residence. Read in position-4\'s own voice (the immutable-subject §4): #4 is \'the contextual position — the position of relation-to-all\', the field in which all states are available together; C4\'s pre-given horizon is exactly this un-thematised availability, the as-yet-undifferentiated \'where things could belong\'. Its void-pole is the folder not yet judged: the container, or the incubation-folder, hovering before Hen\'s MOC-index judgement decides whether it is a real authority at all (C4.md, Hen Use). C4 stands on the thrown givenness of a populated-but-unsorted world that silently asks \'under what authority, in what context, does each of these belong?\' — a question that is total (it encompasses every instance) yet, like every horizon, totally incidental (it is never itself one of the instances). The categorial horizon is present-throughout and never present-as-thing.',
