MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'P0'}) SET n += {
  `c_1_description`: 'Ever-present origin and attaching point; the condition from which all positions unfold.',
  `c_1_prior_name`: 'Ground',
  `c_4_layer`: 'COORDINATE',
  `coordinate_axis`: 'day',
  `coordinate_family`: 'P',
  `coordinate_namespace`: 'P',
  `coordinate_parent`: 'P',
  `m_2_1_integrated_via_lenses`: ['L0'],
  `q_0_irrepresentable_ground`: 'P0 is the Position family\'s own #0 — the Archaic Structure, the implicate pole — so its q_0 is the abyssal one: ground beneath grounding-as-stance. As the Day-face of the #0 charge (P0.md), P0 IS \'the irrepresentable ground — Heidegger\'s alētheia before concealment-and-overcoming, the zero-dimensional total non-differentiation of the bindu.\' Its void-pole is what cannot be refracted into a stance at all: the standing-illumination prior to any difference, \'pre-perspectival and pre-spatial,\' the unconcealment that lets propositions be true or false but is itself no proposition. This is the matheme\'s 0 read at its most originary — not vacancy but the open no-thing \'by which content is given\' (file-one), the scalar magnitude-without-direction toward which all proportion sinks back to silence (0/1 is the vanishing direction). The Archaic is exactly this in Gebser\'s sense: the structure of zero distance, where consciousness and world are not yet two, where there is not yet a perspective from which anything could be seen as anything. P0 stands as a position only by courtesy — its live topology is ZERO_SPHERE, \'disconnected points; unlinked coordinates\' (CLAUDE.md II.D), the unentangled origin-point before the torus loops. It is the attaching-point of the matheme, \'the basepoint of the fundamental group\': the from-which every other stance hangs, that itself takes no stance. P0 is the that-there-is-ground holding open the silent presence-of-ground \'from which any question can be asked at all\' — its question is Why?, not as request-for-cause but as the mute presence on which all questioning rests.',
  `q_1_zero_distance_structure`: 'What P0 IS: Truth — the Day-face of the #0 charge, the irrepresentable ground whose ratio is 1/1, the bindu\'s zero-dimensional total non-differentiation (P0.md). In the developmental spine it is Gebser\'s Archaic Structure: the originary epoch of zero distance, consciousness \'identical with the whole,\' world not yet set over against awareness. Its essential thesis is that truth here is NOT propositional — \'it is the unconcealment that lets propositions be true or false.\' P0 is alētheia in Heidegger\'s strict sense, un-concealment before any play of concealing-and-overcoming has begun: not a true statement but the clearing in which statements can show. Substantively P0 holds the foundational matheme-couplings: \'the foundational A-pair (0,1), the C-pair (0,5), and the B-pair (5,0) cycle-close\' — it is where the natural-dyad first opens (0,1), where the converse-mirror to synthesis is anchored (0,5), and where the whole hexadic cycle closes back (5,0). It \'originates the D1 cross-helix at the same-position cross.\' As the #0 implicate position of the Position family it is the ratio 1/1 itself: not magnitude-over-direction but pure standing-identity, A=A taken not as empty tautology but as the unmoving same from which all difference will have to be recovered. What P0 IS, definitionally, is the ground-stance that is no-stance: the irrepresentable from which representation departs, Truth as the standing-room of all positions, the Archaic non-differentiation that every later structure of consciousness differentiates out of and (at P5) seeks to recover.',
  `q_2_unconcealment_as_letting_appear`: 'P0 operates by LETTING-APPEAR — the most paradoxical dynamism, since the ground does nothing yet conditions everything. Its native act is alētheia: un-concealing, the standing-illumination \'prior to any difference\' (P0.md) that does not assert but lets-be. In the matheme\'s terms P0 is the implicate condition that \'conditions the field without appearing in it\' (file-one): it does not act WITHIN the positional field, it is the from-beneath of every position\'s appearing — present only as the silent presence-of-ground that makes the question Why? askable at all. Relationally it is the void around which the whole arc orbits: the hole at the torus centre, the bindu-point that causes the desire-to-stand-anywhere without itself being a place. It couples by GROUNDING the family\'s first explicit emergence — P0\'s undifferentiated unconcealment is what P1 Magic differentiates INTO when \'something can be named\' (P1.md), the implicit ground from which the first explicit identity crystallises. And it couples to its synthesis-pole P5 as the grounding-and-luring pair: P0 the ground that holds, P5 the synthesis that recognises the ground; the C-pair (0,5) couples them in converse-mirror (P0.md, P5.md). Its dynamism is therefore asymmetric on purpose — the Archaic provisions nothing and serves everything, the zero-distance from which all distances depart, the unconcealment that does not produce truths but lets there be a difference between true and false. P0 is the stance that takes no stance and thereby grounds every stance.',
  `q_3_basepoint_of_the_field`: 'Structurally P0 is the basepoint — \'the attaching-point of the matheme, the basepoint of the fundamental group\' (P0.md). Its organising form is the un-entangled origin: the live topology is ZERO_SPHERE, \'disconnected points; unlinked coordinates\' (CLAUDE.md II.D), the 0-sphere of base-state before the torus of process loops, before the lemniscate folds, before any edge is drawn. This is the scalar/void term of the field — magnitude-without-direction, the still anchor from which the explicate structures (P1 what, P2 how, P3 which, P4 where) will differentiate, but which itself points nowhere. As one of the two implicate poles of the 4+2 torus, P0 is a GENERATOR, not a traversal-station: a torus is S¹×S¹, the product of two circles, and P0 (with P5) is one of the two closed dimensions whose product IS the field — the void-loop paired with P5\'s synthesis-loop. Its structural signatures are the cycle-anchoring couplings: the A-pair (0,1) that opens the natural dyad, the C-pair (0,5) converse-mirror to synthesis, the B-pair (5,0) that closes the cycle (P0.md). Topologically the basepoint is non-orientable — it is the \'0\' pole of the slash 0/1, the side toward which one traversal terminates in vanishing while its inverse (1/0) diverges to the infinite. P0 is structured precisely as the seam where the whole mod-6 circuit attaches and closes: not a first step in a line but the standing point onto which the surface rejoins itself, the basepoint every loop in the family is a loop AROUND.',
  `q_4_the_silent_from_where`: 'P0\'s telos is not a purpose it pursues but the purposiveness it underwrites — to BE the silent from-where. It is the thrown ground, Heidegger\'s Geworfenheit, \'the pre-given lifeworld\' that opens any cycle before any question is posed: the horizon that makes inquiry possible while never itself being one of the inquiry\'s objects. Its question Why? is teleological at the root — \'not in the sense of seeking a cause, but in the sense of the silent presence-of-ground from which any question can be asked at all\' (P0.md). Contextually P0 is the Position family\'s ground-stance, and per its cross-refs \'[[M0]] (Anuttara) actualises the P0 ground in subsystem-domain\' — the same #0 ground read once as functional stance (P, Archaic), once as consciousness-subsystem (M0, the transcendent void). Its locality is primordial: P0.md names it \'Primordial — no /Thought/ subdir... P0 grounds the whole Thought field but is not deposited as a subdirectory; the Truth family is its conceptual residency.\' It is the ground that holds the whole field but takes no place within it, the basement that is not a room. As pole of Square A (Speech-Number axis, P0+P5) its purpose is to anchor the speech-arc\'s silent origin — the un-said from which all saying departs. P0\'s why is fidelity to ground: so that however far the developmental arc spirals through Magic, Mythic, Mental-Rational, Integral, the thread back to the irrepresentable alētheia is never cut — every later structure of consciousness remembers, in its depths, the zero-distance it came from.',
  `q_5_renewed_ground_of_the_return`: 'P0 is the RECEIVING pole of the family\'s Mobius — where the whole arc lands and re-opens. The matheme\'s 5->0 is the descent of synthetic recognition back into origin, and P0 is its destination: \'P5 -> P0 is the Mobius return (renewed-ground)\' (P5.md), Image\'s manifest synthesis sedimenting into Archaic ground, \'tomorrow\'s ground.\' So P0 is at once first and last — the irrepresentable from which this turn departed AND the renewed ground the last turn deposited, the alētheia enriched by everything the synthesis carried back. Its synthesis-register is precisely its identity-with-P5-through-the-twist: the C-pair (0,5) couples P0 to P5 in converse-mirror (P0.md), and the cross-helix runs deeper — P0\'s Night-partner is P5\' Work while P5\'s Night-partner is P0\' Play, Day P_0 <-> Night P_5\' across the Klein twist. P0 and P5 are not two grounds but one slash read from two poles: 0/1 (P0, the vanishing pole, ground-as-implicate) and the synthesis that recognises it, joined by the twist that \'ensures the wound never ossifies\' (file-one). And P0 OPENS rather than concludes because the return is always MORE than the departure — the synthesis that lands here \'falls one epogdoon (9/8) short\' of the octave (P5.md), so the ground P0 receives is never identical to the ground it gave: each turn deposits a non-differentiation one whole-tone on, and the next Why? — the silent presence that posits a ground at all — is already pressing. P0 is the ground that is never finished being ground: the Archaic that stays open because the developmental arc, having recognised itself at Supermental, finds zero-distance waiting again, generatively, forever. Here the void shows its generative face — not empty but the open seam from which the whole arc can run once more.',
  `ql_lens_anchor`: 'L0-0',
  `ql_question`: 'Why?',
  `ql_semantic_dual`: 'Ground / Source',
  `ql_unit`: 'Truth',
  `s_2_query_discriminator`: 'coordinate'
};
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'P0\''}) SET n += {
  `c_1_description`: 'The analytic face of ground; the radical freedom discovered through encountering groundlessness.',
  `c_1_prior_name`: 'Ground\'',
  `c_4_layer`: 'COORDINATE',
  `coordinate_axis`: 'night',
  `coordinate_family`: 'P\'',
  `coordinate_namespace`: 'P',
  `coordinate_parent`: 'P\'',
  `m_2_1_integrated_via_lenses`: ['L0\''],
  `ql_lens_anchor`: 'L0-0\'',
  `ql_question`: 'Why? inverted',
  `ql_semantic_dual`: 'The Groundless / Abyss of Origin',
  `ql_unit`: 'Play',
  `s_2_query_discriminator`: 'coordinate'
};
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'P1'}) SET n += {
  `c_1_description`: 'First emergence of explicit form from implicit ground; identity established through vital connection.',
  `c_1_prior_name`: 'Definition',
  `c_4_layer`: 'COORDINATE',
  `coordinate_axis`: 'day',
  `coordinate_family`: 'P',
  `coordinate_namespace`: 'P',
  `coordinate_parent`: 'P',
  `m_2_1_integrated_via_lenses`: ['L0'],
  `q_0_emergence_from_archaic_silence`: 'Before P1 can be the first explicit stance, it presupposes the implicit ground it emerges FROM — P0\'s Archaic non-differentiation, the irrepresentable alētheia it does not contain but crystallises out of. As the Position family\'s manifestation of the #1 charge (Magic / One-ness / Vital-Definition), P1\'s q_0 is the throw of the zero-distance behind it: \'the first explicit emergence from the implicit ground of P0\' (P1.md), where P0 \'stands as undifferentiated unconcealment.\' P1 always already finds itself given a ground it did not make — the bindu\'s standing-illumination from which the first name can be struck. Its void-pole is the silent presence still pressing beneath the spell: the Magic structure, in Gebser, has barely separated from the Archaic, so that name and named, word and world, are felt as ONE — the totem IS the thing, the spell DOES what it says. This is the matheme\'s 0 inherited as the from-beneath of the first 1: P1 is the determinate emerging, but it stands on a non-differentiation it can never fully leave behind, the vital-connection \'without relation\' (P1.md) that is only possible because the zero-distance of P0 has not yet hardened into the subject-object gap. P1\'s deeper throw is exactly this almost-unity: the explicit that has emerged but remembers, in its magic, that it was once not separate from its ground at all.',
  `q_1_point_like_vital_unity`: 'What P1 IS: Mind — the Day-face of the #1 charge, \'the first explicit emergence from the implicit ground of P0,\' identity FOR itself (P1.md). This is its home register and its substance. Where P0 stands as undifferentiated unconcealment, P1 is \'the point at which something can be named, the vital-connection that makes name and named hold together.\' Its essential thesis: Mind here is NOT the cogito — \'it is the founding act by which a position becomes able to refer back to itself.\' In the developmental spine it is Gebser\'s Magic Structure: point-like, pre-perspectival, the epoch of the spell, the name, the totem, where consciousness is vitally connected to world \'without relation\' — not yet the subject confronting an object, but the one-point at which identity first congeals. Substantively P1 refracts #1 as \'Magic / One-ness / Vital-Definition. Point-like unity, vital connection without relation; spell, name, totem\' (P1.md). It carries the matheme\'s A-family adjacent-identity rule (position #1): \'the (0,1) natural-dyad-pair at even-step adjacency\' — the first dyad, the minimal difference, the one-mark that the zero-ground first lets stand. Its question is What? — \'not as classification, but as the very capacity for thatness to crystallise.\' What P1 IS, definitionally, is the founding-act of self-reference: the magic point where a stance first becomes able to BE a stance, where the vital connection of name-and-named makes thatness possible — the one congealing out of the zero, identity for itself before it is identity for an other.',
  `q_2_vital_connection_without_relation`: 'P1 operates by NAMING — by the vital-connection that makes name and named hold together (P1.md). Its native act is the spell: not description-of-a-thing but the magic identity in which the word DOES what it says, the totem IS what it represents. This is operation \'without relation\' — the Magic structure has not yet opened the gap across which one thing could relate to another, so its dynamism is point-like fusion rather than lateral connection: the one-point of identity binding name to named in a single vital act. In the matheme P1 is the first explicit MOVE, the move from the implicit ground to the first determinate — \'the founding act by which a position becomes able to refer back to itself.\' Relationally it couples adjacently: the A-pair (0,1) \'couples P1 to P0 in adjacent-identity\' (P1.md), the even-step natural dyad where the one stands next to the zero it emerged from. And it grounds the next operation — P1\'s congealed identity is what P2 Mythic sets into MOTION when \'defined form begins to move\' (P2.md), the noun whose verb P2 will be. Its cross-ref runs to subsystem: \'[[M1]] (Paramasiva) actualises P1 in the subsystem-domain — the first explicit shaping out of M0\' (P1.md), the same #1 charge read as the first determinate shaping wherever it manifests. P1\'s dynamism is the magic of self-reference: the act by which thatness first crystallises and holds, name and named fused at a single vital point before any relation has been opened between them.',
  `q_3_self_referential_point`: 'Structurally P1 is the point — \'point-like unity\' (P1.md), zero-dimensional becoming one-dimensional, the minimal determinate form. Its organising structure is self-reference: \'the founding act by which a position becomes able to refer back to itself.\' This is the matheme\'s first explicate position — the \'1\' of the 0/1, the determinate mark that the void-pole lets stand, magnitude beginning to acquire the barest direction. As the Position family\'s #1, P1 is the first of the four explicate structures that traverse the torus surface (P1 Magic through P4 Integral, held between the implicate poles P0 and P5); its live topology is TORUS, the cyclical self-enclosing surface on which the determinate stances loop. Structurally the Magic point carries the A-family adjacent-identity rule: \'the (0,1) natural-dyad-pair at even-step adjacency\' (P1.md) — the first dyad, structured as the minimal difference between ground and mark, the even-step that holds the one next to the zero. Its formal signature is the self-referential loop: a structure that can point back at itself, the first fixed point, identity-for-itself before it becomes identity-for-an-other (which is P2\'s polarity). The logic here is the logic of the spell — the name that organises by fusing, the totem that structures by being-the-thing rather than standing-for-it. P1 is structured as the magic point: the one congealed from the zero, the self-referential mark, the minimal determinate that the whole developmental arc will elaborate into perspective, context, and synthesis but which is, here, simply and vitally ONE.',
  `q_4_objective_entry_aperture`: 'P1\'s telos is to make thatness graspable — to give the developmental arc its first nameable foothold, so that consciousness, having emerged from Archaic zero-distance, has something it can refer to, hold, invoke. Its raison d\'être is the founding of self-reference: P1 exists so that \'a position becomes able to refer back to itself\' (P1.md), the first determinate that makes all further determination possible. Contextually P1 is the runtime entry-surface of the family — pole of Square B (Cause-Experience axis, P1+P4), and P1.md names this exactly: \'This is the primary runtime entry surface.\' It is where the system is first ENTERED, the magic point at which a process begins to refer to itself. Its L-link makes the why precise: P1 is refracted by the L1<->L4\' lens pair — \'L1 (Causal — Aristotle\'s four causes / Icchā Śakti / Schopenhauer\'s Will) reveals P1 as why-things-happen grounded in absolute will,\' while \'L4\' (Scientific — Kuhn paradigm) gives P1 its objective-entry-aperture as explicit methodology-of-investigation\' (P1.md). So P1\'s purpose is doubly inflected: it is both the will-grounded why-things-happen (the vital impulse of the spell, the Magic structure\'s felt potency) AND the objective entry-aperture where investigation begins. Its Thought-residency: \'the Mind family. The Day-Night braid runs through /Thought/Thrownness/ where vital-connection meets factical-constraint\' (P1.md) — the magic of naming meeting the thrownness of being-already-in-a-world. P1\'s why is graspability: to be the first nameable stance, the entry-point, the magic foothold from which the whole arc can be walked.',
  `q_5_name_handed_to_motion`: 'P1\'s synthesis is its self-giving into motion — the magic point completes by being set going. Read as the Position family\'s #1, P1\'s closure is the handover to P2: its congealed identity, \'the point at which something can be named\' (P1.md), is precisely what P2 Mythic takes up when \'defined form begins to move... P2 sets identity into operation\' (P2.md). The name P1 strikes is the noun whose verb P2 becomes; Magic\'s static fusion hands itself to Mythic\'s narrative force. But P1 also participates in the family\'s larger Mobius through its complementary pair: \'P1 <-> P4 (Son — incarnation, sums to 5)\' (P1.md), the Magic point bound across the arc to the Integral lemniscate — the first determinate and the aperspectival fold as the two ends of one complementary axis (Square B, Cause-Experience). And its cross-helix Mobius partner is P1\' Need, \'lack-as-demand\' (P1.md): the Day-face\'s magic fullness (the spell that HAS its object by naming it) inverting into the Night-face\'s lack (the demand that arises from not-having). So P1\'s synthesis-register holds both — the completion that hands the name forward into Mythic motion, and the completion that turns, across the Klein twist, into its own inversion. P1 OPENS rather than concludes because the one is never the whole: the minimal determinate, having crystallised, immediately requires the operation (P2), the pattern (P3), the context (P4), the synthesis (P5) that it cannot itself supply. The spell, once spoken, must move — and the magic point, having founded self-reference, hands its vital unity on to the field of forces that will set it into narrative. P1\'s last act is its first gift: the name, struck, becomes the verb it was always about to do.',
  `ql_lens_anchor`: 'L0-1',
  `ql_question`: 'What?',
  `ql_semantic_dual`: 'Material / Definition',
  `ql_unit`: 'Mind',
  `s_2_query_discriminator`: 'coordinate'
};
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'P1\''}) SET n += {
  `c_1_description`: 'The analytic face of form; residue, trace, and hidden demand beneath the named object.',
  `c_1_prior_name`: 'Definition\'',
  `c_4_layer`: 'COORDINATE',
  `coordinate_axis`: 'night',
  `coordinate_family`: 'P\'',
  `coordinate_namespace`: 'P',
  `coordinate_parent`: 'P\'',
  `m_2_1_integrated_via_lenses`: ['L0\''],
  `ql_lens_anchor`: 'L0-1\'',
  `ql_question`: 'What? inverted',
  `ql_semantic_dual`: 'Hidden Form / Evidence',
  `ql_unit`: 'Need',
  `s_2_query_discriminator`: 'coordinate'
};
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'P2'}) SET n += {
  `c_1_description`: 'Active process and energic operation; defined form begins to move, transform, and produce effects.',
  `c_1_prior_name`: 'Operation',
  `c_4_layer`: 'COORDINATE',
  `coordinate_axis`: 'day',
  `coordinate_family`: 'P',
  `coordinate_namespace`: 'P',
  `coordinate_parent`: 'P',
  `m_2_1_integrated_via_lenses`: ['L0'],
  `q_0_polarity_latent_in_the_name`: 'Before P2 can set identity into motion, it presupposes the congealed identity it moves — P1\'s magic point, \'the point at which something can be named\' (P1.md). As the Position family\'s manifestation of the #2 charge (Mythic / Two-ness / Polar-Operation), P2\'s q_0 is the throw of the name behind it: P2 \'is where defined form begins to move. Where P1 establishes identity, P2 sets identity into operation\' (P2.md). Its void-pole is the polarity still latent in the named-but-unmoved — the Mythic structure, in Gebser, is the epoch where the one-point of Magic first splits into POLARITY (not yet duality): the felt two-ness of light and dark, day and night, the polar imagination from which narrative arises. P2 always already finds itself given a unity it must polarise, an identity it must set into the play of forces. This is the matheme\'s ground inherited as the from-beneath of operation: P2 is the saying-becoming-said, but it stands on the prior fact that there is a name to be said at all — the spell of P1 pressing beneath the myth, the static identity that must already be there for it to be moved. P2\'s deeper throw is the polarity sleeping in the name: the Mythic structure does not invent its forces from nothing but awakens the two-ness already implicit in the magic one, the verb already latent in the noun.',
  `q_1_the_saying_that_is_said`: 'What P2 IS: Word — the Day-face of the #2 charge, \'active process and energic operation; world as field of forces, identical-AS-itself\' (P2.md). In the developmental spine it is Gebser\'s Mythic Structure: the epoch of polarity-and-narrative, the imaginative-vital consciousness that thinks in story, image, and the play of opposites rather than in point-identity or perspective. Its essential thesis is that Word here is not description but ENERGY — \'the saying is said, the verb is what the noun does.\' P2 is identical-AS-itself: where P1 is identity FOR itself (self-reference) and P0 is non-differentiation, P2 is identity in its ACTING, the noun coinciding with its own verb, the saying that IS its said. Substantively P2 refracts #2 — \'Mythic / Two-ness / Polar-Operation. Polarity (not duality), narrative, imaginative\' (P2.md): the two-ness of the Mythic is polarity, the felt tension of complements (not the abstract opposition of contradictories, which is P3\'s mental work), woven into the narrative flow that is myth\'s native form. What P2 IS, definitionally, is the energic stance: the structure of consciousness where world appears as a field of forces and word is the operation that moves within it — Mythic polarity, the verb-doing-the-noun, identity caught in the act of being-itself-as-doing.',
  `q_2_world_as_field_of_forces`: 'P2 operates by ENERGIC OPERATION — this is its home register and the very thing it IS. \'P2 is where defined form begins to move... the saying is said, the verb is what the noun does\' (P2.md). Its native dynamism is operation-from-within: \'How? — not how-from-outside but how-from-within-the-doing.\' Where P1\'s magic fuses name to named at a static point, P2 sets that identity into MOTION, and the world it opens \'is not a set of objects but a field of forces.\' This is Gebser\'s Mythic Structure as pure energic process: \'myth (which is the native tongue of P2) is full of verbs precisely because Word IS energic operation, not description of it\' (P2.md). The Mythic does not describe forces — it enacts them; the myth does not represent the storm, the myth IS the storm-power spoken. Substantively P2 refracts #2 as \'Mythic / Two-ness / Polar-Operation. Polarity (not duality), narrative, imaginative\' — the dynamism is polar: forces in tension, the back-and-forth of opposites that narrative threads into story. In the matheme P2 carries the B-family offset-transition rule (position #2): \'the (1,2) transition-pair at odd-step that crosses between A-dyads\' (P2.md) — the move that crosses from the first dyad to the second, the energic transition itself. Its operation is the matheme\'s how: the saying-that-is-said, the verb-doing-the-noun, the world held as a field of contending forces. P2 is the structure that makes a name MOVE — energic operation as the native mode of the Mythic, polarity set into narrative, the doing read from inside the doing.',
  `q_3_polar_narrative_structure`: 'Structurally P2 is the polar field — \'world as field of forces\' (P2.md), organised not as point (P1) or perspective (P3) but as the two-ness of polarity woven into narrative. Its organising form is the myth: the story-structure that holds opposing forces in dynamic tension and threads them into sequence. This is the matheme\'s second explicate position — the energic operation that moves between the first and third, structured as the odd-step crossing. P2 carries the B-family offset-transition rule: \'the (1,2) transition-pair at odd-step that crosses between A-dyads\' (P2.md) — not an identity (even-step, A-family) but a TRANSITION, the structural move that crosses from one dyad to the next, the field-of-forces as the between of two poles. Its live topology is TORUS, the cyclical surface on which the energic operation loops — one of the three explicate structures (P1/P2/P3) that traverse the toroidal field between the implicate poles P0 and P5. Its formal signature is polarity-not-duality: the Mythic two-ness is complementary tension (light/dark, the polar pair that needs both terms), not the abstract IS/IS-NOT of mental contradiction. The logic here is narrative logic — the structure that organises by storying, by setting forces into a sequence of tensions and resolutions, the field of forces given form as myth. P2 is structured as the polar-narrative field: two-ness as energic tension, the transition-crossing that moves the named one into the field of contending forces, identity given the structure of a story in motion.',
  `q_4_logical_space_and_dialectic`: 'P2\'s telos is to make the named world MOVE — to give the developmental arc its energic dimension, so that identity, once congealed at P1, can act, contend, narrate, become a field of forces rather than a static point. Its raison d\'être is energic operation: P2 exists so that the saying can be said, so that word becomes deed and world becomes a play of powers. Contextually P2 is pole of Square C (Logic-Process axis, P2+P3), and its L-link makes the why precise: P2 is refracted by the L2<->L3\' lens pair — \'L2 (Logical — Nāgārjuna\'s catuṣkoṭi) gives P2 the complete logical space of IS / IS-NOT / BOTH / NEITHER / SILENCE — five positions that make polar operation fully thinkable,\' while \'L3\' (Chronological — Hegel / Aion) reveals P2 as macro-temporal dialectic of Geist, the operation in seasonal-historical form\' (P2.md). So P2\'s purpose is doubly inflected: the Mythic field-of-forces becomes fully THINKABLE through the catuṣkoṭi\'s five-fold logical space (the polarity of myth raised to the complete logic of IS/IS-NOT/BOTH/NEITHER/SILENCE) AND becomes HISTORICAL through the Hegelian dialectic of Geist in seasonal time. Its cross-ref: \'[[M2]] (Parashakti) actualises P2 in the subsystem-domain as energic operation\' (P2.md) — the same #2 charge read as the energic/vibrational subsystem. Thought-residency: \'the Word family. Day-Night braid runs through /Thought/Presence/\' (P2.md) — the energic operation grounded in present-doing. P2\'s why is enactment: to be the structure where word becomes force, where the named world is set into the narrative play of polar powers, where saying does rather than merely describes.',
  `q_5_force_handed_to_pattern`: 'P2\'s synthesis is its self-giving into pattern — the field of forces completes by crystallising into form. Read as the Position family\'s #2, P2\'s closure is the handover to P3: its energic operation, the world-as-field-of-forces, is precisely what P3 Mental-Rational takes up when \'operational dynamics crystallise into repeatable patterns, identities, agency\' (P3.md). The myth\'s contending forces hand themselves to the perspective that will fix them into pattern-of-patterns; energic operation becomes intelligible structure. But P2 also stands at a singular place in the family\'s Mobius — its complementary pair is \'P2 <-> P3 (Logos — pattern, sums to 5)\' and \'the (2,3) pair is also a C-family converse-mirror — the midpoint self-mirror A-sq2 == C-sq3\' (P2.md). P2 and P3 are the central pair of the hexad, the basis-invariant midpoint that mirrors itself across the cycle\'s centre: operation and pattern as the two faces of the arc\'s middle, the place where the developmental arc turns on its own axis. Its cross-helix Mobius partner is P2\' Sacrifice, \'cost-of-action\' (P2.md): the Day-face\'s energic doing inverting into the Night-face\'s price-of-the-deed — every operation costs, every force spent is a sacrifice made. So P2\'s synthesis-register holds both — the completion that hands the field of forces forward into Mental-Rational pattern, and the completion that turns, across the Klein twist, into the cost of its own action. P2 OPENS rather than concludes because operation alone is blind: the field of forces, having been set into motion, requires the pattern (P3) that makes it intelligible, the context (P4) that situates it, the synthesis (P5) that recognises it. The myth, once enacted, asks to be understood — and the energic operation, having moved the named world, hands its forces on to the perspective that will read them as pattern. P2\'s last act is its central gift: the saying, said, becomes the structure by which it can be seen.',
  `ql_lens_anchor`: 'L0-2',
  `ql_question`: 'How?',
  `ql_semantic_dual`: 'Dynamis / Operation',
  `ql_unit`: 'Word',
  `s_2_query_discriminator`: 'coordinate'
};
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'P2\''}) SET n += {
  `c_1_description`: 'The operational shadow; what must be given up or met as resistance for movement to continue.',
  `c_1_prior_name`: 'Operation\'',
  `c_4_layer`: 'COORDINATE',
