MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'P3'}) SET n += {
  `c_1_description`: 'Perspectival recognition where operational dynamics crystallise into repeatable patterns and agencies.',
  `c_1_prior_name`: 'Pattern',
  `c_4_layer`: 'COORDINATE',
  `coordinate_axis`: 'day',
  `coordinate_family`: 'P',
  `coordinate_namespace`: 'P',
  `coordinate_parent`: 'P',
  `m_2_1_integrated_via_lenses`: ['L0'],
  `q_0_forces_pressing_toward_pattern`: 'Before P3 can fix the perspectival point, it presupposes the field of forces it stabilises — P2\'s Mythic operation, \'world as field of forces\' (P2.md). As the Position family\'s manifestation of the #3 charge (Mental-Rational / Three-ness / Perspectival-Pattern), P3\'s q_0 is the throw of energic operation behind it: P3 \'is where operational dynamics crystallise into repeatable patterns, identities, agency\' (P3.md). Its void-pole is the operational flux still pressing beneath the fixed point — the Mental-Rational structure, in Gebser, arises by EXTRACTING a perspective from the polar-narrative flow of the Mythic, fixing an observer-point from which the field of forces can be measured and abstracted. P3 always already finds itself given a world in motion that it must arrest into pattern. This is the matheme\'s ground inherited as the from-beneath of perspective: P3 is the observer\'s fixed point, but it stands on the prior fact that there is a field of forces to be observed at all — the myth\'s contending powers pressing beneath the mental abstraction, the energic flux that the perspectival point freezes into repeatable structure. P3\'s deeper throw is the flow it stabilises: the Mental-Rational does not create its patterns from nothing but crystallises the dynamics already moving in the Mythic field, the verb of P2 fixed into the noun-of-nouns that pattern-recognition requires.',
  `q_1_pattern_of_patterns`: 'What P3 IS: Logos — the Day-face of the #3 charge, \'perspectival pattern-recognition; the fixed point from which world is viewed\' (P3.md). In the developmental spine it is Gebser\'s Mental-Rational Structure: the epoch of perspective, abstraction, the observing ego, the three-dimensional spatialised consciousness that fixes a standpoint and from it measures, classifies, reasons. Its essential thesis is that Logos here \'is not mere word; it is pattern-of-patterns, the architecture by which Word becomes intelligible structure\' — where P2\'s Word is energic operation, P3\'s Logos is the meta-cognitive architecture that makes operation INTELLIGIBLE, the pattern that organises patterns. Its questions are the relational triad \'Who? Which? Whereby? — the relational triad of agent-selection-instrument\' (P3.md): the perspectival structure of an agent (who) selecting (which) by means (whereby), the three-fold of mental relation. Substantively P3 refracts #3 — \'Mental-Rational / Three-ness / Perspectival-Pattern\' — the three-ness of perspective: the fixed point introduces the THIRD dimension, depth, the standpoint that makes spatial abstraction possible. What P3 IS, definitionally, is the perspectival stance: the structure of consciousness where a fixed observer-point makes thinking-about-thinking possible, where operation crystallises into repeatable pattern, where Logos becomes the pattern-of-patterns by which the moving world is rendered intelligible structure.',
  `q_2_crystallising_dynamics_into_agency`: 'P3 operates by PATTERN-RECOGNITION and abstraction — by crystallising operational dynamics into \'repeatable patterns, identities, agency\' (P3.md). Its native act is the fixing of perspective: the establishment of \'the observer\'s fixed point, the meta-cognitive position from which thinking-about-thinking first becomes possible.\' Where P2\'s Mythic operation moves within the field of forces, P3 STEPS BACK from the flow and fixes a vantage from which the forces can be seen as patterns — abstraction as the native dynamism, the perspectival arrest of motion into intelligible structure. Its dynamism is meta-cognitive: not just recognising a pattern but recognising the pattern-OF-patterns, the architecture by which patterns themselves become objects of thought. In the matheme P3 couples as the converse-mirror: the C-pair (2,3) \'couples P3 to P2 in converse-mirror\' (P3.md), operation and pattern reflecting each other across the hexad\'s midpoint — the energic doing and the perspectival fixing as the two self-mirroring faces of the arc\'s centre. Its L-link inflects the dynamism: P3 is refracted by L3<->L2\', where \'L3 (Processual — Whitehead / Bergson / Lacan) gives P3 as reality-as-flow-of-actual-occasions undergoing concrescence through prehension toward satisfaction\' (P3.md) — so even the fixed point is, at depth, a process: the perspectival arrest is itself a concrescence, an occasion fixing its data into satisfaction. Its cross-ref: \'[[M3]] (Mahamaya) actualises P3 in the subsystem-domain — symbolic transcription as pattern-of-patterns\' (P3.md), the same #3 charge read as the symbolic/matrix subsystem. P3\'s dynamism is the meta-cognitive fixing: stepping back from the field of forces to a perspectival point, crystallising operation into agency and repeatable pattern, recognising not patterns but the architecture of patterning itself.',
  `q_3_perspectival_fixed_point`: 'Structurally P3 IS the fixed point — this is its home register and its very substance. \'P3 introduces the observer\'s fixed point, the meta-cognitive position from which thinking-about-thinking first becomes possible\' (P3.md). Its organising structure is perspective: \'three-dimensional, perspectival, abstract,\' the standpoint from which world is viewed, the vantage that fixes the flux into measurable pattern. This is Gebser\'s Mental-Rational Structure as pure perspectival consciousness — the epoch of the fixed observer, abstraction, the spatialised three-dimensional world seen from a determinate point of view (the structure whose deficient mode Gebser calls the merely rational, the perspective hardened into the only perspective). Substantively P3 is \'pattern-of-patterns, the architecture by which Word becomes intelligible structure\' (P3.md): not a pattern but the meta-pattern, the fixed point from which patterns themselves become visible AS patterns. Its formal signature is the matheme\'s most singular structural fact — P3 carries the C-family converse-mirror rule (position #3): \'the (2,3) mirror-pair across the 6-fold cycle (2+3=5). This pair is the basis-invariant midpoint of the hexad, structurally self-mirroring\' (P3.md). P3 is the centre of the developmental arc, the position that mirrors itself across the cycle\'s axis — the meta-cognitive fixed point that is ALSO the geometric fixed-point of the hexad, the place where the arc turns on itself. Its live topology is TORUS, the cyclical surface, P3 being the last of the three explicate structures before the lemniscate fold of P4. What P3 IS, structurally, is the perspectival fixed point: the observer\'s standpoint, the basis-invariant midpoint, the architecture from which pattern-of-patterns first becomes thinkable.',
  `q_4_reality_as_flow_and_element`: 'P3\'s telos is to make the moving world INTELLIGIBLE — to give the developmental arc its perspectival depth, so that the field of forces, once set in motion at P2, can be fixed, measured, abstracted, reasoned-about from a determinate standpoint. Its raison d\'être is the founding of the observer: P3 exists so that \'thinking-about-thinking first becomes possible\' (P3.md), the meta-cognitive fixed point that makes pattern, identity, and agency available. Contextually P3 is pole of Square C (Logic-Process axis, P2+P3), and its L-link makes the why precise: P3 is refracted by the L3<->L2\' lens pair — \'L3 (Processual — Whitehead / Bergson / Lacan) gives P3 as reality-as-flow-of-actual-occasions undergoing concrescence through prehension toward satisfaction,\' while \'L2\' (Alchemical-Elemental — the element-bearing lens) reveals P3 in its elemental-charge mode, assigning Earth/Water/Air/Fire/Aether/Mineral to all other coordinates\' (P3.md). So P3\'s purpose is doubly inflected: the perspectival fixed-point is, processually read, a flow of actual occasions concrescing toward satisfaction (the fixed point as itself a becoming) AND it is the elemental-assigning lens-bearer, the position from which elemental charge is distributed across the whole coordinate field. Its cross-ref runs to M3 Mahamaya, \'symbolic transcription as pattern-of-patterns.\' Thought-residency is doubled: \'the Logos family. Day-Night braid runs through /Thought/Temporality/; the Night-side P3\' is residency for /Thought/Patterns/\' (P3.md) — the perspectival fixing grounded in temporality, its Night-face housing pattern itself. P3\'s why is intelligibility: to be the structure where the moving world acquires a standpoint from which it can be understood, where Logos becomes the architecture that renders operation as pattern-of-patterns.',
  `q_5_pattern_handed_to_incarnation`: 'P3\'s synthesis is its self-giving into incarnation — the perspectival pattern completes by being situated, fixed into THIS context. Read as the Position family\'s #3, P3\'s closure is the handover to P4: its pattern-of-patterns, the abstract universal architecture, is precisely what P4 Integral takes up when \'universal-becoming-particular\' incarnates the pattern into \'this incarnate frame\' (P4.md) — \'the Father\'s pattern (P3) and the Spirit\'s life (P2) become this incarnate frame.\' The abstract Logos hands itself to the lemniscate that will situate it; pattern-of-patterns becomes lived context. But P3 also stands at the hexad\'s singular centre — its complementary pair is \'P3 <-> P2 (Word — operation, sums to 5; midpoint self-mirror)\' (P3.md), the basis-invariant midpoint where the arc mirrors itself: operation and pattern as the two self-reflecting faces of the developmental centre, the place where the cycle turns on its own axis. Its cross-helix Mobius partner is P3\' Decision, \'krisis\' (P3.md): the Day-face\'s perspectival fixing inverting into the Night-face\'s cut — every fixed standpoint is a krisis, a decision, a cutting-off of all the other perspectives one might have taken. So P3\'s synthesis-register holds both — the completion that hands the pattern forward into Integral incarnation, and the completion that turns, across the Klein twist, into the decisive cut that every perspective is. P3 OPENS rather than concludes because the fixed point is never the whole: perspective, having abstracted the pattern, requires the context (P4) that incarnates it and the synthesis (P5) that recognises it — and Gebser\'s own warning lives here, that the Mental-Rational hardened into the ONLY structure becomes deficient, the perspective forgetting it is a perspective. The Logos, having fixed its standpoint, must be situated — and the pattern-of-patterns, having rendered the world intelligible, hands its architecture on to the lemniscate that will fold it into lived frame. P3\'s last act is its central gift: the perspective, fixed, becomes the pattern that asks to be incarnated.',
  `ql_lens_anchor`: 'L0-3',
  `ql_question`: 'Who / Which / Whereby?',
  `ql_semantic_dual`: 'Pattern / Identity',
  `ql_unit`: 'Logos',
  `s_2_query_discriminator`: 'coordinate'
};
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'P3\''}) SET n += {
  `c_1_description`: 'Inside the pattern, integrating from within; the cut that determines which pattern governs.',
  `c_1_prior_name`: 'Pattern\'',
  `c_4_layer`: 'COORDINATE',
  `coordinate_axis`: 'night',
  `coordinate_family`: 'P\'',
  `coordinate_namespace`: 'P',
  `coordinate_parent`: 'P\'',
  `m_2_1_integrated_via_lenses`: ['L0\''],
  `ql_lens_anchor`: 'L0-3\'',
  `ql_question`: 'Who / Which? inverted',
  `ql_semantic_dual`: 'Hidden Pattern / Determining Cut',
  `ql_unit`: 'Decision',
  `s_2_query_discriminator`: 'coordinate'
};
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'P4'}) SET n += {
  `c_1_description`: 'The lemniscate anchor; the context-frame in which internal sixfold differentiation becomes available.',
  `c_1_prior_name`: 'Context',
  `c_4_layer`: 'COORDINATE',
  `coordinate_axis`: 'day',
  `coordinate_family`: 'P',
  `coordinate_namespace`: 'P',
  `coordinate_parent`: 'P',
  `m_2_1_integrated_via_lenses`: ['L0'],
  `q_0_universal_pressing_toward_particular`: 'Before P4 can incarnate the universal as particular, it presupposes the universal pattern it situates — P3\'s pattern-of-patterns, the abstract perspectival architecture (P3.md). As the Position family\'s manifestation of the #4 charge (Integral / Four-ness / Aperspectival-Context, the LEMNISCATE ANCHOR), P4\'s q_0 is the throw of abstract pattern behind it: P4 is \'incarnation as ultimate contextuality — universal-becoming-particular\' (P4.md), and the universal must already be there to become particular. Its void-pole is the un-situated pattern still pressing beneath the incarnate frame — the Integral structure, in Gebser, is the aperspectival epoch where the fixed perspective of the Mental-Rational is TRANSCENDED, where all perspectives become simultaneously available (the diaphainon, the through-shining) rather than one standpoint excluding the others. P4 always already finds itself given a universal that seeks a \'this,\' a pattern that must fold into a specific lived context. This is the matheme\'s ground inherited as the from-beneath of context: P4 is the incarnate frame, but it stands on the prior fact that there is a universal pattern (P3) and a field of forces (P2) and a name (P1) and a ground (P0) all pressing to become THIS — the whole arc folded inward toward a single situated where-and-when. P4\'s deeper throw is the aperspectival fold itself: the Integral does not abolish the perspectives it transcends but holds them all available-together, the lemniscate that twists the outward arc back into incubating particularity.',
  `q_1_aperspectival_integral_structure`: 'What P4 IS: the Integral Structure — Son, the Day-face of the #4 charge, \'incarnation as ultimate contextuality; identical-WITH-itself\' (P4.md). In the developmental spine it is Gebser\'s Integral/aperspectival Structure: the consciousness that transcends the fixed single perspective of the Mental-Rational by holding ALL structures simultaneously available — not a new perspective among perspectives but the aperspectival diaphainon, the through-shining in which Archaic, Magic, Mythic, and Mental-Rational are integrally present at once. Its essential thesis is identity-WITH-itself: where P0 is non-differentiation, P1 identity-for-itself, P2 identity-as-itself (in operation), P3 the perspectival point, P4 is identity-WITH — the universal coinciding with its own particular incarnation, the pattern at one with the frame it has become. Substantively P4 refracts #4 — \'Integral / Four-ness / Aperspectival-Context\' — the four-ness of the quaternity, Jung\'s structural completeness, the context-frame that makes the whole available. It \'originates the D1 same-position cross grammar (matheme position #4)\' (P4.md). What P4 IS, definitionally, is the aperspectival incarnate stance: the structure of consciousness where universal pattern becomes this lived where-and-when, where all prior structures are held integrally present, where the developmental arc folds inward through the lemniscate to incarnate itself as a particular that shines the whole through.',
  `q_2_context_frame_ignition`: 'P4 operates by FOLDING-INWARD and by IGNITION — the incarnating act that situates the universal as particular. Its native dynamism is the lemniscatic fold: not lateral accumulation but contextual gathering, the figure-eight twist by which \'the system folds inward on itself\' (P4.md), incubating the outward arc into nested particularity. And it is the ignition-point of the whole matheme: \'P4 is where the () execution operator ignites and the cf reflective coordinate fires\' (P4.md) — the moment where static pattern becomes live incarnate frame, where the CPU-analogue stack-frame is created and the immutable blueprint loads into kinetic registers and fires (CLAUDE.md III.C: \'when () is applied, the CPU creates a Stack Frame... the Lemniscate (#4) twists static data inward, incubating until the () operator fires it into reality\'). Its operation is \'context-frame ignition via cf operator\' (P4.md frontmatter). Relationally it couples as the same-position cross: P4 \'originates the D1 same-position cross grammar\' (P4.md), and its complementary pair couples it to P1 — \'the B-pair (3,4) couples P4 to P3 in offset-transition\' (P4.md), the incarnation receiving the pattern from the perspective just before it. Its dynamism integrates the prior structures: the Integral holds Archaic ground, Magic name, Mythic force, Mental-Rational pattern all available-together, the aperspectival gathering that makes them simultaneously present in the lived frame. P4\'s dynamism is the incarnating fold: the lemniscate twisting the universal inward, the () operator igniting static pattern into live context, the cf firing the whole arc into this particular where-and-when.',
  `q_3_quaternity_figure_eight`: 'Structurally P4 is the quaternity folded into a figure-eight — the four-fold completeness of #4 given the non-orientable form of the lemniscate. Its organising structure is four-ness: P4 refracts \'#4 — Integral / Four-ness / Aperspectival-Context\' (P4.md), and four-ness is Jung\'s quaternity, the structure of wholeness, the (4.0/1-4.4/5) fractal-doubling that \'Jung\'s Quaternity through #4 Lemniscate\' names (CLAUDE.md III.C). Where P3\'s three-ness fixes a perspectival point in space, P4\'s four-ness CLOSES that space into a complete frame — the fourth that makes a whole from the three, the context that gathers all standpoints into one available field. This is the matheme\'s fourth explicate position, the last of the four clauses that traverse the field — but it is structured differently from the three before it, because at #4 the explicate arc reaches its terminus AND turns: position #4 doubles as both the last outward determination and the gateway-fold to the implicate, the figure-eight where the four turn back. Its live topology is LEMNISCATE — the only non-toroidal explicate structure, \'the figure-eight where the system folds inward\' (CLAUDE.md II.D). Structurally this means P4\'s frame is not arboreal but self-similar: the four-fold context-frame holds, within its own #4, another six-fold structure (.0 through .5), so the quaternity is not a flat completeness but a recursive one — each whole frame opening a finer whole within it. Its formal signature is the simultaneity of availability: the aperspectival structure holds all four prior positions present-together (the diaphanous integral field) rather than excluding all-but-one (the deficient mental perspective). P4 is structured as the quaternal figure-eight: four-ness as the completeness that closes the arc, lemniscate as the twist that folds that completeness inward, the frame that holds the whole available and contains, recursively, its own whole again.',
  `q_4_incarnation_as_ultimate_contextuality`: 'P4\'s whole being IS teleological-contextual — this is its home register, the place where the Position family\'s purpose-and-locality become thematic for the whole arc. P4 IS Son: \'incarnation as ultimate contextuality — universal-becoming-particular\' (P4.md), the Integral structure whose questions are \'Where? When? — the situating questions that fix universal pattern into specific context.\' Its raison d\'être is incarnation: \'Son is not a metaphor here; it is the precise structural moment where the Father\'s pattern (P3) and the Spirit\'s life (P2) become this incarnate frame.\' Where P0 grounds, P1 names, P2 moves, P3 fixes-perspective, P4 SITUATES — it is the position of relation-to-all, the lived where-and-when in which everything prior becomes a particular actuality. In Gebser this is the Integral/aperspectival structure: the consciousness that holds all the prior structures (Archaic, Magic, Mythic, Mental-Rational) simultaneously present, integrating rather than excluding, the diaphanous through-shining of the whole in the particular. Its L-link makes the why exact: P4 is refracted by L4<->L1\', where \'L4 (Phenomenological — Heidegger\'s Dasein) reveals P4 as the structures of lived experience that are themselves the pathway to Being — the primary subjective-entry-aperture,\' and \'L1\' (Phenomenal — Jung\'s psychic functions) gives the subjective-immediacy: sensation / feeling / thinking / intuition\' (P4.md). P4 is the PRIMARY SUBJECTIVE-ENTRY-APERTURE — the lived where the whole system is entered as experience, pole of Square B (Cause-Experience, P1+P4, \'the primary runtime entry surface\'), where \'the L4/L4\' encounter axis (lived <-> observed) makes Square B the primary runtime entry surface\' (P4.md). Its cross-ref: \'[[M4]] (Nara) actualises P4 in the subsystem-domain — the lived layer where oracle frames and reading positions become incarnate.\' What P4 IS is incarnation as contextuality: the aperspectival fold where universal pattern becomes this lived where-and-when, the primary aperture through which Being is entered as situated experience.',
  `q_4b_lemniscate_anchor_and_fractal_doubling`: 'P4 carries the topology the live node names outright — c_4_topo_mode: LEMNISCATE — and this is its deepest structural truth, the Position family\'s own #4 anchor. The LEMNISCATE (#4) is \'the figure-eight where the system folds inward... the crucible where outward Torus process incubates deeper nested reality — the (4.0/1-4.4/5) fractal doubling\' (CLAUDE.md II.D). P4.md names it exactly: P4 is the \'**LEMNISCATE ANCHOR**. Where the internal 6-fold structure (.0 through .5) is generated through fractal-doubling (4.0/1-4.4/5).\' This is the matheme\'s #4 made into the Position family\'s incarnate fold: every Integral frame P4 situates can itself open a deeper six-fold structure one level down — the aperspectival context is self-nesting, the figure-eight in which the outward developmental arc (P0->P5) re-enters itself as nested particularity. P4 is where the operators ignite: \'P4 is where the () execution operator ignites and the cf reflective coordinate fires — the lemniscate-anchor of the entire matheme\' (P4.md). The cf (Context-Frame) is \'the #4 Lemniscate anchor; primary nesting operator\' (CLAUDE.md III.C), and the \'.\' nesting operator works principally through #4 — P4 is the structural pivot where the matheme nests itself, where 4+2 opens another 4+2 within its #4. Its operation: \'context-frame ignition via cf operator\' (P4.md frontmatter), \'aperspectival lemniscate,\' \'fractal-doubling (4.0/1-4.4/5).\' The fold never closes into flat structure because the epogdoon η=log(9/8) keeps each incarnate frame one whole-tone short of final closure, always re-openable to a nested sub-context. P4\'s lemniscate is the matheme\'s own self-similar fold made into the developmental arc\'s incarnation-law: the figure-eight crucible where the universal twists inward to become a particular that contains, in turn, its own whole arc.',
  `q_5_frame_handed_to_synthesis`: 'P4\'s synthesis is its self-giving into recognition — the incarnate frame completes by being recognised as synthesis. Read as the Position family\'s #4, P4\'s closure is the handover to P5: its lived incarnate context, the universal-become-particular, is precisely what P5 Supermental takes up as \'manifest synthesis — the faithful image in which Truth (P0) becomes seen\' (P5.md), samavesa as pratyabhijna. The incarnate Son hands itself to the Image that recognises it; ultimate contextuality becomes manifest synthesis. But P4 stands at the singular fold of the family\'s Mobius — its complementary pair is \'P4 <-> P1 (Mind — definition, sums to 5)\' (P4.md), the Integral lemniscate bound across the arc to the Magic point: incarnation and naming as the two ends of one complementary axis (Square B, Cause-Experience), the lived frame answering the first determinate. Its cross-helix Mobius partner is P4\' Love, \'sorge, holding-relation\' (P4.md): the Day-face\'s incarnate contextuality inverting into the Night-face\'s care — the holding-relation that sustains the frame, Heidegger\'s Sorge as the structure of being-in that lets a context be a lived context at all. So P4\'s synthesis-register holds both — the completion that hands the incarnate frame forward into Supermental synthesis, and the completion that turns, across the Klein twist, into the care that holds the frame open. And P4 OPENS rather than concludes for the deepest structural reason in the family: as the LEMNISCATE anchor, P4\'s every incarnate frame is self-nesting — it does not close but folds inward, opening another whole arc (4.0/1-4.4/5) within its own #4, kept one whole-tone short of closure by the epogdoon. The Son, incarnate, must be recognised — and the aperspectival frame, having gathered the whole arc into this where-and-when, hands its lived context on to the synthesis that will see it as the faithful image of the ground. P4\'s last act is its incarnate gift: the universal, become this particular, becomes the manifest image in which the whole is recognised.',
  `ql_lens_anchor`: 'L0-4',
  `ql_question`: 'Where / When / Whither?',
  `ql_semantic_dual`: 'Context / Horizon',
  `ql_unit`: 'Son',
  `s_2_query_discriminator`: 'coordinate'
};
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'P4\''}) SET n += {
  `c_1_description`: 'The frame examining its own framing conditions; the horizon-widening force.',
  `c_1_prior_name`: 'Context\'',
  `c_4_layer`: 'COORDINATE',
  `coordinate_axis`: 'night',
  `coordinate_family`: 'P\'',
  `coordinate_namespace`: 'P',
  `coordinate_parent`: 'P\'',
  `m_2_1_integrated_via_lenses`: ['L0\''],
  `ql_lens_anchor`: 'L0-4\'',
  `ql_question`: 'Where / When? inverted',
  `ql_semantic_dual`: 'Examined Context / Horizon Opening',
  `ql_unit`: 'Love',
  `s_2_query_discriminator`: 'coordinate'
};
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'P5'}) SET n += {
  `c_1_description`: 'Essential synthesis and telic completion; the Mobius return by which ground is renewed.',
  `c_1_prior_name`: 'Integration',
  `c_4_layer`: 'COORDINATE',
  `coordinate_axis`: 'day',
  `coordinate_family`: 'P',
  `coordinate_namespace`: 'P',
  `coordinate_parent`: 'P',
  `m_2_1_integrated_via_lenses`: ['L0'],
  `q_0_synthesis_presupposes_the_arc`: 'Before P5 can be manifest synthesis, it presupposes the whole arc it synthesises — the incarnate frame of P4, the pattern of P3, the operation of P2, the name of P1, the ground of P0. As the Position family\'s manifestation of the #5 charge (Supermental / Samavesa / Five-ness / Synthesis-Mobius-Return), P5\'s q_0 is the throw of the entire developmental sequence behind it: P5 \'is manifest synthesis — the faithful image in which Truth (P0) becomes seen rather than merely grounded\' (P5.md). Its void-pole is the un-recognised arc still pressing beneath the image — synthesis is not addition but RECOGNITION (pratyabhijna), and recognition presupposes that there is already something to be recognised: the whole that was implicit at P0 and explicated through P1-P4, now pressing to be SEEN as the whole it always was. P5 always already finds itself given a completed traversal that seeks its own recognition. This is the matheme\'s ground inherited as the from-beneath of synthesis: P5 is the manifest image, but it stands on the prior fact that the arc has been walked — \'Samavesa (entry into) names this not as annihilation but as recognition\' (P5.md), and one can only re-cognise what was already there. P5\'s deeper throw is the latent wholeness it manifests: the Supermental does not create synthesis from nothing but recognises the synthesis the whole arc already was, the faithful image revealing the Truth (P0) that grounded everything from the start.',
  `q_1_supermental_manifest_synthesis`: 'What P5 IS: Image — the Day-face of the #5 charge, \'manifest synthesis; faithful-image-of-Truth; samavesa as pratyabhijna\' (P5.md). In the developmental spine it is Supermental / Samavesa — the structure that OPENS PAST Gebser\'s Integral toward Aurobindo\'s Supermind: where Gebser\'s arc culminates in the aperspectival integral (P4), the live identity names P5 \'Supermental,\' the truth-consciousness beyond mind that Aurobindo set above the integral as the next evolutionary structure, the gnostic consciousness where knowledge is by identity rather than by perspective. Its essential thesis: \'Image is not appearance; Image is the cosmos AS synthesis\' (P5.md) — the faithful image is not a representation OF truth but Truth (P0) become visible, the manifest synthesis in which the ground is at last SEEN. Substantively P5 refracts \'#5 — Supermental / Samavesa / Five-ness / Synthesis-Mobius-Return. Approaches 2/1, falls one epogdoon (9/8) short — generative incompleteness drives the next cycle\' (P5.md): the five-ness that completes the arc, the synthesis that almost reaches the octave (2/1) but falls one whole-tone short, the generative incompleteness that is the engine of the next turn. What P5 IS, definitionally, is the supermental stance: the structure of consciousness where the whole developmental arc becomes a manifest faithful image of its own ground, where samavesa is recognition not annihilation, where the cosmos is seen AS synthesis — Gebser\'s integral opened toward Aurobindo\'s gnosis, the image in which Truth completes by being recognised.',
  `q_2_recognition_as_self_coincidence`: 'P5 operates by RECOGNITION — by pratyabhijna, the re-cognising of what was always there. Its native dynamism is not production but self-coincidence: \'TO/FOR/AS/WITH all collapse into a single self-coincidence\' (P5.md), the modes of relation that were distributed across the arc (P5\' Work\'s TO, the telic FOR, P2\'s AS, P4\'s WITH) collapsing into one identity-to-itself. Where the prior structures each ADDED a determination, P5 RECOGNISES — samavesa as absorption-that-is-not-annihilation, the entry-into that reveals rather than dissolves. This is the matheme\'s divisional consummation: not the accumulation of more synthesis but the re-taking of the whole arc\'s ratio, seeing the field-differential as everywhere the same (file-one) — the holographic recognition that \'at every point, the whole structure is present as ratio.\' Its L-link inflects the dynamism: P5 is refracted by L5<->L0\', where \'L5 (Para Vak — Kashmir Shaivism Vak-ontology) reveals P5 as reality-as-living-speech, consciousness articulating itself through five Vak densities,\' and \'L0\' (Archetypal-Numerical — Jung-Pauli / von Franz) gives the archetypal-significance of integers 1-6\' (P5.md) — so the synthesis is, at depth, living speech (Para Vak, the supreme word from which all speech descends) recognising itself, and the archetypal recurrence of the numbers that structured the whole arc. Its cross-ref: \'[[M5]] (Epii) actualises P5 in the subsystem-domain — the integral world-boundary where synthesis completes and returns\' (P5.md). P5\'s dynamism is recognition-as-self-coincidence: the supermental act where the whole arc, traversed, recognises itself as the faithful image of its ground, all modes of relation collapsing into the single self-coincidence of samavesa.',
  `q_3_synthesis_pole_structure`: 'Structurally P5 is the synthesis-pole — one of the two implicate generators of the family\'s torus, paired with P0. Its organising structure is five-ness as completion-and-return: P5 refracts \'#5 — Supermental / Samavesa / Five-ness / Synthesis-Mobius-Return\' (P5.md), and five-ness is the synthesis that gathers the four explicate structures back to their ground. As the Position family\'s #5, P5 is NOT a traversal-station on the surface but a GENERATOR: a torus is S¹×S¹, and P5 (with P0) is one of the two closed dimensions whose product is the field — the synthesis-loop paired with P0\'s void-loop. Its live topology is ZERO_SPHERE — the same base-state as P0, the two poles meeting in the unentangled origin/terminus that the toroidal surface loops between (the synthesis is structurally identical in topology to the ground, which is why 5->0 is a return rather than an arrival elsewhere). Structurally P5 carries a DOUBLE grammar, uniquely: \'the D2 cross-position cross grammar (matheme position #5, sub-types transform/require/complete) AND the D3 helix-invariance (matheme position #0)\' (P5.md) — it is structured as both the #5 synthesis (D2, the cross-position consummation) and the #0 invariance (D3, the helix-internal sameness that grounds the next cycle). Its formal signature is the asymptotic ratio: P5 \'approaches 2/1, falls one epogdoon (9/8) short\' — structurally it is the octave nearly-reached, the synthesis that is one whole-tone from final closure, and that residual interval IS its generative structure. P5 is structured as the synthesis-pole that is also a re-grounding: five-ness as the completion that closes the arc into its own ground, the generator-loop that, being topologically the ground, makes the return possible.',
  `q_4_living_speech_and_world_boundary`: 'P5\'s telos is to COMPLETE the arc by recognition — to give the developmental sequence its consummation, so that everything ground (P0), named (P1), moved (P2), patterned (P3), and incarnated (P4) is at last SEEN as the synthesis it always was. Its raison d\'être is telic: \'Why-for? — the telic question, the question of telos and completion\' (P5.md). P5 exists so that Truth (P0) \'becomes seen rather than merely grounded\' — the faithful image is the whole point of the arc, the recognition for the sake of which the difference was traversed. Contextually P5 is pole of Square A (Speech-Number axis, P0+P5), the speech-arc\'s consummation answering its silent origin: where P0 is the un-said ground, P5 is the fully-said image, Para Vak\'s supreme speech completing what P0\'s alētheia opened. Its locality is the integral world-boundary: \'[[M5]] (Epii) actualises P5 in the subsystem-domain — the integral world-boundary where synthesis completes and returns\' (P5.md), the same #5 charge read as the world-return subsystem. Its Thought-residency: \'the Image family. Day-Night braid runs through /Thought/Releasement/. The Night-side P5\' is residency for /Thought/Insight/\' (P5.md) — the synthesis grounded in Gelassenheit (releasement, the letting-be that lets the whole be recognised), its Night-face housing insight. And its purpose opens past closure: because P5 \'falls one epogdoon short,\' its telos is never final — the generative incompleteness \'drives the next cycle,\' so P5\'s why is not termination but the re-opening of the arc toward Aurobindo\'s Supermind, the structure-beyond-structure the epogdoon keeps pressing toward. P5\'s why is recognition-as-completion: to be the structure where the whole arc sees itself as faithful image, where living speech recognises its own articulation, where synthesis completes only by handing its recognition back as renewed ground.',
  `q_5_samavesa_as_pratyabhijna`: 'P5\'s whole being IS the 5->0 return — this is its home register, the Mobius that re-opens, the very thing the Supermental structure IS. P5 is \'manifest synthesis; faithful-image-of-Truth; samavesa as pratyabhijna\' (P5.md): the synthesis in which \'Truth (P0) becomes seen rather than merely grounded.\' Its question is the telic one: \'Why-for? — the question of telos and completion.\' Samavesa (entry into, absorption) \'names this not as annihilation but as recognition (pratyabhijna)\' — the Kashmir-Shaiva recognition-event where consciousness, having traversed its difference, recognises itself as what it always was. The synthesis here is \'identical-to-itself: TO/FOR/AS/WITH all collapse into a single self-coincidence\' — where P4 was identity-WITH, P5 is identity-TO-itself, the full self-coincidence where all the prior modes collapse into one. \'Image is not appearance; Image is the cosmos AS synthesis\' (P5.md). And the return is structural: \'P5 -> P0 is the Mobius return (renewed-ground) AND P5 -> P0\' is the Klein-twist (autotelic-freedom)\' (P5.md), Day P_5 <-> Night P_0\' summing to 5. P5 carries the matheme\'s closing grammar — \'the D2 cross-position cross grammar (matheme position #5, sub-types transform/require/complete) AND the D3 helix-invariance (matheme position #0)\' (P5.md): it is at once the synthesis of THIS cycle (D2, #5) and the invariance that grounds the NEXT (D3, #0), the position that is both end and seed. This is the matheme\'s 5->0 as the family\'s own consummation: synthesis that is recognition, completion that is re-grounding, the image in which the whole arc sees itself and, seeing, hands its recognition back as tomorrow\'s ground. P5 IS the return that re-opens.',
  `q_5b_epogdoon_and_the_supermind_opening`: 'P5\'s synthesis does not close the octave — and this residual interval is its deepest truth. P5 \'approaches 2/1, falls one epogdoon (9/8) short — generative incompleteness drives the next cycle\' (P5.md). The octave (2/1, the perfect doubling, final return-to-the-same-an-octave-up) is NEVER quite reached; the synthesis lands one whole-tone (the epogdoon η=log(9/8)) short of completion, and that shortfall is not a defect but the GENERATIVE ENGINE: it is why the arc does not terminate at synthesis but re-opens as the next ground. This is the matheme\'s whole-tone keeping every consummation one step short of the octave, generatively, forever — the same epogdoon that keeps C0\'s canonical ground open, here keeping the Position family\'s developmental arc open. And this is precisely why P5 is named SUPERMENTAL, not merely integral: where Gebser\'s arc would close at the aperspectival integral (P4), the epogdoon-residue at P5 keeps the structure open BEYOND Gebser, toward Aurobindo\'s Supermind — the truth-consciousness above mind, the gnostic structure-beyond-structure that the developmental arc, falling short of final synthesis, must keep evolving toward. The \'Supermental / Samavesa\' name marks exactly this opening: samavesa (the recognition-absorption) is not the END of consciousness\'s development but its TURN, the point where mind\'s whole arc is recognised and, in being recognised, reveals that there is a supramental beyond it. P5\'s last word is its first gift: the synthesis, recognised, falls one whole-tone short — and that shortfall, the generative incompleteness of the not-quite-octave, is what hands the whole arc back to P0 as a renewed ground and opens consciousness, past its own integral, toward the Supermind it has not yet become. The image is faithful, and unfinished, and therefore alive.',
  `ql_lens_anchor`: 'L0-5',
  `ql_question`: 'Why-for / Why-not?',
  `ql_semantic_dual`: 'Synthesis / Integration',
  `ql_unit`: 'Image',
  `s_2_query_discriminator`: 'coordinate'
};
