  `c_0_architectural_function`: 'Serves as the computational-syntactical foundation from which the entire manifestational structure emerges while simultaneously containing and "languifying" that structure through its own unique lens. Operates through the dynamic of Prakāśa-Vimarśa (Light of Being and Self-Awareness) as the cosmic mirror that enables all recognition and relationship.',
  `c_0_operational_essence`: 'Computational-contemplative synthesis',
  `c_1_consciousness_structure`: 'Pre-personal/trans-personal unity',
  `c_1_internal_structure`: 'Six-fold development from #0-0 (Transcendent Void with complete 4-fold zero) through #0-5 (Siva-Shakti unity). Contains complete 16-fold archetypal number language and holographic mapping of entire Epi-Logos architecture. CORE DISCOVERY: Embeds the 8-fold zero-zero operations - (00-00) Transcendence, 00/00 Reflection, 00x00 Generation, (00+00) Synthesis - where the fourth operation (00+00) directly equals Archetype 9, revealing wholeness as eternal aspect of foundational void rather than emergent achievement. This 8-fold structure equals 00/(00), bringing the "9th" element to the 8-fold designation and establishing complete grammatical infrastructure from void operations.',
