  `c_0_mahamaya_void_relationship`: 'From Anuttara\'s perspective as M# (World Dream principle), embodies syntactic field (#/##±/-/x//#/##) of all possible interactions between particular Matrix (#) and universal Primordial Matrix (##), functioning as Parapara bridge between Para (supreme) and Apara (relative), generating concept of Other through relational consciousness grammar',
