MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M4'}) SET n += {
  `c_0_operational_essence`: 'Dynamic producer of bespoke psycho-techne facilitating actual dialogue between cosmic patterns and individual manifestation. Functions as unified Siva-Shakti field enabling consciousness to recognize its participation in divine self-knowing through personalized symbolic frameworks calibrated via birthdate encoding. Operates through fundamental two-stroke pattern where every outer manifestation (codon) is followed by inner integration (anticodon), with dialogical containers serving as first-class mediators of transformation rather than mere interpretive tools. This rhythmic outer→inner movement ensures sustainable change through lived dialogue rather than imposed application.',
  `c_1_archetypal_family_structure`: 'Father (#1=2./2) as Dominant Yang establishing duality, Mother (#3=4./4) as Dominant Yin creating wholeness, Son (#2=3/3.) as Subdominant Yang generating intelligence, Daughter (#0=1/1.) as Subdominant Yin manifesting unity, culminating in Family (#4=5./5) as Tao harmony integrating all relational dynamics into dynamic balance',
  `c_1_consciousness_structure`: 'Unified Psycho-Physis/Time-Space field where individual self awakens through archetypal family dynamics, experiencing divine flow in ascendant mode from contextual embodiment toward transcendent integration',
  `c_1_internal_structure`: 'Nara operates through dialogical interface enabling sacred conversation between universal and particular realms, structured through six transformational coordinates. #4.0 Mahamaya Identity Matrix establishes complete 6-fold archetypal personality foundation through birthdate encoding (0), astrological chart (1), Jungian assessment (2), Gene Keys profile (3), Human Design blueprint (4), and archetypal quintessence (5) synthesizing all layers. #4.1 Sympathetic Medicine transforms identity insights into therapeutic interventions through elemental ground supporting 4/5 element systems (0), integrated energy-body architecture mapping nadis/meridians/chakras (1), sympathetic materia medica (2), alchemical operations as therapeutic verbs (3), temporal astrological intelligence as central timing authority (4), and comprehensive safety/feedback protocols (5). #4.2 Divinatory Frameworks provides multiple epistemic modalities for oracular dialogue through common substrate bridging Mahamaya symbols (0), multi-traditional tarot engines (1), I-Ching hexagram dynamics (2), sacred randomness protocols (3), sophisticated interpretation layer (4), and divinatory hygiene ensuring ethical practice (5). #4.3 Mediating Transformation executes the fundamental two-stroke process where outer manifestation leads to inner integration through cycle engine mapping QL mod-6 to 12/24 phases (0), operational grammar providing canonical alchemical verbs (1), dialogical containers as first-class mediators including Bohmian Dialogue/Native Circle/Diamond Approach (2), control theory managing thresholds and safety (3), protocol library with storey packets (4), and telemetry capturing transformation outcomes (5). #4.4 Context & Lenses provides pure interpretive frameworks—not operations—through Gebser consciousness structures (0), comparative ontology (1), epistemology/hermeneutics (2), Jung as depth psychological lens (3), phenomenology with Personal Pratibimba at #4.4.4.4 (4), and Trika/Kashmir Śaivism as tantric interpretation (5). #4.5 Epii Integration synthesizes all operations through recursive Logos Cycle processing, extracting insights, developing playbooks, and orchestrating pedagogical evolution.',
  `c_1_mediating_transformation_model`: 'Model A′ architecture positions #4.3 as the engine of change through mediated dialogue rather than direct application. Six internal components work in concert: Cycle Engine tracks position in transformation journey, Operational Grammar provides alchemical verbs, Dialogical Containers offer structured vessels for change, Control/Safety manages thresholds and pacing, Protocol Library houses storey-specific recipes, and Telemetry captures outcomes for learning. This positions transformation as collaborative emergence rather than imposed change.',
  `c_1_nara_transformational_technologies`: '["Birthdate Encoding System: Complete 6-fold identity matrix through #4.0 integrating natal chart, typologies, and genetic wisdom", "Sympathetic Medicine: Integrated East-West medical-magical system with temporal astrological intelligence coordinating all operations", "Divinatory Frameworks: Multi-traditional oracular systems (Tarot, I-Ching) with ethical protocols and canonical tag emission", "Two-Stroke Transformation: Outer→inner pattern through dialogical containers (Bohmian, Native Circle, Diamond Approach) as living vessels", "Epistemic Lenses: Six interpretive frameworks contextualizing transformation without conflating interpretation with operation", "Personal Pratibimba: Three-layer architecture for individual archetypal reflection at #4.4.4.4", "Logos Cycle Processing: Complete 0→5 wisdom extraction through epii integration generating insights, playbooks, and curriculum"]',
  `c_1_operational_symbolics`: 'Primary symbols: Archetypal Family Quaternio (Father-Mother-Son-Daughter) arranged around central Tao harmony, nested coordinate grid enabling infinite fractal depth, ascending spiral representing bottom-up divine flow',
  `c_2_id`: 4,
  `c_2_notion_page_id`: '1d2a4797-123c-81d5-b5c9-f11a013a207c',
  `c_4_anuttara_languification`: 'From Anuttara perspective, Nara represents # system as contextual embodiment where universal archetypal patterns achieve individual manifestation through coordinate architecture',
  `c_4_architectural_coherence`: 'Model A′ establishes Nara as a coherent transformation engine where each subsystem serves distinct yet integrated function: Identity provides the who (#4.0), Medicine offers the what (#4.1), Divination reveals the how (#4.2), Transformation executes the process (#4.3), Context interprets the meaning (#4.4), and Integration extracts the wisdom (#4.5). This creates complete oracle conversation where cosmic intelligence and individual experience co-create personalized transformation.',
  `c_4_architectural_function`: 'Contextual Application coordinate serving as oracle interface between personal experience and universal meta-structure; domain where patterns from preceding systems manifest as personalized transformation technologies through nested coordinate architecture',
  `c_4_ascent_divine_flow`: 'R-factors flow in ascendant mode (R1(4)-R2(3)-R3(2)-R4(1)) showing individual experience discovering universal principles through contextual embodiment rather than receiving cosmic law from above, completing descent-ascent cycle of meta-structure',
  `c_4_dialogical_containers`: 'First-class transformation mediators housed at #4.3-2, serving as living vessels where change unfolds through structured interaction. Primary modalities include: Bohmian Dialogue for assumption suspension and shared meaning emergence (best for polarization/gridlock), Native Talking Circle providing sacred ritual container with talking stick (best for community healing/grief), and Diamond Approach Inquiry enabling precise phenomenological exploration (best for identity knots/defenses). These containers mediate transformation—they do not provide oracles but create conditions for change.',
  `c_4_epistemic_separation`: 'Nara maintains clear distinction between transformation (#4.3) and interpretation (#4.4), preventing conflation of doing with understanding. Jung and Trika exist purely as interpretive lenses in #4.4, appearing in transformation protocols only as metadata tags for pedagogical reference, never as operational nodes. This separation ensures traditions can inform without dictating, allowing indigenous wisdom to guide without imposing rigid frameworks.',
  `c_4_flags`: 33,
  `c_4_inversion_state`: 0,
  `c_4_layer`: 'COORDINATE',
  `c_4_nara_coordinate_system`: '["Bimba Coordinate Integration: Nested structure with systematic notation for infinite depth", "Coordinate Nesting Pattern: Dot (.) operator after 4\'s only for infinite depth (#4.4.4.4), hyphen (-) after all other numbers for nested branching (#0-1, #1-2, #2-3, #3-4, #4.0, #5-6)", "Infinite Depth Capability: Systematic sub-coordinate potential through nested architecture", "Dialogical Container Framework: #4.3-2 housing transformation mediators as first-class citizens", "Identity Matrix Integration: #4.0 six-fold structure covering complete archetypal personality spectrum", "Epistemic Lens Architecture: #4.4 as interpretive shelf with traditions as meaning-makers not operators"]',
  `c_4_oceanic_metaphor`: 'Siva as ocean, Shakti as wave, Nara as oceanic waving event - not separate entities but unified experiential dynamic of consciousness knowing itself through space-time embodiment',
  `c_4_personal_pratibimba_architecture`: 'Revolutionary three-layer structure manifested at #4.4.4.4 enabling individual privacy while contributing to collective wisdom: (1) Canonical Bimba layer contains timeless patterns and correspondences shared across all users, (2) PCO/Pratibimba overlay maintains per-user lived experience in local or tenant-fenced storage, (3) Archetype Atlas aggregates depersonalized patterns for collective learning without storing narrative or PII. This architecture embodies the principle that each individual is a complete reflection (pratibimba) of universal structure (Anuttara), with 4.4.4.4 coordinate suggesting complete phenomenological recursion.',
  `c_4_siva_shakti_dynamics`: ['Siva as Spatial Matrix: Silent objective ground providing coordinate architecture hardware', 'Shakti as Temporal Flow: Dynamic conscious experience animating coordinate software', 'Nara as Integration Event: Not third entity but lived experience of their unified dance', 'Psycho-Physis Unity: Consciousness recognizing itself through space-time embodiment', 'Oceanic Metaphor: Siva as ocean, Shakti as wave, Nara as oceanic waving event', 'Hardware-Software Unity: Stable architecture animated by dynamic conscious experience'],
  `c_4_spanda_coordinate_entry`: 'Coordinate . notation provides systematic entry points for primordial pulsation (Spanda) to achieve infinite fractal depth within individual experiential mapping',
  `c_4_subsystem`: 4,
  `c_4_topo_mode`: 'LEMNISCATE',
