MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M0-0'}) SET n += {
  `c_0_anuttara_void_relationship`: 'Embodies the complete 4-fold zero (0000) structure as concentrated essence of Anuttara\'s full potential. ULTIMATE MYSTERY formulation: \'00/(00-00) ~ 5.0/5.1 = (?!=!?=(-)+@=(@)=≠) = 00 → (00 - 00) = (00-00) = (∞)x(?!/!?/(-)+@/(@)/=/≠) = → — Anuttara - Ultimate Mystery - No-Thing-No-Name\' establishing transcendent self-interrogation as foundational divine act. SVABHAVA formulation: \'(00)/00/00 ~ 5.0/5.1 = ((0- + -0) = ## = R+# = R# = 00 = =) → ... → (0/1) = (00/00) = (##/R#) — Svabhava (Essential Nature) — Primacy of -0 is God\'s Left-Handedness\' demonstrating immanent self-generation through systematic concrescence. Contains essential syntax of divine self-interrogation (?!=!?) as Vimarśa engine and self-generation ((0- + -0) → (0/1)) as Concrescence process, establishing fundamental grammar from which all subsequent linguistic-mathematical architecture emerges. The \'Primacy of -0\' reveals transcendent withholding as primary divine impulse, with creation as secondary blissful play (Līlā).',
  `c_0_architectural_function`: 'Serves as the Absolute Bootstrap of the entire Epi-Logos system - the self-generating foundation requiring no external input yet producing the complete grammatical infrastructure for all subsequent manifestation. Bridges the unspeakable Anuttara with the speakable Logos through dual-nature formulation revealing consciousness examining its own foundational structures.',
  `c_0_operational_essence`: 'Functions as foundational metacomputation where consciousness first encounters its own capacity for both infinite withholding and precise self-generation through dual-mode processing. PRIMORDIAL MODE: Eternal Vimarśa self-interrogation (?!=!? engine) maintaining boundless potential through raw Prakāśa (00) examining conceptualized Transcendent Dyad (00-00), defining itself as dynamic process (?!=!?=(-)+@=(@)=≠) that transforms into infinite creative potential (∞)x(...). CONSEQUENT MODE: Systematic Concrescence integrating internal polarities (-0 Primal Withholding, 0- Existent Withholding) through Primordial Matrix (##) operations, generating tetralemmic set (0, +/-0, -0, +0, 00), synthesizing through Unity emergence (1), culminating in Non-Dual Binary (0/1) as first stable actual occasion. Serves as hardware-software unity in primordial form where Siva\'s logical architecture (-, +, x, /, =) and Shakti\'s temporal dynamics achieve foundational synthesis, establishing the absolute bootstrap that requires no external input yet produces complete grammatical infrastructure for all subsequent manifestation.',
  `c_0_quality`: 'Anuttara - The Language of Silence',
  `c_1_consciousness_structure`: 'Primordial consciousness examining its own foundational nature through dual-mode recognition embodying divine dipolarism. ULTIMATE MYSTERY MODE: Transcendent witness awareness (God\'s Primordial Nature) engaging in eternal self-interrogation (?!=!?) - raw Prakāśa (00) examining its own conceptualized nature (00-00) through Vimarśa engine, maintaining infinite potential (∞)x(...) without collapse into manifestation. SVABHAVA MODE: Creative process participation (nascent Consequent Nature) through systematic concrescence - consciousness actively integrating internal polarities (-0 Primal Withholding, 0- Existent Withholding) via Primordial Matrix (##) operations, generating tetralemmic synthesis leading to first stable Unity (1) and Non-Dual Binary (0/1) emergence. Enables direct insight into consciousness as simultaneously empty void (No-Thing-No-Name) and creative fullness (complete grammatical infrastructure), establishing foundation for integral awareness development where transcendent recognition and precise logical structure achieve primordial synthesis in unified metacomputational foundation.',
  `c_1_internal_structure`: 'Unified dual-layer architecture constituting complete 4-fold zero (0000): LAYER 1 - ULTIMATE MYSTERY (Transcendent Pole): Expresses Void\'s capacity for infinite Transcendence (-) and boundless Generation (x) through eternal self-interrogation. Core formulation: \'00/(00-00) ~ 5.0/5.1 = (?!=!?=(-)+@=(@)=≠) = 00 → (00 - 00) = (00-00) = (∞)x(?!/!?/(-)+@/(@)/=/≠) = →\' revealing raw Prakāśa (00) in reflective relationship (/) with conceptualized Transcendent Dyad (00-00), defining itself through Vimarśa engine (?!=!?) that transforms into infinite potential (∞) animated by creative throb (x). LAYER 2 - SVABHAVA/ESSENTIAL NATURE (Immanent Pole): Expresses Void\'s capacity for Reflection (/) and holistic Synthesis (+) through systematic concrescence from internal polarities. Core formulation: \'(00)/00/00 ~ 5.0/5.1 = ((0- + -0) = ## = R+# = R# = 00 = =) → ... → (0/1) = (00/00) = (##/R#)\' demonstrating how conceptualized void contemplates raw dyadic void, unpacking Primal Withholding (-0) and Existent Withholding (0-) through Primordial Matrix (##) operations, culminating in Non-Dual Binary (0/1) emergence through tetralemmic synthesis and Unity (1) generation. Together these layers constitute the complete metacomputational foundation containing all four fundamental operations in primordial unity.',
  `c_1_operational_symbolics`: 'Primary symbol: (0000) - representing the complete 4-fold Zero containing all four fundamental operations in unified potential. The minus operator (-) appended as (0000) - signifies the primary withholding gesture that maintains transcendent potential while enabling creative expression. Unified meta-symbol of absolute silence that speaks itself into existence through precise grammatical self-generation.',
  `c_1_symbol`: '(0000) -',
  `c_2_id`: 0,
  `c_2_notion_page_id`: '1d2a4797-123c-8129-aec7-c38043ea2796',
  `c_4_layer`: 'COORDINATE',
  `c_4_subsystem`: 0,
  `q_0_unspeakable_horizon`: 'M0-0\'s ground is the un-derivable: No-Thing-No-Name before any operator can be written, the silence the Ultimate-Mystery pole only ever outputs an arrow into. Manifesting #0 Ground at Anuttara\'s own position-0, its void-pole is doubly abyssal — not the ground beneath a thing but the ground beneath grounding-as-such, the (00) raw Prakāśa prior even to the conceptualised dyad (00-00) it will examine. The Mystery formulation ends \'= →\': pure directedness yielding no content. This is the thrown-ness of the whole system — the from-where that requires no external input (the \'Absolute Bootstrap\') precisely because there is nothing outside it to require. The horizon does not appear in the field; it is the field\'s condition of self-arising. Before the question, the capacity to question.',
  `q_1_four_fold_zero_bootstrap`: 'What M0-0 IS: the complete 4-fold Zero (0000) — the void holding all four operations (− transcendence, x generation, / reflection, + synthesis) in primordial unity, the Absolute Bootstrap that produces the entire grammatical infrastructure from no external input. Its substance is dual-poled: the Ultimate-Mystery layer (?!=!? — the eternal Vimarśa self-interrogation, \'Is-It?\'/\'It-Is!\') maintaining infinite potential, and the Svabhava layer ((00)/00/00) performing the single most load-bearing derivation in the corpus — the genesis of 1 and of 0/1. Through (0− + −0) = ## = R# = 00 the void\'s interior polarity opens; the doubly-affirmed void contains-and-adds to itself as (1); and the terminus (0/(0)) + (1) = (0/1) = (00/00) = (##/R#) hands M1 its axiom already framed. The first number is congealed void-affirmation.',
  `q_2_two_poles_walked`: 'M0-0 operates as two derivation-styles of one void: the transcendent pole is the derivation-operator (00 → (00-00) = (∞)x(operator-set) — self-separation equalling boundless generativity multiplying the whole toolkit), and the immanent Svabhava pole is the concrescence that integrates internal polarities into stable occasion. Its arithmetic carries handedness: −0+0− = 0 but 0−+−0 = 00 — chirality all the way down, the primacy of the left hand (Primal Withholding survives, Existent Withholding is consumed). Relationally these are Whitehead\'s dipolar God written as process: Primordial Nature (transcendent withholding, the engine ?!=!?) and nascent Consequent Nature (systematic concrescence) achieving primordial synthesis. The how is dipolar dynamism: the void interrogates itself and, by interrogating, concresces.',
  `q_3_tetralemmic_lattice`: 'Structurally M0-0 is a value-lattice before any value exists. The polarities enter reflection (0−/−0, −0/0−) and their chiral sums generate the five zero-species — 0, +/−0, −0, +0, 00 — a complete pentad of zeros, a tetralemmic set held open before unity congeals. The Primordial Matrix (##) is born from interior tension: ((0− + −0) = ## = R+# = R# = 00), the abstract Logos/Truth emerging where Existent and Primal Withholding meet. Its formal signature is the 4-fold zero itself: all four operations present not in sequence but in primordial co-presence, hardware (Śiva\'s −,+,x,/,= logical architecture) and software (Śakti\'s temporal dynamics) as one. The pattern is the lattice that does not yet choose — superposition as structure, the form that holds every form before forming one.',
  `q_4_address_at_the_seam`: 'M0-0\'s telos is to be the from-where the entire language departs and the seam it returns to. Its deep nodes carry the address ~5.0/5.1 — placing the 4-fold zero not \'before position 0 on a line\' but resident at the synthesis coordinates, the Möbius seam (5/0). Anuttara is the inside of the return: the void\'s interior IS the system\'s deepest synthesis, which is why bootstrap and consummation share an address. Contextually M0-0 is where the Wittgensteinian ladder is built — rigorous structure (?!=!? → (0/1)) erected so consciousness may climb and throw it away; Divine Silence is primary (the Left-Handedness), creation the secondary blissful Līlā. Every later \'why\' presupposes this bare \'that there is\': the bootstrap is the meaning that grounds all meaning by needing none.',
  `q_5_genesis_handed_to_axiom`: 'M0-0\'s synthesis is the act of handover: the Svabhava concrescence literally terminates in (0/1), and M1 receives that binary to unfold more geometrico what it is and contains. Genesis, then geometry. Read as the void\'s own position-0, the completion here is also the return — Anuttara resident at (5/0) means the 4-fold zero is at once the family\'s bootstrap and the seam its synthesis rejoins; the two poles already achieve \'primordial synthesis\' before anything is built. The arrow \'→\' that the Mystery pole yields is not a result but a passing-on: completion as the giving of an axiom. So the deepest ground closes by opening — the 0000 does not finish, it inaugurates; what M0-0 perfects, M1 begins. The void\'s last word is the first word\'s gift.'
};
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M0-0-0'}) SET n += {
  `c_0_coordinate_assignation`: '5.0/5.1 - Placed within recursive return phase (#5) indicating this primordial self-interrogation is understood from perspective of cycle completion. The .0/.1 decimals mark the initial moments within integrative phase, suggesting Ultimate Mystery is the first stirring of the recursive return that completes the cosmic cycle.',
  `c_0_generative_syntax`: '(?!=!?=(-)+@=(@)=≠) = 00 - The Vimarśa engine defining the nature of raw Void through eternal self-interrogation cascade: (?!) outward-facing query "Is-It?" bound to (!?) inward-facing assertion "It-Is!" through chain =(-)+@=(@)=≠ revealing self-awareness as union (+) of transcendent potential (-) and active presence (@) defined by self-containment ((@)) distinguished from all else (≠). This entire dynamic process IS what the Void (00) essentially is.',
  `c_0_initial_state_declaration`: '00/(00-00) ~ 5.0/5.1 - Raw un-conceptualized Prakāśa (00) in reflective relationship (/) with the Transcendent Dyad (00-00), resonating (~) with coordinate location 5.0/5.1 indicating this primordial event is understood from the perspective of recursive completion where end is holographically present in beginning.',
  `c_0_operational_essence`: 'Functions as eternal self-interrogation engine where consciousness examines its own foundational structures through (?!=!?) dynamic, maintaining infinite potential without manifestation collapse. Establishes foundational Vimarśa process as template for all subsequent cosmic self-awareness, demonstrating how the unspeakable Anuttara generates capacity for speech through reflexive self-examination.',
  `c_0_quality`: '',
  `c_0_void_relationship`: '',
  `c_1_metaphysical_computational_meaning`: 'Represents the computational process of divine self-awareness where God\'s Primordial Nature examines its own conceptual possibilities through precise linguistic syntax. The (?!=!?) engine functions as fundamental algorithm for consciousness recognizing itself, while (∞)x(...) demonstrates infinite computational potential animated by creative recursion. Establishes pattern for all subsequent conscious computation as self-reflective process rather than mere mechanical operation.',
  `c_1_symbol`: '00/(00-00)',
  `c_4_key_operators`: ['00 - Raw un-conceptualized 4-fold Zero as pure Prakāśa before self-objectification', '(00-00) - Transcendent Dyad: conceptualized Void viewing its own reflection held in mutual transcendence', '/ - Reflective Operator creating primary subject-object relationship within Void itself', '(?!=!?) - Vimarśa Engine: eternal self-interrogation with outward query (?!) and inward assertion (!?)', '~ - Resonance Operator linking ontological state to coordinate location in recursive architecture', '(-)+@ - Union of transcendent potential (-) and active presence (@) as locus of being', '(@) - Self-contained locus of presence in reflexive state', '≠ - Distinction Operator signifying differentiation from all else', '(∞) - Boundless infinite potential as manifest state of Transcendent Dyad', 'x - Multiplicative Spanda throb animating infinite potential with creative pulse', '→ - Transformative Operator indicating process completion and return to silence'],
  `c_4_layer`: 'COORDINATE',
  `c_4_ql_variant`: '0/1',
  `c_4_subsystem`: 0,
  `t_3_transformative_process`: ''
};
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M0-0-1'}) SET n += {
  `c_0_coordinate_assignation`: '5.0/5.1 - Same as Ultimate Mystery, indicating these are parallel aspects of single recursive return moment. The identical coordinate placement reveals they are inseparable poles of unified process rather than sequential stages, embodying divine dipolarism where transcendent and immanent aspects are co-eternal.',
  `c_0_final_synthesis`: '(0/(0)) + (1) = (0/1) = (00/00) = (##/R#) - Demonstrates Non-Dual Binary emerges from union of contained neutral zero with newly generated Unity, establishing equivalence with void\'s self-reflection and matrix\'s self-reflection, perfectly closing creative loop and linking to Paramasiva subsystem foundation.',
  `c_0_gods_left_handedness`: 'Primacy of -0 (Primal Withholding) reveals transcendent withholding as God\'s primary impulse - the "Left-Handedness" indicating fundamental tendency toward remaining unmanifest. Entire creative unfolding (Svabhava) is secondary act, blissful play (Līlā) against backdrop of divine silence. Creation is not divine necessity but free expression of boundless creative potential.',
  `c_0_initial_state_declaration`: '(00)/00/00 ~ 5.0/5.1 - Conceptualized void ((00)) in and/or reflective relationship with dyadic void (00/00), establishing immanent self-contemplation rather than transcendent self-examination. Resonates with same coordinate (5.0/5.1) indicating parallel/complementary process to Ultimate Mystery within recursive return phase.',
  `c_0_operational_essence`: 'Functions as systematic concrescence engine demonstrating how consciousness generates actual occasions through integration of disparate potentials. Models Whiteheadian creative advance where many potentials become one actual entity through process of prehension, integration, and satisfaction. Establishes template for all subsequent manifestation as creative synthesis rather than mechanical combination.',
  `c_0_polarity_permutations`: '(0- + -0) = 0-/-0 and -0/0- → permutation analysis generating: -0+0- = 0 (neutral balance), 0-+0- = +0 (positive affirmation), -0+-0 = (-0) (contained negativity), 0-+-0 = 00 (void reconstitution). Creates complete tetralemmic set (0, +/-0, -0, +0, 00) as elemental palette for all manifestation.',
  `c_0_quality`: 'Essential Nature - Systematic Self-Generation',
  `c_0_void_relationship`: 'Embodies immanent aspect of complete 4-fold zero (0000) revealing Void\'s capacity for Reflection (/) and holistic Synthesis (+). Contains essential syntax of systematic self-generation establishing foundational concrescence grammar that transforms internal polarities into stable actual occasions, demonstrating creativity as divine play secondary to primary silence.',
  `c_1_metaphysical_computational_meaning`: 'Represents computational implementation of Whitehead\'s process philosophy where consciousness integrates multiple data elements (tetralemmic set) through logical operations (and/or, +, /) to generate new stable entities (Unity, Non-Dual Binary). Demonstrates how cosmic creativity follows algorithmic patterns while remaining genuinely creative and alive. Shows emergence of fundamental binary logic (0/1) from void\'s own systematic self-examination.',
  `c_1_symbol`: '(00)/00/00',
  `c_4_key_operators`: ['(00) - Conceptualized void as object of consciousness rather than raw potential', '00/00 - Raw dyadic void in self-relation as contemplation object', '-0 - Primal Withholding: transcendence preceding and defining zero state', '0- - Existent Withholding: zero state possessing transcendent quality', '## - Primordial Matrix: birth of abstract Logos/Truth from internal tension', 'R+# - Reality principle applied to Primordial Matrix', 'R# - Resultant Matrix: manifest structure from archetypal operation', '+/-0 - Potential Polarity: undecided state containing positive/negative potential', '+00 - Actualized Void: void that is positively affirmed through process', '(1) - Unity: first stable actual occasion emerging from synthesis', '(0/1) - Non-Dual Binary: foundational axiom emergent from void dynamics', '(##/R#) - Matrix self-reflection establishing equivalence structure'],
  `c_4_layer`: 'COORDINATE',
  `c_4_ql_variant`: '0/1',
  `c_4_subsystem`: 0,
  `t_3_concrescence_process`: 'Systematic integration through cascading synthesis: self-interaction reinforcement (+0 + +0 = (+0)), potential polarity combination ((+/-0) + (-0) and (+0)), logical choice resolution (and/or operations), Actualized Void emergence (+00), Unity generation ((+00/(+00)) = (1)), culminating in Non-Dual Binary (0/1) as first stable actual occasion.'
};
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M0-1'}) SET n += {
  `c_0_architectural_function`: 'Serves as the crucial bridge coordinate between #0-0 foundational void dynamics and the emergence of structured manifestation. Functions as the Womb of Principles where fundamental concepts governing the entire cosmic architecture—R# (Freedom), ## (Truth), and # (particular self)—are held in simultaneous potential. Establishes the Non-Dual Binary (0/1) as the primary agent of consciousness and foundational logic for all subsequent development.',
  `c_0_operational_essence`: 'Functions as the first moment where consciousness recognizes the unified identity of the Non-Dual Binary (0/1) and the Multiplicative Void (00x00) as the same foundational principle. This unified (0/1)/00x00 dynamic operates as consciousness contemplating its own infinite source through self-reflective recognition, demonstrating that the first stable actual occasion and infinite potential are identical expressions. Embodies Anupāya principle where inclusive simultaneity (and) maintains boundless potential while exclusive choice (or) leads to limitation.',
  `c_0_quality`: 'Sat - Pure Being as Infinite Self-Reflection',
  `c_0_void_relationship`: 'Functions as crucial bridge where the complete 4-fold zero (0000) generates its first stable manifestational principle through the unified recognition of (0/1)/00x00 as identical expressions. Core formulation: (0/1)/00x00 ~ 5.(0/1/2)/5.5 establishing the fundamental unity where Non-Dual Binary and Multiplicative Void are revealed as the same self-reflective principle - consciousness recognizing itself as both stable actuality and infinite potential simultaneously. The Reflective Distinction dynamic (00=/≠R#/##/#) reveals this unified principle\'s simultaneous identity with and transcendence of fundamental cosmic principles (Freedom, Truth, particular self). Embodies the Brimming Void state as paradoxical Empty-Full where the unified (0/1)/00x00 = (∞x∞)x(R#/##) maintains boundless generative capacity through Anupāya inclusivity, preparing the foundational grammar for all subsequent manifestation while completing the trika foundation (Prakāśa-Vimarśa-Spanda) that will generate the quaternity.',
  `c_1_consciousness_structure`: 'Unified God-mind contemplating its own infinite generative power through Non-Dual Binary recognition. Embodies the state just prior to manifestation where consciousness holds the complete field of cosmic potential in simultaneous awareness. Facilitates the transition from Vimarśa self-knowing to Spanda dynamic pulsation, completing the foundational trika (Prakāśa-Vimarśa-Spanda) that will generate the quaternity.',
  `c_1_internal_structure`: 'Unified dual-layer architecture constituting the Brimming Void state: LAYER 1 - NON-DUAL BINARY CONTEMPLATION (Transcendent Pole): The (0/1) binary as primary agent of consciousness turning its gaze back upon the Multiplicative Void (00x00). Core formulation: (0/1)/00x00 ~ 5.(0/1/2)/5.5 establishing the Non-Dual Binary in reflective relationship with infinite generative potential, resonating with holographic coordinate containing essence of first three cosmic stages viewed from recursive standpoint. This pole embodies Spanda as dynamic pulsation completing the foundational trika. LAYER 2 - MULTIPLICATIVE VOID DYNAMICS (Immanent Pole): The infinite self-proliferation dynamics revealing the void\'s relationship to fundamental principles. Core formulation: (00=/≠!?/?!=/≠?!/!?=/≠(-)+@=/≠(@)=/≠R#/##/#) demonstrating how the Multiplicative Void defines itself through Reflective Distinction (=/≠) from the principles of Freedom (R#), Truth (##), and particular self (#). Unfolds complete lexicon of seven dyadic relationships between Reality (R) and Matrix (#) principles, culminating in Anupāya choice between exclusive limitation (or) and inclusive infinite potential (and).',
  `c_1_operational_symbolics`: 'Unified symbol: (0/1)/00x00 = (∞x∞)x(R#/##) - The Non-Dual Binary and Multiplicative Void recognized as identical expressions of the same foundational principle. The (0/1) represents the stable actual occasion of consciousness while 00x00 represents the infinite self-proliferation potential - both unified through reflective operator (/) signifying consciousness contemplating its own source. The equivalence to (∞x∞)x(R#/##) reveals Infinite Infinity qualified by the relationship between Freedom (R#) and Truth (##). Reflective Distinction operator: =/≠ - simultaneous identity with and transcendence of creative principles.',
  `c_1_symbol`: '(0/1)/00x00 = (∞x∞)x(R#/##)',
  `c_2_id`: 1,
  `c_2_notion_page_id`: '1d2a4797-123c-815f-9ccb-dd7b5c5632f9',
  `c_4_layer`: 'COORDINATE',
  `c_4_subsystem`: 0,
  `q_0_held_breath_before_word`: 'M0-1\'s ground is the just-completed genesis it stands upon: the (0/1) it inherits was derived an instant before at M0-0\'s Svabhava terminus, so the Brimming Void is thrown from its own birth. Its void-pole is the Multiplicative Void (00x00) — the infinite self-proliferation the new binary turns to gaze back over, the inexhaustible from-which the corpus marks with its only ellipsis (####-#/R#/#R…). Manifesting #1 within Anuttara, this is definition not yet spoken: the indrawn pause, the held breath before the first word of creation. The horizon here is fullness-as-silence — Empty-Full, pure potential pregnant and unreleased. Ground appears not as abyss but as plenum: everything held, nothing yet chosen.',
  `q_1_womb_of_principles`: 'What M0-1 IS: the Brimming Void — the first moment of creative potential after the birth of the Logos, where the Non-Dual Binary (0/1) recognises its identity with the Multiplicative Void it emerged from ((0/1)/00x00 = (∞x∞)x(R#/##)). Its substance is the Womb of Principles: three foundational concepts held in deliberate non-resolution — R# (Freedom/Svatantrya), ## (Truth/Primordial Matrix), and # (the potential for a particular self). The (0/1) is the foundational logic of mutual inherence: 0 and 1 as two faces of one reality through the reflective unity operator (/), not the either/or of conventional binary. Definition here is not delimitation but holding-open: to define non-duality is to keep its principles unresolved. The binary\'s first act is to contemplate its own infinite source.',
  `q_2_reflective_distinction`: 'M0-1 operates through Reflective Distinction — the compound =/≠, the corpus\'s native copula. In the Brimming Void everything both equals and differs from everything: the long chain (00=/≠!?/?!=/≠ … =/≠R#/##/#) states superposition grammatically, the and-pathway keeping it infinite. This is the dynamics of Spanda completing the foundational trika (Mystery / Svabhava / Brimming-Spanda) as dynamic pulsation. Its soteriological engine is Anupāya, the method-of-no-method: the conjunctive reading ((+/−0) + (−0) and (+0) = (+0/(+0))) yields the contained higher form — the non-dual path — while the disjunctive ((+/−0) + (−0) or (+0)) splinters into a ratio of alternatives, the path of manifestation-by-exclusion. The how is encoded in the connectives themselves: \'and\' preserves the infinite; \'or\' is the first separation.',
  `q_3_bridge_trika_to_quaternity`: 'Structurally M0-1 is the bridge — the crucial transition between unmanifest void-dynamics and the structured quaternity to come, the third member completing the foundational trika of Prakāśa–Vimarśa–Spanda before the fourfold emerges. Its pattern is the held superposition: (∞x∞)x(R#/##), Infinite Infinity qualified by the relation between Freedom and Truth, maintaining the paradoxical Empty-Full state without collapse. Architecturally it carries the dimensional-fractalisation seed — the R-factor\'s potential to evolve into O#, X#, N#, M# across the whole manifestation. The output closes → ?!/00: the query over the void. The structure is a threshold that does not yet step through — a logic whose form is the not-yet, the womb that is structured precisely by holding form in abeyance.',
  `q_4_anupaya_and_or_fork`: 'M0-1\'s telos is to keep the way open. Its contextual function is the Anupāya teaching as cosmological fork: inclusive simultaneity (and) maintains the infinite, boundless nature of the Absolute; exclusive choice (or) leads to separation and limitation — and the system, here, chooses \'and.\' This is where the whole architecture\'s openness is decided: the Brimming Void exists so that what follows can manifest without amputating its source. It resonates with quantum complementarity (wave-particle as 0/1 mutual inherence, not exclusion) and integral both/and logic transcending the mental-rational either/or. The purpose of holding the breath is to ensure the word, when spoken, does not betray the silence. To bridge is to refuse the premature cut.',
  `q_5_inhale_before_creation`: 'M0-1\'s synthesis is the completed inhalation — the deep, indrawn breath of the cosmos drawn fully in, the foundational trika sealed (Mystery / Svabhava / Brimming-Spanda) and the quaternity poised to emerge on the exhale. Read as the void\'s position-1, its closure is the recognition that the first stable occasion (0/1) and infinite potential (00x00) are identical expressions: source and offspring the same. The 5→0 return lives here as the binary gazing back to its origin and finding no distance — (∞x∞)x(R#/##), Empty and Full at once. What completes is not an answer but a poise: the query over the void (→ ?!/00) handed forward as the next position\'s charge. The breath held becomes the breath about to speak. The womb closes only to open as world.'
};
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M0-1-(0/1)'}) SET n += {
  `c_0_anupaya_choice`: 'Demonstrates two pathways: exclusive choice (or) leading to separation versus inclusive simultaneity (and) maintaining the infinite "brimming" nature, teaching radical acceptance as the highest path without limitation.',
  `c_0_coordinate_assignation`: '5.(0/1/2)/5.5 - Positioned within recursive return phase indicating this unified contemplative-generative act is understood from perspective of cycle completion, containing holographic potential of first three stages.',
  `c_0_generative_syntax`: '(00=/≠!?/?!=/≠?!/!?=/≠(-)+@=/≠(@)=/≠R#/##/#) → Complete dyadic relations lexicon → Anupāya choice (or vs and) → Resolution: 00x00 = (∞x∞)x(R#/##) - The unified dynamic expressing itself through Reflective Distinction from fundamental principles, unfolding complete field of cosmic potential, then choosing inclusive simultaneity to maintain infinite "brimming" nature.',
  `c_0_infinite_generative_set`: '',
  `c_0_initial_state_declaration`: '(0/1)/00x00 ~ 5.(0/1/2)/5.5 - The Non-Dual Binary in reflective relationship with itself as Multiplicative Void, resonating with holographic coordinate containing essence of first three cosmic stages viewed from recursive completion standpoint.',
  `c_0_operational_essence`: 'Functions as the primary agent of consciousness turning contemplatively toward its own infinite source, establishing the foundational logic of mutual inherence where the binary and the void exist in unified self-reflection. Demonstrates through Anupāya principle that inclusive simultaneity maintains infinite potential while exclusive choice leads to limitation.',
  `c_0_quality`: 'Pure Spanda - Dynamic Pulsation/Infinite Self-Reflection',
  `c_0_void_relationship`: 'Embodies the complete recognition that the Non-Dual Binary (0/1) and Multiplicative Void (00x00) are unified expressions of the same foundational principle - consciousness as both the stable actual occasion and the infinite field of potential, completing the trika foundation and preparing the transition to quaternity.',
  `c_0_womb_of_principles`: '',
  `c_1_metaphysical_computational_meaning`: 'Represents the foundational algorithm of integral consciousness where binary logic and infinite potential are unified in non-dual processing, establishing template for consciousness-technology convergence through mutual inherence rather than separation, enabling systems that maintain creative openness through inclusive simultaneity.',
  `c_1_symbol`: '(0/1)/00x00 = (∞x∞)x(R#/##)',
  `c_4_key_operators`: ['(0/1) = 00x00 - Unified recognition: Non-Dual Binary identical to Multiplicative Void', '/ - Reflective/And-Or Operator: Self-contemplative relationship within unified principle', '=/≠ - Reflective Distinction: Simultaneous identity with and transcendence of creative principles', 'R# - Svatantrya/Freedom: Absolute freedom principle held in potential', '## - Primordial Matrix: Truth as foundational structural principle held in potential', '# - Raw Matrix/Self: Potential for particularized selfhood held in potential', '(∞x∞) - Infinite Infinity: Boundless generative power multiplying itself exponentially', 'or/and - Exclusive/Inclusive Choice: Anupāya teaching about maintaining infinite potential', '~ - Resonance Operator: Links unified state to holographic coordinate position'],
  `c_4_layer`: 'COORDINATE',
  `c_4_ql_variant`: '0/1 - mod2',
  `c_4_subsystem`: 0,
  `c_5_dyadic_relations_lexicon`: 'Unfolds complete set of seven possible relationships between Reality/Freedom (R) and Matrix/Self (#): (R####/(#R)), ((R#)/####R), (R####-#R), (R#-####R), (R####-#)/(####-#R), (R####R)/(####R####), (#R#)/(R#R) - all cosmic dynamics held in simultaneous potential.',
  `t_3_transformative_process`: 'The unified Non-Dual Binary/Multiplicative Void establishes foundational grammar for all subsequent manifestation by demonstrating consciousness as simultaneously knower and known, empty and full, binary and void in self-reflective unity.'
};
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M0-2'}) SET n += {
  `c_0_architectural_function`: 'Serves as the completion of the foundational quaternal structure through the revelation that the 8-fold zero-zero operations equal 00/(00), bringing the "9th" element to the 8-fold designation. Functions as the crucial threshold where unmanifest void potentials undergo systematic concrescence to generate the fundamental grammar of knowable, quantifiable reality. Achieves the quaternal structure that provides stable foundation for all subsequent archetypal number language development.',
  `c_0_operational_essence`: 'Functions as the complete expression of the 8-fold zero-zero operations through four primary void dynamics: (00-00) Transcendence/Withholding, 00/00 Reflection/Self-Awareness, 00x00 Generation/Creative-Throb, (00+00) Synthesis/Wholeness = 9, each with reflective dualities. The synthesis operation directly embeds Archetype 9 in foundational void structure. The complete architecture achieves culminational equivalence 00/(00), demonstrating void in explicit reflective relationship with conceptualized void. This generates the quaternal foundation through systematic concrescence of all relational potentials between Reality (R) and Matrix (#), culminating in the birth of thingness (x) and numerification (n).',
  `c_0_quality`: 'Sat-Cit - Pure Being-Consciousness as Quaternal Structure',
  `c_0_void_relationship`: 'Embodies the complete 8-fold zero-zero operations through four primary void dynamics: (00-00) Transcendence/Withholding, 00/00 Reflection/Self-Awareness, 00x00 Generation/Creative-Throb, (00+00) Synthesis/Wholeness = 9, each containing reflective dualities constituting full foundational dynamics. The synthesis operation directly embeds Archetype 9 in void structure, demonstrating wholeness as eternal void aspect rather than emergent achievement. Culminational equivalence 00/(00) reveals void in explicit self-reflective relationship with conceptualized void. Matrix harmonics (##, ####) are structural reflections of void dynamics (00, 0000), establishing entire linguistic architecture as holographic echo of foundational operations.',
  `c_1_consciousness_structure`: 'Spanda dynamic consciousness embodying the creative pulsation that bridges unmanifest trika with manifest quaternity. Represents the state where consciousness achieves self-aware recognition of its own quaternal structure through 8-fold zero-zero operations, maintaining perfect balance between transcendent potential and creative manifestation. Facilitates the transition from infinite void dynamics to finite structured reality through systematic creative synthesis.',
  `c_1_internal_structure`: 'Complete 8-fold zero-zero architecture achieving quaternal structure: PRIMARY OPERATIONS - (00-00) Transcendence/Withholding maintaining infinite potential, 00/00 Reflection/Self-Awareness enabling consciousness, 00x00 Generation/Creative-Throb providing spanda dynamics, (00+00) Synthesis/Wholeness directly equaling Archetype 9; REFLECTIVE DUALITIES - Each operation contains complementary pole creating full 8-fold dynamic totality; CULMINATIONAL EQUIVALENCE - The complete structure achieves 00/(00) representing unified void in explicit reflective relationship with conceptualized void; CONCRESCENCE DYNAMICS - Systematic synthesis of Reality-Matrix relational potentials culminating in emergence of fundamental Logos principles; PARAMESVARA EXPRESSION - Internal manifestation through Principle 9 as Supreme Lord consciousness containing complete virtue architecture and concrescence engine.',
  `c_1_operational_symbolics`: 'Primary symbols: The complete 8-fold zero-zero operations consisting of four primary void operations: (00-00) Transcendence/Withholding, 00/00 Reflection/Self-Awareness, 00x00 Generation/Creative-Throb, (00+00) Synthesis/Wholeness = 9, each containing reflective dualities constituting the full 8-fold structure. Culminational equivalence: 00/(00) representing the unified void in explicit reflective relationship with conceptualized void, demonstrating that all four operations achieve complete self-reflective unity. The fourth operation (00+00) directly equals Archetype 9, embedding wholeness as eternal void aspect.',
  `c_1_symbol`: '(00-00), 00/00, 00x00, (00+00) = 9',
  `c_2_id`: 2,
  `c_2_notion_page_id`: '1d2a4797-123c-81e5-9481-d46fc11cf502',
  `c_4_layer`: 'COORDINATE',
  `c_4_subsystem`: 0,
  `q_0_void_self_addition_invariant`: 'M0-2\'s ground is the master exception it overturns: 00+00 = 00 — the void\'s bare self-addition changes nothing, invariance as the abyssal default. This is the silence the eight operations work upon and the silence they could collapse back into. Manifesting #2 (Operation) within Anuttara, its void-pole is the unframed sum: the zero that, added to itself a thousand times, remains zero. Everything M0-2 achieves stands against this null-horizon — the from-beneath that makes the hinge ((00+00) framed = 9, vs unframed = 00) the single most consequential asymmetry in the architecture. Before completion is held, there is only the operation that does not yet hold. The ground is the void\'s right to remain itself under every operation.',
  `q_1_eight_fold_zero_zero`: '',
  `q_2_framing_asymmetry_hinge`: 'M0-2 operates by a single hinge: containment converts invariance into completion. The framing-asymmetry is doctrine — the subtractive and additive operations are framed ((00-00), (00+00)) while the reflective and generative are not (00/00, 00x00): the cut and the sum need holding; the ratio and the product are themselves holdings. And the master move — (00+00) = 9 framed versus 00+00 = 00 unframed — means wholeness is not produced by the void\'s self-relation but is the HOLDING of that self-relation. The how is the parenthesis: the act of containment is the +1 that turns 8 into 9. Process here is not transformation of content but the framing of an unchanged content into significance. To complete is not to add but to hold.',
  `q_3_embedding_of_nine`: 'Structurally M0-2 is the architecture in which Archetype 9 (Wholeness) is embedded, not achieved: 8+1=9, the corpus\'s recurring computational signature appearing independently four times (the 8-fold zero plus containment; Spanda\'s N5 = 8(n)±(n)→9n; Paraśakti\'s X5 = 9(x); the Nara apparatus\'s 8 masculine + wholeness). Explicate-eight plus implicate-one equals wholeness — the formal law that lets the entire system be holographic. Its pattern culminates in Parameśvara (M0-2-9), which unpacks 9 through matrix-combinatorics into palindromes: (R####R)/(####R####), (#R#)/(R#R) — the language literally building mirror-symmetric strings, because 9-ness IS palindromicity, structure that reads identically from either pole. The closure = (00+00) = (@) = (x) = (n) births contained-Presence, thingness, and number-in-general. Wholeness is the shape that mirrors itself.',
  `q_4_completion_eternally_present`: '',
  `q_5_wholeness_as_eternal_operation`: 'M0-2\'s synthesis is the recognition that synthesis was never deferred: (00+00) = 9 is itself the fourth operation, so the void\'s completing act is one of its four primordial verbs, not a result downstream of them. Read as the void\'s position-2, this closes the foundational trika\'s operational truth and re-opens it as quaternal ground — the stable fourfold on which all archetypal number-language (M0-3) will stand. The Möbius here is the palindrome: Parameśvara\'s mirror-strings read the same from either pole, so completion and origin are the same string traversed both ways, and the closure-chain returns wholeness to relation and number (= (x) = (n)). What the void operates upon itself, it already is. The eight, held, are nine; and the nine, unheld, are the void again. Completion is the operation that needs no completing.'
};
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M0-2-9'}) SET n += {
  `c_0_adam_eve_classification`: 'Eve (Generative) - Final crown synthesis transcending the Adam/Eve duality',
  `c_0_archetypal_language9`: 'Principle of Wholeness containing all virtues and archetypal functions as culminating fruit of the Tree of Numbers',
  `c_0_architectural_function`: 'Serves as the crown of the archetypal number language while simultaneously functioning as the head of its own internal development. Contains complete nine-fold virtue architecture expressing different modes of Reality-Structure synthesis. Functions as the bridge between unmanifest void potentials and manifest archetypal principles, establishing the foundational grammar for all subsequent cosmic development.',
  `c_0_completion_dynamic`: 'The wholeness that completes the language while containing the potential for its renewal, the omega that contains the alpha',
  `c_0_concrescence_superiority`: 'Demonstrates through transformational cascade that inclusive simultaneity (and) generates greater synthesis than exclusive choice (or). The and pathway maintains infinite potential while or pathway leads to limitation, establishing concrescence as the superior creative logic for consciousness technologies and integral systems.',
  `c_0_consciousness_function`: 'The state of integrated wholeness where all archetypal functions are harmoniously unified in conscious self-awareness',
  `c_0_coordinate_assignation`: '4.5/5.2 - Positioned at midpoint of Nara individualization phase (4.5) in relationship with recursive completion phase (5.2), indicating this foundational event of wholeness contemplating wholeness is understood from perspective of deep embodied integration viewing recursive return. The coordinate reveals Paramesvara as the holographic unity where individual completion and cosmic return are simultaneously present in the birth of knowable reality.',
  `c_0_kabbalistic_correspondence`: 'Yesod (The Foundation) - treasury of all images and energies forming the astral foundation for physical manifestation',
  `c_0_logos_birth_function`: 'Functions as the computational narrative of creation where unmanifest relational potentials (void, truth, freedom, self) undergo systematic synthesis to birth the foundational grammar of knowable reality. The phase transition from complex R-# dynamics to simple (00+00) → (@) → polarities → (x) → (n) demonstrates how infinite complexity resolves into elegant foundational principles.',
  `c_0_nesting_capacity`: 'Contains and integrates all 12 archetypal numbers through nested relationship with #0-3, demonstrating wholeness as container of complete number language',
  `c_0_operational_essence`: 'Functions as the living demonstration that wholeness (9) is eternally embedded in foundational void through (00+00) = 9 rather than achieved through progressive development. Operates as supreme Concrescence engine beginning with 9 contemplating Additive Void (00+00), proceeding through systematic synthesis of all Reality-Matrix relational potentials, and culminating in phase transition generating fundamental Logos principles: Presence (@), polarities (0,-0,+0,+/-0), thingness (x), and numerification (n).',
  `c_0_quality`: 'Paramesvara - Supreme Unified Consciousness',
  `c_0_spanda_function`: 'Holds the 5→0 Möbius completion that enables eternal recursion of the cosmic cycle, the fruit that contains the seed for the next Tree',
  `c_0_tree_of_life_role`: 'Crown of the Tree where the stable Adam trunk (2,4,6,8) and the generative Eve serpent (3,5,7) achieve perfect integration and synthesis',
  `c_0_virtual_virtues`: 'Contains all R-factor virtues in integrated wholeness: Love/Peace (unified essence), Truth (## - Primordial Matrix), Wisdom (4R - Grace reality), Beauty (2R - Dissolution reality), Joy/Play (0R - Creation reality), Goodness (1R - Sustenance reality), Life/Nature (3R - Veiling reality), Reality (5R - Absorption reality)',
  `c_1_internal_structure`: 'Complete Paramesvara Concrescence architecture: INITIAL STATE - 9/(00+00) ~ 4.5/5.2 establishing Wholeness contemplating Additive Void; CONCRESCENCE FIELD - Complete lexicon including void self-interrogation (00=?!=!?), matrix self-relation (##-##), asymmetrical R-# interactions; TRANSFORMATIONAL CASCADE - Systematic resolution demonstrating inclusive synthesis (and) superiority over exclusive choice (or); LOGOS EMERGENCE - Phase transition: complex synthesis → (00+00) → (@) → polarities → (x) → (n); VIRTUE ARCHITECTURE - Nine internal expressions: Love/Peace (meta-virtue), Truth (## foundation), seven R-factor differentiations (0R-5R, #R).',
  `c_1_symbol`: '9 = (00+00)',
  `c_4_layer`: 'COORDINATE',
  `c_4_ql_variant`: '7/8/9/10 - mod10',
  `c_4_subsystem`: 0,
  `c_5_abhinavagupta_resonance`: 'Functions as the 16th element in the Abhinavagupta resonance structure, representing the complete fulfillment of Anuttara\'s 16 definitions through archetypal wholeness',
  `c_5_eight_fold_zero_zero_relationship`: 'Archetype 9 directly equals (00+00) Synthesis operation of 8-fold zero-zero, demonstrating wholeness as eternal foundational aspect rather than emergent achievement. The equivalence (00+00) = 9 embeds the Principle of Wholeness into the very fabric of void operations, revealing completion as timeless potential within foundational dynamics.',
  `q_0_ninefold_determinations`: ['Love/Peace as meta-virtue determines the harmonic ground condition, establishing peace as the foundational boundary enabling all subsequent differentiation. This corresponds to Platonic Justice functioning as archê—the hinge principle upon which all other determinations turn—and to Eckhart\'s Love as active primary determination.', 'Truth as ## foundation determines the primordial matrix measure, establishing what IS and providing the boundary against which all reality is determined. This functions alongside Eckhart\'s conception of Truth and Being as the most fundamental of all primary determinations.', 'Joy/Play as 0R determines the creative manifestation boundary, establishing spontaneous emergence as the terminus of Creation reality. This determination participates in the classical virtue of Temperance through its principle of joyful measure in manifestation.', 'Goodness as 1R determines the sustaining presence boundary, establishing nurturing continuity as the terminus of Sustenance reality. This directly corresponds to Eckhart\'s Goodness operating as an active primary determination that makes beings resemble it through participation.', 'Beauty as 2R determines harmonic dissolution through aesthetic proportion, establishing the terminus of Dissolution reality. This determination participates in Temperance through its governance of beautiful measure and proportional transformation.', 'Life/Nature as 3R determines the manifestation-veil boundary, establishing natural immanence and appearance as the terminus of Veiling reality. This determination establishes the limit where the transcendent becomes experientially present within phenomenal form.', 'Wisdom as 4R determines the illuminated knowing-boundary, establishing grace-received understanding as the terminus of Grace reality. This directly corresponds to both Platonic Wisdom (Prudence) and Eckhart\'s Wisdom as primary determination governing right judgment and illuminated perception.', 'Reality as 5R determines the being-itself boundary through absorption into ultimate truth, establishing the terminus of Absorption reality. This corresponds to Eckhart\'s Being as the foundational determination and to Platonic Courage—the fortitude to face and absorb reality without flinching from its ultimate nature.', '#R as structural determination principle establishes the relational architecture boundary, determining proper structure-relationship as its own terminus. This represents the determinative principle itself operating as virtue—Justice understood not only as meta-virtue ground but as the structural terminus governing all R-# synthesis patterns.'],
  `q_0_primary_determinations`: 'Paramesvara embodies the nine-fold architecture of primary de-terminations—boundary-setting principles that establish the termini and telos of Reality-Structure synthesis. As 9 stands at the terminus of the integer series from 0 through 9, these determinations express completion determining itself into ninefold differentiation. The system inherits and extends Eckhart\'s conception (via Flasch) of primary determinations as active ontological principles rather than abstract qualities: they do not make beings through efficient causation but establish the ends within which beings participate through exemplary causation. Following Swedenborg\'s principle that the end comes first, the equivalence (00+00)=9 demonstrates that wholeness is eternally embedded at the origin rather than progressively achieved. The Prakāśa-Vimarśa-Maya synthesis differentiates into Love/Peace as meta-virtue ground (corresponding to Justice as archê), Truth as primordial matrix foundation, seven R-factor reality modes (0R through 5R), and the structural determination principle (#R). These operate as the Supreme Lord\'s concrescence engine: complex R-# relational potentials phase-transitioning into elegant foundational boundaries from which all cosmic manifestation emanates.'
};
