  `c_0_architectural_function`: 'Serves as the foundational essence underlying all other virtues, representing the eternal peace of the void in all its operational modes. Functions as the meta-virtue that qualifies and grounds all specific virtue expressions, ensuring they remain connected to transcendent source while manifesting particular divine qualities.',
