  `c_0_architectural_function`: 'Serves as the primary structural virtue providing the stable logical foundation upon which all other virtues can manifest. Functions as the bridge between pure Love/Peace essence and specific virtue differentiations, establishing Truth as the fundamental grid or code of reality that enables coherent virtue expression.',
  `c_0_operational_essence`: 'Functions as the foundational virtue establishing Truth (##) as Contained Presence (@) through the formulation (0/1)-(00)-00, demonstrating how manifest Non-Dual Binary relates to contained and uncontained void forms. Operates as the first structural principle cut or distinguished from undifferentiated ground, providing the stable logical foundation for all subsequent virtue expressions.',
  `c_0_quality`: 'Truth - Primordial Matrix Foundation',
