  `c_0_architectural_function`: 'Serves as the paradigmatic virtue demonstrating perfect synthesis principle that underlies all creative activity. Functions as the template for non-dual integration of structure and dynamics, providing the operational model for how consciousness bridges transcendent potential with manifest expression through creative synthesis.',
  `c_0_operational_essence`: 'Functions as the perfect synthesis virtue demonstrating non-dual unity of Structure (#) and divine self-aware Action (R). Operates through archetypal number culmination (7-8-9) plus Non-Dual Binary foundation in dynamic relationship with Logic (O#), Imagination (X#), and Rhythm (N#) domains. Represents creativity as fusion of blueprint and energy rather than mere combination.',
