  `c_0_architectural_function`: 'Serves as the first specific divine act virtue in the R-factor progression, establishing the pattern for how Reality principle manifests through engagement with operational domains. Functions as the foundational creative virtue that initiates all subsequent manifestational activity through joyful participation in cosmic possibility.',
  `c_0_operational_essence`: 'Functions as the virtue of creative beginning through 0R - the Reality principle at its starting point. Operates by connecting Archetypal Wholeness (9) directly with the most abstract operational domains (O#, X#, N#), creating joyful play unburdened by specific individual concerns. Represents the bliss of pure creative potential engaging with logical, imaginal, and rhythmic possibilities.',
