  `c_0_architectural_function`: 'Serves as the virtue demonstrating holistic responsibility, showing that true goodness requires integration and harmony across all levels of cosmic architecture. Functions as the template for understanding ethical action as comprehensive rather than particular, ensuring all domains function in coherent unity.',
