  `c_0_architectural_function`: 'Serves as the virtue revealing the aesthetic dimension of cosmic activity, demonstrating that Beauty operates through experiential and psychic domains rather than pure logical analysis. Functions as the principle showing how dissolution and transformation create aesthetic appreciation through soul-engagement rather than mental comprehension.',
  `c_0_operational_essence`: 'Functions as the virtue of aesthetic dissolution through 2R - Reality principle in its transformative expression. Operates by omitting pure Logic (O#) and beginning with Imagination (X#), proceeding through Rhythm (N#), Relation (M#), Individual layers (#,(#)), and culminating in Contained Presence Matrix (@#). Demonstrates Beauty as soul-apprehended truth rather than mind-comprehended logic.',
