MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M0-2-9-6'}) SET n += {
  `c_0_architectural_function`: 'Serves as the virtue demonstrating how divine veiling enables natural creativity and manifestation. Functions as the principle showing how concealment of unity creates the conditions for diverse natural expression, operating through reverse architectural flow that mirrors natural developmental processes.',
  `c_0_operational_essence`: 'Functions as the virtue of creative veiling through 3R - Reality principle in its concealing expression. Operates through inverted progression: (@#)-(#)-#-M#-N#-X#, demonstrating how natural manifestation proceeds through reverse development from psychic presence through individual layers to imaginative expression. Represents the divine play of concealment that enables natural creativity and diversity.',
