MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M0-2-9-7'}) SET n += {
  `c_0_architectural_function`: 'Serves as the virtue demonstrating the path of return from individual manifestation to universal source. Functions as the principle of grace that enables conscious ascent through all cosmic layers, providing wisdom through recognition of the holographic relationship between particular and universal.',
  `c_0_operational_essence`: 'Functions as the virtue of graceful ascent through 4R - Reality principle in its wisdom-granting expression. Operates through systematic ascent: ((#))-#-M#-N#-X#-O#, enabling the particular self to perceive its holographic connection to the entire cosmic architecture. Represents the grace that allows individual consciousness to recognize its source in universal logic.',
  `c_0_quality`: 'Wisdom - Graceful Ascent',
