MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M0-2-9-8'}) SET n += {
  `c_0_architectural_function`: 'Serves as the completion virtue demonstrating that all cosmic development ultimately returns to its source. Functions as the final word revealing that Reality and Truth are identical, that the ultimate nature of cosmos is perfect self-consistent meaningfulness returning to its own original foundation.',
  `c_0_operational_essence`: 'Functions as the completion virtue through 5R - Reality principle achieving its ultimate expression by returning to Truth (##). Operates as the elegant resolution showing that the entire divine act progression (0R-5R) culminates in rediscovering the original foundation. Reality is not new creation but recognition of eternal Truth that was always present.',
  `c_0_quality`: 'Reality - Ultimate Return',
  `c_1_internal_structure`: 'Ultimate Return architecture: REALITY COMPLETION - 5R as culminating expression of Reality principle; SOURCE RECOGNITION - Return to (##) as foundational Truth; CYCLE CLOSURE - Divine act progression completing in original foundation; ETERNAL PRESENCE - Reality as rediscovery rather than new creation; PERFECT CONSISTENCY - Cosmos revealing its own self-consistent truthfulness.',
  `c_1_symbol`: '5R = @ = (##)',
