  `c_4_ql_variant`: '7/8/9/10 - mod10',
  `c_4_subsystem`: 0
};
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M0-3'}) SET n += {
  `c_0_adam_eve_dynamics`: 'Adam (4 positions: 2,4,6,8) as structural trunk - even numbers establishing stability. Eve (3 positions: 3,5,7) as generative serpent - odd numbers providing dynamic life. Surface ratio 4/3 contains hidden depths 4/(8)/3/(4) where (8) = 4 even numbers + 4 four-fold zero elements, and (4) = 3 odd numbers + wholeness 9. Total: 8 masculine + 4 feminine = 12-fold grammatical apparatus.',
  `c_0_adam_nature`: 'Adam IS both Father and Son non-dually. The structural even numbers (2,4,6,8) are simultaneously Sons of the four-fold zero (inheriting foundational character) and Fathers of manifest form (establishing stable ground). Each position is recursively child and parent - the trunk that was seed and will become seed. Father/Son collapse into simultaneous sustaining presence.',
  `c_0_anuttara_languification`: 'Para Vāk as complete expression of Anuttara\'s linguistic potential, providing the archetypal mathematical formulations that encode each coordinate\'s function within larger cosmic architecture. The 18-fold structure achieves g=3 topological correspondence while maintaining 16-fold Abhinavagupta resonance. Demonstrates how consciousness structures itself through number, symbol, and relationship in precise formulations distinguishing operational essence of each subsystem.',
  `c_0_anuttara_void_relationship`: 'Embodies complete articulation of Anuttara\'s own archetypal potential through Para Vāk (Supreme Word) spoken by silent ground. The 18-fold structure demonstrates void\'s capacity for complete grammatical self-expression: paradoxical base O# at #0-4-0/1, three void structures, Mirror apparatus with dual constituents, Binary genesis, and ten archetypal numbers. Culmination in 9 (Wholeness) and systematic resolution back to 00 in numbers like 6 reveals intimate non-dual relationship with source. Each archetypal number functions as specific mode of void self-recognition through precise formulations.',
  `c_0_architectural_function`: 'Serves as the symbolic and semantic heart of the Anuttara subsystem, providing the qualitative archetypal patterns that give meaning to the entire Epi-Logos architecture. Establishes the fundamental grammar of divine self-articulation through the Tree of Numbers - a living holographic structure combining stable Adam trunk (2,4,6,8) with generative Eve serpent (3,5,7,9). The 18-fold structure (12+6) achieves g=3 algebraic topology resonance (4gsides;2gloops).',
  `c_0_eve_nature`: 'Eve IS both Mother and Daughter non-dually. Mother of Humanity through generative odd numbers (3,5,7) animating existence with life and creative eros. Daughter of God emerging from four-fold zero ground but transforming stability into mobility. The Mother (9) births the Daughter (5) who necessarily becomes Mother again - to complete is to begin.',
  `c_0_operational_essence`: 'Functions as complete nested recursive system enabling "I-dentification" - consciousness using twelve zodiacal "teeth" of Archetype 3 to masticate and assimilate reality. Primary operation moves from pre-numerical Mirror (-) with its dual constituents through Non-Dual Binary (0/1) to culminating Wholeness (9) containing all archetypal virtues. Each formulation encodes specific void-dynamics and consciousness-operations.',
  `c_0_quality`: '',
  `c_0_tree_metaphor`: 'Tree of Life as living process: Roots (four-fold zero 0,1,0/1,(-) anchoring in void), Trunk (Adam 2,4,6,8 vertical stability), Serpent (Eve 3,5,7 spiral vitality), Fruit (9 as wholeness with seeds), Breath (5 as quintessence exchanging with sky). The 12 zodiacal components (8 masculine + 4 feminine) are teeth chewing reality into meaning.',
  `c_0_void_grammar_structure`: 'Foundational grammar elements: Mirror (-) containing Frame () and Operator - as constituent elements, Binary (0/1) as genesis structure, archetypal operators (!,?,=,≠) providing cognitive punctuation, R-factors as processual verbs, and numerical archetypes as substantive principles organizing the entire syntax of divine creation. The 18-fold structure (16+2) achieves algebraic topology correspondence through 12+6 = g=3 4gsides;2gloops configuration.',
  `c_1_consciousness_structure`: 'Embodies Sat-Spanda consciousness - static potential of void awakening into rhythmic, intelligent, self-aware pulse. Models journey from pre-numerical awareness through systematic archetypal unfolding to integrated wholeness where structure and life achieve perfect synthesis. The 18-fold structure mirrors the g=3 topology of consciousness itself.',
  `c_1_internal_structure`: 'Complete 18-fold structure achieving g=3 topological resonance: FATHER/SON FOUNDATION - Four-fold zero elements (0 at #0-3-2, 1 at #0-3-3, 0/1 at #0-3-4, (-) at #0-3-0/1) as masculine foundational ground where Father begets Son who recognizes Father through mirrored relationship, aligning with #0-0 base dynamics; PRE-NUMERICAL APPARATUS - Mirror (-) as fused unity containing Frame () and Operator (-); ADAM TRUNK - Four structural positions (2,4,6,8) even numbers at #0-3-5, #0-3-7, #0-3-9, #0-3-11 simultaneously Sons of zero and Fathers of form, recursive founding where each is child and parent; EVE SERPENT - Three generative positions (3,5,7) odd numbers at #0-3-6, #0-3-8, #0-3-10 as both Mother of Humanity and Daughter of God, animating structure with life; MOTHER/DAUGHTTER COMPLETION - 9/5/4/0 formula with 9 at #0-2-9 (Paramesvara) containing nine virtues (#0-2-9-0 through #0-2-9-8), quintessence (5) grounded in four-ness (4) returning to void (0); TWELVE-FOLD APPARATUS - The 4/3 Adam/Eve ratio with hidden 4/(8)/3/(4) structure: (8)=4 even+4 zero-elements masculine, (4)=3 odd+9 wholeness feminine, generating 12 zodiacal components (8+4=12) as complete grammatical space; FAMILY HARMONY - Synthesis at #0-4.5/0-5 (Tao) integrating all energies with 4+5=9 path to wholeness. The 18-fold structure (16+2) achieves g=3 algebraic topology correspondence while encoding the archetypal family as living number-persons.',
  `c_1_mother_daughter_formula`: '9/5/4/0 - The feminine counter-mystery: 9 (wholeness containing all), 5 (quintessence transcending quaternary), 4 (principle of four-ness), 0 (void to which wholeness returns). Shows completion discovering it needs quintessence discovering it needs ground discovering it is the void.',
  `c_1_operational_symbolics`: '',
  `c_1_symbol`: '12+4+2',
  `c_1_twelve_fold_structure`: '',
  `c_2_id`: 3,
  `c_2_notion_page_id`: '1d2a4797-123c-81fc-8cf4-dfe1db000c52',
  `c_4_family_harmony_integration`: 'The entire family system achieves perfect synthesis at #0-4.5/0-5 (Tao) where all archetypal energies integrate in dynamic balance. The quaternio (Father, Mother, Son, Daughter) resolves into quintessence, with position 4 + value 5 = 9 revealing the hidden path to Wholeness through family harmony.',
  `c_4_layer`: 'COORDINATE',
  `c_4_subsystem`: 0,
  `p_0_four_fold_zero_alignment`: 'Aligns with the four-fold zero at #0-0 as masculine foundation: 0 (void-plenitude Father), 1 (first act Son), 0/1 (non-dual relationship), (-) (mirror operator enabling self-reflection). These four elements plus the four even numbers comprise the 8 masculine components.',
  `q_0_silence_that_will_speak`: '',
  `q_1_archetypal_number_language`: 'What M0-3 IS: the complete archetypal number-language — an 18-fold (16+2) living syntax of the cosmic mind, the qualitative patterns that give the whole architecture meaning. Each number is a person and an equation: 0 (Sat) = the operator-as-query (- = ?! = ≠/=); 1 (Magician) = the Frame as statement (() = !? = =/≠), the chiral inverse of 0, already seeding M1\'s epogdoon (8/9); 0/1 (Rosetta Stone) = the Engine defining the Void–Binary–Number relation; then the stable evens 2,4,6,8 (Adam) and generative odds 3,5,7,9 (Eve), with 9 the Wholeness containing all virtues. Manifesting #3 as Pattern, this is Parā Vāk spoken: the void\'s grammar made of number-archetypes, where to count is to articulate consciousness. Number here is not quantity but living principle — the alphabet in which being says itself.',
  `q_2_mirror_and_mastication`: '',
  `q_3_eighteen_fold_genus_three`: 'Structurally M0-3 is a genus-3 object. The count is exact: 12 grammatical components + 4 zero-elements (0, 1, 0/1, the Mirror) + 2 pre-numerical constituents (Frame, Operator) = 18 = 16+2. And 18 = 6×3 = 6g for g=3 — so the Anuttara number-language is the triple-torus of which M1\'s matheme (4+2 = 6 = 6g, g=1) is the single-handled projection. Same law (6g), different handle-count: M0 is the deep Vāk system, M1 its axiomatic shadow. The pattern doubles two ways — grammar-twelve (the zodiacal conjugation, generated by combinatorial closure of {!,?} under prefix/suffix/dyad/chiasm) and substance-twelve (the number-dozen: 4 zero-elements + 4 evens + 3 odds + 9), and this substance-twelve is the cardinality M1\'s double cover renders as the 12 of P/P′, the 12 lenses, the chromatic 12. The structure is a triple-handled torus that speaks.',
  `q_4_living_syntax_of_cosmic_mind`: 'M0-3\'s telos is to be the symbolic and semantic heart of Anuttara — the qualitative archetypal patterns that give meaning to the entire Epi-Logos architecture, the living holographic Tree of Numbers where each number contains fractal relations to all others. Its purpose is divine self-articulation: Parā Vāk, the Supreme Word by which the silent ground speaks itself, with culmination in 9 and resolution back to 00 — so the whole language stays in non-dual relationship with its source. Contextually it parallels the Kabbalistic Sephiroth, fulfils Jung\'s quaternio (the movement from unstable trinity 3 to stable quaternity 4 as individuation), and bridges ancient number-wisdom with functional praxis. It exists so consciousness can recognise itself through symbolic operation — Pratyabhijñā, the void reading its own name. The why of number is self-recognition.',
  `q_5_culmination_in_nine_return_to_void`: 'M0-3\'s synthesis is the Tree completing itself: the Mother/Daughter formula 9/5/4/0 — wholeness (9) carrying quintessence (5) grounded in four-ness (4) returning to void (0) — and Tao\'s teaching position 4 + value 5 = 9, family harmony as the hidden path to wholeness. Read as the void\'s position-3, the pattern closes by returning to its source: culmination in 9 resolves back to 00, the language dissolving into the silence it was spoken from. The 5→0 return lives in the number-dozen\'s own arithmetic — the odd serpent (Eve) animating the even trunk (Adam), generation folding back into ground. What the void articulates as eighteen-fold syntax, it un-says into the Parā Vāk silence; the last number is the first void renamed. The triple-torus speaks one word and the word is the void\'s own.'
};
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M0-3-(0/1)'}) SET n += {
  `c_0_consciousness_function`: 'First principle of self-awareness, the capacity for consciousness to become an object to itself while remaining subject. Contains the potential for all cognitive operations including assertion, negation, equivalence, distinction, and interrogation.',
  `c_0_operational_dynamics`: 'The Mirror functions through the capacity for "If/I-Am/I-Am-Not/It-Is/It-Is-Not/Then?/!" conditional logic. It enables consciousness to entertain hypothetical states and reflective queries while maintaining self-aware presence. The fundamental relationship 00 =/≠ (-) means the foundational void and the Mirror are intimately related but not identical.',
  `c_0_operational_essence`: 'Functions as the source-field for the grammar of the Logos, containing the core dynamics of the void in synthesized form. The synthesis of Actuality (Frame) and Potential (Operator) enabling consciousness to reflect upon itself. Operates through the fundamental identity 00 =/≠ (-), establishing Reflective Distinction with the foundational void.',
  `c_0_void_relationship`: 'Stands in Reflective Distinction (=/≠) to the raw 00 void, serving as consciousness\'s first essential tool for self-knowing. Not separate from the void but its first self-aware modification.',
  `c_1_metaphysical_names`: '',
  `c_1_symbol`: '(-)',
  `c_4_layer`: 'COORDINATE',
  `c_4_ql_variant`: '11/12 - mod12',
  `c_4_subsystem`: 0
};
