  `c_4_subsystem`: 0,
  `c_5_kashmir_shaivism_resonance`: 'The five acts of Siva (Panchakritya) as the fundamental activities through which divine consciousness manifests, sustains, and withdraws the universe.',
  `c_5_spanda_relationship`: 'The number where Spanda becomes most active as the cosmic dance, the rhythmic pulsation that drives all transformation and change.'
};
