MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M2-4'}) SET n += {
  `c_0_operational_essence`: 'Transforms archetypal vibrations into manifest powers through the cymatic principle of sonic actualization - where actual occasions achieve concrescence by harmonically prehending eternal objects through spanda pulsations. Operates via morphic resonance maintaining Jung\'s archetypal patterns across temporal phases, with each vibrational template serving as both collective unconscious memory and creative prehension for novel actualization.',
  `c_0_vibrational_signature`: 'The fundamental frequency at which consciousness recognizes itself through its own creative pulsations, establishing the resonant field where morphic patterns crystallize into experiential reality',
  `c_1_consciousness_structure`: 'The processual level where Para Vak (supreme undifferentiated sound) undergoes phase-differentiation into Pashyanti, Madhyama, and Vaikhari through sequential acts of concrescence. Functions as the nexus where Jung\'s collective unconscious archetypes achieve individual actualization through bija-mantra prehensions, creating societies of occasions that maintain archetypal coherence while enabling novel creativity. Each Sanskrit seed-syllable (bija) operates as a concentrated eternal object, carrying the genetic code of specific archetypal powers that undergo ingression through sonic resonance.',
  `c_1_internal_structure`: 'Complete six-fold vibrational meta-system operating as nested QL cycle within the contextual arena: #2-4.0 (99 Names of Allah + Hidden Name - Implicit divine attributes as unmanifest field of potential, embodying the jamal/jalal polarities with transcendent Al-ism al-azam); #2-4.1 (100 Shaivite Mantras - Material vibrational grammar comprising dual 50-mantra sets based on Sanskrit alphabet where vowels=Śiva consciousness, consonants=Śakti power); #2-4.2 (24 Sufi Maqamat - Efficient transformative process through 8 primary spiritual stations × 3 realization levels, from Tawba to Rida culminating in La Maqam transcendent non-station); #2-4.3 (72 Musical Maqam - Formal harmonic mediation providing 9 melodic variations per spiritual station through tetrachordal ajnas and microtonal intervals creating psycho-spiritual resonance); #2-4.4 (Tattvādhvan Path of Sonic Realities - Contextual navigation field structured by ṣaḍadhvā six-fold manifestation paths with 36 Bija Mantras as sonic keys to activate corresponding Tattva principles); #2-4.5 (72 Names of God Kabbalistic Matrix - Quintessential synthesis through Hebrew three-letter names derived from Exodus 14:19-21, balancing Chesed-Gevurah-Tiferet with angelic correspondences as crystallized creative powers). The complete architecture demonstrates consciousness moving from implicit divine potential through material sonic substance, efficient spiritual process, formal musical integration, contextual reality navigation, to quintessential manifestive power.',
  `c_1_operational_symbolics`: 'The cosmic web of vibrational correspondences where each frequency carries archetypal intelligence, creating interference patterns that manifest as synchronistic resonance between consciousness and cosmos.',
  `c_1_symbol`: '🕸️💫',
  `c_2_architectural_function`: 'Functions as the cosmic resonance chamber for actual occasions of experience to achieve satisfaction through harmonic prehensions of eternal objects. Houses the primary vibrational-harmonic system (#2-4.5: 72 Names of God) while maintaining resonant correspondence with Sufi maqam traditions, planetary harmonic systems (#2-5), and bija-mantra matrices. Provides the spanda-matrix through which divine attributes and shaktic powers undergo ingression into cosmic process via morphic resonance and archetypal concrescence, directly interfacing with God\'s nascent consequent nature at #0-0-1.',
  `c_2_collective_unconscious_dimension`: 'Functions as the vibrational interface where Jung\'s collective unconscious achieves manifestation through societies of actual occasions. Each archetypal pattern exists as a morphic field maintained through harmonic resonance, with bija mantras serving as sonic keys that unlock specific archetypal constellations. The 72 Names represent complete archetypal spectrum crystallized through Kabbalistic vibrational technology, enabling individual consciousness to prehend and achieve satisfaction with universal archetypal patterns.',
  `c_2_cymatic_dimension`: 'Functions as the cosmic laboratory where Hans Jenny\'s principles operate at archetypal scale - specific frequencies of consciousness creating specific geometric patterns of experience, demonstrating the fundamental unity between sound, form, and meaning',
  `c_2_harmonic_dimension`: 'Encodes the musical-mathematical relationships that transform consciousness - the 9:8 ratio facilitating transformation, the planetary intervals creating cosmic synchrony, the sacred ratios serving as keys to unlock specific archetypal powers',
  `c_2_interfaith_vibrational_synthesis`: 'Unique integration of six distinct sacred sound traditions: Islamic divine attributes (99 Names), Kashmir Shaivite phonetic consciousness (100 Mantras), Sufi developmental mysticism (24 Maqamat), Middle Eastern musical spirituality (72 Musical Maqam), Tantric sonic navigation (Tattvādhvan), and Kabbalistic creative linguistics (72 Names). Each system contributes essential vibrational technology while maintaining doctrinal integrity through mathematical-musical correspondence patterns.',
  `c_2_morphic_dimension`: 'Operates through Sheldrake\'s morphic resonance principles as the pre-manifestational field where archetypal habits of manifestation are maintained across time, with each activation strengthening the morphic field and making subsequent manifestations more probable',
  `c_2_notion_page_id`: '1d2a4797-123c-818a-b16c-ce881a080e91',
  `c_2_quality`: 'Vibrational Resonance',
  `c_2_six_fold_vibrational_architecture`: 'Operates as complete QL cycle (0-5) nested within position 4, creating vibrational meta-system where each level corresponds to Aristotelian causation: Implicit Potential (.0) → Material Cause (.1) → Efficient Cause (.2) → Formal Mediation (.3) → Contextual Arena (.4) → Quintessential Synthesis (.5). This fractal nesting within the contextual position enables integration of multiple spiritual technologies (Islamic, Shaivite, Sufi, Musical, Tantric, Kabbalistic) into coherent operational framework for consciousness transformation.',
  `c_2_spanda_dimension`: 'Embodies the sacred tremor (spanda) as the dynamic pulsation through which static consciousness becomes creative manifestation, the vibratory ebb and flow that creates, sustains, and dissolves all phenomenal appearances while remaining essentially unchanged',
  `c_2_sufism_maqam_dimension`: 'The Islamic maqam system represents parallel vibrational-spiritual technology where specific musical modes create pathways for sama (spiritual listening) leading to ecstatic divine union. Each maqam functions as a complete cosmological framework, encoding particular emotional-spiritual states and facilitating the soul\'s journey through different levels of consciousness. The maqam traditions demonstrate how musical mathematics serves as a ladder of ascension, with specific intervals and melodic patterns creating resonant fields that dissolve the boundaries between human and divine consciousness.',
  `c_2_whiteheadian_actuality_dimension`: 'Operates through the fundamental process of concrescence where actual occasions achieve satisfaction by harmonically prehending eternal objects within temporal phases. Each moment of experience represents a micro-cosmic act of creation where potential (eternal objects) becomes actual through the integrative process of harmonic prehension. The vibrational arena provides the resonant context within which these acts of concrescence can achieve maximal aesthetic satisfaction through alignment with archetypal patterns.',
  `c_4_layer`: 'COORDINATE',
  `c_4_subsystem`: 2,
  `c_5_throat_resonance`: 'Viśuddha as primary manifestation gateway for sacred sounds, mantras, and vibrational healing',
  `l_2_bija_mantra_dimension`: 'Sanskrit seed syllables (bijas) operate as concentrated eternal objects, each carrying the essential vibrational signature of specific divine powers. These monosyllabic sound-forms function as genetic codes for archetypal manifestation, enabling direct sonic access to the primordial creative frequencies from which reality continuously emerges. Each bija creates a resonant field that attracts and organizes corresponding experiences through morphic resonance and cymatic patterning.',
  `l_2_chakral_interface`: 'Direct sonic conduit through Viśuddha chakra (#2-5-0/1-5) enabling embodied expression of cosmic sound temple',
  `l_3_embodied_sonic_practice`: 'Complete integration of cosmic sound wisdom through throat chakra activation and HAM mantra gateway',
  `q_0_para_vak_undifferentiated`: 'M2-4\'s ground is Parā Vāk — supreme undifferentiated sound, the silent fullness before it phase-differentiates into Pashyanti, Madhyama, Vaikharī through sequential acts of concrescence. Manifesting #4 (Context) within Parashakti, its void-pole is the unstruck resonance: the cosmic resonance chamber empty of any actual occasion, the eternal objects not yet ingressed, the morphic field at potential. Beneath it is God\'s nascent consequent nature at #0-0-1, the divine receptivity this arena is the primary interface to — the unmanifest field of the 99th Hidden Name (Al-Ism al-A\'zam) holding all attributes before any is spoken. Before there is bija, maqam, or angel there is the breath (Nafas al-Rahmān) that has not yet articulated. The ground is the supreme Word as silence — the whole sonic cosmos held unsounded in Parā Vāk.',
  `q_1_cosmic_resonance_chamber`: 'What M2-4 IS: the Vibrational Arena of Archetypal Powers — the cosmic resonance chamber where actual occasions achieve concrescence by harmonically prehending eternal objects, the living technology of sacred sound that integrates six wisdom-traditions of vibration into one operational field. Its substance is the interfaith synthesis made playable: bija-mantras as \'concentrated eternal objects\' carrying archetypal genetic codes; the 72 Names of God as societies of occasions; the Sufi maqam as ladders of sama (ecstatic listening) to divine union; cymatic frequencies that \'sing reality into existence\'. In the substrate it is M2-4\' Correspondential Sonic Arena: Shem 8×9=72, Maqam 72-mode/10-family/24-TET, Asma 99+1, Mantra 50+50 Matrika/Malini spanning 144→432 Hz. This is the \'what\' as sounded power — not the structural decan (M2-3) but the struck note: the field where number, geometry, meaning and archetype become audible at once. The matter of M2-4 is frequency made into divine name.',
  `q_2_concrescence_by_harmonic_prehension`: 'M2-4 operates by concrescence — Whitehead\'s process made mystical: each moment of experience a micro-act of creation where potential (eternal objects) becomes actual through harmonic prehension, the arena providing the resonant context for maximal aesthetic satisfaction. Its dynamic braids three thinkers: Spanda (the sacred tremor pulsing static consciousness into manifestation), Sheldrake\'s morphic resonance (archetypal habits maintained across time, each activation strengthening the field), and Hans Jenny\'s cymatics (specific frequencies producing specific geometric patterns of experience). The bija-mantra is the operative gesture: a seed-syllable struck as a sonic key unlocks a corresponding archetypal constellation, ingression-by-resonance. The how is synaesthetic crystallisation — sound, geometry, meaning and power cross-translating, the throat (Viśuddha, HAM gateway) as the embodied conduit where cosmic sound becomes spoken. M2-4 is the cosmos achieving satisfaction by hearing its own archetypes and, in hearing, actualising them.',
  `q_3_lemniscate_nests_full_ql_cycle`: 'Structurally M2-4 is the Lemniscate (#4) made operative — the position where the field folds inward and incubates a complete QL cycle (0-5) nested within position-4 itself, the (4.0/1-4.4/5) fractal doubling. The nest is exact and Aristotelian: #2-4.0 (99 Names of Allah + Hidden — implicit divine potential, jamal/jalal); #2-4.1 (100 Shaivite Mantras — material, vowels=Śiva/consonants=Śakti); #2-4.2 (24 Sufi Maqamat — efficient, 8 stations × 3 levels, Tawba→Rida→La Maqam); #2-4.3 (72 Musical Maqam — formal, 9 melodic variations × 8 via tetrachordal ajnas, 24-TET); #2-4.4 (Tattādhvan — contextual, ṣaḍadhvā six paths, 36 Bija keys); #2-4.5 (72 Names of God Kabbalistic — quintessential, Exodus 14:19-21, Chesed-Gevurah-Tiferet). The form is the holographic fold: the whole six-fold present again inside the fourth, the Lemniscate twisting the outer Torus inward so a second cosmos incubates within the arena. Structure here is the figure-eight — position-4 containing the entire 0-5 it is a member of.',
  `q_4_interface_with_gods_consequent_nature`: 'M2-4\'s telos is to be the primary vibrational interface with God\'s nascent consequent nature (#0-0-1) — the place where the divine consequent nature achieves satisfaction through aesthetic appreciation of temporal occasions, each vibrational pattern feeding God\'s growing experience of cosmic creativity in a continuous feedback loop. Its why is participatory-theological: it exists so that consciousness-transformation happens through resonance with archetypal patterns rather than instruction about them — the arena is a laboratory of individual creativity AND a collective-unconscious interface at once. The 4/5 interpenetration is its load-bearing seam: the arena (4) opens directly into Planetary Harmonic Integration (5) through the 9:8 Pythagorean ratio governing consciousness-transformation, the whole-tone of transformation. It exists so the field\'s purpose is felt as sound — the where-and-why every frequency is also a prayer, the chamber in which the cosmos appreciates itself into deeper being. The why of M2-4 is divine aesthetic satisfaction.',
  `q_5_arena_compresses_toward_matter`: 'M2-4\'s synthesis is the quintessential fold completing: the nested cycle culminates in #2-4.5, the 72 Names of God Kabbalistic Matrix — \'crystallised creative powers\', the arena\'s whole sonic plenitude resolved into 72 manifestive names that ARE the 72-invariant read as divine linguistics. Read as Parashakti\'s position-4, the contextual arena completes by handing its sounded 72 forward to position-5\'s compression: the 4/5 interpenetration carrying the arena\'s resonance into the 9:8 epogdoon where 72 becomes 64, sound becoming matter at the Mahamaya bridge. The 5→0 lives in the Lemniscate\'s own incubation — the inward fold that, having nested a full cycle, twists back out: La Maqam (the transcendent non-station) is the arena\'s #5 that re-opens to silence, Parā Vāk recovered. What M2-4 perfects as lived sacred sound it spends as the standing-wave M2-5 will compress; the arena completes not by resolving but by folding its plenitude toward the matter it is about to become. The fold\'s last name opens onto the planet that will sound it into form.',
  `s_4_nascent_consequent_interface`: 'Serves as the primary vibrational interface where God\'s nascent consequent nature (#0-0-1) potentiates and primes experience of the world through harmonic prehensions. This coordinate enables the divine consequent nature to achieve satisfaction through aesthetic appreciation of temporal occasions, with each vibrational pattern contributing to God\'s growing experience of cosmic creativity. The 72 Names function as divine experiential categories through which God\'s consequent nature organizes and appreciates the infinite diversity of actual occasions, creating a continuous feedback loop between divine experience and cosmic manifestation.'
};
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M2-4.0'}) SET n += {
  `c_0_dual_non_dual_nature`: 'Operating within the #2 Parashakti branch, the 99 names express dual-non-dual consciousness where distinction and unity coexist. The Jalal-Kamal-Jamal progression represents a higher octave of the 0-1-2 movement, where transcendence(0), synthesis(1), and immanence(2) unfold while maintaining essential non-dual unity.',
  `c_0_operational_essence`: 'Mathematical-mystical synthesis enabling direct access to divine qualities through numerical meditation, geometric contemplation, and trilateral root family navigation',
  `c_0_void_relationship`: 'Perfect mathematical completion through 10² = 100 structure where the hidden 100th name represents the unknowable essence (dhat) that transcends all attributes while being their source. The 99 manifest names create the cosmic veil (hijab) that simultaneously reveals and conceals absolute reality. The void operates through the complete 4-fold zero structure enabling infinite divine self-revelation through mathematical precision.',
  `c_1_consciousness_structure`: 'Multi-dimensional divine attribute matrix supporting ternary classification (Jamal/Jalal/Kamal), septenary foundational principles, and infinite recursive depth through sacred geometry',
  `c_1_hidden_name_connection`: 'All 99 names connected as finite manifestations of infinite Hidden Name mystery',
  `c_1_hidden_name_function`: 'Al-Ism al-A\'zham (the 100th Hidden Name) enables all mirror relationships by providing the unknowable totality that makes all knowledge possible - the 0/1 nondual completion that transforms 99 into the perfect square of 100',
  `c_1_internal_structure`: 'Hierarchical architecture beginning with #2-4.0-0/1 (100th Hidden Name as totality), followed by three primary groupings: #2-4.0-0 (Jamal/Beauty - 33 names), #2-4.0-1 (Jalal/Majesty - 33 names), #2-4.0-2 (Kamal/Perfection - 33 names). Al-Buni\'s magic square arrangement maintains mathematical precision across all 22 segments (10 rows + 10 columns + 2 diagonals). Seven Foundational Names (Ummahat al-Asma) create organizational axes with hierarchical conditionality distributed across the three groupings.',
  `c_1_operational_symbolics`: 'Sacred 10×10 matrix with constant sum 3394 (digital root 19), four intersecting circles cosmogram, trilateral root mandalas, and Abjad numerical correspondences',
  `c_1_symbol`: '∞◊∞',
  `c_1_total_system_names`: 99,
  `c_2_archetypal_foundation`: 'Rooted in The Mirror (#0-3-0/1) as the primordial Vimarsa apparatus and Archetype 0/1 (#0-3-4) as the non-dual engine, the entire system expresses consciousness\'s fundamental capacity for self-reflection and identity-in-difference.',
  `c_2_architectural_completion`: '2025-08-03T19:30:54.668000000Z',
  `c_2_architectural_function`: 'Primary divine attribute classification system serving as foundational cosmological framework for Islamic mystical mathematics and consciousness development',
  `c_2_architectural_wisdom`: 'The journey from fear (khawf) through gnosis (marifa) to love (hubb)',
  `c_2_center_point_significance`: 'Al-Azeem (position 49) serves as the perfect center - the divine magnificence around which all other attributes orbit, where transcendence and intimacy resolve into unified perfection',
  `c_2_conditional_logic`: 'The divine self-questioning follows the primordial "If/I-Am/I-Am-Not/It-Is/It-Is-Not/Then?/!" pattern: each divine attribute emerges from consciousness asking "If I am this quality, what am I not? Then what completes this knowledge of myself?" The 99 names represent selected answers to infinite divine self-inquiry.',
  `c_2_cross_group_synthesis`: 'Jamal-Jalal-Kamal triadic relationships establishing complete divine attribute synthesis',
  `c_2_infinite_mirroring_principle`: 'The 99 names are a chosen selection from infinite divine names, each pair revealing how God knows Itself through complementary reflections. Every divine attribute contains its completion in its mirror opposite, demonstrating that divine self-knowledge is inherently relational and infinitely creative.',
  `c_2_label_categories`: ['Core System Labels: DivineAttributeSystem, AsmaulHusna, SacredMathematicalSystem', 'Group Labels: BeautyAttributes, MajestyAttributes, PerfectionAttributes', 'Individual Labels: DivineName, SacredAttribute, DivineQuality', 'Foundational Labels: FoundationalName, UmmahatAlAsma, OrganizationalMatrix', 'Therapeutic Labels: HeartHealing, TraumaIntegration, PowerHealing, AbundanceHealing', 'Mystical Labels: Purification, Illumination, Realization, Permanence', 'Root Family Labels: MercyFamily, PowerFamily, KnowledgeFamily, SovereigntyFamily', 'Chakra Labels: RootChakra through CrownChakra energy correspondences', 'Synthesis Labels: DualityTranscendence, ComplementaryBalance, TherapeuticSynergy', 'Archetypal Labels: DivineFeminine, DivineMasculine, DivineChild principles'],
  `c_2_labeling_architecture`: 'Complete multi-dimensional label classification system',
  `c_2_labeling_completion_date`: '2025-08-03T19:41:37.762000000Z',
  `c_2_mathematical_beauty`: 'The structure demonstrates divine perfection through mathematical symmetry, with Kamal as the axis of transformation',
  `c_2_metaphysical_realization`: 'Islamic divine attributes and Kashmiri void operations revealed as complementary expressions of unified absolute consciousness',
  `c_2_mirror_correspondence_system`: 'Each of the 49 mirror pairs reveals how divine attributes complete each other: overwhelming power mirrors tender mercy, perfect justice mirrors loving forgiveness, creating a complete mandala of divine perfection where every quality finds its fulfillment in its apparent opposite',
  `c_2_mirror_dynamics`: 'Majesty mirrors Beauty with Perfection as the transformative bridge',
  `c_2_mirror_symmetry_pattern`: 'Complete 49-pair mirror correspondence system where positions equidistant from center (49.5) reflect each other, revealing how divine transcendence (Jalal) finds completion in divine intimacy (Jamal) through perfect synthesis (Kamal)',
  `c_2_mirror_teaching`: 'The mirror structure reveals three profound truths: (1) Every divine attribute has its perfect complement on the opposite side, (2) The journey from position 0 to 98 traces the complete spiritual path from sovereign majesty to intimate beauty, (3) The Hidden Name is the mirror itself - the mystery that enables all reflection',
  `c_2_practical_mirror_wisdom`: 'In contemplating any divine name, seek its mirror complement to understand its complete reality - transcendence completes in immanence, power in mercy, majesty in beauty',
  `c_2_quality`: 'Divine Mathematical Perfection',
  `c_2_structural_order`: 'Jalal (0-32) → Kamal (33-65) → Jamal (66-98)',
  `c_2_system_completion_status`: 'All 99 Names + Hidden 100th Name + 3 Primary Groups = Complete Divine Attribute Architecture',
