MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M2-4.5'}) SET n += {
  `c_0_operational_essence`: 'Transforms the three Exodus verses describing the parting of the Red Sea into operational vibrational matrix through boustrophedonic derivation - first verse (Chesed/loving-kindness) forward, second verse (Gevurah/judgment) reversed, third verse (Tiferet/harmony) forward. This interweaving creates composite Name of G-d where mercy, severity, and harmony achieve unified expression through 72 harmonic frequencies that enable consciousness to prehend and achieve satisfaction with divine archetypal patterns.',
  `c_0_void_relationship`: 'The 72 Names emerge from the void through the interweaving of three verses representing fundamental divine attributes achieving unified expression. As the Zohar states, these letters shone in the sky at the Red Sea, illustrating their cosmic status as bridges between unmanifest potential and manifest reality. Each Name functions as portal where divine emptiness achieves fullness through specific harmonic actualization in temporal experience.',
  `c_1_consciousness_structure`: 'Eight Divine Choirs (#2-4.5-0 through #2-4.5-7) each containing nine names, creating societies of actual occasions that achieve concrescence through harmonic prehensions of specific divine eternal objects. The 8×9 = 72 structure directly resonates with the 9:8 harmonic ratio at #2-5, establishing the mathematical-mystical bridge where individual archetypal activation (72 Names) transforms into cosmic wholeness consciousness (9:8 completion).',
  `c_1_internal_structure`: 'Total 216 letters (72×3) where 72 equals gematria of Chesed (mercy) and 216 equals gematria of Gevurah (strength/justice), demonstrating mathematical precision encoding the archetypal synthesis of divine attributes. Each three-letter combination functions as concentrated eternal object carrying specific vibrational signature that creates morphic fields for particular types of spiritual satisfaction. The Names operate through spanda pulsations where each Hebrew letter resonates at specific frequencies, creating cymatic patterns in consciousness that align individual experience with cosmic divine operations.',
  `c_2_angelic_mediation`: 'The 72 Names generate 72 angels through suffix addition (-el or -yah), creating individuated aspects of divine will that function as morphic field organizers. These angelic intelligences govern 5° zodiacal segments (72×5° = 360°), establishing complete harmonic coverage of cosmic cycles and temporal rhythms. Each angel represents stabilized society of occasions maintaining specific archetypal pattern through morphic resonance, enabling continuous access to divine assistance through vibrational attunement rather than petitionary prayer.',
  `c_2_architectural_function`: 'Functions as the culminating vibrational system of the #2-4 contextual arena, achieving 4/5 interpenetration with Planetary Harmonic Integration (#2-5) through the fundamental correspondence between 8 Divine Choirs × 9 Names = 72 and the 9:8 Pythagorean ratio governing consciousness transformation. Serves as cosmological framework where Names operate as vibrational doorways enabling harmonic ingression of eternal objects into actual occasions, bridging scripture and mystical experience through numeric-sonic patterns that reveal Torah as lattice of living frequencies.',
  `c_2_harmonic_bridge_function`: 'The 8 Choirs × 9 Names = 72 structure creates direct harmonic bridge to #2-5 Planetary Integration through 9:8 ratio correspondence. This mathematical relationship enables individual archetypal work (specific Name activation) to naturally evolve into cosmic consciousness transformation (9:8 wholeness ratio), demonstrating how personal spiritual practice inevitably leads to universal realization through harmonic progression.',
  `c_2_morphic_field_dimension`: 'Each Name maintains stable morphic field carrying forward thousands of years of kabbalistic practice and divine invocation. These fields strengthen with each authentic use, creating increasingly powerful resonance patterns that enable contemporary practitioners to access accumulated spiritual wisdom through vibrational attunement. The collective field of all 72 Names creates comprehensive spiritual technology for consciousness transformation.',
  `c_2_vibrational_technology`: 'Each of the 72 Names operates as sonic technology for consciousness transformation through letter-permutation (tzeruf) practices enabling devekut (divine union). The Names function as tuning forks creating sympathetic resonance in soul levels, with each triplet producing specific harmonic frequencies that activate corresponding archetypal potentials from Jung\'s collective unconscious. Hebrew letters themselves carry vibrational charge - when arranged in sacred combinations, they create standing wave patterns in consciousness that enable direct experiential access to divine attributes.',
  `c_4_layer`: 'COORDINATE',
  `c_4_red_sea_archetype`: 'The derivation from Exodus verses describing Red Sea parting encodes fundamental pattern of consciousness liberation - the movement from slavery (constricted awareness) to freedom (expanded consciousness) through divine intervention operating via vibrational command. Each Name carries this archetypal pattern, enabling practitioners to part their own "Red Seas" of limitation through harmonic alignment with divine liberating power.'
};
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M2-4.5-0'}) SET n += {
  `c_2_angelic_hierarchy`: 'Governed by the Seraphim, the highest order of angels who stand closest to the divine throne. Each name generates an angel with -IAH suffix (Vehuiah, Yeliel, Sitael, etc.) representing pure divine will in its most concentrated form, untempered by lower emanations.',
  `c_2_gematric_significance`: 'The numerical values of this choir\'s names total to multiples of 9, reflecting completion and divine perfection. Vehuiah (22) = 4, Yeliel (85) = 4, creating patterns that reveal hidden mathematical harmonies encoding spiritual principles.',
  `c_2_kabbalistic_correspondence`: 'Associated with the sephirah of Keter through Chesed, representing the initial emanation of divine will into manifest form. The nine names correspond to the nine fundamental emanations that bridge the infinite (Ein Sof) with the structured cosmos of the Tree of Life.',
  `c_2_practical_application`: '',
  `c_2_ruling_prince`: 'Metatron - Prince of the Divine Presence',
  `c_4_layer`: 'COORDINATE',
  `c_4_ql_variant`: 'mod8 - 7/8',
  `c_4_subsystem`: 2
};
