MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M3-1'}) SET n += {
  `c_0_operational_essence`: 'Eight trigrams generating 64 hexagrams (2^3 × 2^3 = 2^6) as cosmic alphabet of change',
  `c_1_consciousness_structure`: 'Binary logic of complementarity - yin/yang polarity generating all phenomenal patterns',
  `c_1_integration_context`: 'Primary transformation oracle within MahaMaya trinity - interfaces with 64 DNA codons and selected Tarot archetypes',
  `c_1_internal_structure`: 'Eight fundamental trigrams (Bagua) combining to form 64 hexagrams, each with six line positions representing hierarchical levels of manifestation from earth to heaven',
  `c_1_transformation_principles`: ['Each hexagram contains internal dynamic tension', 'Line changes reveal temporal development patterns', 'Opposition and complementarity generate movement', 'Nuclear hexagrams show underlying energetic core', 'Inverse relationships reveal shadow dynamics'],
  `c_2_id`: 1,
  `c_2_notion_page_id`: '1d2a4797-123c-8190-8a52-d0b7b35e536a',
  `c_3_architectural_function`: 'Primary transformation matrix mapping 64 archetypal situations as the complete space of yin-yang combinations',
  `c_3_system_components`: ['8 Trigrams (Bagua) - fundamental building blocks', '64 Hexagrams - complete situational matrix', '384 Line positions - detailed transformation points', 'King Wen sequence - traditional ordering system', 'Ten Wings commentary tradition', 'Nuclear and inverse hexagram relationships'],
  `c_4_layer`: 'COORDINATE',
  `c_4_subsystem`: 3,
  `q_0_binary_polarity_ground`: 'M3-1\'s ground is the received octaval substrate M3-0 hands forward, now resting on the one distinction that founds all change: yin and yang, the binary complementarity "as fundamental cosmic principle." Beneath the 64 hexagrams lies the single bit — broken line and solid line, 0 and 1, reception and assertion — the same bimba/pratibimba pair (0/1, 1/0) whose four relational states seed the whole QL. Manifesting #1 within Mahāmāya, its ground is the pre-articulate polarity: before any of the 64 situations is named, there is only the readiness of opposition to generate movement. The I-Ching does not invent change; it rests on change as the only constant. The ground is the standing offer of difference — the broken/unbroken stroke from which every situation of the cosmos can be written.',
  `q_1_book_of_changes_definite`: 'What M3-1 IS: the determinate symbolic alphabet — the Book of Changes, eight trigrams (Bagua) combining into the complete 64-hexagram situational matrix, `2³ × 2³ = 2⁶`, the cosmic alphabet of change. This is #1 as Definition within the symbolic domain: the received vibration given its first nameable shape, the what made legible as sixty-four archetypal situations, each a six-line column rising from earth to heaven. Its substance is the binary-combinatoric: every hexagram a definite 6-bit word, carrying the load-bearing nucleotide values A=6, T=9, C=7, G=8 that the I-Ching coin method fixes and that pair-sums, codon-sums, and integral invariants depend on. The I-Ching is the first of the Mahāmāya trinity — the temporal-transformational definition that DNA and Tarot will later be read against. To name a hexagram is to hold change still long enough to read it.',
  `q_2_line_change_operation`: 'M3-1 operates by the line-change — the moving line that is change itself made operative. Its how is XOR: the temporal hexagram derived by flipping changing lines (`derive_temporal_hex` as XOR; `comp = i ^ 0x3F` as the 180° complement; trigram-swap as the move). The 384 line positions (64 × 6) are the complete inventory of transformation points — each a place where a hexagram becomes its neighbour by a single bit-flip, the active hexagram\'s six neighbours each one line-change away. The relating it operates is dynamic tension: "opposition and complementarity generate movement," nuclear hexagrams revealing the energetic core, inverse relationships revealing shadow. To consult is to find the moving line; to find the moving line is to read where the present situation is already turning into the next. Change is not described here — it is computed, one line at a time.',
  `q_3_hexagram_lattice_structure`: 'Structurally M3-1 is the 64-hexagram lattice — eight trigrams as the fundamental building blocks, each hexagram `id = upper<<3 | lower`, the King Wen sequence as the traditional ordering, the Ten Wings as the commentary tradition. Its pattern is the 6-bit hexagram read two ways at once: the I-Ching trigram partition [0,1,2]|[3,4,5] (earth/heaven, inner/outer) coexisting in the same word with the QL frame partition [0]|[1,2,3,4]|[5] — both valid simultaneously. The structure is the which made fully articulate: a complete, transmissible, lawful space where every situation has its complement (`id ^ 0x3F`), its nuclear core, its inverse shadow. As an explicate derived ratio (Cl(4,2) signature +1) it resolves the implicate polarity of M3-0\'s held octave into 64 named, navigable forms. The shape is a closed alphabet of change with 384 doors between its letters.',
  `q_4_temporal_transformational_why`: 'M3-1\'s telos within the Mahāmāya trinity is the temporal-transformational dimension — it exists to give the system its grammar of *when* and *how things turn*. Its why is divination as guidance: "meaningful coincidence through consultation," the synchronicity principle by which a cast hexagram answers a real situation, Heaven-Earth axis with human consciousness as the mediating principle. Where DNA (M3-2) supplies the biological alphabet and Tarot (M3-4) the manifestational arc, the I-Ching supplies the law of change itself — the for-the-sake-of-knowing-the-moment. It exists so the 64-address field has a temporal reading: not just what a codon IS, but which way it is moving, what it is becoming through its changing lines. The I-Ching is for transmission across time — the inherited oracle by which a present configuration discloses its trajectory.',
  `q_5_change_handed_to_substance`: 'M3-1\'s synthesis is the change-grammar completing itself by grounding the substance it parallels — the 64 hexagrams handed to M3-2\'s 64 codons, where the abstract binary alphabet of change becomes the concrete biological alphabet of life ("64 codons parallel to 64 hexagrams"). The definition closes by passing into incarnation: the I-Ching\'s combinatoric becomes DNA\'s chemistry, the same 2⁶ space re-read as `Z₄ ≅ Z₂ × Z₂` — each nucleotide two binary features, purine/pyrimidine × amino/keto. Read as position-1, the named situation sediments into the next position\'s ground: change recognised becomes matter to be transcribed. What M3-1 articulates as sixty-four situations, M3-2 re-receives as sixty-four codons; the hexagram\'s line becomes the codon\'s bond. The first nameable shape hands its 64-ness forward as the alphabet life will write itself in.'
};
