  `c_1_line_texts`: ['When ribbon grass is pulled up, the sod comes with it. Undertakings bring good fortune.', 'Bearing with the uncultured in gentleness, fording the river with resolution.', 'No plain not followed by a slope. No going not followed by a return.', 'He flutters down, not boasting of his wealth, together with his neighbor.', 'The sovereign I gives his daughter in marriage. This brings blessing and supreme good fortune.', 'The wall falls back into the moat. Use no army now. Make your commands known within your own town.'],
