  `c_3_image`: 'Earth over Heaven',
  `c_3_image_dynamics`: 'Creative force uplifts receptive earth - Heaven\'s yang energy rises to meet Earth\'s descending yin in perfect cosmic intercourse, generating the golden age of mutual fulfillment. Creative impulse (Heaven) willingly supports and elevates receptive nature (Earth), while nurturing force descends to embrace and guide creative power. This sexual polarity creates the fertile union where all potentials find harmonious expression and manifestation.',
