  `c_1_english_name`: 'The Power of the Great',
  `c_1_keywords`: ['Great Strength', 'Power', 'Vigorous Advance', 'Momentum', 'Correctness needed', 'Restraint', 'Danger of Arrogance', 'Potential', 'Controlled Force', 'Determination'],
  `c_1_line_texts`: ['Power in the toes. Continuing brings misfortune. This is certainly true.', 'Perseverance brings good fortune.', 'The inferior man works through power. The superior man does not act thus.', 'Perseverance brings good fortune. Remorse disappears.', 'Loses the sheep-goat with ease. No remorse.', 'A goat butts against a hedge and cannot go backward or forward.'],
