  `c_1_line_texts`: ['Hold to him in truth and loyalty; this is without blame.', 'Hold to him inwardly. Perseverance brings good fortune.', 'You hold together with the wrong people.', 'Hold to him outwardly also. Perseverance brings good fortune.', 'Manifestation of holding together. The king uses beaters on three sides only and foregoes the game that runs off.', 'He finds no head for holding together. Misfortune.'],
