  `c_3_image_dynamics`: 'Spontaneous action aligns with cosmic will - Heaven\'s divine order harmonizes perfectly with Thunder\'s natural impulse, creating the state of innocent authenticity where personal will and cosmic purpose become one. Creative principle (Heaven) guides movement (Thunder), generating effortless action that flows from inner truth rather than calculated intention. Like lightning naturally following the path of least resistance, this dynamic establishes harmony between individual impulse and universal order.',
