  `c_3_social_role`: ['Father guiding Eldest Son', 'Acting naturally'],
  `c_3_social_role_dynamics`: 'Eldest Son (thunder/natural action) aligned with Father (heaven/cosmic order) - Son\'s action naturally following father\'s principle, creating innocent family harmony.',
