  `c_1_line_texts`: ['Fellowship with men at the gate. No blame.', 'Fellowship with men in the clan. Humiliation.', 'He hides weapons in the thicket; he climbs the high hill in front of it.', 'He climbs up on his wall; he cannot attack. Good fortune.', 'Men bound in fellowship first weep and lament, but afterward they laugh.', 'Fellowship with men in the meadow. No remorse.'],
