  `c_1_line_texts`: ['Not going out of the door and the courtyard is without blame.', 'Not going out of the gate and the courtyard brings misfortune.', 'He who knows no limitation will have cause to lament. No blame.', 'Contented limitation. Success.', 'Sweet limitation brings good fortune. Going brings esteem.', 'Galling limitation. Perseverance brings misfortune. Remorse disappears.'],
  `c_1_symbol`: '䷻',
  `c_3_direction`: 'North (Water) over West (Lake)',
  `c_3_directional_power`: 'North restraint containing West pleasure - Necessary discipline moderating joyful expression through appropriate limitation.',
  `c_3_image`: 'Water over Lake',
  `c_3_image_dynamics`: 'Necessary restraint contains overwhelming pleasure - Water\'s disciplined depth restrains Lake\'s expansive joy, creating the wise limitation that preserves happiness through conscious moderation and appropriate boundaries. Danger/depth (Water) limits joy (Lake), generating the mature wisdom where self-discipline serves long-term happiness rather than immediate gratification. Like deep channels guiding surface waters, this dynamic establishes the structure where authentic pleasure can be sustained through conscious limitation and respect for natural boundaries.',
