  `c_1_line_texts`: ['Going quickly when one\'s tasks are finished is without blame.', 'Perseverance furthers. To undertake something brings misfortune.', 'When three people journey together, their number decreases by one.', 'If a man decreases his faults, it makes the other hasten to come.', 'Someone does indeed increase him. Ten pairs of tortoises cannot oppose it.', 'If one is increased without depriving others, there is no blame.'],
