  `c_3_image`: 'Mountain over Lake',
  `c_3_image_dynamics`: 'Silent sacrifice serves joyful purpose - Mountain\'s dignified restraint rises above Lake\'s flowing generosity, creating the alchemy of conscious reduction where giving increases both giver and receiver. Stillness (Mountain) transcends pleasure (Lake), generating the paradox where apparent loss creates real gain through wise distribution and conscious simplification. Like a mountain feeding springs that nourish the valley below, this dynamic demonstrates how authentic sacrifice enhances rather than diminishes true wealth.',
