  `c_1_line_texts`: ['Contented joy. Good fortune.', 'Sincere joy. Good fortune. Remorse disappears.', 'Coming joy. Misfortune.', 'Pondered joy is not at peace. After ridding himself of mistakes a man has joy.', 'Sincerity toward disintegrating influences is dangerous.', 'Seductive joy.'],
