  `c_3_direction`: 'West',
  `c_3_directional_power`: 'West pleasure amplifying West pleasure - Joyful expression creating infinite feedback loops of mutual delight.',
  `c_3_image`: 'Lake over Lake',
  `c_3_image_dynamics`: 'Joy reflects itself in infinite celebration - Lake\'s flowing pleasure doubles upon itself, creating the perfect resonance of shared happiness where individual delight amplifies collective bliss. Pleasure upon pleasure generates the feedback loop of mutual appreciation where each joy enhances every other joy through conscious celebration and open-hearted sharing. Like two lakes connected by flowing streams, this dynamic creates the paradise of authentic community where individual fulfillment and collective harmony unite through the practice of generous appreciation and joyful exchange.',
