MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M3-2'}) SET n += {
  `c_2_id`: 2,
  `c_2_notion_page_id`: '1d2a4797-123c-81ff-966f-ee8fd01e8b46',
  `c_4_layer`: 'COORDINATE',
  `c_4_subsystem`: 3,
  `q_0_nucleotide_charge_ground`: 'M3-2\'s ground is the four-letter substrate beneath all combination — the nucleotides themselves, each a charged elemental primitive before any codon assembles them. Adenine the primary Yang (purine, double-ring, 2 hydrogen bonds, integrals pp 84 / nn −36) and Thymine the primary Yin (pyrimidine, single-ring, pp 96 / nn −24) stand as the Taoist poles — white-active-expanding against black-passive-contracting, Pingala against Ida, Fire against Water. Manifesting #2 within Mahāmāya, its ground is the 64-hexagram alphabet M3-1 handed down, now grounded in chemistry: the 2-bit encoding A=00, T=01, C=10, G=11 by which each base IS two binary features (`Z₄ ≅ Z₂ × Z₂`, purine/pyrimidine × amino/keto). Before there is a codon there are four letters with charge — the alphabet life rests its whole act of self-writing upon.',
  `q_1_sixty_four_codon_alphabet`: 'What M3-2 IS: the complete 64-fold genetic code — "the complete genetic architecture from individual nucleotides through base pairs to the full 64-codon system, the fundamental language through which life writes itself into existence." Its substance is the atomic unit at three scales: 4 nucleotides, 16 dinucleotide base-pairs, 64 codons — each codon a 6-bit word built `outer<<4 | middle<<2 | inner` from three 2-bit letters. This is #2 as Entity within the symbolic domain: not the law of change (M3-1) but the discrete biological things that change acts upon, the foundational layer containing every nucleotide, pair, and codon that encodes biological information. The same 2⁶ = 64 space the I-Ching read as situations, DNA reads as the actual molecules of inheritance. Each codon is an atom of meaning-bearing matter: Codon_AAA the "Pure Yang Trinity" coding Lysine, a perfect palindrome with definite inner charges. The alphabet is the matter; the matter is the alphabet.',
  `q_2_pair_composition_act`: '',
  `q_3_four_class_codon_typology`: 'Structurally M3-2 is the four-tier codon typology — the algorithmic classifier that sorts all 64 codons by their symmetry: 4 perfect palindromes (n1=n2=n3, the AAA/TTT/CCC/GGG cardinals), 12 imperfect palindromes (n1=n3≠n2), 24 non-palindromic non-dual (one repeated adjacent pair), and 24 fully dual (all neighbours differ). This yields the load-bearing partition 40 non-dual + 24 dual = 64, and the rotational law 40×7 + 24×8 = 472 distinct states (compile-asserted in `m3.h`). The pattern is symmetry-as-structure: a non-dual codon has an axis and collapses 8 raw rotations to 7; a dual codon preserves all 8. As an explicate derived ratio (Cl(4,2) signature +1) it is the which of matter — the lawful, transmissible classification that holds the genetic alphabet as a navigable, typed space. The four perfect palindromes stand as cardinal directions in genetic space; the structure is a mandala of unity and tension.',
  `q_4_language_life_writes_itself`: 'M3-2\'s telos is to be the language in which life writes itself — the for-the-sake-of-incarnation: a symbolic alphabet that is simultaneously the actual chemistry of inheritance, so that the abstract 64-space has a body. Its why is to supply the Mahāmāya trinity\'s material pole: where the I-Ching gives change and Tarot gives manifestation, DNA gives the substance both operate on — the codons that will be transcribed (M3-3), reflected as cards (M3-4), and arrayed on the wheel (M3-5). The quaternion-elemental signature fixes its purpose at the root: position 1 = real = A = Material cause = Earth = Sensation; i = U = Efficient = Water = Feeling; j = G = Formal = Air = Thinking; k = C = Context = Fire = Intuition. The genetic code exists so that the four causes have a molecular alphabet — so that meaning can be written into existence one codon at a time, and read back out as life.',
  `q_5_codon_handed_to_transcription`: 'M3-2\'s synthesis is the alphabet completing itself by passing into act — the static 64-codon archive handed to M3-3\'s Universal Transcription Engine, where the eternal DNA archive becomes active RNA messenger through the T→U gateway. The entity closes by becoming process: the codon that merely IS becomes the codon that is read, transcribed, translated into amino acid, folded into protein. Read as position-2, the live combinatorial act settles into the pattern that will carry it — the 64 letters becoming the sacred pathway Archive→Message→Form→Vessel. The 37 T-containing codons already carry their RNA-potential forward; the 4 perfect palindromes already anchor the wheel\'s cardinal directions. What M3-2 holds as the alphabet of life, M3-3 re-takes as the transcription of life: the noun of matter re-opened into the verb of meaning. The letters hand themselves on to be spoken.'
};
