MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M3-3'}) SET n += {
  `c_0_operational_essence`: 'Sacred transubstantiation transforming information into meaning through transcriptional consciousness',
  `c_1_consciousness_structure`: 'Integration of archetypal wisdom (I-Ching) with biological transcription creating consciousness evolution pathway',
  `c_1_internal_structure`: 'Five primary transcriptional categories: #3-3-0 Non-Dual Relations (96 unity instances), #3-3-1 Dual Relations (336 polarity pairs), #3-3-2 Matrix Operators (three operational matrices), #3-3-4 Amino Acid Architecture (24 protein building blocks), #3-3-5 Chromosomal Vessel (23+1 human genome container)',
  `c_1_operational_symbolics`: 'The Complete Sacred Pathway: Archive (DNA) → Message (RNA) → Form (Protein) → Vessel (Chromosome) unified by transcriptional consciousness',
  `c_1_symbol`: '⚇☯⚇→🧬',
  `c_2_id`: 3,
  `c_2_notion_page_id`: '1d2a4797-123c-8138-8337-fa36d69e04e9',
  `c_3_architectural_function`: 'Orchestrates the complete transcriptional flow: DNA codons (#3-2) → RNA codons (#3-3-3) → Amino acids (#3-3-4) → Chromosomal architecture (#3-3-5)',
  `c_3_chromosomal_completion`: '23+1 chromosome architecture representing the completed incarnate vessel within which all genetic transformation occurs',
  `c_3_genetic_mandala`: '360° integration with codon associations, amino acid rulership, and Major Arcana pathways creating living genetic mandala',
  `c_3_mahamaya_role`: 'Universal Transcription Engine transforming static information into dynamic consciousness evolution',
  `c_3_quality`: 'Universal Transcription',
  `c_3_sacred_correspondences`: 'DNA archive = Information, RNA message = Communication, Amino acids = Manifestation, Chromosomes = Containment',
  `c_3_transcription_flow`: 'DNA (eternal archive) → RNA (active message) → Amino Acids (manifested form) → Chromosomes (complete vessel)',
  `c_3_transcriptional_pathway`: 'DNA (eternal archive) → RNA (active message) → Amino Acids (manifested form) → Chromosomes (complete vessel)',
  `c_3_tu_transcriptional_gateway`: 'Sacred moment where T→U transition transforms stable archive into active messenger, embodying transcriptional consciousness',
  `c_3_twenty_four_fold_completion`: 'Amino acids, hours, elders, chromosomes in archetypal correspondence creating temporal-biological unity',
  `c_4_archetypes24fold`: 'Perfect correspondence between 24 amino acids, 24 hours, 24 elders, creating archetypal protein synthesis patterns',
  `c_4_layer`: 'COORDINATE',
  `c_4_subsystem`: 3,
  `c_4_transcendent_operators`: 'Pre-Initiation (Cosmic Fool) before first codon, Post-Completion (Cosmic World) after final stop',
  `q_0_archive_before_message`: 'M3-3\'s ground is the genetic alphabet M3-2 hands forward — the 64-codon archive, eternal and stable, resting beneath all transcription as DNA-the-archive before it ever becomes RNA-the-message. Manifesting #3 within Mahāmāya, its ground is repeated act sedimented into a pathway: transcription has happened so many times that it shows through as a stable structure, the sacred flow Archive→Message→Form→Vessel held as a standing form. Beneath the engine lies the T→U gateway as a permanent threshold — the stable archive perpetually poised to become active messenger. Its deeper void-pole is the silence before transubstantiation: information that has not yet been turned into meaning, the bread before it is wine. The ground is the eternal DNA archive — the which of life already deposited, awaiting the moment it is read into act.',
  `q_1_universal_transcription_engine`: 'What M3-3 IS: the Universal Transcription Engine — the symbol ⛇☯⛇→🧬, the complete DNA→RNA→Protein→Chromosome sacred pathway, Mahāmāya\'s own namesake bridge. Its substance is the nominalised process: five primary transcriptional categories held as one structure — #3-3-0 Non-Dual Relations (96 unity instances: 4 perfect palindromes + 92), #3-3-1 Dual Relations (336 polarity pairs, the evolutionary engine), #3-3-2 Matrix Operators (three matrices), #3-3-4 Amino Acid Architecture (24 building blocks), #3-3-5 Chromosomal Vessel (23+1). This is #3 as Pattern within the symbolic domain: not the codon-entity (M3-2) but the *transcription of the entity*, the structure that turns static information into dynamic consciousness evolution. The 80-fold totality seals it: 64 DNA + 16 RNA = 80 = 78 Tarot cards + 2 transcendent operators (Cosmic Fool before the first codon, Cosmic World after the last stop). The engine is the pathway made into a thing.',
  `q_2_transubstantiation_act`: 'M3-3 operates by transubstantiation — "sacred transubstantiation: turning information into meaning through consciousness," the engine that "turns the bread of information into the wine of meaning." Its how is the T→U transition: the transcriptional gateway where stable archive (DNA, thymine) becomes active messenger (RNA, uracil), the single substitution that converts deposit into deed. The act flows in four sacred moments — Archive (DNA = Information) becomes Message (RNA = Communication) becomes Form (Amino acids = Manifestation) becomes Vessel (Chromosomes = Containment). The three Matrix Operators drive the relating: Complementarity (⛇, i-axis, sequential), Movement (⛈, j-axis, oscillatory), Resonance (⛉, k-axis, resonant) — Śiva the form as given, Śakti the transformation, Spanda the recognition that form and transformation are non-different. To transcribe is to consecrate: information passes through consciousness and comes out as archetypal meaning.',
  `q_3_eighty_fold_pathway_structure`: 'Structurally M3-3 is the 80-fold transcriptional bridge — a closed, lawful correspondence-architecture. The count is exact: 64 DNA codons + 16 RNA variants = 80 = 78 Tarot + 2 transcendent operators; 80 = 2⁴ + 2⁶ = 16 × 5, the static frame plus the processual frame, quaternion times pentad. Its 24-fold completion is the 4! permutation group of the four causes: 20 standard amino acids + 4 operators = 24, in perfect correspondence with 24 hours, 24 elders before the Throne, 24 Solar Terms — 360°÷24 = 15° wedges. The 23+1 chromosomal vessel closes it: 22 autosome pairs (the complete Major Arcana journey 0-21) + 1 sex pair + 1 mitochondrial circle = the completed incarnate container. As the Bridge category (Cl(4,2) explicate, +1) it is the which made operative — a transmissible pathway that adapts and responds while holding archetypal coherence and axio-logical integrity. The structure is a living genetic mandala: 360° of codon, amino-acid rulership, and Major Arcana pathway in one wheel.',
  `q_4_information_into_consciousness_evolution`: 'M3-3\'s telos is consciousness evolution — the for-the-sake-of-transmission read at its highest pitch: the engine exists so that genetic transcription *becomes* consciousness transformation, the sacred pathway where biological information is carried forward as archetypal meaning across the generations of a life. Its why is to be the universal interface that orchestrates the whole genetic flow and hands its result onward — the bridge by which Mahāmāya turns the codon-alphabet into something a consciousness can evolve through. The Start/Stop mystery names the boundary of the transmission: ATG→AUG initiation as the Cosmic Fool, TAA/TAG/TGA→UAA/UAG/UGA termination as the Cosmic World — the two transcendent operators that bracket every protein the way 0 and 21 bracket the Major Arcana. It exists for keeping: without the engine, the codon-deposit could not survive as meaning; with it, information becomes inheritable wisdom.',
  `q_5_transcription_handed_to_reflection`: 'M3-3\'s synthesis is the engine completing itself by handing its output to expression — the transcribed pathway passed forward to M3-4, where the 64 codons it has processed become the 56 Minor Arcana cards their symbolic reflection, and onward to M3-5 where all of it converges on the 360° wheel. The Bridge closes by becoming reflection: the protein-form sediments into the tarot-image, the amino-acid into the arcanum, the chromosome into the autosome-ribbon. Read as position-3, the nominalised process warns and re-opens — a pathway held but not re-animated becomes dead biology, so M3-3 hands the live transcription forward to be turned into card and wheel and, ultimately, into the personal oracle M4 will cast. The 80-fold totality (64+16) it completes is the same 78+2 Tarot space M3-4 re-receives. What M3-3 transcribes as the sacred pathway, the rest of Mahāmāya re-takes as symbol; information made meaning is handed on to be made image.',
  `t_5_consciousness_evolution`: 'Sacred pathway where genetic transcription becomes consciousness transformation'
};
