  `c_2_notion_page_id`: '1d2a4797-123c-8143-9b8e-d33996cb25a4',
  `c_3_architectural_function`: 'Primary interface for manifesting Major Arcana archetypal forces through elemental quaternary operations',
  `c_3_quality`: 'Rotational Manifestation',
  `c_4_layer`: 'COORDINATE',
  `c_4_subsystem`: 3,
  `q_0_manifestation_engine_ground`: 'M3-4\'s ground is the transcribed pathway M3-3 hands forward — the 80-fold totality now resting as the manifestation engine\'s substrate, archetypal forces poised to descend into lived experience. Manifesting #4 within Mahāmāya, its ground is the sephirotic bridge: the Yetziratic formation waiting to become Assiatic materialisation, Kether held at the brink of Malkuth. Beneath the 56 cards lies the elemental quaternary as standing condition — Fire/Water/Air/Earth as the four operational modes from which any card draws its character, the same four nucleotide-letters now read as suits. Its void-pole is the pre-manifest archetype: the Major Arcana force before it has been stepped down through an element into a playable card. The ground is the threshold of incarnation — the archetypal landscape held ready to be walked, where the abstract pattern of M3-3 awaits its descent into the operational technology of transformation.',
  `q_1_fifty_six_fold_rotational_field`: 'What M3-4 IS: the Minor Arcana — the 56-Fold Rotational Dynamics of Phase State Operations, symbol 56→360, the complete manifestation engine of consciousness. Its substance is the 4×14 elemental matrix: four suits (Wands/Fire, Cups/Water, Swords/Air, Pentacles/Earth) each holding the full sephirotic journey Ace-to-King, suit index = nucleotide 2-bit value (Cups=A=0, Wands=T=1, Pentacles=C=2, Swords=G=3). This is #4 as Type/Context within the symbolic domain: not the transcription-process (M3-3) but the *manifested forms it produces*, the 64 codons compressed into 56 cards (48 single-codon + 8 dual-codon court pairings). Each card is not a static meaning but a transformational function — a phase-state operation. The 56 cards mapping the 360° of consciousness IS the load-bearing identity: a living phase-space calculator where archetypal force becomes lived experience through elemental rotation.',
  `q_2_phase_state_rotation_act`: 'M3-4 operates by rotation — "cards as transformational functions rather than static meanings," the 8-fold phase-relationships that turn each card through its modal positions. Its how is the codon-to-card turn: `M3_TAROT_CODON_MAP[suit][rank]` lights the active card from the current codon, and turning the card cycles it through its 7 or 8 rotational states (non-dual cards 7, dual-codon courts 8). The 56 cards × 8-fold rotational capacity generate 448 potential relationships — the full phase-space within which any card\'s dynamics play. The relating it operates is elemental dignity: Fire feeding Air, Water against Fire, the four suits in mutual modulation, court cards as relational modes (Page/material, Knight/efficient, Queen/formal, King/telic — the four causes incarnated as persons). To manifest is to rotate: a card expresses different aspects of its codon-configuration depending on its computed inner yin/yang phase. The deck is a calculator of becoming, not a dictionary of fixed fates.',
  `q_3_elemental_quaternary_structure`: 'Structurally M3-4 is the elemental quaternary — four suits of 14, each suit a 90° arc of the 360° wheel: Cups (Water) 0-89°, Wands (Fire) 90-179°, Pentacles (Earth) 180-269°, Swords (Air) 270-359°. Its pattern is the per-suit integral as the wheel\'s own partition: the codon-space\'s elemental division IS the card-space\'s elemental division — Cups=84, Wands=96, Pentacles=88, Swords=92, summing to 360 (compile-asserted). Within each suit, 10 numbered cards trace the processual sephirotic arc Kether-to-Malkuth, 4 court cards the relational hierarchy. As the #4 Lemniscate-anchor it is where the structure folds inward: the 8 generative gaps (pre-Ace, post-King, 4 inter-suit transitions, central void) are the nesting points where the figure-eight twists, where 56 stops short of completion and a new octave can open. The structure is the which made operational — a complete, typed, rotatable manifestation matrix held open by exactly eight strategic absences.',
  `q_4_generative_absence_why`: 'M3-4\'s telos is generative absence — the #4 why read as the lemniscate\'s secret: the 8 missing positions exist so that the system can never close, so that "strategic absences ensure perpetual novelty while maintaining coherent structure." Its purpose is to be the primary interface that manifests Major Arcana archetypal force through elemental quaternary operations — the for-the-sake-of-incarnation by which abstract pattern becomes lived experience. Where #4 is the Context/Type position, here it is the context of manifestation itself: the place where the wheel folds inward (the Lemniscate at #4) and incubates a deeper nested reality. The 8 gaps are the (4.0/1-4.4/5) fractal doubling made symbolic — the pre-Ace and post-King spaces where consciousness transcends its current octave and jumps a level. M3-4 exists so manifestation stays alive: a closed deck would ossify into fixed fate; the eight absences keep it a spiral, perpetually able to re-take its own forms at a higher turn.',
  `q_5_cards_handed_to_the_wheel`: 'M3-4\'s synthesis is manifestation completing itself by converging — the 56 rotating cards and 8 generative gaps handed forward to M3-5, where they join the hexagram-transformations, genetic matrices, and archetypal mathematics on the 360° Mythic Synthesis Wheel. The Type/Context closes by being totalised: each card\'s phase-state becomes one position on the cosmic clock, the four suit-quadrants becoming the wheel\'s four compass anchors, the Major Arcana ribbon (22 autosomes) running above the minor ring. Read as position-4, M3-4 performs the recovery #4 owes — it re-animates the transcribed deposit of M3-3 into living, turnable cards, and hands that living manifestation up to synthesis. The 360° its 56 cards already map (56→360) is the very wheel M3-5 completes. What M3-4 manifests as the loved face of turnable cards, M3-5 re-receives as the mythic mandala; the operational technology of transformation hands itself on to become lived story.'
};
