  `c_1_internal_structure`: 'Four compass anchors (#3-5-1 through #3-5-4) establishing the I-Ching directional foundation and 4-fold basis alignment with nucleotides and tarot suits. Central Unity Point (#3-5-5/0) serving as both quintessential totality and zero degree origin. 360 degree positions (#3-5-5/0-1 through #3-5-5/0-360) branching from the unity center forming the complete cosmic clock. 16 archetypal division lenses operating through dynamic lens operators, 9 transformational chambers of 40° each, 22 Major Arcana pathways, and 720° double-covering architecture where every position exists in light/shadow superposition. Total 365 nodes creating the complete archetypal calendar.',
