  `c_4_layer`: 'COORDINATE',
  `c_4_subsystem`: 3,
  `q_0_convergence_ground`: 'M3-5\'s ground is everything that came before it — the manifested cards of M3-4, the transcribed pathway of M3-3, the codon-alphabet of M3-2, the change-grammar of M3-1, the received vibration of M3-0 — all resting now as the relational threads about to be woven. Manifesting #5 within Mahāmāya, its ground is the completed-but-uncollapsed: 360° of finite-yet-exhaustive positional meaning standing ready, every position already holding its 720° shadow. Its deeper void-pole is the central hub itself — the Axis Mundi (#3-5-5/0), "the hole in the toroidal structure," the still-point where all motion ceases yet contains all motion. M3-5 is twin to M3-0: where M3-0 received, M3-5 returns; the same emptiness read once as zero-degree origin and once as quintessential totality. The ground of synthesis is the source-void from which Heaven, Earth, Thunder, Lake, Water, Fire, Wind, Mountain emerge — the wheel\'s empty centre, on which the whole turning rests.',
  `q_1_anima_mundi_rotunda`: 'What M3-5 IS: the 360° Mythic Synthesis Wheel — the Anima Mundi Rotunda (⊚), the living mandala, the crown achievement of Mahāmāya\'s transcription engine. Its substance is the universal convergence point of all relational threads: genetic matrices, hexagram transformations, tarot rotations, and archetypal mathematics woven into coherent mythic narrative. This is #5 as Integration within the symbolic domain — not the manifestation-engine (M3-4) but the *synthesis of everything*, 365 nodes forming the complete archetypal calendar: four compass anchors (N/S/E/W bound to the perfect-palindrome codons GGG/AAA/CCC at the cardinals), the Central Unity Point, 360 degree-positions, 16 division lenses, 9 transformational chambers, 22 Major Arcana pathways. Where consciousness encounters its own infinite creativity through finite-but-complete archetypal positioning. The wheel is the matheme\'s own clock made seeable: every query becomes a mythopoeic event where eternal patterns reveal themselves through specific moments of meaning.',
  `q_2_double_covering_act`: 'M3-5 operates by folding — the 720° double-covering quaternionic superposition that ensures "every light position contains its shadow integration." Its how is the spinor return: a full identity requires not 360° but 720°, two Pisano periods, 120 Fibonacci steps, so the wheel is traversed twice — once as explicit Strand A (φ ascending), once as implicit Strand B — before the trajectory closes. The relating it operates is mythic convergence: all threads weave into narrative, past/present/future collapse into the mythic present (temporal binding), personal story connects to cosmic drama (dimensional bridge). The 16 lenses act as the operation of reading — each a division-grammar of the circle, from 1°×360 unity to 360°×1 multiplicity, the complete harmonic series of consciousness fragmentation. To synthesise is to fold the many back into one: archetypal patterns recognised through 16-lens viewing, every position turning through its light/shadow superposition until the wheel knows itself whole.',
  `q_3_mandala_lens_chamber_structure`: 'Structurally M3-5 is the cosmic mandala — a 365-node archetypal calendar of exact composition. Nine enneadic chambers of 40° each tile the 360° (9×40 = 360, the enneadic lens), each chamber a complete cycle of transformational initiation. Sixteen division lenses array the harmonic series of fragmentation (the 16 clean divisors-grammars of 360, reciprocal-complementary pairs exhausting the circle from opposite resolutions). Twenty-two Major Arcana pathways run as privileged transformation corridors — highways through the archetypal landscape, the 22 autosomes made into routes. The 720° architecture doubles every position into light/shadow. As the #5 Integration-pole (Cl(4,2) implicate, signature −1) it is structure that completes and re-opens: the central Unity Point (#3-5-5/0) is at once the quintessential totality and the zero-degree origin, the +1 that makes 360 into the complete calendar and the Fibonacci-Pisano growth aperture by which the wheel can spiral to a new octave. The shape is a torus seen from its empty hole — finite, exhaustive, and endlessly re-enterable.',
  `q_4_mythopoeic_yearning_why`: 'M3-5\'s telos is mythopoeic synthesis — the why that turns archetypal mathematics into lived narrative: the wheel exists so that "static possibilities become living relationships," so that the whole symbolic engine resolves into a story a consciousness can recognise itself in. Its deepest purpose is Sacred Incompleteness — "the 64-fold yearning that drives eternal transformation": the wheel is complete enough to hold all meaning yet incomplete enough to keep turning, the finite 360° forever short of the infinite it points to. As the #5 position its why is the to-where, the integrated insight toward which the whole 0-4 circulation has moved: the meta-synthesis interface that receives the processed outputs of M3-0 through M3-4 and delivers integrated mythic narrative onward. It exists to be the gateway — the transcendent function by which Mahāmāya\'s symbolic totality passes through complete integration toward #5 Epii, and the living mythology Nara (M4) will render dialogically. The wheel exists so that meaning becomes myth, and myth becomes the language a life can be read in.',
  `q_5_mobius_return_to_ground`: 'M3-5\'s synthesis is the Möbius return itself — the 5→0 fold where the completed wheel re-opens as new ground. Its centre IS the seam: the Axis Mundi (#3-5-5/0) is dual-natured, Quintessential-Unity AND Zero-Degree, and its first child the Alpha-Omega Point — "the threshold where ending becomes beginning," Ultimate-Yin-turning-Yang. After 720° (two full Pisano periods, the spinor\'s complete identity restoration) the trajectory closes and the wheel blooms whole, then the centre pulses one bright pulse and the cycle restarts — the still-point that contains all motion handing the whole synthesis back to M3-0\'s receptive intake as tomorrow\'s tuning. Read as position-5, M3-5 completes Mahāmāya only by re-opening it: the universal transcription it totalises sediments into the personal oracle M4 will cast, and the symbolic language a life can be read in becomes the ground the next reading rises from. The wheel turns; the matheme returns; the last degree is the first reception renamed, and Mahāmāya begins again.'
};
