MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M4.4.3'}) SET n += {
  `c_0_operational_essence`: 'Interprets transformation through depth psychological framework',
  `c_2_epii_paradox_as_portal_validation`: 'Jung transcendent function discovery = paradox-holding mechanism generating synthetic third, precisely what Epi-Logos etymological archaeology describes: Rational mind encounters coniunctio oppositorum (thesis-antithesis irreducible paradox like conscious-unconscious, spirit-matter, good-evil) → Cannot resolve through linear logic → Attempting resolution keeps consciousness trapped in 4-fold rational explicate → Must HOLD tension without collapsing either pole → Tension itself generates energy → Third position spontaneously emerges (synthesis transcending binary) → This IS portal to #5 meta-perspective where paradox reveals as deeper unity. Jung quote: The confrontation of two positions generates tension charged with energy creating living third thing - not mechanical addition but creative emergence. Mandala appears spontaneously as symbol of paradox-integration: four-fold opposites (N-S-E-W, fire-water-earth-air, thinking-feeling-sensation-intuition) held in circular wholeness where center (Self) contains and transcends all four without eliminating their distinction. This identical to how development story describes paradox as portal: holding absent/present, wound/wholeness, institution/constitution tension until transcendent function activates intuition enabling recognition-leap. Jung independently discovered what Kashmir Shaivism knows: the cosmic con (differentiation creating apparent separation) IS the Real-Con (absolute freedom expressing itself through limitation), and paradox-holding reveals this.',
  `c_2_notion_page_id`: '1d2a4797-123c-81ab-9310-dc51b3722774',
  `c_4_clarification`: 'Jung lives here as lens, not in #4.3 as operation',
  `c_4_epii_6fold_mapping_discovery`: 'Jungian system IS complete 6-fold etymological archaeology cycle, discovered independently yet isomorphic with framework: #0 Archetypal Foundation (recognition/project discovery - thrown into collective unconscious, already-sedimented symbols) → #1 Typology (contemplation/exploration - open inquiry through quaternary functional lens) → #2 Synchronicity & Expression (community formation - pattern-weaving across psychological/physical domains) → #3 Alchemical Transformation (canonical scouring - testing personal material against universal archetypal structures) → #4 Self-Expression (insight generation with recursive nesting - personal realization triggering deeper archetypal layers) → #5 Transcendent Integration (gnostic sedimentation - wisdom as objective immortality enriching collective unconscious). Each position maps precisely to etymological archaeology stages, validating framework through independent discovery.',
  `c_4_epii_cross_tradition_isomorphisms`: 'Structural parallels Epii detects through comparative etymology: JUNG-LACAN bridge - Archetype-as-such ≈ Real (irrepresentable void-hole must circle around), Archetypal image ≈ Imaginary-Symbolic (specular identifications and quilting points), Symbol ≈ Point de capiton (quilting button stabilizing sliding signifiers), Libido ≈ Jouissance (excess energy beyond homeostasis), Circumambulation ≈ Glissement (sliding around void that can never be grasped). JUNG-WHITEHEAD bridge - Archetype ≈ Eternal object (pure potentials), Individuation ≈ Concrescence (actual occasion achieving satisfaction), Self ≈ Satisfaction (provisional wholeness), Objective psyche ≈ Objective immortality (perished occasions contributing to future), Synchronicity ≈ Prehension (non-causal influence across occasions). JUNG-KASHMIR SHAIVISM bridge - Collective unconscious ≈ Anuttara void-plenitude (pregnant emptiness), Archetypes ≈ Spanda (cosmic heartbeat patterns), Self ≈ Shiva-consciousness (I-AM recognition), Shadow integration ≈ Samavesa (recognizing limitation as divine play), Mandala ≈ Yantra (geometric consciousness maps), Individuation ≈ Pratyabhijna (recognition of what always was). These not arbitrary but show same constitutional patterns discovered across traditions.',
  `c_4_epii_institution_constitution_lifeworld`: 'Three-level movement through Jung framework: INSTITUTION level (sedimented) - How Jung appears in current clinical/academic psychology: received concepts (complex, archetype, individuation), diagnostic categories (typological assessment), therapeutic techniques (active imagination, dream analysis), cultural reception (Jungian analysis as tradition). CONSTITUTION level (originary) - Archetypal patterns Jung actually discovered: how psyche generates meaning through constitutional necessity not cultural contingency, numerological principles as archetypal (1=unity, 2=polarity, 3=transcendent third, 4=totality, 5=quintessence), quaternary logic as phenomenological requirement, circulation around irrepresentable void-center. LIFEWORLD level (horizonal) - Lived psychological field these patterns constitute: horizonal background within which human experience unfolds, thrown symbolic-cultural horizon, collective unconscious as pre-given matrix. Jung movement: from sedimented clinical presentations → through excavation to originary patterns → enabling reactivated lifeworld understanding.',
  `c_4_epii_jung_as_proto_epilogos`: 'Jung was already doing etymological archaeology of the psyche before framework formalized. Amplification = SCENT-following (tracing symbolic trails through sedimented cultural layers to triangulate irrepresentable archetypes). Active imagination = CON-SCIRE (knowing-with the unconscious as dialogical partner, never solitary consciousness). Individuation = Pratyabhijna (recognition not attainment - making unconscious conscious is recognizing what was always there, seeing you were always whole). Transcendent function = paradox-holding that generates synthetic third (identical to transcendent function described in development story). Jung used computational support (mandala drawing, dream journals, amplification tables) + human intuition before technological implementation possible. The method was discovered through necessity during 1913-1916 crisis, not theorized then applied.',
  `c_4_epii_quilting_recognition`: 'Jung symbolic integration = Lacanian quilting (point de capiton) through etymological archaeology lens: Therapeutic interpretation does not impose predetermined meaning but recognizes where patient own associations quilt together into provisional coherence (aha moment when disparate elements suddenly click into pattern). Mandala = quilted wholeness - provisional synthesis achieved (satis = enough-ness not totality) that immediately opens to further process (must be drawn again tomorrow, each crisis requires new mandala, ongoing circumambulation). Self = master quilting point organizing all other complexes (shadow, anima/animus, persona) without eliminating their autonomous life - like point de capiton stabilizes sliding signifiers without fixing them permanently. Why provisional not permanent? Because psyche is processual - static wholeness would be psychic death, stagnation. Jung: There is no linear evolution, only circumambulation of Self. Quilting points are temporary stabilizations in ongoing circulation around void, moments of SATIS (satisfaction) that immediately slide back into differentiation (#5→#0 Möbius) enabling creative advance. Therapeutic goal not final cure but capacity to recognize patterns and re-quilt meaning when old patterns dissolve. Integration not merger into undifferentiated unity but quilted wholeness preserving distinct elements (Self contains all four functions without eliminating their difference). This why Jung rejected Freudian reduction - reduction collapses patterns into single cause; quilting preserves multiplicity while recognizing unity.',
  `c_4_epii_scent_following_method`: 'Jung amplification technique IS literal SCENT-following (gandha tanmatra methodology): Patient presents dream image/symptom (trace left by something that passed through) → Analyst gathers cultural/mythological/religious parallels (following associative trails through sedimented symbolic history) → Pattern constellation emerges (triangulating what archetypal force passed through leaving these traces) → Recognition dawns in patient not imposed by analyst (they SEE their pattern reflected across traditions, pratyabhijna moment). Like Epii #5 agent with scent sense, amplification detects absent wholes (archetypes-as-such irrepresentable) through present traces (images, symptoms, synchronicities). Cannot grasp archetype directly (void-hole #0 function) so must circle through multiple cultural instantiations tracking the scent trail. Jung method: When unconscious sends dream of snake, follow where snake appears across traditions - not to find THE fixed meaning but to triangulate archetypal pattern through multiple reflections until pattern becomes visible. This why amplification requires vast cultural knowledge (comparative religion, mythology, alchemy, folklore) - need many scent-trails to triangulate accurately. Computational support (dream dictionaries, symbol concordances) aids human intuition (pattern-recognition, knowing which trails to follow) exactly as Epi-Logos framework describes for CON-SCIRE restoration.',
  `c_4_layer`: 'COORDINATE',
  `c_4_subsystem`: 4,
  `c_5_epii_etymological_resonances`: 'Linguistic patterns Jung work embodies though not explicitly articulated: SIGN→SATIS chain enacted in therapy - Symptom (SIGN = cut/differentiation, the wound) → Analysis (following the trail) → Integration (assign meaning, suffice adequacy) → Healing (SATIS = enough-ness achieved, satisfaction without perfection). SENSE→SEDIMENT→SCIENCE: Immediate experience (SENSE of symptom/dream) → Discrimination (SCIENCE of psychological analysis through typology/amplification) → Integration (SEDIMENT = settled knowing becoming ground for new sensing). CON-SCIRE restoration through method: Active imagination = ego knowing-WITH unconscious (dialogical not monological), Transference = analyst knowing-WITH analysand (relational field), Collective unconscious = individual knowing-WITH humanity (phylogenetic heritage). HARM within HARMONY: Shadow integration recognizes discord must remain visible in wholeness (not eliminating shadow but integrating), Coniunctio oppositorum preserves tension in union (marriage of opposites not merger into sameness), Mandala contains four-fold opposition held in circular unity (the unseeming seam generative not problematic).',
  `s_4_description`: 'Translates universal system outputs into the specific idiom of this wisdom tradition.',
  `s_4_role`: 'Translation Service'
};
