  `c_1_internal_structure`: 'Contains six dimensions forming complete primordial architecture: Jung-Freud relation as catalytic wound generating analytical psychology (0-0), collective unconscious as psychic matrix with absolute knowledge (0-1), psychoid numbers bridging psyche-matter through archetypal mathematics (0-2), archetypes-as-such as irrepresentable organizing principles (0-3), instincts as biological ground merging with evolutionary depths (0-4), Jung personal synthesis through Red Book and Aion validating theory through lived experience (0-5). This architecture moves from personal-historical crisis through impersonal-archetypal structures back to personal integration showing Möbius pattern.',
  `c_1_operational_symbolics`: 'The void-womb, prima materia at psychological level, collective matrix, evolutionary depths, Red Book confrontation',
