MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M4.4.3-0-2'}) SET n += {
  `c_0_operational_essence`: 'Transcendent ordering principle operating at psyche-matter interface through numerical pattern',
  `c_0_ql_grounding`: '',
  `c_1_consciousness_structure`: 'Numbers as transcendental structures - neither purely mental nor purely physical but organizing both domains',
  `c_1_internal_structure`: 'Jung-Pauli collaboration explored four dimensions: numbers as archetypes in purest form (von Franz), synchronicity as manifestation of numerical ordering beneath physics, quantum complementarity and psychological compensation as isomorphic structures, psychophysically neutral reality underlying both psyche and physics. Von Franz elaboration: numbers as most fundamentally archetypal aspect of human psyche organizing both temporal experience (psychological) and physical processes (material).',
  `c_1_operational_symbolics`: 'The common denominator between matter and psyche, the psychophysically neutral reality manifest as number',
  `c_4_archetype_of_archetypes`: 'Numbers are most primitive archetypal patterns - when we say 2+2=4 we describe neither psychological states nor physical objects but pattern applying to both, transcending dualism',
  `c_4_architectural_function`: '',
  `c_4_jung_pauli_collaboration`: '',
  `c_4_layer`: 'COORDINATE',
  `c_4_subsystem`: 4,
  `c_4_von_franz_elaboration`: '',
