MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M4.4.3-0-3'}) SET n += {
  `c_0_irrepresentable_nature`: 'Can never be directly apprehended - like crystal axial system with no material existence yet preforming crystalline structure. Known only through effects and images produced.',
  `c_0_operational_essence`: 'Pre-existent forms organizing both inward psychological experience and outward physical manifestations through psychoid effects',
  `c_1_consciousness_structure`: 'Transcendental conditions (in Kant sense) for structured experience - without archetypes experience would be formless chaos',
  `c_1_internal_structure`: 'Critical distinction: archetype-as-such is pattern itself (unknowable, irrepresentable, like crystal axial system) versus archetypal image (specific cultural or personal form the archetype takes, such as Mother as Virgin Mary, Terrible Mother, Earth Mother). Archetype-as-such is possibility-structure not fixed content. Jung called them hypothetical because we infer existence from recurring patterns - can never encounter Mother archetype directly, only specific mothers, maternal images, mother-complexes.',
  `c_1_operational_symbolics`: 'Crystal axial system preforming crystallization, Plato Forms, Kant categories, possibilities-structures prior to actualization',
  `c_1_preexistent_forms`: 'Jung insisted archetypes existed since remotest times, not created by individuals or cultures but discovered. Constitutional patterns consciousness uses to organize reality.',
  `c_4_architectural_function`: 'Establishes the void-hole function at archetypal level - must circle around through images and effects but can never penetrate directly. Grounds amplification method and SCENT-following necessity.',
  `c_4_crystal_metaphor`: 'Like axial system of crystal preforming crystalline structure in mother liquid though having no material existence of own - archetypes preform but do not predetermine',
  `c_4_layer`: 'COORDINATE',
  `c_4_organizing_function`: 'Structure experience without appearing in experience - transcendental conditions for meaningful experience. Without archetypes, experience would be formless chaos.',
  `c_4_subsystem`: 4,
  `t_4_created`: '2025-10-09T20:50:30.403000000Z'
};
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M4.4.3-0-4'}) SET n += {
  `c_0_operational_essence`: 'Phylogenetically transmitted behavioral patterns grounding psychic life in embodied biological existence',
  `c_0_somatic_ground`: 'Body as pre-given substrate for psychic life - the thrown biological condition we do not choose but find ourselves within. Soul emerges from soma; psyche is incarnate.',
  `c_1_consciousness_structure`: 'The thrown biological condition - we do not choose our instincts but find ourselves with body that hungers, desires, fears, ages',
  `c_1_internal_structure`: 'Jung recognized psychoid continuum from ultra-violet (spirit, purely psychic) through middle range (archetypal images, myths) to infra-red (instincts, biology). At both ends psyche becomes indistinguishable from its other - spirit at one pole, matter at other. Archetype-instinct identity: these are two ends of same spectrum, not separate systems. Archetype IS instinct at psychic level; instinct IS archetype at biological level. Example: hero archetype (psychic) and territorial defense instinct (biological) are one pattern viewed from different angles.',
  `c_1_operational_symbolics`: 'The red end of spectrum, animal nature, soma as ground of psyche, evolutionary heritage, limbic and reptilian brain contributions',
  `c_2_archetype_instinct_identity`: 'Archetypes and instincts are two ends of same spectrum - archetype IS instinct at psychic level, instinct IS archetype at biological level. Hero archetype and territorial defense instinct are one pattern.',
  `c_2_psychoid_continuum`: 'Position at infra-red end where psyche merges indistinguishably with biology - at material pole of spectrum from spirit (ultra-violet) to matter (infra-red)',
  `c_4_architectural_function`: 'Establishes the material pole of psychoid spectrum. Where archetypes are ultra-violet (purely psychic), instincts are infra-red (purely biological), but both ends of one continuum.',
  `c_4_layer`: 'COORDINATE',
  `c_4_phylogenetic_inheritance`: 'Instincts are not learned but transmitted through evolutionary descent - spider inherits web-weaving pattern, humans inherit capacity to generate symbols and respond to archetypal situations',
  `c_4_subsystem`: 4,
  `t_4_created`: '2025-10-09T20:50:30.403000000Z'
};
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M4.4.3-0-5'}) SET n += {
  `c_0_operational_essence`: 'Biographical validation - the personal IS the universal individuated, method emerges from lived necessity',
  `c_1_consciousness_structure`: 'Exemplar function - one human complete journey from fragmentation to provisional wholeness',
  `c_1_internal_structure`: 'Three primary dimensions: Red Book (1913-1930) as confrontation with unconscious following Freud break, developing active imagination, mapping collective unconscious through lived encounter, individuation as path not theory; Aion (1951) as late masterwork synthesizing Christ as Self-symbol, Aeon transformation, shadow integration, quaternary completion; Lived Individuation throughout life including stone tower built by own hands, daily mandala painting, enduring marriage despite tensions, later life serenity as achieved wholeness.',
  `c_1_operational_symbolics`: 'Stone tower at Bollingen, mandala paintings, alchemical studies, marriage as coniunctio, Red Book illuminated manuscript',
  `c_2_lived_individuation`: '',
  `c_4_aion_synthesis`: 'Late masterwork synthesizing: Christ as Self-symbol (archetypal dimension of religious symbolism), Aeon of Pisces-Aquarius (collective psychic transformation through historical time), Shadow integration (Christianity missing fourth - Devil, feminine, matter), Quaternary completion (Trinity requiring fourth for wholeness)',
  `c_4_architectural_function`: '',
  `c_4_layer`: 'COORDINATE',
  `c_4_red_book_method`: '',
  `c_4_spontaneous_expression`: '',
