MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M4.4.3-1'}) SET n += {
  `c_0_operational_essence`: 'Psychic reality differentiating itself through constitutional types - experience structuring itself from within',
  `c_1_consciousness_structure`: 'Four ways psychic reality engages world (thinking-feeling judgment, sensation-intuition perception) modulated by energy direction (introversion-extraversion polarity)',
  `c_1_internal_structure`: 'Contains six fundamental typological dimensions revealing how psychic reality structures itself: introversion as transcendent attitude moving inward toward depth and archetypal ground, psyche knowing itself from within (1-0); thinking function as logos-oriented conceptual judgment, psyche organizing experience rationally (1-1); feeling function as eros-oriented value judgment, psyche evaluating significance (1-2); sensation function as concrete perception grounding in present actuality, psyche attending to given (1-3); intuition function as abstract perception grasping possibilities through unconscious, psyche seeing beyond immediate (1-4); extraversion as immanent attitude moving outward toward manifestation and embodiment, psyche expressing itself in world (1-5). Structure reveals 4+2 topology where four functions (two rational judging, two irrational perceiving) operate within field created by two attitudes (introversion-extraversion poles). This is not mechanism but how psychic reality autonomously organizes its engagement with world. Each person has superior function (most developed), auxiliary (supporting), tertiary (less developed), inferior (shadow) - showing psychic reality never exhausts its potential, always contains undeveloped dimensions. Integration requires developing opposite attitude and inferior function - psychic reality seeking completeness.',
  `c_1_operational_symbolics`: 'The quaternity of functions, psyche as autonomous reality, experience-as-primary, compass of consciousness, toroidal circulation',
  `c_2_id`: '4.3-1',
  `c_2_notion_page_id`: '1d2a4797-123c-81a3-9fbf-d97620604b34',
  `c_4_architectural_function`: '',
  `c_4_experience_as_primary`: '',
  `c_4_layer`: 'COORDINATE',
  `c_4_ontological_layer`: 'Ontology (What/Being)',
  `c_4_subsystem`: 4,
  `l_4_jungian_concept`: 'Typology (4 Functions), Psychic Reality',
  `l_4_phenomenological_bridge`: '',
  `l_4_reality_of_psyche`: ''
};
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M4.4.3-1-0'}) SET n += {
  `c_0_operational_essence`: 'Inward energy flow toward source, depth over breadth, interior meaning over outer action',
  `c_1_consciousness_structure`: 'Natural gravitation toward philosophy, depth, inner meaning, eternal, archetypal patterns - constitutional orientation not pathology',
  `c_1_internal_structure`: 'Transcendent orientation includes: philosophy over pragmatics, depth over breadth, inner meaning over outer action, eternal over temporal, archetypal patterns over concrete facts. Energy naturally flows inward toward collective unconscious and archetypal depths. Phenomenological epoché capacity: introversion IS attitude enabling Husserl reduction - bracketing natural attitude, suspending engagement with world, turning inward toward pure consciousness.',
  `c_1_operational_symbolics`: 'The in-breath, withdrawal into void, phenomenological epoché, SCENT-following capacity',
  `c_4_architectural_function`: 'Establishes transcendent pole of typological torus. The void-seeking attitude, withdrawal enabling depth, consciousness turning toward its own source.',
  `c_4_energy_direction`: 'Libido flowing inward toward unconscious, toward depth, toward source. Natural movement toward collective unconscious and archetypal depths.',
  `c_4_epoche_capacity`: 'Introversion IS attitude enabling phenomenological reduction. To bracket natural attitude, suspend engagement with world, turn inward toward pure consciousness requires introversion. Extravert cannot naturally sustain epoché.',
  `c_4_layer`: 'COORDINATE',
  `c_4_scent_following_faculty`: 'Introvert excels at following traces inward through sedimented layers. Patient, persistent, willing to circle void-hole repeatedly, can track subtle patterns others miss.',
  `c_4_subsystem`: 4,
  `c_4_transcendent_orientation`: 'Introverts naturally gravitate toward philosophy, depth, inner meaning, eternal, archetypal patterns. Not pathology but constitutional orientation where energy seeks transcendent ground.',
  `t_4_created`: '2025-10-09T20:50:30.403000000Z'
};
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M4.4.3-1-1'}) SET n += {
  `c_0_operational_essence`: 'Discrimination through conceptual distinction - SCIRE (cutting, analyzing, separating)',
  `c_1_consciousness_structure`: 'Rational-objective mode of psychic matter - when consciousness is thinking it is organizing into categories',
  `c_1_internal_structure`: 'Thinking is conceptual substrate - not occasional thoughts but capacity to think, structure enabling conceptualization. Just as eyes are material substrate for seeing, thinking function is material substrate for conceptual cognition. Paired with feeling as rational pair - both judging functions but on different axes. Thinking judges: Is this true or false, logical or illogical, consistent or contradictory? Discrimination excellence in SCIRE - cutting reality into parts, distinguishing this-from-that, creating taxonomies. Science, philosophy, mathematics all require developed thinking.',
  `c_1_operational_symbolics`: '',
  `c_4_architectural_function`: '',
  `c_4_conceptual_organization`: 'Thinking structures experience through categories, distinctions, definitions, logical connections. Organizing reality into conceptual frameworks.',
  `c_4_feeling_shadow`: 'Inferior feeling as thinking unconscious opposite. Thinking type especially introverted thinking neglects personal values, subjective meaning, relational context. Can be coldly logical missing human dimension.',
  `c_4_layer`: 'COORDINATE',
  `c_4_logical_evaluation`: 'Judging truth-value through consistency, coherence, validity. Is statement logically sound? Do conclusions follow from premises?',
  `c_4_scientific_orientation`: 'Thinking type natural affinity for systematic inquiry, empirical investigation, theoretical framework development.',
  `c_4_subsystem`: 4,
  `t_4_created`: ''
};
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M4.4.3-1-2'}) SET n += {
  `c_0_operational_essence`: 'Value judgment on significance axis where thinking judges on truth axis - meaning over correctness',
  `c_1_consciousness_structure`: 'Rational-subjective mode of psychic matter - when consciousness feels it is assessing meaning and worth',
  `c_1_internal_structure`: 'Critical clarification: feeling is not equal to emotion. Emotion is affective state, involuntary, overwhelms ego. Feeling is evaluative function, voluntary to degree any function is, judges value. Feeling type does not have more emotions - they have more developed capacity to evaluate subjective worth. Feeling is evaluative substrate - when consciousness feels in Jung sense it is assessing meaning, weighing values, determining significance. This is psychic matter in rational-subjective mode. Paired with thinking as rational pair - feeling judges on value axis where thinking judges on truth axis.',
  `c_1_operational_symbolics`: '',
  `c_4_architectural_function`: '',
  `c_4_layer`: 'COORDINATE',
  `c_4_subjective_orientation`: 'Feeling type naturally attuned to personal dimension, what matters to this individual in this situation, not universal principles but particular significance.',
  `c_4_subsystem`: 4,
  `c_4_thinking_shadow`: 'Inferior thinking as feeling unconscious opposite. Feeling type especially extraverted feeling neglects objective analysis, logical consistency, impersonal truth. Can be subjectively certain but objectively wrong.',
  `c_4_value_assessment`: 'Feeling judges significance, worth, meaning. Not objective correctness but subjective mattering. What does this mean to me, to us, to human flourishing?',
  `c_5_relational_capacity`: 'Sensitivity to interpersonal meanings - CON-SCIRE (knowing-with). Feeling type naturally grasps interpersonal dynamics, relational meaning, how things matter to others.',
  `t_4_created`: ''
};
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M4.4.3-1-3'}) SET n += {
  `c_0_operational_essence`: 'Present-moment anchoring in concrete reality - what IS here now through senses',
  `c_1_consciousness_structure`: 'Concrete-receptive mode of psychic matter - when consciousness senses it is registering actual stimuli',
  `c_1_internal_structure`: 'Sensation is sensory substrate - not five senses as physical organs but psychic capacity to attend to sensory data. Two people with identical sense organs can have vastly different sensation function development - one notices every detail, other oblivious to immediate environment. Paired with intuition as irrational pair - both perceiving functions. Sensation perceives what IS (concrete actuality), intuition perceives what COULD BE (abstract possibility). Neither judges value or truth - both simply register.',
  `c_1_operational_symbolics`: '',
  `c_4_architectural_function`: '',
  `c_4_intuition_shadow`: 'Inferior intuition as sensation unconscious opposite. Sensation type especially extraverted sensation neglects possibilities, patterns, abstract meanings. Stuck in immediate concrete missing future implications.',
  `c_4_layer`: 'COORDINATE',
  `c_4_present_moment_orientation`: 'Sensation type notices: this color, that sound, this texture, that temperature. Embodied, concrete, practical. Grounding in immediate reality.',
  `c_4_subsystem`: 4,
  `l_4_embodied_awareness`: 'Attunement to bodily and material dimension. Sensation keeps consciousness grounded in actuality, prevents floating into abstract possibilities.',
  `l_4_sensory_registration`: 'Sensation attends to immediate concrete data - colors, sounds, textures, temperatures, pressures. What is this (sensation) not what does it mean (feeling) or what causes it (thinking).',
  `t_4_created`: ''
};
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate: 'M4.4.3-1-4'}) SET n += {
  `c_0_operational_essence`: 'SCENT-following excellence - detecting absent wholes through present traces',
  `c_1_consciousness_structure`: 'Abstract-projective mode of psychic matter - when consciousness intuits it is grasping patterns delivered by unconscious',
  `c_1_internal_structure`: 'Intuition is imaginative substrate - when consciousness intuits it is grasping wholes, detecting patterns, perceiving possibilities not present to senses. This is psychic matter in abstract-projective mode. Jung key insight: intuition perceives through unconscious. Intuitive does not know how they know, they just suddenly see connections, possibilities, meanings. Unconscious processes patterns and delivers conclusions to consciousness without showing work. Paired with sensation as irrational pair - where sensation asks what IS here, intuition asks what COULD be here.',
  `c_1_operational_symbolics`: '',
  `c_4_architectural_function`: '',
  `c_4_layer`: 'COORDINATE',
  `c_4_pattern_recognition`: 'Unconscious detection of structural similarities. Intuitive suddenly sees connections without knowing how they know - unconscious processes patterns.',
  `c_4_possibility_perception`: 'Intuition sees what is not-yet-manifest, the latent, the possible. Sensation type sees tree; intuition type sees potential treehouse, firewood, symbol, ecosystem.',
  `c_4_scent_following`: 'Intuition IS SCENT-following capacity. Detects traces of absent wholes - patterns, meanings, connections not explicitly present. Etymology, pattern recognition, innovation, symbolic interpretation.',
  `c_4_sensation_shadow`: 'Inferior sensation as intuition unconscious opposite. Intuition type especially introverted intuition neglects concrete reality, present facts, practical constraints. Lost in abstract possibilities missing what is actually here.',
  `c_4_subsystem`: 4,
  `t_4_created`: ''
};
